RM are participated and school community were always informed of DRRM updates. Constant drills were conducted', 'School conducted weekly wellnes activity both teachers and learners', 'No record of PWD enrolled', 'the school has a developed strategic plan', 'Planning team were organized', 'Has established SPG with different conducted by the coordinators', 'Stakeholder\'s support were evident and supports the school', 'strategic plan were utilized', 'SGC\'s are functional and supported the school in all activities', 'Working PTA\'s. IMplemented yearly projects', 'Partnership with stakeholders are evident through constant participation of stakeholders to the community activities as manifested in attendance and list of supports given', 'PAP\'s in school were monitored in terms of implementation aa manifested in the evaluation tools and SMEA Reports', 'The school has drop box for suggestions and commnents as basis for clients satisfaction proved to be Satisfactory', 'teachers achieved VS rating or even Outstanding', 'The school head achieved the highest rating in OPCRF', 'LAC sessions were religiously implemented through the presentation of needed documents for LAC', 'Teachers were promoted yearly', 'personnel were given recognition annualy but not all ', 'Salaries were given on time to school personnel', 'Teachers load were based on the memorandum and were properly distributed to all teachers as manifested in their class program', 'The school facilities were inspected yearly or as needed based on the data of needs-based assessment ', 'The school initiated improvements in school through stakeholder\'s support (projects)', 'the school has no library but has a reading center utilized by the learners', 'has power supply  but no water and internet. in school. Sometimes utilized the community provide commercial net', 'Had a computer laboratory but not functional due to power shortage and damaged computers', 'The school utilizes the MOOE as stated in the plan', 'Submitted liquidation on time through received copies of liquidation submitted'),
