ld have access to quality education.', 'Encourage community to enroll in ALS program.', 'The school and the community has its function in implementing child protection policy.', 'Participated drills regularly and shows manifested functional DRRM plan. ', 'Impowering guidance  coordinator and grievance committee to support metal wellness.', 'No establishment of the SNED facilities', 'The school has a strong partnership with the community stakeholders', 'The school presented to the stakeholders the vision and mission of the school.', 'Unfunctional SSG officers', 'The school has its effective feedback mechanism.', 'The school strengthen the implementation of its strategic plan with the help and support of stakeholder.', 'Good partnership between school and community leaders.', 'The school has established PTA that supports to the programs and projects of the school.', 'The school was supported by the LGU and other sectors.', 'The school has a regular  monitoring and evaluation.', 'Good partnership with the community stakeholders.', 'The school implemented the RPMS guidelines in rating teachers.', 'Quarterly presentation of accomplishments on the programs and projects in school.', 'The school consolidate d the priority needs for improvement for the teachers.', 'The school supports to the promotion of the qualified teachers and support on its professional development.', 'The school recognizes teachers\' achievement by giving certificate ', 'Well organized compilation of records for salary, allowances and other additional compensation.', 'The work load of the teachers were distributed accordingly.  ', 'Involvement of stakeholders on the inspections', 'Involve stakeholders on the improvement of school facilities.', 'The school has no library', 'Irregular  source of water', 'No ICT room', 'The school has a proper implementation of the utilization of MOOE', 'The school is transparent on the liquidation of MOOE'),
