harmonious delivery of basic services in the school. ', 'Should be given time and effort in mitigating and providing effective strategic plan for a smooth flow of implementation.', 'The school has to established a functional SGC to develop the strong partnership al all stakeholders in the community. ', 'Sustain the best practices  extended to the organization of SPTA', 'Continuous support and engagement of the stakeholders to really strengthen the partnership of all stakeholders.', 'The school has to conduct monitoring and evaluation of all school programs, projects and activities regularly in order to address the gaps and provide interventions and resolutions.', 'The school should provide interventions in sustaining  the implementation of client satisfaction survey to address the needs and feedback of the stakeholders.', 'The school should sustain the average rating of teachers in the individual performance commitment and review to really uphold the performance of teachers in the school.', 'Sustain the average rating of the school performance.', 'Sustain the implementation of school LAC Session.', 'Sustain the continuous enhancement of teachers through different trainings attended set by the DepEd or NEAP based professional development.', 'The school has to strengthen the implementation of rewrds and recognition or milestone achievements of every teacher in the school to recognize their performance and significant effort extended as facilitator of learning.', 'N/A', 'The school should sustain the fair and equitable distribution of teacher\'s workload. ', 'The school should strengthen the conduct of inspection of infrastructure and facilities to see to it its safety and security also of all learners in the school.', 'The school should take initiative in the provision of improving the infrastructure and facilities in the school.', 'N/A', 'The school has to make a plan that will address to the pressing needs of the learners in the school like safe and clean water and theprovision of internet connection.', 'The school has to take some initiatives to address the needs of the school which all learners can benefit also.', 'The school should always adhere to the 1000% utilization of school MOOE', 'The school should sustain the 100% utilization of school MOOE', '501422', '2024', 'The school should prioritize the result for the ELLNA implementation.', 'The school should do their efforts and time in order to have the results on the proficiency level during the conduct of NAT. ', 'N/A', 'Utilization of contextualized learning materials should be given enough priority especially in the teaching and learning process.', 'Good point that teachers usually conducted remediation activities to learners to address the learning gaps in reading and other skills.', 'The school adapted the integration of Peace and DepEd Core values in teaching, it signifies that teachers wnated to develop learners become Batang Makabansa, Bansang Makabata.', 'The school should be given enough time and focus in the conduct of test item analysis to really address the needs and demands in the teaching and learning process.', 'N/A', 'The school strongly strengthen the conduct of zero child bullying through school-community campaign.', 'The school strengthen', 'The school strengthen the and adapted the zero drop-out rate  in response to the target of the division.', 'The school adhere to the welfare of the learners though the conduct og culture-sensitive activities.', 'The school has rare manifestations in  the provision of access to learners learning experiences for those disadvantage learners.', 'N/A', 'The school addressed the concerns of every learner though the established and functional child-protection committee.', 'The school has manifested the DRRM implementation through the efforts extended by the teachers in providing safe and secure learning environment with the functional DRRM evacuation plan.', 'The school supported and provided mechanisms that will give support to mental wellness program in the school though initiating different programs achored to the mental wellness activity.', 'The school has limited access to education with special needs.', 'The school rarely developed the strategic plans.', 'The school has manifested frequently the school-community planning team by which be given priority and focus.', 'The school has always been manifested the organization of Student Organization in he school in promoting learner\'s views and ideas in the delivery of basic education services to all.', 'The school rarely manifested the innovative provision of frontline services to the stakeholders. ', 'The school rarely manifested the implementation of strategic plan which can really affect the operational flow of the school\'s programs and activities.', 'The school frequently manifested the implementation of functional School Governance council (SGC).', 'The school has always manifested the SPTA through a regular meetings and conferences conducted in the school.', 'The school has always been manifesting the collaboration of stakeholders to the schools to really strengthen the partnership and support to the development of the school programs and projects.', 'The school frequently manifested the conduct of monitoring and evaluation of school programs, projects and activities.', 'The school frequently manifested the implementation of client satisfaction survey to the stakeholders.', 'The school always manifested and achieved the average or very satisfactory rating in the individual performance commitment review.', 'The school always manifested the average rating in the office performance commitment and review during the conduct of monitoring and evaluation.', 'The school always manifested the conduct of School LAC Session to address the needs of every teachers and responds to the demand of the learners.', 'The school adheres to the continuous professional development of teachers through attending seminar and workshops conducted in the Department of education.', 'The school rarely manifested the rewards and recognitions of its personnel. ', 'N/A', 'The school manifested the teacher workload and evenly and fairly distributed to all teachers. ', 'The school frequently conducted the inspection of infrastructure and facilities done by the school Facilities In-charge. ', 'The school had an initiative in the provision of improvement its infrastructure and facilities.', 'N/A', 'The school has no functional water system and internet connection which can hinder sometimes the delivery of basic services to the learners.', 'The school has no functional computer laboratory which can affect the delivery of lesson anchored to the ICT integration of the topics.', 'The school always manifested  the 72-100% utilization of MOOE', 'The school manifested the 100% utilization of school MOOE which covers all the needs in the Annual Implementation and procurement plans.'),
(6, 'While waiting for the ELLNA result, continue doing the best practices in conducting the ELLNA  at the school.', 'While waiting for the ELLNA result, continue doing the best practices in conducting the NAT at the school.', 'NA', 'The materials must be quality assured.', 'The school must continue this kind of activity as their best practices.', 'consistently reviewed and monitored the integration of peace and core values in all topics', '', 'NA', 'Include clear guidelines for reporting and addressing bullying incidents, along with timely follow-up actions.', 'The school should continue to reinforce its protective measures by regularly reviewing and updating its child protection policies.', 'These findings suggest that targeted interventions, increased student engagement, and community support have effectively reduced drop-out rates. However, ongoing efforts are necessary to maintain and further improve this progress.', 'To further enhance inclusivity and unity, it is recommended that the school continue implementing regular culture-sensitive activities while expanding their scope to include more diverse cultural perspectives. ', 'Regular assessment and feedback mechanisms should be implemented to evaluate the effectiveness of these projects and ensure they meet the evolving needs of students.', 'Involving the local community and parents in promoting the program can help increase enrollment and engagement, ensuring its sustainability and impact.', 'To maintain and enhance the effectiveness of the child-protection committee, it is recommended that the school continue to provide regular training for all staff on child protection policies, emerging issues, and intervention strategies. ', 'To maintain the DRRM plan’s effectiveness, the school should regularly update it to address new risks and incorporate feedback from drills and real-life events.', 'To strengthen the support system for mental wellness, the school should expand access to counseling services and mental health resources, ensuring they are available to all students. ', 'o further enhance inclusivity, the school should continue improving and maintaining its special education and PWD-friendly facilities.', 'The school should allocate sufficient resources and provide professional development for staff to support the effective implementation of the plan.', 'To strengthen the impact of the school-community planning team, it is recommended that the team continue fostering regular communication and collaboration with all stakeholders. ', 'SELG adviser involvement is crucial to the success of the student leadership program, but continued attention and support are necessary for sustained effectiveness.', 'To ensure continuous improvement, the school should regularly gather and analyze stakeholder feedback to identify areas for enhancement. ', 'The school should regularly check the progress of the strategic plan and make changes as needed. Ongoing monitoring and flexibility will help keep the plan on track and ensure it is effectively carried out.', 'To sustain its impact, the SGC should maintain regular involvement and periodically evaluate its activities to ensure continuous improvement and alignment with the school\'s goals.', 'Encouraging feedback and shared decision-making will further improve the effectiveness of this partnership.', 'The school should improve its partnership with the stakeholder by maintaining regular communication, working together on plans, participating in school events, and encouraging feedback.', 'It is important to establish a feedbacking with stakeholders to assess effectiveness and identify areas for improvement. ', 'The school should concentrate on enhancing key areas to improve performance and increase stakeholder satisfaction, aiming for progress beyond the current average rating.', 'The school should keep offering professional development and support to teachers to maintain and improve their performance, ensuring the \"Very Satisfactory\" rating is sustained.\r\n', 'The school should keep improving its practices and focus on growth areas to maintain its \"Very Satisfactory\" rating and ensure lasting success. Regular reviews and updates will help maintain high performance.', 'Regular evaluations and professional development will help sustain and enhance these practices for long-term improvement.', 'The school should maintain its professional development efforts, regularly assessing and adjusting them to address changing needs. Providing continuous support and resources for teachers will ensure ongoing success and enhance teaching quality.', 'The school should improve its award and reward system by introducing more impactful and varied recognition methods to better inspire and involve school personnel, creating a positive and effective work environment.', 'Regular audits and feedback mechanisms will help maintain efficiency, prevent errors, and ensure staff satisfaction.', 'The school should continue monitoring the distribution of teacher workload regularly to ensure fairness and address any potential imbalances promptly, ensuring a sustainable and supportive work environment.', 'The school should continue conducting regular inspections and assessments of its infrastructure to ensure ongoing safety, efficiency, and necessary improvements.', 'Regular assessments and strategic planning will ensure the sustainability and effectiveness of these improvements.', 'The school should improve the learning resources room by reorganizing it for better accessibility, expanding the variety of resources available, and integrating modern technology to support diverse learning needs and enhance teaching effectiveness.', 'The school should consistently monitor and maintain its water and electricity systems, adopting energy-saving and water-conserving measures to ensure sustainability and lower costs.', 'The school should continue to collaborate with the Division ITO to secure the necessary ICT resources, ensuring the effective integration of technology into education and improving access to digital learning tools for both students and teachers.', 'The school should continue monitoring and planning the allocation of its MOOE to ensure optimal use of resources and long-term sustainability, adjusting as needed to meet evolving operational needs.', 'The school should enhance its liquidation practices to ensure full accountability and timely reporting of MOOE funds. Regular monitoring and staff training will improve compliance and transparency.', '129248', '2024', 'The school requested the result  from the division office on time.', 'The school requested the result  from the division office on time.', 'NA', 'Sustain the best practices in the context of contextualized materials to develop learners needs.', 'The school has established school-based reading intervention program.', 'The integration of promoting peace and the DepEd Core Values should be consistently reviewed and monitored.', 'It is recommended that the school head regularly supervise the test-item analysis following each grading period to ensure a thorough evaluation of student performance, identify areas for improvement, and enhance teaching strategies for future assessments.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'NA', 'To intensify the implementation, a more systematic approach to policy enforcement, increased staff training, and student engagement in anti-bullying campaigns are recommended.', 'Although no child abuse incidents have been reported, it is essential to maintain vigilance and continue reinforcing protective measures to ensure a safe and nurturing environment for all students.', 'These findings indicate that a combination of targeted interventions, enhanced student engagement, and community support have successfully contributed to reducing the drop-out incidence, but continuous efforts should be made to sustain and build on this progress.', 'The implementation of regular culture-sensitive activities has proven to be beneficial in promoting inclusivity and unity within the school, but continued efforts are necessary to ensure all students feel supported and respected.', 'The school’s initiative is a promising step toward supporting disadvantaged learners, but continued efforts and additional resources are needed to maximize the impact of these projects.', 'This initiative highlights the school’s commitment to inclusive education, but ongoing collaboration and resource allocation are essential for its success.', 'These findings suggest that the child-protection committee is effectively contributing to student safety, but continuous training and monitoring are essential to maintain its effectiveness.', 'The school is well-prepared for disaster response, but ongoing updates, training, and community engagement are necessary to maintain and improve the plan\'s effectiveness.', 'These findings suggest that the school has a strong support system for mental wellness, but ongoing efforts are needed to expand access and increase awareness.', 'These findings highlight the importance of expanding access to mental health services and resources to meet the growing needs of students, ensuring all students have equal opportunities for support.\r\n', 'The school has a well-developed strategic plan in place, but regular monitoring and adjustments are needed to stay aligned with evolving needs and challenges.', ' The school-community planning team is effective, but continued engagement and clear communication will further strengthen its impact.', 'These findings indicate that the school’s SELG is functioning well in terms of leadership and representation, but continuous support and guidance are essential to maintain its effectiveness and ensure meaningful student involvement.', 'These findings indicate that the school’s innovation in frontline services has improved efficiency and accessibility, but ongoing attention to stakeholder feedback and adaptation is crucial for continuous improvement.', 'The implementation of the strategic plan is effective, but continuous evaluation and adaptability are essential for sustained success.', 'Findings indicate that the SGC is functioning, but continuous involvement and regular evaluation of its activities will ensure its sustained impact on school governance.', 'The partnership with the SPTA is beneficial, but maintaining and strengthening this collaboration will ensure continued success and support for the school community.', 'Partnership with the SPTA through regular communication, joint planning, and active involvement in school events, while encouraging feedback and shared decision-making to enhance collaboration.', 'SMEA process is a valuable tool for improving school quality, but ongoing engagement and follow-up actions are necessary to sustain progress.', 'Findings suggest that while the school has maintained an average rating, continuous efforts to improve in key areas could enhance its performance and increase stakeholder satisfaction.', 'The school has successfully maintained a high standard of teacher performance, but ongoing professional development and support are essential to sustain and further improve the VS rating.', 'Findings suggest that the school has consistently met high standards, but efforts to maintain and build upon this performance will ensure continued success and growth.', 'The school LAC practices are highly effective, but ongoing support and adaptation are necessary to sustain and further improve these practices.', 'The school is on the right track with its professional development initiatives, but ongoing effort and adaptation are essential for continued success and improvement.', 'While some recognition exists, the award and reward system could be improved to better motivate and engage school personnel.', 'The school is on the right path in improving compensation management, but continuous monitoring and adaptation of strategies are necessary to maintain efficiency and avoid errors.', 'The school is effectively managing teacher workload, but continued monitoring is essential to ensure fairness and prevent future imbalances.', 'The school is committed to maintaining its facilities but should continue regular assessments to ensure continued safety, efficiency, and improvement.', 'The school is taking important steps toward improving its infrastructure, but continued effort and strategic planning will be necessary to sustain and maximize these improvements.\r\n', 'While the learning resources room exists, improvements in organization, resource variety, and technological integration are needed to enhance its functionality.', 'Findings suggest that while the water and electric facilities are functioning, continuous monitoring and improvements are necessary for their long-term sustainability.', 'While the school is taking steps to secure the necessary ICT resources, continued collaboration with the Division ITO is crucial for improving technology access and integration in education.\r\n', 'The school is effectively managing its MOOE, but continued monitoring and planning are necessary to ensure long-term sustainability and optimal resource use.', 'While the school is effectively using its MOOE, there is a need for improved practices and systems to ensure 100% liquidation of the funds.'),
