(15, 'Continue train the teachers to address the barriers.', 'Remain the strategy that promotes 21st century skills.', 'Continue scouting out of school youth in enrolling ALS.', 'Keep on doing contextualize learning materials.', 'Keep on implementing remediations.', 'Continue integrating the DepEd core values in the lesson.', 'Be sure to make item analysis to address the least learned competency.', 'N/A', 'Strengthen in promoting anti bullying in school. ', 'N/A', 'Continue monitoring learner\'s progress.  ', 'Continue promoting culture sensitive environment.', 'Keep on providing access to disadvantage learners.', 'N/A', 'Continue promoting the CPP.', 'As much as possible implement the functional DRRM  plan to avoid untowards incident in school.', 'Keep on supporting teachers mental wellness.', 'N/A', 'Make it a habit to follow the plan. ', 'Continue strengthen the partnership to stakeholders.', 'Seek help to motivate the SSG.', 'Continue the good partnership to stakeholders. ', 'Continue follow the strategic plan.', 'Conduct orientation to SGC Officer about their functions.', 'Continue empowering PTA for the beterment of the school. ', 'Keep collaborates to stakeholders to have a good partnership. ', 'Continue monitor and evaluate.', 'Maintain the good connections to internal and external stakeholders.', 'Continue seek professional development.', 'Continue perform well to maintain the VS rating.', 'Keep on addressing the learning gaps.', 'Continue to learn.', 'N/A', 'Continue doing good in delivering the needs of every learners. ', 'Seek help to the higher ups to address the needs.', 'Continue monitor and inspect.', 'Keep aiming what is best for the school.', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'Continue  utilize the MMOE for the betterment of the school.', 'Continue submitting the MOOE liquidation on time. ', '129230', '2024', 'The school address the barriers in coping up  language, literacy, and numeracy skills.', 'The school practice the new methodologies to produce 21st century learners.', 'Through ALS no one will be left behind.', 'The school promotes contextualized materials to empower learners in achieving learning outcomes that they deserve. ', 'The school implement remediation to improves retention.', 'Promoting the DepEd core values in school help the learners become a responsible citizen.', 'Item analysis should be make to identify the least learned competency.', 'N/A', 'The school need to monitor the incident of bullying.', 'N/A', 'The school constantly monitor the performance of every learner.', 'The school promotes culture sensitive to help the learners appreciate their differences.', 'The school give access to disadvantage learners to promote inclusivity.', 'N/A', 'The school implement CPC in assuring the safety of every learners.', 'The school failed to implement the functional DRRM plan which can lead to some unwanted incident in the school.', 'The school had support in mental wellness of every teacher to deliver quality education to learners.', 'N/A', 'Strategic plan will give right direction to every school.', 'Good partnership to stakeholders will lead the school improved.', 'Give orientation to SSG about their functions.', 'The school always strengthen their partnership to stakeholders.', 'The school implemented the strategic plan to function well.', 'The school failed to empower the SGC to function well.', 'The strengthen the strong partnership with the parents.', 'The school extended their connections to stakeholders.', 'The schools conduct monitoring and evaluation to give feedback its programs, projects and activities. ', 'The school maintains the connection between external and internal stakeholders for school improvement. ', 'The teachers should perform well to achieve a very satisfactory rating. ', 'The school achieves the very satisfactory rating.', 'Through SLAC the school address the learning gaps.', 'Professional development helps the teachers improve their skills. ', 'N/A', 'The teachers free from stress because they are paid what is due to them.', 'The teacher deserved fair and equitable workload. ', 'Monitoring the infrastructure and facilities will help the school avoid untoward incidents.', 'Doing improvements infrastructure will lead the school become conducive for learning .', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'The school utilizes the MOOE to address the need of the school.', 'The school promote in submitting MOOE liquidation on time '),
(16, 'Conduct regular trainings and LAC session for teachers to enhance their teaching strategies in the conduct of ELLN.', 'Compare the diagnostic test result of the grade 6 pupils to their post test result to measure the proficiency level and learning gaps of the pupils.', 'N/A', 'Leverage ICT tools to develop and enhance contextualized learning materials for more effective and engaging instruction.', 'Continue the use of effective strategy that addresses the learning gaps of the pupils.', 'Promote a culture of peace and integrate the DepEd core values in all school programs and activities.', 'Conduct the test item analysis regularly.', 'N/A', 'Establish a schedule for periodic review and updating of anti-bullying policies.', 'Implementing effective policies, programs, and practices that prioritize child safety, protection, and overall well-being.', 'The implementation of regular home visitations has proven to be an effective strategy in reducing dropout rates.', 'By promoting belonging and mutual respect, the school strengthens community ties and builds a positive, inclusive culture that benefits all stakeholders', 'Address these challenges through community involvement and partnership ', 'N/A', 'To enhance the effectiveness of CPP Committee it should be supported by clear policies and actively engage pupils, parents   and stakeholders  to maintain strong and protective school culture.', 'Continue to implement what has been indicated in the contingency planning. ', 'Integrate the the health and wellness program across academic learning areas. ', 'Include the budgetary requirement in the AIP.', 'Continue the good rapport in the community.', 'Sustain the good relationship of the school from its stakeholders. ', 'Empower the SPG adviser to organize activities to mentor SPG members to practice leadership skills.', 'Enhance the frontline service mechanisms to ensure efficiency, accessibility, and customer satisfaction.', 'Develop a regular assessment schedule such as 