ving the community.', 'The school has been supported by the stakeholders.', 'The school\'s SPG lacks sufficient leadership training to effectively fulfill their responsibilities.', 'The school has less connection when it comes to its provision of frontline services to stakeholders.', 'The school is lack of regular assessment to track progress and identify areas that needing adjustment.', 'The school has a functional SGC but needs to strengthen deep understanding of the policies and procedures.', 'The functional PTA contributes to the continuous improvement of the school. ', 'The school conducted quarterly or special meetings with stakeholders to strengthen partnership. ', 'The school has frequently manifested to monitor and evaluate its programs, projects and activities due to overlapping activities.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
