ining on child-protection laws and case management', 'Partner with LGUs and agencies for resources; request updated rescue kits', 'Train teachers as mental health first-aiders; strengthen advocacy campaigns', 'Lobby for additional facilities, train teachers in SPED, strengthen inclusive education', 'Provide capacity-building workshops on strategic planning; strengthen monitoring and evaluation mechanisms', 'Enhance stakeholder engagement strategies; schedule planning activities at convenient times; provide recognition to active members', 'Sustain leadership training programs; expand student participation in decision-making and school governance', 'Adopt cost-efficient innovations; partner with LGUs and NGOs for support; utilize ICT-based platforms for stakeholder services', 'Strengthen monitoring and alignment of implementation plan with SIP priorities', 'Conduct regular orientation and capacity building for SGC members', 'Strengthen parent engagement through orientations, recognition, and partnership-building', 'Broaden partnerships through MOUs, recognition activities, and joint programs', 'Standardize documentation processes and integrate monitoring in LAC sessions', 'Provide continuous mentoring and coaching to sustain and further improve performance', 'Align office targets with available resources and strengthen monitoring', 'Broaden L&D activities with external partners and resource persons', 'Continue its strong support for career advancement and capacity-building of its personnel.', 'Enhance recognition through creative, non-monetary incentives and stakeholder support', 'Strengthen coordination with division office to avoid delays and  ensures personnel’s financial security and so as to reinforce trust in school systems.', 'Regularly review teacher workload and adjust as needed', 'Request support from LGU and DepEd engineers for technical evaluation', 'Strengthen linkages with LGUs and NGOs for additional resources', 'Establish a functional library to enrich