(259, '2026', '129433', '', '', 'Not applicable', '', '', '', '', 'Not applicable', '', '', 'Family support and teacher guidance keep learners staying in school.', '', 'Inclusive programs and community partnerships open doors for every learner.', 'Dedicated ALS teachers and community support help out-of-school learners return.', '', '', 'Caring teachers and counseling services support every learner\'s emotional well-being.', 'Accessible facilities and inclusive practices support every learner\'s right to education.', '', '', '', 'Openness to new ideas and stakeholder feedback drives better service delivery.   .', '', 'Active SGC members and strong leadership keep governance effective and responsive. ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Adequate reading materials and a dedicated librarian keep the library actively serving learners.', '', 'Available equipment and trained teachers make the computer laboratory useful and effective. ', '', '', 'Dedicated teachers and supportive parents help Grade 3 learners achieve proficiency.', 'Strong teaching, parental support, and practice help learners pass NAT.', '', 'Knowing learners\' needs inspires teachers to create better learning materials', 'Identifying learning gaps early helps teachers plan effective remediation activities.\"', 'Teachers\' commitment and DepEd\'s clear values guide meaningful lesson integration', 'Test results guide teachers in improving lessons and learning outcomes.', '', 'Strong school rules and caring teachers prevent bullying effectively.', 'Active child protection policies keep every learner safe always.', '', 'Respect for local culture enriches school programs and learner participation.', '', '', 'An active committee ensures every child\'s rights are protected daily.', 'Prepared staff and clear protocols keep the school community safe.', '', '', 'Collaborative planning and clear school goals drive effective strategic development.', 'Active community involvement and strong leadership make planning teams effective.', 'Supportive advisers and engaged pupils strengthen student government participation and leadership.   ', '', 'Clear action plans and committed staff ensure strategic goals are achieved.', '', 'Engaged parents and supportive teachers make the PTA strong and effective.', 'Open communication and shared goals build strong and lasting school partnerships.', 'Regular monitoring and honest evaluation help improve school programs and outcomes. ', 'Responsive service and continuous improvement earn trust and satisfaction from stakeholders.', 'Clear performance goals and regular feedback motivate personnel to perform excellently. ', 'Strong teamwork and accountable leadership drive the school\'s overall performance excellence. ', 'Identifying real training needs ensures LAC sessions are relevant and meaningful. ', 'Supportive leadership and available training opportunities encourage personnel growth and advancement. ', 'A culture of appreciation and recognition inspires personnel to excel continuously. ', 'Efficient administrative processes and accurate records ensure timely and correct compensation.', 'Transparent workload distribution and open communication promote fairness among all teachers. ', 'Regular inspection schedules and responsible personnel ensure facilities remain safe and functional.', 'Community support and available funds drive timely infrastructure improvement and maintenance.', '', 'Proper maintenance and timely repairs ensure uninterrupted utility services for the school.', '', 'Careful budget planning and timely procurement ensure maximum utilization of MOOE funds.', 'Accurate financial records and prompt reporting ensure full and timely MOOE liquidation.', 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 6, 6, 2, 6, 6, 2, 2, 2, 6, 2, 1, 1, 4, 1, 1, 2, 2, 6, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 6, 3, 1, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'We commit to nurturing every Grade 3 learner\'s language and numeracy skills.', 'We commit to stronger teaching and better preparation for NAT', 'The school has no school-based ALS Program', 'We commit to creating learning materials that truly fit our learners', 'We commit to regular remediation until every learner catches up', 'We commit to weaving peace and good values in every lesson.', 'We commit to using test results to improve our teaching daily.', 'The school has not offered TLE-TVL Program', 'We commit to maintaining a safe and bully-free school environment.', 'We commit to protecting every child from any form of abuse.', 'We commit to keeping every learner engaged and staying in school.', 'We commit to honoring local culture in all school activities.', 'We commit to opening equal learning opportunities for every marginalized learner.', 'We commit to strengthening ALS programs to reach every out-of-school learner.', 'We commit to keeping our child protection committee active and responsive.', ' We commit to regularly updating and practicing our school\'s DRRM plan.', 'We commit to nurturing every learner\'s mental health and emotional well-being.', 'We commit to improving facilities that support every learner\'s accessibility needs.', 'We commit to developing a clear and responsive school strategic plan.', 'We commit to keeping our school-community planning team active and engaged.', 'We commit to empowering our SPG to lead with purpose and integrity.', 'We commit to continuously improving our frontline services for every stakeholder.', 'We commit to faithfully implementing our strategic plan for school improvement', 'We commit to maintaining an active and responsible School Governance Council.\r\nThe school has a functional Parent-Teacher Association (PTA).\r\n', 'We commit to strengthening PTA participation for the benefit of every learner.', 'We commit to building meaningful collaborations that benefit our learners and community.', 'We commit to consistently monitoring all programs to ensure quality and effectiveness.', 'We commit to supporting every personnel in achieving their best performance rating.', 'We commit to working together to maintain a very satisfactory office performance.', 'We commit to conducting LAC and L&D activities based on actual personnel needs.', 'We commit to actively supporting the professional growth and promotion of every personnel.', 'We commit to consistently recognizing and celebrating the achievements of our dedicated personnel.', 'We commit to ensuring every personnel receives correct and timely salaries and allowances.', 'We commit to distributing teacher workload fairly to support balance and well-being.', 'We commit to conducting regular inspections to keep all school facilities safe.', 'We commit to initiating facility improvements that support a better learning environment.', 'We commit to maintaining a functional library that supports every learner\'s reading needs.', 'We commit to ensuring all utility facilities remain functional and accessible for everyone.', 'We commit to keeping our computer laboratory functional and ready for every learner.', 'We commit to wisely utilizing our MOOE to support school programs and needs.', 'We commit to liquidating all utilized MOOE completely and in a timely manner.', 'We commit to delivering quality service that meets and exceeds stakeholder expectations.', 1, 16, 12, 61),
