rting procedures\r\n', 'Sustain drills and safety compliance', '*Partner with LGU health office for mental health support \r\n*Conduct mental health awareness sessions\r\n', 'Maintain safety and accessibility; enhance facilities if needed', 'Continue SIP alignment and annual reviews', 'Strengthen coordination and ensure scheduled meetings', 'Continue training and leadership programs \r\n\r\n', 'Sustain and enhance digital systems (enrollment, feedback) ', 'Continue monitoring through M&E tools', 'Maintain engagement and conduct quarterly assemblies. \r\n\r\n', 'Sustain transparency and involvement \r\n\r\n', 'Strengthen MOAs and annual partnership review', 'Continue quarterly M&E and documentation', '*Sustain coaching and mentoring sessions \r\n*Continue providing technical assistance during performance planning and review \r\n*Maintain clear communication of performance expectations\r\n', '*Continue strengthening teamwork and school-wide planning \r\n*Maintain alignment of programs with performance targets \r\n*Enhance documentation of OPCRF accomplishments\r\n', '*Sustain needs-based LAC sessions \r\n*Expand L&D opportunities based on new teacher needs \r\n*Improve monitoring of LAC outputs and implementation\r\n', '*Continue providing opportunities for CPD and training \r\n*Strengthen linkages with external PD providers \r\n*Promote participation in specialization and leadership programs\r\n', '*Create a yearly recognition plan and calendar \r\n*Allocate funds for awards during celebrations and ceremonies \r\n*Improve documentation and nomination processes\r\n', '*Maintain prompt compliance with payroll requirements \r\n*Continue coordinating with finance offices for timely release. \r\n\r\n', '*Sustain fair workload distribution \r\n*Review duties regularly to ensure workload balance\r\n', '*Maintain routine inspections \r\n*Improve reporting and documentation through inspection forms\r\n', '*Continue planning and implementing improvement projects \r\n*Strengthen partnerships with LGUs and stakeholders\r\n', '*Continue improving library resources \r\n*Promote reading programs and literacy activities\r\n', '*Maintain utility inspections \r\n*Improve internet connections through available programs \r\n\r\n', '*Upgrade ICT equipment as needed \r\n*Continue training teachers on ICT integration \r\n\r\n', '*Sustain effective budgeting and expenditure practices \r\n*Improve transparency through posting and reporting \r\n', '*Maintain timely liquidation \r\n*Strengthen record-keeping and audit preparation \r\n\r\n', '*Establish stakeholder satisfaction survey \r\n*Conduct regular dialogues and feedback sessions \r\n*Improve responsiveness in school services\r\n', 1, 1, 12, 61),
