.', 'Implement the plan accordingly.', 'Implement the plan accordingly.', 'Continue the good practice', 'Assign one personnel to regularly handle the program.', 'Continue the strict implementation and evaluation.', 'Ensure the sincerest commitment of stakeholders.', 'Continue the good practice', 'Maintain the good rapport and connection', 'Continue the good practice.', 'Maintain the good standing if not improve more.', 'Continue the good practice.', 'Continue the implementing the program', 'Inspire potential teachers to go on despite adversities  and  request that the division give prior concern.', 'Continue the program and practice.', 'Maintain the best practice.', 'Maintain fairness at all times.', 'Regularly maintain the activity  every end of the SY.', 'Continue the  initiative.', 'Maintain the provision of functional library', 'Assure that water and electricity are available at all times.', 'Increase the number of computer units in school.', 'Maintain the good track of financial record', 'Maintain the good practice.', 'Keep up the good work.', 0, 122, 12, 57),
