(280, '2026', '128263', '', 'Large class sizes and diverse learner needs affecting individualized instruction. Inconsistent parental support in reinforcing learning at home.\r\nAttendance issues and learning interruptions impacting continuity of learning.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Occasional unreported or unnoticed bullying cases, Limited awareness among learners on reporting mechanisms', 'Fear of reporting abuse cases, \r\nNeed for stronger coordination with stakeholders', 'Attendance issues due to economic and family-related factors', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Limited infrastructure and assistive facilities,\r\nInsufficient specialized learning resources,\r\nNeed for continuous improvement of accessibility', '', '', '', '', '', 'Irregular meetings and participation due to work and personal commitments of stakeholders.', '', '', 'Limited time for thorough monitoring, Need for improved evaluation tools', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Lack of library space and facilities,\r\nInsufficient books and learning resources,\r\nNo designated library personnel', '', '', '', '', 'Strong Implementation of Foundational Programs, Regular Assessment and Data-Driven Instruction', '', 'Flexible learning schedules and delivery modes suited to the needs of ALS learners.', 'Regular LAC sessions and professional development.Use of assessment data and learner profiles to guide the design of appropriate materials.', 'Collaboration among teachers in designing and sharing remediation strategies.', 'Strong alignment with the core values of the Department of Education (Maka-Diyos, Maka-Tao, Makakalikasan, Makabansa) in lesson planning and delivery. Integration of peace education and values formation in daily classroom activities and discussions.', 'Availability of tools and templates for efficient item analysis.', '', '', '', '', 'Regular conduct of inclusive and culture-based activities,\r\nTeachers’ awareness of cultural diversity and inclusivity,\r\nSupport from stakeholders and community', 'Implementation of inclusive education and ALS programs, \r\nFlexible learning modalities and schedules', 'Active implementation of ALS program, Support from school leadership and stakeholders', 'Established child protection policies and committee,\r\nRegular orientation and awareness programs,\r\nActive involvement of stakeholders', 'Established DRRM plan and policies,\r\nRegular conduct of drills and simulations,\r\nActive DRRM coordinator and school support', 'Implementation of mental wellness programs and activities', 'Presence of SPED program and inclusive practices,\r\nSupport from school leadership and stakeholders', 'Active school leadership in planning processes,\r\nAvailability of school data for planning,\r\nCollaboration among stakeholders', 'Established planning team structure, Regular collaboration and coordination, Support from school leadership and stakeholders', 'Active student government organization,\r\nSupport from teacher-advisers,\r\nConduct of leadership activities and programs', 'Use of innovative practices and digital tools', 'Clear implementation plan aligned with strategic goals,\r\nActive monitoring and evaluation by school leaders,\r\nAvailability of resources and defined responsibilities', '', 'Active PTA organization and leadership,\r\nRegular meetings and school activities,\r\nStrong partnership between teachers and parents', 'Strong partnership with stakeholders. Active communication and collaboration initiatives,\r\nSupport from school leadership', '', 'Regular feedback from stakeholders,\r\nPositive school-community relationships,\r\nContinuous improvement of services', 'Regular performance monitoring and coaching', 'Clear roles and responsibilities, Strong leadership and supervision,\r\nEstablished performance monitoring system', 'Regular conduct of LAC sessions,\r\nCollaboration among teachers', 'Active participation in LAC sessions and seminars,\r\nCommitment of personnel to professional growth', 'Established recognition programs and activities', 'Efficient administrative processes\r\nCoordination with relevant offices\r\nProper documentation and monitoring', 'Clear designation of roles and responsibilities, Collaboration and teamwork among teachers', 'Regular monitoring and inspection schedules,\r\nActive involvement of school personnel', 'Support from stakeholders and partners,\r\nProper planning of improvement projects', '', 'Available basic utility connections, Regular monitoring and maintenance', 'Existing computer units and facilities, \r\nICT integration in teaching', 'Proper budget planning and allocation,\r\nEfficient financial management system,\r\nActive monitoring of fund utilization', 'Organized documentation system,\r\nCoordination among school personnel,\r\nCompliance with financial guidelines', 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 1, 2, 2, 6, 5, 2, 2, 6, 1, 2, 2, 6, 6, 1, 6, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'The school commits to sustain foundational programs such as ELLN and interventions while conducting regular assessments and utilizing data to guide instruction, provide targeted support, and monitor learner progress through continuous teacher development, adequate resources, stakeholder involvement, and effective monitoring.', 'The school commits to address large class sizes and diverse learner needs through differentiated instruction, strengthen parental engagement to support learning at home, and implement strategies to improve attendance and ensure continuity of learning.', 'The school commits to sustain and enhance flexible learning schedules and delivery modes tailored to ALS learners’ needs to ensure accessibility, engagement, and successful completion of the program.', 'The school commits to strengthen regular LAC sessions and professional development while consistently utilizing assessment data and learner profiles to guide the design of contextualized and responsive learning materials.', 'The school commits to strengthen collaboration among teachers through regular sharing of best practices and joint planning in designing effective remediation strategies to address learners’ needs.', 'The school commits to ensure strong alignment of lesson planning and delivery with the core values of the Department of Education and to consistently integrate peace education and values formation in daily classroom activities and discussions.', 'The school commits to ensure the availability and effective use of standardized tools and templates to support efficient and accurate test item analysis.', '', 'The school commits to strengthen anti-bullying programs, ensure consistent monitoring, and promote awareness of reporting mechanisms among learners and stakeholders.', 'The school commits to strengthen child protection mechanisms, increase awareness on reporting procedures, and enhance collaboration with stakeholders to ensure learner safety.', 'The school commits to strengthen attendance monitoring, enhance parental engagement, and implement intervention programs to sustain learner retention.', 'The school commits to strengthen culture-sensitive activities by integrating local culture in programs and increasing stakeholder participation.', 'The school commits to strengthen inclusive programs by improving learner identification, ensuring access to learning opportunities, and enhancing stakeholder collaboration.', 'The school commits to sustain and strengthen the ALS program through adequate resources, regular monitoring, and continuous support to learners.', 'The school commits to strengthen the child protection committee through regular training, consistent monitoring, and increased awareness among stakeholders.', 'The school commits to strengthen DRRM implementation through regular drills, continuous training, and provision of necessary resources.', 'The school commits to strengthen mental wellness support through awareness programs, stakeholder collaboration, and accessible support mechanisms.', 'The school commits to improve SPED and PWD-friendly facilities by enhancing accessibility, providing appropriate resources, and strengthening inclusive practices.', 'The school commits to strengthen strategic planning through active stakeholder participation, regular review, and effective monitoring of implementation.', 'The school commits to strengthen the planning team through regular meetings, improved communication, and active stakeholder participation.', 'The school commits to strengthen student leadership through continuous training, active participation, and consistent guidance and monitoring.', 'The school commits to enhance frontline services through innovation, use of technology, and improved feedback systems to better serve stakeholders.', 'The school commits to ensure effective implementation of its strategic plan through regular monitoring, alignment of activities, and timely execution of programs.', 'The school commits to strengthen the SGC through regular meetings, improved communication, and active stakeholder participation.', 'The school commits to strengthen PTA engagement through regular communication, active participation, and collaboration in school programs.', 'The school commits to strengthen partnerships through continuous coordination, active engagement, and collaborative programs with stakeholders and other schools.', 'The school commits to strengthen monitoring and evaluation through consistent documentation, improved tools, and regular review of programs and activities.', 'The school commits to sustain high performance through continuous professional development, coaching, and effective workload management.', 'The school commits to strengthen office performance through improved coordination, timely completion of tasks, and consistent monitoring.', 'The school commits to strengthen LAC implementation through regular scheduling, relevant topics, and active participation of teachers.', 'The school commits to support continuous professional development through