(318, '2026', '304328', 'n/a', 'At Davao Oriental Regional Science High School (DORSHS), while a significant number of learners demonstrate strong academic performance, not all Grade 10 and Grade 12 students consistently reach the required proficiency levels in the National Achievement Test (NAT). Gaps are evident in higher-order thinking skills and application-based competencies, particularly in Mathematics and Science. There is also a need for more structured and sustained NAT-focused review programs, improved utilization of assessment data for targeted interventions, and more consistent performance across subject areas.', 'n/a', 'At Davao Oriental Regional Science High School (DORSHS), teachers demonstrate efforts in developing contextualized learning materials; however, not all materials are consistently aligned with the diverse needs, learning styles, and local context of learners. Some challenges include limited time for material development, varying levels of teacher expertise in contextualization, and insufficient access to localized references or updated instructional resources. Additionally, there is a need for stronger collaboration among teachers to standardize and share best practices.', 'At Davao Oriental Regional Science High School (DORSHS), teachers regularly conduct remediation activities; however, not all learners consistently benefit from these interventions due to varying levels of participation and engagement. Challenges include limited time for remedial sessions, insufficient individualized instruction for learners with persistent gaps, and occasional lack of appropriate instructional materials for targeted remediation. Monitoring and tracking the effectiveness of remediation programs also needs strengthening.', 'At DORSHS, teachers regularly integrate lessons on peace, social responsibility, and DepEd core values into their instruction. However, some learners still show inconsistent understanding or application of these values, particularly in collaborative activities or conflict resolution scenarios. Challenges include limited time to fully explore these topics and variability in teachers’ approaches to contextualizing values education across different subjects.\r\n\r\n', 'At DORSHS, teachers regularly perform test item analysis, yet some challenges remain in consistently using the results to adjust instruction and address specific learning gaps. Limited time for collaborative analysis and varying teacher proficiency in interpreting item statistics can reduce the impact of this practice.\r\n\r\n', 'n/a', 'At DORSHS, bullying cases are rare but occasional peer conflicts occur that require monitoring. Teachers and staff sometimes need additional training in proactive intervention strategies.', '', 'Some learners still face personal, financial, or family challenges that could lead to dropping out.', '', '', 'n/a', '', '', '', 'Facilities exist but may require upgrades to fully accommodate all learners with special needs; some accessibility features need improvement.', 'At DORSHS, a strategic plan is regularly developed, but some areas lack clear timelines, measurable targets, or follow-up monitoring, which can limit its full impact.', 'While the planning team is active, some community stakeholders have inconsistent participation, and coordination among members can be strengthened.', 'The school has a functional Supreme Student Leaders Government (SSLG)', 'DORSHS regularly implements innovative approaches, but some processes can be delayed due to limited resources or coordination challenges.', 'At DORSHS, implementation plans exist to operationalize the strategic plan, but some activities lack clear timelines or measurable indicators, and monitoring can be inconsistent.', 'The SGC is minimally active at DORSHS, limiting participatory governance and stakeholder engagement. Challenges include unclear roles, limited member participation, and inadequate guidance for council activities.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'DORSHS currently lacks a fully functional library; limited space, resources, and staffing hinder its establishment.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Strong child-protection policies and active involvement of the child-protection committee.', '', 'Activities are well-implemented; the challenge is ensuring consistent integration in all subjects.', 'n/a', '', 'ommitted staff and clear DepEd child-protection policies.', 'School leadership support, trained personnel, and collaboration with LGU disaster units.', 'vailability of peer counselors, active mental wellness programs - AGBAY and teen Center and supportive leadership.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Strong school leadership and regular communication with parents contribute to the PTA’s functionality.', 'Existing linkages with local government units, other schools, and community stakeholders support partnerships.', 'SLAC sessions, mentoring, and leadership support enable regular program review and improvement.', 'Active engagement with learners, teachers, parents, and community members supports positive stakeholder perception', 'Regular mentoring, SLAC sessions, and administrative support help staff achieve high ratings.', 'Clear policies, administrative guidance, and collaborative SLAC sessions support high office performance.', 'SLAC sessions and mentoring programs allow teachers to collaborate, share best practices, and address professional learning needs.', 'Active HR management, mentoring, and guidance support career growth and professional development.', 'Supportive leadership and existing award programs encourage recognition and motivation.', 'Efficient finance office, clear payroll procedures, and administrative oversight.', '', 'The school has dedicated personnel for facilities management and established inspection routines.', 'Supportive leadership, collaboration with stakeholders, and access to DepEd improvement guidelines.', '', 'Existing infrastructure, administrative oversight, and staff monitoring ensure continuity of services.', 'Supportive ICT staff, available equipment, and integration into teaching and learning activities.\r\n\r\n', 'Transparent budgeting, administrative oversight, and periodic monitoring of fund usage.', 'Efficient finance office, clear procedures, and staff training.', 0, 2, 1, 1, 1, 6, 1, 1, 6, 6, 6, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 5, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 0, 2, 2, 2, 6, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 3, 0, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'n/a', 'DORSHS commits to strengthening its academic support systems by implementing a comprehensive NAT review program for Grades 10 and 12, conducting regular diagnostic and mock assessments, and integrating 21st century skills into daily instruction. The school will also enhance data-driven decision-making for remediation and enrichment, provide continuous professional development for teachers, and increase parent engagement to better support learner performance.\r\n\r\n', 'n/a', 'DORSHS commits to enhancing the development of contextualized learning materials through capacity-building activities, collaborative planning sessions, and sharing of best practices among teachers. The school will also allocate time for material development, improve access to localized and updated resources, and strengthen monitoring and evaluation to ensure materials are responsive, inclusive, and aligned with learner needs.', 'The school commits to enhancing remediation programs by scheduling regular, structured sessions, providing differentiated and learner-centered instructional materials, and monitoring learners’ progress closely. Teachers will also receive training in effective remedial strategies, and collaboration with parents will be strengthened to support learning at home.\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'DORSHS commits to strengthening the integration of peace education and core values by designing cross-curricular lesson plans, conducting regular SLAC sessions for strategy sharing, and mentoring teachers in values-oriented pedagogy. The school will also monitor learners’ application of these values through classroom activities, student councils, and school-based projects promoting harmony and responsibility.\r\n\r\n', 'DORSHS commits to institutionalizing regular test item analysis through SLAC sessions, enhancing teacher skills in data interpretation via mentoring, and systematically applying analysis results to improve lesson planning, remediation, and enrichment activities.', 'n/a', 'he school will reinforce anti-bullying programs, conduct regular orientation sessions for learners and staff, and strengthen monitoring and reporting mechanisms to maintain a safe environment.', 'Maintain strict monitoring, regular staff orientation, and coordination with local authorities to ensure learners’ safety.', 'Strengthen monitoring, provide targeted academic and psychosocial support, and engage parents and stakeholders to prevent drop-outs.', 'Continue organizing culture-sensitive programs, integrate cultural awareness in lessons, and encourage student participation in community-based projects.', 'n/a', 'n/a', 'Conduct regular training, maintain active monitoring, and coordinate with local authorities when necessary.', 'Maintain regular DRRM drills, update plans annually, and provide refresher trainings for teachers and learners.', 'Continue implementing counseling programs, monitor learner well-being, and promote mental wellness initiatives school-wide.', 'Enhance and upgrade facilities, ensure accessibility compliance, provide teacher training on inclusive education, and monitor usage to meet learners’ needs effectively.', 'The school commits to updating the strategic plan annually, setting clear targets and timelines, conducting regular monitoring, and providing mentorship to staff involved in planning.', 'Strengthen community partnerships, formalize schedules for regular meetings, and provide mentoring to team leaders to improve collaboration and planning outcomes.', 'The school will strengthen the SSLG \r\nby providing structured mentoring, conducting leadership training, engaging students in planning and school activities, and ensuring regular meetings with clear objectives.', 'The school commits to documenting and sharing innovative practices, improving service delivery efficiency, and mentoring staff to enhance frontline services for learners, parents, and the community.', 'The school will strengthen operationalization by setting clear targets, timelines, and responsibilities, conducting regular progress monitoring, and mentoring staff in plan execution.\r\n\r\n', 'The school will strengthen the SGC by providing orientation and mentoring, clarifying roles and responsibilities, and ensuring regular meetings with actionable agendas.', 'Continue strengthening the PTA through regular meetings, collaborative planning, and parent engagement in school programs and decision-making.\r\n\r\n', 'Maintain and expand partnerships through formal agreements, joint programs, and regular communication to ensure sustained collaboration.', 'The school will institutionalize systematic monitoring and evaluation, ensure documentation of results, and use findings to inform decision-making and continuous improvement.', 'Continue coaching and mentoring personnel, provide timely feedback, and support documentation of accomplishments to sustain very satisfactory performance ratings.', 'Maintain effective office practices, enhance coordination, and provide mentoring to staff to ensure sustained high OPCR ratings.', 'Continue conducting needs-based LACs and L&D activities, ensuring that training is responsive to specific teacher needs and updated with DepEd guidelines.', 'Maintain transparent promotion processes, provide timely feedback, and continue supporting professional development programs.\r\n\r\n', 'Enhance recognition programs to celebrate milestones regularly and ensure all personnel feel valued.\r\n\r\n', 'Ensure continued timely processing of salaries and benefits through monitoring, mentoring of finance staff, and systematic coordination.', '', 'Continue regular inspections, improve documentation of findings, and ensure prompt follow-up on maintenance needs.', 'Strengthen planning and coordination for facility improvement projects, ensure timely implementation, and monitor outcomes for quality assurance.', 'Establish a functional library by allocating space, acquiring books and digital resources, training personnel, and integrating library use in learning activities.\r\n\r\n', 'Maintain regular monitoring, perform preventive maintenance, and coordinate with service providers to ensure uninterrupted facilities.\r\n\r\n', 'Maintain the lab, schedule regular maintenance, provide teacher training for ICT integration, and ensure equitable learner access.\r\n\r\n', 'Continue monitoring MOOE utilization, align expenditures with planned activities, and provide mentoring for staff handling financial operations.', 'Ensure continued timely liquidation, improve documentation processes, and provide mentoring to staff to prevent delays.', 'The school will continue gathering feedback, address areas for improvement, and strengthen stakeholder communication to maintain or improve satisfaction levels.', 1, 126, 12, 103),
