(370, '2026', '128719', '', 'Some learners still struggle with reading comprehension and numeracy despite overall proficiency\r\n', '', '', '', '', 'Limited skills of some teachers in conducting item analysis and interpreting results; lack of standardized tools/templates.', 'Limited partnerships with local industries; lack of available companies for immersion/OJT; transportation and coordination challenges for learners.\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Limited time for sessions due to workload; insufficient resources/materials.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Limited updated books and learning resources \r\n', '', 'Insufficient number of computers; outdated units ', '', '', 'Strong teacher support, regular monitoring of learner progress, availability of learning materials, active parental involvement, and effective remediation/enrichment activities.', '', 'Support from family and community', 'DepEd policies and curriculum requirements , teachers training and professional development, Availability of local resources Collaboration among teachers Learning diversity of learners of needs , Strong community involvement , Access to technology , Improved learning outcomes as motivation  ,School Leadership Support.professional development\r\nAvailability of local resources\r\nCollaboration among teachers\r\nLearning diversity of learners\r\nStrong community involvement\r\nAccess to technology\r\nImproved learning environment variation\r\nStudent participation enhanced', 'Available assessment data ', 'Active teacher collaboration, use of localized examples, and integration of Department of Education core values (Maka-Diyos, Maka-tao, Makakalikasan, Makabansa) in lesson planning and classroom activities.\r\n', '', '', 'Strong anti-bullying policies and discipline system', 'Active Child Protection Committee\r\n', 'Effective attendance monitoring system\r\n', 'Support from community and stakeholders', 'Inclusive education 