red skills\r\n', 'Conduct home visits and flexible leaning Schedule', 'The school resolves and commits to the continuous preparation and use of contextualized learning materials to enhance teaching and learning. Recognizing DepEd’s thrust on contextualization, teachers shall integrate local culture, real-life experiences, and learners’ needs in instructional materials to improve understanding and engagement. The school further commits to collaboration, sharing of best practices, and continuous improvement of materials to ensure quality, relevant, and learner-centered education.', 'Conduct targeted remediation sessions ', 'Conduct LAC sessions and trainings on integrating patriotism in lessons, develop localized teaching materials, and continuously monitor and support teachers in embedding values across all learning areas.', 'Provide training on test item analysis, develop standard templates, strengthen LAC sessions for data interpretation, and ensure regular use of results to improve teaching strategies.', 'Strengthen partnerships through MOA with local industries, conduct regular stakeholder meetings, expand linkages for work immersion, and align TLE-TVL programs with industry needs.', 'Sustain awareness programs and strengthen monitoring of student behavior', 'Conduct regular orientations and improve reporting mechanisms', 'Implement intervention programs like home visitation and learner support', 'Integrate cultural practices and seek assistance from local groups', 'Expand access through flexible learning and outreach programs', 'Strengthen partnerships for resource support', 'Provide regular training and evaluation', 'Coordinate with LGU and conduct regular drills', 'Partner with experts and integrate wellness programs', 'Improve infrastructure and ensure accessibility for all learners', 'Strengthen participatory planning involving parents and community', 'Strengthen partnership with LGUs and NGOs', 'Encourage active participation in school programs', 'Introduce