 of school data for planning.', '', 'Active student participation and supportive teacher-advisers.', '', '', '', '•	Active PTA officers \r\n•	Strong communication channels (GCs, meetings) \r\n', '', '•	Existing monitoring tools and reports \r\n•	Assigned personnel for M&E\r\n', '', '•	Strong performance management system \r\n•	Supportive school leadership and mentoring \r\n•	Regular monitoring and feedback \r\n', '•	Clear office systems and procedures ', '•	Active participation of teachers \r\n•	Support from school head and LAC leaders \r\n', '•	Availability of online trainings/webinars \r\n•	Encouragement from school leadership \r\n', '•	Established recognition practices \r\n•	Support from stakeholders and PTA \r\n', '•	Established coordination with division office \r\n•	Proper documentation and submission \r\n', '•	Clear guidelines on workload distribution \r\n•	Open communication among staff \r\n', '•	Assigned personnel for inspection \r\n•	Existing inspection checklist and guidelines \r\n', '•	Support from stakeholders and LGU \r\n•	Prioritized school improvement plans \r\n', '', '•	Existing utility connections \r\n•	Support from LGU and service providers\r\n', '', '•	Approved Annual Implementation Plan (AIP) \r\n•	Trained personnel in financial management \r\n', '', 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 6, 1, 0, 6, 6, 3, 6, 2, 2, 2, 5, 6, 5, 2, 2, 6, 1, 1, 2, 6, 6, 1, 6, 1, 1, 1, 3, 6, 3, 2, 1, 3, 5, 5, 3, 3, 3, 'Strengthen reading programs, conduct parent orientations, and provide additional remediation sessions.', 'Implement intensive review classes and integrate test-taking strategies in daily lessons.', 'Improve data monitoring, strengthen community advocacy, and encourage enrollment in ALS programs.', 'Provide LAC sessions focused on material development and allocate time for collaboration.', 'Schedule regular remediation periods and use differentiated instruction strategies.', 'Conduct training/workshops and monitor integration in lesson plans.', 'Train teachers on item analysis and use results for targeted interventions.', '', 'Strengthen reporting mechanisms, conduct regular anti-bullying campaigns, and involve parents.', 'Conduct awareness seminars and ensure confidential reporting systems.', 'Strengthen intervention programs, provide financial assistance referrals, and improve learner engagement.', 'Integrate culture in curriculum and celebrate cultural events regularly.', 'Expand outreach programs and strengthen partnerships with stakeholders.', 'Provide more resources and continuous training for ALS implementers.\r\n________________________________________\r\n', 'Conduct regular capacity-building and strengthen monitoring systems.', 'Improve disaster preparedness resources and conduct frequent drills.', 'Partner with mental health professionals and conduct wellness programs.', 'Upgrade facilities and provide assistive learning materials.', 'Ensure inclusive planning with stakeholders and conduct regular reviews and updates of the strategic plan.', 'Strengthen stakeholder involvement through regular meetings and clear roles and responsibilities.', 'Provide leadership training and increase student involvement in school activities.', 'Adopt digital systems, streamline processes, and provide training for staff on innovative service delivery.', '•	Conduct orientation on implementation plan for all staff \r\n•	Strengthen monitoring through quarterly reviews \r\n•	Assign clear roles and timelines for each activity \r\n', '•	Organize and formally establish SGC \r\n•	Conduct orientation and capacity-building for members \r\n•	Schedule regular meetings and define clear functions\r\n', '•	Strengthen parent engagement through regular communication \r\n•	Conduct activities that encourage parent participation \r\n•	Recognize active parents to motivate involvement \r\n', '•	Establish formal partnerships (MOAs) \r\n•	Conduct regular stakeholder meetings \r\n•	Expand network with NGOs and other institutions \r\n', '•	Strengthen data collection and reporting system \r\n•	Conduct regular evaluation and feedback sessions \r\n•	Use results for planning and improvement \r\n', '•	Provide coaching on IPCR preparation and target setting \r\n•	Ensure timely submission through monitoring \r\n•	Conduct regular performance review sessions \r\n', '•	Improve task delegation and time management \r\n•	Strengthen documentation and reporting system \r\n•	Provide additional support or training if needed \r\n', '•	Schedule regular and well-planned LAC sessions \r\n•	Identify needs through assessment surveys \r\n•	Invite experts or use updated learning resources \r\n', '•	Encourage participation in free online trainings \r\n•	Allocate budget for professional development \r\n•	Support teachers in applying for promotion\r\n', '•	Institutionalize regular recognition programs \r\n•	Seek stakeholder support for incentives \r\n•	Promote a culture of appreciation \r\n', '•	Ensure timely submission of required documents \r\n•	Strengthen coordination with concerned offices \r\n•	Provide regular updates to personnel \r\n', '•	Review and adjust workload regularly \r\n•	Ensure transparency in task assignments \r\n•	Consider teachers’ capacity and specialization \r\n', '•	Conduct regular and documented inspections \r\n•	Maintain updated records of findings \r\n•	Address identified issues promptly \r\n', '•	Prioritize urgent infrastructure needs \r\n•	Seek additional funding/support from stakeholders \r\n•	Monitor project implementation regularly \r\n', '•	Establish a functional library area \r\n•	Request and solicit books/resources \r\n•	Assign a teacher or staff as library coordinator \r\n', '•	Coordinate with providers for stable services \r\n•	Conduct regular maintenance checks \r\n•	Allocate budget for repairs and upgrades \r\n', '•	Request ICT equipment from higher offices \r\n•	Allocate space for computer lab \r\n•	Seek donations/partnerships for resources \r\n', '•	Improve procurement planning and scheduling \r\n•	Ensure timely utilization of funds \r\n', '•	Ensure complete and timely documentation \r\n•	Conduct regular monitoring of liquidation status \r\n•	Provide training on proper financial reporting \r\n', '•	Conduct regular satisfaction surveys \r\n•	Address concerns promptly through action plans \r\n•	Improve transparency and communication \r\n', 1, 71, 12, 107);
