e implementation of child protection policy.', 'Sustain the implementation of child protection policy.', 'Keep on implementing ADM program.', 'Assigned focal person for culture-sensitive activities.', 'Not Applicable', 'Not Applicable', 'Maintain the function  of child protection committee.', 'The school implemented  the  crafted DRRM  action plan.', 'Sustain the implemented program.', 'Construct pathway for differently abled persons.', 'Sustain the good partnerships with the stakeholders', 'Ensure the SPT is doing their job', 'Let the SELG perform their responsibility with the guidance of their adviser', 'We need personnel to attend promptly to stakeholder\'s need', 'Continue the best practices in conducting PAPs', 'The School Government Council (SGC) members are committed to do their part for the school improvement/performance', 'Continue fostering strong partnerships with parents and teachers to support holistic learner development', 'Strengthen the good partnership with the stakeholders', 'Sustain and strengthen the school\'s monitoring and evaluation of PAPs progress ', 'Encourage the teachers to sustain their Outstanding performance ', 'Strive to sustain the outstanding rating', 'Sustain the best practice in conducting LAC Sessions', 'Continually provide technical assistance to teachers based on their individual supervisory plan', 'Continually provide incentives for teachers.', 'Continue to be transparent for the allocations.', 'Setting dates for Crafting Class Program .', 'Continue the yearly monitoring', 'Have collegial discussions with DRRM and Physical Property Coordinator twice a year and have targeted years of usage of facilities and improvement of infrastructure.', 'Have a separate building for school library. Put code/label for books and references.', 'Timely update of power, internet and water consumption.', 'Repair of damaged devices and include this in the SIP for allocation of funds.', 'Continue the proper utilization of MOOE budget and submit liquidation on time.', 'Allocation, Utilization and Liquidation of MOOE budget must be posted in the transparency board.', 'Sustain the good practice in ', 1, 36, 12, 58),
