(422, '2026', '128762', 'lack of follow up of parents and absences', 'Learners show poor study habits', 'ALS in Barangay New Visayas is community-based', '', '', '', '', 'No implementation of TLE_TVL course ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Plans is in Progress', '', 'Damage/ Not Functional Computer Equipment and  Presence of ICT-Capable Teachers or Personnel', '', '', '', '', '', 'Lesson exemplar, and Materials are tailored to learners’ interests, backgrounds, and readiness levels.', 'Teachers use formative assessments to pinpoint gaps and design appropriate interventions.', 'Learning exemplar', 'Proficiency level', '', 'Character education thru lesson integration', 'Clear Child Protection Policies', 'Parental Involvement', 'Lessons integrate diverse cultural perspectives and traditions.', 'Flexible Learning Programs', 'number of completers and certificates', 'School-wide awareness', 'Regular Drills and Simulations', 'Awareness Programs', 'Accessible Infrastructure', 'Active Participation of teachers, staff, parent& students i the planning process', 'Regular Meetings', 'Active Student Participation', 'Community Collaboration', 'Stakeholder Engagement and Collaboration', 'Access to Relevant Data and Information', 'Active Participation of Parents and Teachers', 'Established Communication and Coordination Mechanisms', 'Established Monitoring and Evaluation (M&E) Framework', 'Stakeholder Engagement and Participation', 'Access to Professional Development Opportunities', 'Collaborative and Professional Work Environment', 'Monitoring and Documentation of Outcomes', 'Availability of Training and Development Programs', 'Established Recognition and Rewards System', 'Established Financial and Payroll Systems', 'Transparent Workload Allocation Process', 'Proper Documentation and Reporting', 'Allocated Budget for Infrastructure Developmen', '', 'Basic Utility Infrastructure and Allocated Budget for Utilities and Services', '', 'Alignment with School Improvement Plan (SIP) and AIP and strong administrative and financial management systems.', 'Financial Management and Liquidation Procedures', 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Provide differentiated instruction, regular formative assessments, and targeted interventions to improve the manifestation of SBM indicators, ensuring grade 3 learners achieve proficiency in early language, literacy, and numeracy skills across all clusters.', 'Commit to collaborating with parents, teachers, and stakeholders to create a supportive learning environment that motivates students to attend regularly and engage actively in their learning to reach the desired proficiency levels.', 'The New Visayas Elementary School commits to actively support the implementation of the community-based Alternative Learning System (ALS) program in Barangay New Visayas by strengthening coordination with ALS implementers and barangay officials, identifying and referring out-of-school youth and adult learners, providing available resources and technical assistance, promoting community awareness, and ensuring continuous monitoring to sustain an inclusive and accessible learning environment for all.', 'Supporting teachers in preparing and utilizing contextualized learning materials tailored to the specific needs of learners, ensuring engaging and effective instruction that fosters better understanding and achievement.', 'Conduct targeted remediation activities, such as implementing programs like ARAl and providing one-on-one tutorials, to effectively address learning gaps in reading, comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics, ensuring that every learner achieves their full potential.', ' Integrate topics that promote peace and DepEd core values into their lessons, encouraging students to embody respect, responsibility, and unity, thereby fostering a positive and values-oriented learning environment.', 'Conduct test regular item analysis to identify the least learned competencies and proficiency levels, so that teachers can use this information to improve instruction and ensure that students achieve mastery in all learning areas.', 'N/A', 'Continuous Awareness Campaigns', 'Continuous Education', 'Maintain open communication to jointly address attendance and performance issues.', 'Promoting Culture sensitive education', 'Provide vocational and livelihood programs aligned with local job opportunities.', 'Continuous Teacher Training', 'Institutionalizing a functional school-protection policies', 'Continuous Training', 'Ensures that students, teachers, and staff thrive in a safe and healthy learning environment', 'Continuous Teacher Training', 'Train staff on strategic planning, project management, and monitoring tools.', 'Consistent communication ensures issues are addressed promptly.', 'Provide workshops and seminars for student leaders on governance and advocacy.', ' Clear processes and reporting build trust among stakeholders.', 'School leadership and stakeholders pledge to work collaboratively, ensure accountability, and efficiently utilize resources to realize strategic goals.', 'The school commits to sustaining a functional and responsive School Governance Council that upholds transparency, shared accountability, and participatory decision‑making.', 'Through continuous engagement and capacity building, the PTA will remain a vital partner in promoting quality education and holistic learner growth.', 'The school commits to strengthening collaboration with stakeholders and other schools to support shared goals and sustainable school development.', 'Through regular review, documentation, and feedback mechanisms, the school remains dedicated to enhancing program quality and achieving improved learner outcomes.', 'Through collaborative efforts, capacity building, and consistent monitoring, the school remains dedicated to achieving and maintaining a Very Satisfactory performance rating in the IPCR for the benefit of learners and the school community.', 'Through collaborative efforts, sound management practices, and adherence to performance standards, the school remains dedicated to achieving and maintaining a Very Satisfactory rating in the Office Performance Commitment and Review.', 'Through sustained implementation, monitoring, and improvement of LAC and L&D initiatives, the school remains dedicated to improving instructional quality and learner outcomes.', 'Support the school\'s efforts in facilitating the ongoing professional development of its personnel through training, workshops, and collaborative learning opportunities to address challenges and empower teachers to improve their teaching skills for the benefit of our students.', 'The school is dedicated to motivating teachers by recognizing and rewarding their milestone achievements. We will celebrate their contributions through meaningful incentives  or simple token such as certificates and public appreciation to encourage continued excellence and professional growth.', 'The school ensures timely and accurate receipt of salaries, allowances, and additional compensation by maintaining daily time records that align with payslips.', 'Ensure that teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably in accordance with DepEd Order (DO) No. 005, s. 2024, entitled \"Rationalization of Teachers\' Workload in Public Schools and Payment of Teaching.\" I will uphold the principles outlined in this order to promote a balanced work environment, support teachers\' well-being, and ensure that responsibilities are allocated justly among all teaching personnel.', ' Ensure that they meet safety standards and are conducive to a secure learning environment and prioritize the maintenance and timely repair of any hazards to promote the safety and well-being of students, staff, and visitors.\r\n', ' Actively initiating and supporting the improvement of the school\'s infrastructure and facilities to ensure they are safe, functional, and conducive to effective learning, and the school also works towards upgrading and maintaining our environment to provide a secure and supportive space for all students and staff.', 'The school commits to develop and establish a functional library to promote reading and learning among students, complementing our existing classroom reading corners.', 'Provide and maintain essential facilities such as clean and reliable water supply, stable and sufficient electric power, and fast, consistent internet connectivity. These resources are vital to ensure a healthy, safe, and conducive learning environment for both students and staff. By consistently upkeeping these facilities, we aim to support effective teaching, learning, and overall school operations.', ' Ensure that the school maintains a fully functional computer laboratory/classroom that is accessible and beneficial to both learners and teachers. Specifically, we will conduct regular maintenance and updates of computer equipment, provide necessary training for teachers on integrating technology into their lessons, and ensure that the laboratory is well-equipped with up-to-date software and reliable internet connectivity. Our goal is to create a conducive environment that enhances learning, promotes digital literacy, and supports innovative teaching methods for all users.', 'Ensure the efficient utilization of the school\'s Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE), aiming to achieve a utilization rate of 72-100%. This commitment reflects our dedication to effectively managing resources to support the school\'s operations, maintenance, and improvement initiatives. By maintaining this high level of utilization, we strive to enhance the quality of education and the overall learning environment for our students and staff.\r\n', 'Maintain the liquidation of 100% of the utilized Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE). This ensures responsible financial management and transparency in the use of school resources. By fully liquidating the expenses, we aim to promote accountability and sustain the efficient operation and improvement of the school environment for the benefit of our students and staff.', 'The school commits to maintaining and continuously improving stakeholder satisfaction by delivering quality education, responsive services, and transparent governance.', 1, 42, 12, 58),
