(425, '2026', '128592', 'Limited mastery of foundational skills (phonemic awareness, decoding, comprehension, basic numeracy operations)', 'Limited integration of 21st century skills (critical thinking, collaboration, communication, creativity)', 'Insufficient budget allocation for ALS learning resources, assessment fees, and program implementation', '*Limited skills of some teachers in developing high-quality, contextualized and differentiated learning materials\r\n*Lack of access to updated references, digital tools, and content resources\r\n*Time constraints due to multiple teaching and administrative tasks\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', '*Lack of school-based simulation facilities/laboratories that mirror real industry settings\r\n*Limited access to modern tools and equipment needed for hands-on training', '', '', '*Weak early identification of learners at risk of dropping out\r\n*Inconsistent tracking of attendance and learner progress\r\n*Limited intervention strategies tailored to individual learner needs', '', '', 'ALS program not yet formally integrated into the School Improvement Plan (SIP)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Insufficient funds to procure advanced ICT tools, software, and equipment\r\nLimited budget for capacity-building and innovation initiatives', '', '*Limited understanding of SGC roles, functions, and responsibilities among members.\r\n*Lack of structured orientation and capacity-building on governance and participatory planning.\r\n*Weak documentation and reporting system for SGC meetings and outputs.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Frequent changes in DepEd priorities or directives affecting continuity of planned L&D programs.', '*Changing policies and requirements for promotion (e.g., ranking systems, portfolio requirements) create uncertainty.\r\n*Limited slots or opportunities for promotion due to plantilla constraints.', '', '', '', '', '', '*Limited space or reading area for learners\r\n*Inadequate furniture (tables, chairs, shelves)\r\n*Lack of p