AIP; Participation of stakeholders in identifying priority needs and programs', 'Strict adherence to COA (Commission on Audit) rules and DepEd financial guidelines', 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 1, 6, 5, 6, 5, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Sustain and strengthen evidence-based teaching strategies on maintaining learner proficiency for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills', 'Intensify remediation, enrichment, and intervention programs; Strengthen data-driven instruction based on NAT results and item analysis', 'Intensify tracking and mentoring of learners at risk of dropping out', 'Sustain the development of high-quality contextualized learning materials aligned with learner needs', 'sustain targeted remediation programs for learners with difficulties; Provide continuous capacity-building for teachers on remediation techniques', 'Sustain the integration of peace education and core values across all learning areas; Monitor and assess the impact of values integration on learner behavior and school climate', 'Sustain the regular conduct of test item analysis after every assessment', '', 'Sustain strict implementation of child protection and anti-bullying policies; Always create/ foster a safe, inclusive, and nurturing school environment', 'Sustain strict enforcement of child protection policies and protocols', 'Strengthen early identification and monitoring of at-risk learners; Implement flexible and inclusive learning strategies for struggling learners', 'Maintain the collaboration with community leaders and cultural bearers', 'Continue the  learner identification, mapping, and recruitment of OSYs', 'Sustain  the implementation of the school-based ALS program', 'Sustain the functionality and effectiveness of the Child Protection Committee', 'Promote continuous awareness and culture of safety and preparedness in the school', 'Maintain a supportive, inclusive, and stress-free learning environme