ur DRRM coordinator together with the teaching staff supports any activity conducted (drills and etc.)', 'Training opportunities and LAC', 'Yes we have our facility, however not really functional.', 'It is already in our SIP that is ready for implementation and to be followed by monitoring of its implementation and ready for adjustment.', 'The planning team community has its own training and TA\'s provider and open to learn more.', '', '', 'We will always uphold our plan to be more effective and efficient.', 'To organize the SGC next school year', 'We will always do the collaboration on constant communication in order to come up with good outcome of plans.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, 35, 12, 58),
