Properly the ALS teacher assign in the school barangay ', 'Conduct symposium of Teachers , PTA and parents to have responsive child-protection committee', 'Continue to conduct strategic planning of  DRRM to teachers , parents and comunity', 'Coninue to support mental wellness of pupils, teaches and parents', 'Build partnership  and ask assistance to SEF fund', 'Continue ask supports with stakeholders', 'continue and  strengthen collaboration  with parents aand stakeholders', 'conduct training of SELG  and adviser', 'Conduct training and syposium to stakeholders or rewards system', 'Organize plan ahead of time ', 'Strengthen support of stakeholders ', 'Continue collaboration to PTA Officials', 'Conduct partnership and collaboration with other stakeholders ', 'Conduct SIPMEA on designated time frame', 'Conduct School professional development, LAC sessions', 'Collaboration , teamwork with colleagues, parents, pupils, community', 'Conduct strategic Planning , to conduct LAC sessions ', 'Support teamworks and collaboration for professional developmennt', 'Supports Rewards system and W.A.T.C.H  program', 'Tracking systems and logbooks', 'Class Program and Workload Distribution', 'Conductb school inspections quarterly, mothly to address tyhe needs arises', 'Monitor and conduct school inspection quarterly to address the needs through School MOOE in minor repairs', 'No classrooms and lack of budget, ask assistance  to SEF fund and other source', 'continue to support the mandatory  facilities of teh school', 'Request to Division office for computer  sets for the learners', 'Submit liquidation on or before the deadline ', 'Achieved the time frame implementation  of programs and progjects', 'Continue support and collaboration with skakeholders', 1, 35, 12, 58),
