mittee', 'update the DRRM plan annually ', 'Always include the mental wellness activity in the SIP', 'Revisit the PIA\'s in the SIP to adhere such facilities.', 'Develop and improve more the strategic planning', 'develop and improve the School Community planning team', 'Develop  the functionality of  the  Supreme Elementary Learner Government (SELG)', 'The school needs to improve its communication to the stakeholders', 'Revisit the SIP', 'Implementation of the SGC in the school ', 'Inform the officials with the functions and  roles of PTA vis a vis with the SGC ', 'More improvement of the collaborations with the  external stakeholders and the school internal stakeholders', '. Systems and Framework Modernization\r\n\r\n2. Strategic Operational Reforms\r\nEnhanced Stakeholder Involvement\r\n', 'continue to have an outstanding rating in the IPCRF', 'continue to have an outstanding rating in the OPCRF', '1. Performance and Professional Alignment\r\n Reducing Administrative Burden\r\n Specialized and Targeted Training', 'Continue to have a promotion and continuous professional development of teaching and non teaching Personnel', 'Ensure every school has a functional, representative committee to objectively screen nominees based on Standardized Rubrics.\r\nlign rewards with the new PMES (Performance Management and Evaluation System)', 'The NTP must ensure that the personnel received correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner', 'Preparations of workload a head of time to have fair distributions.', 'There must be quarterly monitoring or inspection of the infrastructure and facilities or more frequent.', 'There must be quarterly monitoring or inspection of the infrastructure and facilities or more frequent.', 'Due to the absence of the library , the school provides each classroom with reading corner and a reading center', 'Transparency of the MOOE allocation', 'Asking the help of the Division ITO to check the DCP in the school', 'Transparency on the MOOE allocation ', 'Transparency on the MOOE allocation ', 'The transparency of the school leads a good communication both internal and external stakeholders ', 1, 35, 12, 58),
