SGCs.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to inclusive and transparent decision-making.\r\n\r\nActive involvement of teachers, parents, and community leaders in governance processes.', 'Strong DepEd mandate for PTA as a partner in school governance.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership support ensuring PTA activities are aligned with school priorities.\r\n\r\nActive involvement of parents and teachers in meetings, projects, and decision-making.', 'Strong DepEd policies encouraging collaboration and partnerships.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to building networks and alliances.\r\n\r\nActive involvement of parents, LGUs, NGOs, and community leaders in school programs.', 'Strong DepEd requirement for monitoring and evaluation of school programs.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to accountability and continuous improvement.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff involvement in documenting and reviewing activities.', 'Strong school leadership commitment to accountability and service excellence.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff dedication to responsive and quality service delivery.\r\n\r\nCommunity partnerships providing feedback and support.\r\n\r\nDepEd policies encouraging participatory governance and stakeholder engagement.', 'Strong DepEd performance management system guiding IPCR processes.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership support ensuring personnel are mentored and guided.\r\n\r\nTeacher dedication to meeting performance standards and exceeding expectations.\r\n\r\nProfessional development programs enhancing skills and competencies.\r\n\r\nCommunity and stakeholder support contributing to personnel success.', 'Strong DepEd performance management system guiding OPCR processes.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to accountability and excellence.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff dedication to meeting and exceeding office performance standards.', 'Strong DepEd policy requiring LACs and continuous professional development.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to teacher growth and capacity-building.\r\n\r\nTeacher collaboration and willingness to share best practices.', 'Strong DepEd policies on continuous professional development.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to teacher growth and capacity-building.\r\n\r\nTeacher willingness to engage in training and apply new learnings.', 'Strong school leadership commitment to valuing personnel contributions.\r\n\r\nDepEd policies encouraging recognition and rewards for performance.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff dedication to excellence and continuous improvement.', 'Strong DepEd payroll and financial management system ensuring accuracy and timeliness.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to monitoring and facilitating salary and allowance disbursement.\r\n\r\nCoordination with finance offices to ensure smooth processing.', 'Strong DepEd guidelines on equitable workload distribution.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to fairness and transparency.\r\n\r\nTeacher cooperation in accepting assignments and responsibilities.\r\n\r\nMonitoring mechanisms to ensure balance across grade levels and subjects.', 'Strong DepEd mandate for safety and infrastructure inspection.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to maintaining safe and functional facilities.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff cooperation in reporting facility concerns.\r\n\r\nCommunity and stakeholder support for infrastructure improvements.', '', '', 'Strong school leadership commitment to maintaining functional utilities.\r\n\r\nDepEd support for ensuring basic facilities are operational.\r\n\r\nCommunity and stakeholder partnerships assisting in facility upkeep.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff cooperation in reporting issues promptly.', '', 'Strong DepEd guidelines on MOOE utilization and accountability.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to transparent and efficient financial management.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff cooperation in identifying priority needs.\r\n\r\nCommunity and stakeholder support in supplementing resources.\r\n\r\nRegular monitoring and reporting systems ensuring compliance and efficiency.', 'Strong DepEd financial management policies ensuring accountability.\r\n\r\nSchool leadership commitment to transparency and compliance.\r\n\r\nTeacher and staff cooperation in submitting required documentation.', 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 2, 'Strengthen intervention program  and supplementary worksheets  to enhance learner\'s performance in these least learned competencies. ', 'Strengthen intervention program  and supplementary worksheets  to enhance learner\'s performance in these least learned competencies', 'N/A', 'As a school principal, I commit to ensuring that teachers consistently prepare contextualized learning materials that are responsive to the diverse needs of our learners. I will provide strong instructional leadership, continuous professional development opportunities, and a supportive environment that values innovation and collaboration. By fostering a culture of inclusivity and relevance, I pledge to sustain this practice as a cornerstone of quality education, empowering both teachers and students to thrive in a rapidly changing world.', 'As a school principal, I commit to ensuring that teachers consistently conduct remediation activities to address learning gaps in reading and comprehension, science and technology, and mathematics. I will provide the necessary support through instructional leadership, professional development opportunities, and access to appropriate learning resources. By fostering a culture of collaboration and continuous improvement, I pledge to sustain remediation as a vital practice in our school, so that every learner is given the chance to succeed and thrive academically.', 'As a school principal, I commit to ensuring that teachers consistently integrate topics that promote peace and uphold the DepEd core values of Maka-Diyos, Maka-tao, Makakalikasan, and Makabansa. I will provide strong instructional leadership, encourage innovative lesson planning, and support professional development that equips teachers to embed these values across all learning areas. By fostering a school culture rooted in respect, inclusivity, and social responsibility, I pledge to sustain this practice as a foundation for holistic education and nation-building.', 'As a school principal, I commit to institutionalizing the regular conduct of test item analysis as a vital tool for improving teaching and learning. I will ensure that teachers are capacitated through training and mentoring to interpret results effectively and apply them in lesson planning, remediation, and enrichment activities. I resolve to provide adequate time, resources, and collaborative platforms for teachers to analyze data and translate findings into actionable strategies. By embedding test item analysis into our school’s culture of continuous improvement, I pledge to strengthen instructional practices and guarantee that every learner’s needs are addressed.', 'N/A', 'As a school principal, I commit to strengthening our anti-bullying initiatives by ensuring consistent monitoring, empowering teachers and student leaders to act as advocates for child protection, and engaging parents in awareness programs. I will institutionalize regular reporting and counseling mechanisms, integrate peace and values education across subjects, and foster a school culture where respect, empathy, and inclusivity are always upheld. Through these actions, I pledge to sustain a safe and nurturing environment where zero child bullying incidence is not only a goal but a lived reality.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a zero child abuse incidence in our school by strengthening child protection policies, ensuring continuous teacher and staff training, and fostering a safe and nurturing environment for all learners. I will enhance collaboration with parents, local government units, and child protection agencies to ensure early detection, reporting, and intervention. By embedding child rights education and values formation in our school culture, I pledge to uphold the dignity, safety, and holistic development of every child under our care.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining our reduced drop-out incidence by strengthening early warning systems, enhancing school-based interventions, and engaging parents and communities in learner support. I will continue to provide opportunities for remediation, counseling, and financial assistance through partnerships with LGUs and stakeholders. By fostering a nurturing and inclusive school environment, I pledge to ensure that every child remains in school and is given the chance to complete their education.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining culture-sensitive activities that honor the diverse traditions, values, and identities of our learners. I will strengthen partnerships with parents, elders, and community leaders to enrich school programs, provide continuous training for teachers on contextualization, and ensure that cultural practices are meaningfully integrated into the curriculum. By fostering inclusivity and respect, I pledge to uphold a school environment where every learner feels valued and connected to their heritage while thriving academically.', 'I will continue to build partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and community stakeholders to provide financial and resource support, while empowering teachers to design contextualized and learner-responsive materials. By fostering inclusivity and resilience, I pledge to uphold education as a right for all, ensuring that no learner is left behind.', 'N/A', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a fully functional child-protection committee by providing continuous training, strengthening reporting mechanisms, and ensuring timely coordination with external agencies. I will allocate resources for awareness campaigns, counseling services, and monitoring systems to safeguard learners. By fostering a culture of vigilance, inclusivity, and respect for child rights, I pledge to uphold a safe and nurturing school environment where every child is protected and valued.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a functional DRRM plan by ensuring regular drills, continuous training, and adequate resources for disaster preparedness. I will strengthen partnerships with LGUs, emergency response agencies, and community stakeholders to enhance coordination and support. By embedding disaster risk reduction education into our school culture, I pledge to uphold the safety, resilience, and well-being of every learner and staff member.', 's a school principal, I commit to sustaining a functional support mechanism for mental wellness by strengthening counseling services, integrating mental health awareness into school programs, and reducing stigma through continuous advocacy. I will enhance partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and health agencies to provide professional support and resources. By fostering a safe, inclusive, and nurturing school environment, I pledge to uphold the mental well-being of every learner and staff member as a cornerstone of holistic education.', 'As a school principal, I commit to strengthening our special education and PWD-friendly facilities by prioritizing accessibility upgrades, securing resources, and providing continuous training for teachers. I will foster partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and stakeholders to sustain inclusive programs and ensure that learners with disabilities are given equal opportunities to thrive. By embedding inclusivity into our school culture, I pledge to uphold the right of every child to quality education in a safe and supportive environment.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the development of a strategic plan that reflects our vision, mission, and goals for continuous improvement. I will ensure inclusive participation of teachers, parents, learners, and stakeholders in the planning process, strengthen monitoring and evaluation mechanisms, and align priorities with available resources. By fostering collaboration and accountability, I pledge to uphold a strategic plan that drives innovation, equity, and excellence in our school.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a functional school-community planning team by ensuring inclusive participation, strengthening coordination, and providing capacity-building opportunities for members. I will foster partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and stakeholders to mobilize resources and support the implementation of plans. By embedding collaboration and accountability into our school culture, I pledge to uphold a planning team that drives innovation, inclusivity, and continuous improvement for the benefit of all learners', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a functional Supreme Student Government/Supreme Pupil Government by providing continuous leadership training, mentoring, and resources for student-led initiatives. I will strengthen coordination between SSG/SPG and other school organizations, ensure inclusivity in leadership opportunities, and foster a culture of democratic participation. By empowering student leaders, I pledge to uphold their role as partners in promoting school improvement, learner engagement, and holistic development', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining and enhancing innovative frontline services by integrating technology, strengthening feedback mechanisms, and providing continuous training for staff. I will foster partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and stakeholders to mobilize resources and ensure responsive, inclusive, and efficient service delivery. By embedding innovation into our school culture, I pledge to uphold excellence in serving our learners, parents, and community.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the operationalization of our strategic plan through a clear and responsive implementation plan. I will ensure inclusive participation of teachers, parents, learners, and stakeholders in both planning and monitoring, strengthen accountability mechanisms, and align initiatives with available resources. By fostering collaboration and continuous improvement, I pledge to uphold an implementation plan that transforms our strategic vision into tangible results for the benefit of all learners.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a functional School Governance Council by ensuring inclusive participation, strengthening capacity-building for members, and fostering transparency in decision-making. I will enhance collaboration with LGUs, NGOs, and stakeholders to mobilize resources and support the council’s initiatives. By embedding participatory governance into our school culture, I pledge to uphold accountability, inclusivity, and continuous improvement for the benefit of all learners.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining a functional Parent-Teacher Association by fostering inclusive participation, strengthening communication channels, and providing capacity-building opportunities for members.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining collaboration with stakeholders and other schools by fostering inclusive participation, strengthening coordination, and establishing monitoring mechanisms to measure impact. I will enhance partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and educational institutions to mobilize resources and share best practices. By embedding collaboration into our school culture, I pledge to uphold partnerships that drive innovation, inclusivity, and continuous improvement for the benefit of all learners.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the monitoring and evaluation of our programs, projects, and activities by strengthening documentation systems, ensuring inclusive participation, and aligning evaluation tools with both quantitative and qualitative outcomes. I will foster collaboration with teachers, parents, and stakeholders to enhance accountability and transparency. By embedding monitoring and evaluation into our school culture, I pledge to uphold continuous improvement and ensure that all initiatives effectively contribute to learner success.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the achievement of very satisfactory ratings in the IPCR by providing continuous mentoring, professional development opportunities, and supportive resources for school personnel. I will strengthen documentation systems, foster collaboration, and align performance targets with school priorities. By embedding accountability and excellence into our school culture, I pledge to uphold high standards of performance that contribute to learner success and institutional growth.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the achievement of very satisfactory ratings in the OPCR by strengthening documentation systems, providing continuous mentoring, and ensuring alignment of office targets with school priorities. I will foster collaboration among departments, enhance professional development opportunities, and mobilize resources to support performance excellence. By embedding accountability and continuous improvement into our school culture, I pledge to uphold high standards of office performance that contribute to learner success and institutional growth.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development activities by ensuring relevance, inclusivity, and alignment with teacher needs. I will strengthen documentation systems, mobilize resources, and foster collaboration among teachers and stakeholders. By embedding continuous professional development into our school culture, I pledge to uphold excellence in teaching and learning for the benefit of all learners.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the promotion and continuous professional development of our personnel by ensuring relevance, inclusivity, and alignment with school priorities. I will strengthen documentation systems, mobilize resources, and foster collaboration among teachers and stakeholders. By embedding continuous learning into our school culture, I pledge to uphold excellence in teaching and leadership for the benefit of all learners.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the recognition and rewarding of milestone achievements of our personnel by strengthening documentation systems, mobilizing resources, and fostering a culture of appreciation. I will ensure inclusivity in recognition programs, align rewards with school priorities, and celebrate achievements in meaningful ways. By embedding recognition into our school culture, I pledge to uphold motivation, morale, and continuous improvement among our personnel.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the timely and accurate facilitation of salaries, allowances, and other compensation by strengthening coordination with finance offices, ensuring transparency in payroll processes, and providing clear communication to personnel. I will uphold accountability, inclusivity, and fairness in compensation practices. By embedding efficiency and trust into our school culture, I pledge to maintain personnel satisfaction and motivation, contributing to overall institutional growth.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining fair and equitable distribution of teacher workload by strengthening monitoring systems, ensuring transparency in assignments, and aligning responsibilities with teacher expertise. I will foster collaboration among teachers, mobilize resources to address staffing needs, and uphold inclusivity in workload distribution. By embedding fairness and accountability into our school culture, I pledge to maintain teacher satisfaction, efficiency, and continuous improvement for the benefit of all learners.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining regular inspections of our infrastructure and facilities by strengthening monitoring systems, mobilizing resources, and coordinating with external agencies for specialized needs. I will ensure inclusivity, safety, and transparency in inspection processes. By embedding accountability and proactive maintenance into our school culture, I pledge to uphold safe, functional, and learner-friendly facilities for the benefit of all stakeholders.', 'As a school principal, I commit to strengthening the initiation of infrastructure and facility improvements by mobilizing resources, fostering partnerships, and prioritizing projects based on safety and learner needs. I will coordinate with LGUs, NGOs, and stakeholders to address gaps, ensure transparency in processes, and sustain proactive maintenance. By embedding continuous improvement into our school culture, I pledge to uphold safe, functional, and learner-friendly facilities for the benefit of all stakeholders.', 'Submit proposal for a school library.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining functional water, electric, and internet facilities by strengthening monitoring systems, mobilizing resources, and coordinating with external agencies for timely support. I will ensure inclusivity, safety, and transparency in facility management. By embedding accountability and proactive maintenance into our school culture, I pledge to uphold reliable and learner-friendly facilities for the benefit of all stakeholders.', 'As a school principal, I commit to initiating the establishment of a functional computer laboratory/classroom by mobilizing resources, fostering partnerships, and prioritizing ICT integration in our school improvement plan. I will coordinate with LGUs, NGOs, and stakeholders to secure equipment, training, and infrastructure support. By embedding ICT development into our school culture, I pledge to provide equitable access to technology that enhances teaching, learning, and innovation for all learners', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining the 72–100% utilization rate of our MOOE by strengthening financial planning, ensuring transparency, and aligning expenditures with school priorities. I will foster collaboration among teachers, staff, and stakeholders to identify needs, mobilize resources, and uphold accountability. By embedding efficiency and integrity into our school culture, I pledge to maintain effective financial management that supports quality education and learner success.', 'As a school principal, I commit to sustaining 100% liquidation of our utilized MOOE by strengthening documentation systems, ensuring transparency, and fostering collaboration among teachers and staff. I will provide capacity-building opportunities on financial reporting, mobilize resources to support compliance, and uphold accountability in all financial transactions. By embedding integrity and efficiency into our school culture, I pledge to maintain trust and ensure that resources are maximized for learner success.', 'I will foster inclusive participation in consultations, align initiatives with stakeholder needs, and mobilize resources to address areas of concern. By embedding accountability and collaboration into our school culture, I pledge to uphold excellence in service delivery and maintain the trust of our stakeholders.', 1, 139, 12, 59),
