ance system', 'Strong leadership support; adoption of digital tools and systems; committed school personnel', 'Strong leadership and management support; active participation of teachers and stakeholders; clear alignment with DepEd planning guidelines', 'Strong support from school leadership; active stakeholder involvement; clear governance structure and policies', 'Active PTA officers; strong school-home communication; support from school administration', 'Strong network of partners; active school leadership support; established partnership agreements and collaborations', 'Strong monitoring system in place; committed school M&E team; support from school leadership and stakeholders', 'Strong stakeholder engagement; responsive school leadership; established feedback mechanisms', 'Strong performance monitoring system; clear IPCR guidelines; regular coaching and feedback from school heads', 'Strong leadership and management systems; clear OPCR guidelines; committed and competent personnel', 'Strong teacher collaboration; support from school leadership; identified training needs based on assessment results', 'Strong support from school leadership; access to DepEd professional development programs; active guidance for career progression', 'Strong support from school leadership; existing recognition programs; active participation of personnel in school achievements', 'Strong coordination with finance and payroll offices; established salary processing systems; compliance with DepEd guidelines', 'Strong school leadership; collaborative scheduling among teachers; adherence to workload distribution guidelines', 'Active school maintenance committee; support from stakeholders and LGU; established school inspection routines', 'Strong support from school leadership; active engagement of stakeholders and LGU; existing school improvement planning system', 'Support from school administration; committed library-in-charge; existing collection of learning resources', 'Support from LGU and utility providers; established maintenance coordination; school prioritization of essential utilities', 'Support from school leadership; basic ICT infrastructure available; teacher supervision and ICT focal person support', 'Strong financial management system; adherence to DepEd budgeting guidelines; active School MOOE planning committee', 'Strong financial monitoring system; guidance from accounting office; committed administrative personnel', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 0, 2, 2, 6, 5, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 3, 2, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, '', '', '', 'Teachers will continue to prepare and enhance contextualized learning materials through collaboration, LAC sessions, and integration of local context to better address learners’ needs', 'Teachers will continue to conduct structured remediation programs, utilize differentiated instruction, and monitor learner progress regularly to effectively address learning gaps', 'Teachers will consistently integrate peace education and DepEd core values across learning areas through contextualized lessons, modeling positive behavior, and reinforcing values in daily instruction', 'Teachers will continue to conduct regular test item analysis, enhance data analysis skills through training, and use results to improve instruction and learner outcomes', '', 'The school will sustain a safe and inclusive environment by strengthening anti-bullying campaigns, ensuring open communication channels, and continuously monitoring and addressing learners’ well-being', 'The school will continue to uphold child protection policies, strengthen awareness programs, ensure proper reporting mechanisms, and maintain a safe and nurturing environment for all learners', 'The school will sustain and strengthen intervention programs, enhance parent engagement, and continuously monitor at-risk learners to further reduce drop-out incidence', 'The school will continue to promote inclusive and culture-sensitive activities, strengthen partnerships with the community, and integrate cultural awareness in school programs and curriculum', 'The school will continue to strengthen inclusive education programs, improve access through flexible learning modalities, and enhance support systems for OSYS, disadvantaged, and adult learners', '', 'The school will sustain and strengthen the Child Protection Committee through regular meetings, continuous training, proper documentation, and active monitoring of child protection cases', 'The school will continuously update and implement the DRRM plan, conduct regular drills, strengthen stakeholder coordination, and ensure readiness for emergencies and disasters', 'The school will strengthen its mental health support system by enhancing guidance services, promoting mental wellness awareness, reducing stigma, and ensuring accessible counseling and intervention programs for learners and staff', 'The school will continue to improve and maintain PWD-friendly and inclusive facilities, prioritize accessibility in future projects, and strengthen partnerships for additional resources and upgrades', 'The school will continuously review and update its strategic plan through participatory planning, ensure alignment with DepEd priorities, and strengthen stakeholder engagement in goal-setting and implementation', 'The school will sustain and strengthen the school-community planning team through regular meetings, inclusive participation, improved documentation, and continuous stakeholder engagement in planning processes', 'The school will strengthen student leadership development programs, enhance participation in governance activities, and provide continuous mentoring and training for SSLG officers', 'The school will continue to enhance and sustain innovative frontline services by improving ICT utilization, providing continuous training for personnel, and streamlining processes to ensure efficient and responsive stakeholder services', 'The school will ensure effective implementation of the strategic plan through regular monitoring, alignment of activities with available resources, and continuous review and updating of the implementation plan with stakeholder participation', 'The school will sustain and strengthen the School Governance Council through regular meetings, improved stakeholder engagement, proper documentation, and continuous collaboration in school governance and decision-making', 'The school will strengthen PTA engagement through regular communication, flexible meeting schedules, and active involvement of parents in school programs and decision-making processes', 'The school will sustain and expand partnerships through regular coordination meetings, improved communication channels, and strengthened collaboration with stakeholders and neighboring schools to support shared goals and programs', 'The school will strengthen its monitoring and evaluation system through regular data analysis, streamlined reporting processes, and continuous capacity building of personnel to ensure effective implementation of programs, projects, and activities', 'The school will sustain and enhance personnel performance through regular coaching, monitoring of IPCR targets, provision of professional development opportunities, and continuous feedback mechanisms to maintain high performance ratings', 'The school will sustain and improve OPCR performance through continuous monitoring of targets, streamlining of processes, provision of capacity-building activities, and regular performance feedback and evaluation', 'The school will sustain and enhance needs-based LACs and L&D activities through effective scheduling, continuous training needs assessment, and provision of relevant, context-based professional development programs', 'The school will continue to support personnel promotion and professional development through mentoring, provision of training opportunities, encouragement of graduate studies, and assistance in meeting promotion requirements', 'The school will strengthen its recognition and rewards system through regular awarding activities, development of clear recognition guidelines, and coordination with stakeholders for support.', 'The school will ensure timely and accurate processing of salaries and benefits through strict compliance with payroll requirements, improved coordination with concerned offices, and regular monitoring of personnel compensation records', 'The school will continue to ensure fair and equitable distribution of workload through transparent scheduling, regular review of assignments, and collaborative planning among school personnel', 'The school will sustain regular inspection of infrastructure and facilities, strengthen maintenance planning, and coordinate with stakeholders for timely repair and improvement of school facilities', 'The school will continue to initiate and prioritize infrastructure and facility improvements through effective planning, stakeholder collaboration, and efficient utilization of available resources and external support', 'The school will enhance library functionality through acquisition of updated resources, improvement of facilities, and integration of ICT-based library systems to promote a more effective learning resource center', 'The school will ensure continuous improvement and maintenance of water, electricity, and internet facilities through regular coordination with service providers, preventive maintenance, and efficient resource management', 'The school will continue to improve and maintain the computer laboratory through regular equipment maintenance, upgrading of ICT resources, and integration of technology in teaching and learning processes', 'The school will sustain efficient utilization of MOOE funds through proper planning, timely procurement processes, strict budget monitoring, and transparent financial management aligned with DepEd guidelines', 'The school will ensure timely and accurate liquidation of MOOE funds through strict compliance with accounting guidelines, complete documentation, and continuous capacity building of personnel handling financial records', 'The school will continue to improve service delivery through regular stakeholder feedback, enhanced responsiveness to concerns, and continuous quality improvement initiatives to maintain and exceed satisfactory ratings', 1, 0, 12, 59),
