done collaboratively.', 'The physical facilities coordinator monitored the structires periodically.', 'Repairs of faciloties were seen as imporatnt part of the SIP.', 'Reading program was a priority.', 'A utility worker to oversee these facilities was hired.', '', 'The school always kept records.', 'Decisive attitude of tje AO made it through the way.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 2, 2, 2, 5, 2, 6, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 3, 3, '', '', '', 'A monitoring tool for each teacher must be developed.', '\'Family\' dialogue must be conducted to determine issues so that TA shall be given appropriately.', 'Each teacher must be resourceful to looking for LM to enhance DLP development.', 'Item analysis must not be kept as mere numbers and figures but these statistics must ne used in informing teaching practice.', '', 'Strengthen homeroom guidance program', 'Strengtjen HRGP and peer helpers group', 'Strengthen home visitation\r\nPeriodic attendance of learners must be monitored\r\nStrengthen school - community partnership', 'Increase the participation from the IP learnerrs.', 'Strengthen child find activities', '', 'CPC must be given a priority for the next SY', 'Sustain the resiliency related activities among the stakeholders.', 'Thisust be part of the schoolwide program.', 'The school will squeeze the budget to allocate some funds for the purpose.', 'Make sure that all plans are in plave and monitored.', 'Organize the SGC in order to increase collaboration\r\n', 'Engage student leaders to a more engaging learenr- centered activities\r\n', 'Improve and contextualize some processes.', 'Do regular monitoring and evaluation the implan.', 'Organize SGC\r\n', 'Strengthen participation', 'Inquire about the dpda procedures', 'Institurionalize SMEA.', 'Each teacher must not settle for less.', 'The school must not settle for less.', 'LAC sessipns must be accredited by the PRC.', 'Continue ', 'Establish the awards processes.', 'Sustain.',