nd Appreciation of Partners', '', '', 'Almost all teachers have an outstanding rating for their IPCRF', 'Almost all teachers have an outstanding rating for their IPCRF', '', 'All teachers are sent to trainings based on their professional needs and based on the conducted training ', 'All Teachers are being recognized during the World Teachers Day Celebration', 'All teachers are given their payslip and updates on their salary and other benefits', 'Created a class program for all teachers', 'The school conducts inspection on infrastuctures and facilities annually and as needed especially after the occurrence of an earthquake', 'The school conducts inspection on infrastuctures and facilities annually and as needed especially after the occurrence of an earthquake', '', 'Scheduled inspection and immediate repair of facilities prevent breakdowns and prolong usability.', '', 'Conduct of BAC Meeting and coordination with BAC members', 'Liquidation Reports and transparency', 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1, 6, 1, 6, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1, 6, 1, 6, 1, 6, 1, 1, 6, 6, 1, 6, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 5, 5, 5, 5, 1, 3, 3, 'Catching the least mastered competencies', 'Intensify the conduct of review and enhancement activities', 'N/A', 'Conduct of collaborative expertise ', 'Monitoring and evaluation of the program implemented', 'Monitoring and evaluation', 'Monitoring and evaluation', 'N/A', 'Maintaining zero child bullying case', 'Conduct Parent Orientation during the first month from the opening of classes', 'Conduct programs that increased the interest of learners in attending classes', 'maintain respectful and an inclusive School Environment', 'Monitor and evaluate of the programs implemented for inclusive education', 'N/A', 'Organize child-protection committee and conduct orientation about their functions and responsibilities', 'Conduct collabortive expertise on creating a DRRM Plan and monitor and evaluate the programs conducted', 'Strengthen the conduct  of the programs for the mental wellness  ', 'Coordinate with the community and other stakeholders for the implementation of inclusive education', 'Monitoring and evaluation of the programs conducted', 'Organize a functional school-community planning team and conduct orientation about their role and responsibility', 'Continue the conduct of activties for Supreme Student Government/Supreme Pupil Government', 'Conduct activities for parents to increase parents support', 'Craft SIP and submit the SIP on or before the given date of submission', 'Conduct a Quarterly meeting with the School Governance Council', 'Strengthen the programs conducted for the PTA that increase their engagement in school', 'Strengthen the programs conducted for the stakeholders that increase their engagement in school', 'Organize a Team for the conduct of the monitoring and evaluation of the programs and projects', 'Give Technical Assistance to Teachers to maintain and improve the concerns and gaps they have based on their IPCRF', 'Give Technical Assistance to Teachers to maintain and improve the concerns and gaps they have based on their IPCRF', 'Conduct Collaborative Expertise on the creation of L & D', 'Conduct LAC Sessions and Collaborative Expertise to Teachers', 'Conduct Rewards and Recognition to Teachers', 'Continue the projects and programs based on the mandates of DepEd', 'Condcut collaborative expertise to teachers for their workloads and updates on the curriculum', 'Continue the conduct of inspection of infrastructure and facilities', 'Conduct minor repairs of school buildings ', 'Include this on reports', 'Continue the monitoring and evaluation', 'Conduct inspection of classroom buildings', 'Monitoring and evaluation', 'Monitoring and evaluation', 'Organize a Team to gather stakeholders feedback ', 0, 35, 12, 58),
