ssment next school year for grade 3 and provide interventions', 'Prepare learners through review and ensure participation when NAT is administered', 'Coordinate with ALS coordinator and identify potential learners if needed', 'Strengthen LAC and sharing of contextualized materials', 'Sustain remediation programs and provide additional materials', 'Continue integration and strengthen through activities and school programs', 'Sustain regular item analysis and use results to improve instruction', 'Explore possible partnerships if program becomes applicable', 'Strengthen monitoring and conduct regular awareness activities', 'Sustain awareness and strict implementation of policies', 'Implement monitoring, home visits, and intervention programs', 'Increase and sustain culture-based activities', 'Sustain inclusive programs and strengthen support', 'Coordinate with ALS and identify learners if needed', 'Reorganize committee and conduct regular meetings and activities', 'Sustain implementation and regular drills', 'Establish simple mental wellness program and referral system', 'Maintain and improve accessible facilities', 'Strengthen stakeholder involvement in planning', 'Improve communication and meeting schedules', 'Conduct leadership trainings and increase student involvement', 'Strengthen dissemination of Citizens’ Charter and ensure regular orientation for stakeholders', 'Strengthen regular monitoring and updating of implementation plan', 'Organize and activate SGC and orient members on roles', 'Continue to strengthen parent participation in school activities', 'Formalize partnerships and document collaborative activities', 'Develop and implement a structured M&E system', 'Continue performance coaching and monitoring', 'Maintain strong OPCRF implementation and reporting', 'ensure timely approval and implementation of LAC proposals', 'Continue supporting teacher CPD and training participation', 'Strengthen documentation and regular recognition activities', 'Maintain time