gency and safety; improve procurement planning and implementation timelines; ensure alignment with school development plan', 'Upgrade and update library resources; strengthen library staffing and management support; improve reading programs; enhance maintenance and utilization of library facilities', 'Strengthen coordination with utility providers; improve backup systems (e.g., water storage, power backup); upgrade internet connectivity; ensure regular maintenance and prompt reporting of service issues', 'Upgrade and maintain computer units regularly; increase number of functional devices; strengthen ICT maintenance system; allocate funds for equipment replacement and software updates', 'Strengthen procurement planning and scheduling; improve documentation and liquidation processes; ensure timely and strategic fund utilization; enhance training on financial management and procurement procedures', 'Strengthen monitoring of liquidation deadlines; provide continuous training on financial documentation and reporting; improve internal checking of supporting documents; ensure timely and accurate submission of liquidation reports', 'Strengthen feedback collection system to ensure wider participation; improve data consolidation and analysis processes; regularly act on stakeholder feedback; sustain programs that improve service delivery and stakeholder satisfaction', 1, 0, 12, 59);
