(554, '2026', '128812', 'The K–12 curriculum introduces too many competencies too early, overwhelming learners who lack mastery of basics.', '', '', 'Teachers often juggle lesson planning, teaching, and administrative tasks, leaving little time for contextualization.', 'Weak home-school collaboration in supporting remedial learning.', 'Weak collaboration between schools, families, and communities in reinforcing values.', '', 'Some local businesses may hesitate to collaborate due to costs, liability, or lack of incentives.', 'Limited access to counselors, psychologists, or social workers', '', '', 'Some teachers may lack training in cultural awareness and facilitation', '', '', '', '', 'Mental health is often overlooked compared to academic performance', '', 'Activities may overlap, conflict, or fail to align with DepEd priorities.', 'No clear body to monitor, evaluate, and adjust plans.', '', '', 'Success indicators are undefined, making evaluation impossible.', 'School programs may lack alignment with community priorities and DepEd thrusts.', '', '', 'Programs risk being abandoned or repeated without improvement.', 'The school may prioritize meeting requirements rather than striving for excellence.', '', '', 'Academic loads and administrative tasks overshadow professional development.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'schools lack physical areas to house a library No assign librarian, No room', '', 'No available functional ICT equipment', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Submit by grade level the item analysis every end of the quarterly exam', '', '', 'Schools identify at-risk students quickly and provide targeted support.', 'Shared responsibility between school and parents in addressing absenteeism.', '', 'Equal opportunity to all pupils regardless of physical conditions, age, ethnic group and economic status', '', 'Cater all cases for child protections', 'Regular calamity drills in the school ', '', 'School leadership prioritizes budget allocation for accessibility features (ramps, accessible toilets, assistive devices).', '', '', 'chool administration provides guidance, mentoring, and resources.', 'Clear policies and guidelines ensure frontline services are consistently delivered.', '', '', 'Parents and teachers actively attend meetings and participate in decision-making.', 'Community stakeholders (LGUs, NGOs, alumni) are tapped through PTA networks.', '', '', 'Regular orientation and coaching sessions on performance evaluation.', 'Regular orientation and coaching sessions on performance evaluation.', '', 'Provide TA and indorse teachers for promotions', 'Recognized and give awards to deserving  teachers', 'Updated service records and guidelines for additional compensation', 'No teachers given overload classes', 'Assigned committees for regular inspections', 'Allocation from the MOOE', '', 'Stakeholders give priority on the purchase of water facility of the school', '', 'well mange available MOOE FUNDS', 'Updated and  accurate documents for MOOE liquidation', 2, 0, 0, 2, 6, 6, 1, 3, 1, 1, 6, 2, 2, 0, 2, 2, 2, 5, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 3, 5, 0, 3, 3, 3, 'Conduct regular training workshops focused on contextualization techniques across subjects.', '', '', 'Simplify reporting requirements so teachers can focus more on instructional design', 'Create shared responsibility agreements where teachers and parents commit to specific actions.', 'Establish regular dialogues between teachers, parents, and community leaders about values education.', 'Online submission of the test analysis results', 'Provide government subsidies or grants to offset expenses for industries hosting students.', 'Invite volunteer professionals (psychologists, social workers) to conduct periodic sessions in schools.', 'Sustain', 'Sustain', 'Develop teacher guides with practical strategies for integrating culture-sensitive activities into lessons.', 'sustain', '', 'organized and functional CPC', 'sustain', 'Encourage teachers to balance