ve participation of the PTA and clear designation of the Child Protection Policy (CPP) coordinator.', 'Regular conduct of quarterly nationwide ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Strong representation from community leaders and consistent quarterly SGC meetings.', 'Transparent financial reporting and active communication through social media groups/SMS.', 'Active membership in the District Learning Action Cell (LAC) and strong LGU support.', 'Consistent use of the School Monitoring, Evaluation, and Adjustment (SMEA) tool.', 'High level of transparency in school ', 'Consistent conduct of mid-year performance reviews and coaching sessions.', 'Clear alignment of school goals with the Division’s performance targets and strong leadership oversight.', '', 'Regular dissemination of DepEd orders and active coaching from the School Head.', 'Institutionalized \"Project PRAISE\" (Rewards and Recognition) committee and annual awarding rites.', 'Timely submission of the school’s Form 7 and efficient coordination with the Division Payroll Unit.', 'Adherence to the Magna Carta for Public School Teachers and use of a standard loading master plan.', 'Regular conduct of the School Facilities Inventory (SFI) and weekly inspections by the property custodian.', 'Active Brigada Eskwela partnerships and successful resource mobilization from the LGU/Stakeholders.', '', '', '', 'Alignment of the Annual Implementation Plan (AIP) with the school budget and monthly expenditure tracking.', 'Strict adherence to accounting and auditing rules and a functional School Bids and Awards Committee (BAC).', 1, 1, 0, 1, 2, 6, 1, 0, 6, 2, 3, 6, 6, 0, 2, 5, 6, 0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 6, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 2, 5, 3, 0, 1, 0, 3, 3, 'Implement a \"Buddy Reading\" program and conduct remedial literacy/numeracy sessions during the scheduled intervention hour.', 'Conduct intensive NAT review sessions and utilize interactive simulation software to bridge the gap in laboratory experiments.', '', 'Establish a \"Resource Bank\" of localized lesson plans and materials accessible to all grade levels.', 'Institutionalize a \"Progress Tracking Tool\" for learners under remediation to monitor improvement more closely.', 'Conduct a quarterly \"Values Integration Showcase\" to share best practices in teaching DepEd core values.', 'Provide training on digital tools or software that can automate the item analysis process for faster instructional adjustment.', '', 'Strengthen \"Bantay Bata\" patrols during recess and integrate anti-bullying lessons in EsP classes.', 'Conduct quarterly orientation for teachers and parents on positive discipline and child rights.', 'Enhance the School-Home Partnership (Home Visitation) and seek local stakeholders for student feeding programs.', 'Curate and develop localized learning materials that reflect the community’s cultural heritage.', 'Collaborate with Barangay officials to conduct a comprehensive \"Child Find\" mapping to identify potential learners.', '', 'Institutionalize a fixed monthly meeting schedule and digitize the reporting system for quicker documentation.', 'Allocate a portion of the MOOE for the procurement of emergency kits and conduct a DRRM refresher for all teachers.', 'Conduct mental health awareness seminars for staff and establish a dedicated \"Quiet Room\" or counseling nook.', '', 'Establish a mid-year review committee to track SIP progress and align it with the Annual Implementation Plan (AIP).', 'Re-organize the School Governance Council (SGC) to include a wider range of community stakeholders and external partners.', 'Conduct a Student Leadership Empowerment Seminar and allocate a small revolving fund for SSG-led campus initiatives.', 'Develop and implement a School Information System (SIS) for online enrollment and digital document tracking to streamline frontline services.', 'Conduct monthly coordination meetings with committee chairs to align program implementation with the set timeline.', 'Formulate a 1-year SGC action plan that focuses on resource mobilization and community-led school safety.', 'Schedule PTA meetings on weekends or evenings and provide virtual attendance options to increase participation.', 'Establish a shared community calendar with partner schools and agencies to better synchronize joint activities.', 'Strengthen the M&E team by providing advanced training on data analysis and digital reporting tools.', 'Institutionalize a digital repository for teachers to upload and organize Means of Verification (MOV) throughout the school year.', 'Conduct quarterly internal school performance audits to ensure all office targets are on track for the year-end review.', 'Utilize specialized LAC sessions based on teacher needs assessments (TNA) and explore hybrid/virtual meeting options.', 'Create a \"Professional Growth Tracking Board\" to monitor teacher training hours and upcoming development opportunities.', 'Seek local stakeholders or PTA support to sponsor non-monetary incentives or plaques for performing personnel.', 'Establish a school-based tracking system for personnel benefits to ensure timely follow-ups on pending increments.', 'Conduct a year-end review of ancillary assignments to ensure a balanced distribution of administrative duties among staff.', 'Digitalize the facility inspection checklist for real-time reporting of maintenance needs to the school head.', 'Create a prioritized Project Procurement Management Plan (PPMP) specifically for high-impact facility repairs.', '', 'Upgrade to a mesh network system for wider Wi-Fi coverage and implement a \"Green School\" energy-saving policy.', '', 'Conduct monthly budget reviews with the school finance committee to ensures funds are spent according to the prioritized PPMP.', 'Set a school-based \"Internal Deadline\" for liquidation documents five days before the official Division Office deadline to avoid delays.', 'Conduct semi-annual stakeholder satisfaction surveys to proactively address emerging concerns and maintain trust.', 1, 39, 12, 58),
