reas of collaboration. Regular meetings, joint planning sessions, and collaborative activities will be scheduled to maintain active engagement. The school will also recognize and acknowledge partners’ contributions to encourage continued participation and sustain long-term relationships that support school improvement initiatives.', '', '', '', 'Attend clustered-schools LAC ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Temporarily restore and ensure the operational functionality of the school’s computer/laboratory classroom', '', '', '', 0, 144, 12, 59),
