, 'Compliance with government accounting standards.', 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 6, 1, 1, 6, 6, 2, 6, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 5, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 2, 5, 5, 1, 5, 1, 3, 3, 'None', 'Strong internet connection', 'None', 'Allocate Time for Material Development', 'Strengthen assessment systems and conduct regular INSET', 'Sharing of best practices', 'Peer Mentoring', 'None', 'Strengthen the reporting and monitoring mechanism', 'Strengthen home- school partnership', 'Provide academic support and remedial classes as needed', 'Develop localized and contextualized instructional materials', 'Provide appropriate learning materials and support.', 'None', 'Strengthen partnership with MSWD, PNP, and LGU', 'Conduct regular drills and training for staff and students', 'Conduct training for teachers on Mental Health and Psychosocial', 'Prioritize improvement of accessible facilities', 'Align plans with available resources and priorities', 'Recognize and appreciate community contributions', 'Implement meaningful projects that address student needs', 'Regularly gather feedback to improve services', 'Strictly follow the implementation plan', 'Conduct orientation on functions and policies', 'Conduct regular general assembly and meetings.', 'Recognize and appreciate contributions of partners', 'Use results to adjust plans and improve implementation', 'Maintain  transparency in the evaluation process.', 'Strengthen teamwork and communication', 'Plan LAC schedule in advance and align with school calendar.', 'Ensure fairness and transparency in promotion processes.', 'Conduct regular awarding ceremonies ( Quarterly and Year end)', 'Provide clear information and assistance to personnel regarding their compensation.', 'Ensure equity and justice in all tasks and responsibilities.', 'Create a system for reporting and addressing issues.', 'Conduct needs assessment to identify priority areas.', 'Develop a plan and support to improve facilities.', 'Promote awareness on energy and water co