ity and conituous improvement', '', 'Reource management and accountability.', 'Resource Management, Accountability ', 6, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 5, 1, 1, 4, 1, 1, 4, 4, 4, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 6, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Intensified reading remediation through the help of Barangay Education Workers.', 'Strong parental support.', 'Mapping of learners.', 'Develop more contextualized  materials.', 'Maintain the good partnerships and shared accountability and responsibility within school community.', 'Provide more contextualized materials integrating peace and DepEd core values.', 'Utilize test item analysis for more learners intervention program.', 'Only secondary level offers TLE-TVL course offerings.', 'Impose school discipline and orderliness especially during break time.', 'Inculcate God\'s words as moral standard to live out among learners and teachers.', 'Strengthen teacher-parental communication and strengthen family relationship through family moral development program.', 'School and community collaboration on IPED implementation.', 'Resource allocation for disadvantage learners.', 'Children mapping', 'Strengthen CPC.', 'Update DRRM Plan time to time.', 'Established strong community support and mental wellness program.', 'Redesign PWD friendly classrooms  and other facilities.', 'Revisions of strategic plan in school.', 'Strengthen the bond of teachers and stakeholders.', 'Strengthen student leadership.', 'Training on innovation of frontline services to stakeholders.', 'Resource allocation.', 'Encourage strong partnerships.', 'Officers take the lead on some school PPAs.', 'Acknowledge stakeholders participation and collaboration.', 'Conduct monitoring and evaluation on PPAs.', 'Help teachers improve their performance through giving TA and encourage FGD among colleagues.', ' Cooperation and collaboration  among school personnel contributes to office successful performance.', 'Trainings offered should align on the needs of the teachers.', 