motions, professional development, awards).', 'Sustain Efficiency', 'Continue to communicate workload distribution clearly to all personnel.', 'Continue scheduled facility checks to ensure safety and functionality.', 'Continue involving stakeholders in identifying infrastructure needs and prioritizing projects.', 'Allocation of Funds for school Library.', 'Continue ensuring uninterrupted access to water, electricity, and internet services.', 'Provision of Computer laboratory.', 'Continue publishing financial reports and updates for stakeholders.', 'Commit to maintaining standardized and accurate records of all expenditures and liquidation reports.', 'Continue involving parents, learners, and community partners in school planning and activities.', 1, 147, 12, 59),
