rs', 'To send more teachers for training and recommend for promotion', 'To encourage more awardees', 'To sustain the good practice', 'To do the planning regularly', 'To prepare the report regularly', 'To continue the minor repair', 'To encourage advisers to have a reading corner in their classrooms', 'To avail stronger internet service and add hauling of water if there is scarcity of water ', 'Repair and resetting will be charged to MOOE', 'To Sustain the practice', 'To Sustain the practice', 'To assign the ADAS to lead this activity and produce the form to be used', 0, 144, 12, 59);
