nce of this facilities were carried out.', 'Functional and well-maintained ICT classrooms for JHS and SHS.', 'The school received a Division award for top 5 Excellence in Financial management.', 'Submitted liquidation on time with 100% utilization.', 'The school received recognitions as manifestation how committed we are in our mission. We continue to strive harder to sustain all of these.', 1, 3, 12, 61),
