ate School for professional development.', 'Conduct School Recognition to teachers for their Outstanding Performance', 'Adminitrative Officer prepares payroll for incentives and all the benefits. ', 'Conduct Teachers\' Conference on their Work loads', 'School Property Custodian conducts monthly inspection of the school facilities. ', 'Initiate partnership with parents & stakeholders to improve  infrastructure & facilities. ', '', 'Monthly check-up of electrical wirings , internet and water facilities. ', '', 'Utizaion of MOOE is being displayed in the Transparency Board. ', '100% liquidation is being submitted. ', 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 6, 6, 3, 6, 2, 2, 6, 1, 1, 6, 3, 3, 4, 6, 3, 6, 6, 6, 5, 6, 1, 1, 1, 1, 6, 3, 1, 5, 5, 3, 3, 5, 3, 3, 'Strengthen School Reading Program . Conduct Pre=Test & Post Test to ensure that learners will achieve the 100 percent Proficiency Level . ', 'Intensify Classroom Observations & Conduct Regular LAC Session for Teacher Development. ', 'The school does not offer ALS.', 'Contextualized Learning Materials based on the Needs, Inventory of Contextualized Materials ,Certificate of Utilization  ', 'Reading Remediation Program per classroom, Action Plan & Journal ', 'Submission of Daily Daily Lesson Log with integration of the DEpEd Core Values.', 'Quarterly Item analysis must be conducted.', '', 'Conduct Symposium on Anti-Bullying Act', 'Conduct Parents Orientation on their Roles & Duties as parents  & Discussing the Rights of the Child', 'ADM is being strengthened to those LARDO ', 'Action Plan on Different Activities & Accomplishment Report', 'Action Plan on ADM', 'ALS Program is not being implemented in the school.', 'Child Protection Committee is being created.', 'DRRM Plan & Accomplisment Report', 'School Mental Wellness Program must be conducted.', 'Send Teachers to Special Education Training in order for us to cater those learners with special needs.  ', 'SIP ,AIP, APP ,WFP, PPMP are being made & presented  to the Stakeholders.', 'Send Letters to Stakeholders and Make Accomplishments Reports', 'SELG Action Plan must be made.', 'Citizen Charter must be visible.', 'Well -Planned  SIP, AIP & PPMP were being made,', 'Quarterly  Meeting with the  SGC must be conducted.', 'GPTA must be created & Resolutions must be made for a certain Project. ', 'Monthly DPDS must be updated. ', 'Conduct Quarterly SMEA ', 'Development Plans must be identified for future tranings. ', 'All teachers must be promoted to ECP. ', 'Proposal for the LAC Session must be made & the Accomplishment Report. ', 'Majority of the Teachers will be promoted to ECP.', 'Action Proposal for School Gawad Baybayani', 'Updated  Monthly DTR , NOSA ,Leave credits must be updated. ', 'Approved Class Program & Summary of Teaching Loads (Form 7) must be made. ', 'Physical Facilities Inventory Form must be updated & compiled. ', 'Program of Works must be made ', 'School Learning Resource Center must be functional. ', 'Quarterly   payment of water bill, electric bill and internet bill. ', 'Provision of Computers must be made. ', 'MOOE Utilization Certificate', 'MOOE Liquidation Cerification', 'Client Satisfaction Survey must be answered.  ', 1, 145, 12, 59),
