(736, '2026', '129099', 'Inadequate implementation of targeted remediation and intervention programs for struggling learners due to teachers’ heavy workload and multiple ancillary responsibilities', 'Multiple activities hosted by the school, resulting in suspension of face-to-face classes', '', '', 'Insufficient time for remediation because of numerous school-hosted activities', '', '', 'Not applicable', 'Learners have limited awareness that their behavior towards their classmates may already be considered bullying', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Absence of a clear, school-wide mental wellness program or framework', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Unavailability of both internal and external stakeholders due to conflicting schedules and competing priorities, hindering coordination and formal organization of the SGC', '', '', '', 'Lack of a regular schedule and dedicated system for conducting and consolidating the client satisfaction survey results', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Deterioration and poor condition of the school’s existing library, making it unsafe and unusable for learning activities', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Certification', 'Contextualized learning materials based on the needs; Inventory of contextualized materials', '', 'Lesson Plan and Daily Lesson Log', 'Quarterly Item Analysis', '', '', 'Incident Report\' Logbook', 'SRC', 'Approved Project/Activity Proposal; Accomplishment Report', 'ADM/ALS', 'ALS Teachers and ALS Enrollment', 'Accomplished Child Protection Committee Team', 'DRRM Plan', '', 'Special Education and PWD-friendly Facilities Inventory', 'SIP/AIP/WFP/PPMP/APP', 'Letter,  Attendance, Minutes, Pictures, Accomplishment Report', 'Integrated General Plan of Action (IGPOA)', 'Citizen\'s Charter', 'SIP/AIP/APP', '', 'Letter, Attendance, Minutes, Pictures, Accomplishment Report', 'DPDS, MOA', 'SMEA Report, Letter, Attendance, Minutes, Pictures, Accomplishment Report', '', 'IPCR SY 2024-2025, Summary of Ratings', 'OPCR SY 2024-2025', 'Training N