and enhance the systematic use of test item analysis as a basis for instructional improvement through regular data review, collaborative planning, and evidence-based decision-making', 'Not applicable', 'Strengthen learners’ awareness and understanding of bullying behaviors through sustained values education and continuous guidance interventions', 'Sustain a safe and protective learning environment through strict enforcement of child protection policies, continuous monitoring, and proactive safeguarding measures ', 'Further improve learner retention through strengthened early warning systems, targeted interventions, and enhanced stakeholder collaboration', 'Sustain and rev up the implementation of culture-sensitive activities through inclusive practices, continuous capacity-building, and strong community engagement', 'Sustain and expand inclusive and accessible learning opportunities for disadvantaged learners, out-of-school youth, and adult learners through flexible, responsive, and community-based education programs', 'Sustain and strengthen the school’s ALS program through continuous quality implementation, stakeholder support, and regular monitoring to ensure equitable learning opportunities for all learners', 'Sustain and intensify the functionality of the school’s Child Protection Committee through continuous capacity-building, strict policy enforcement, and proactive safeguarding of learners’ welfare', 'Sustain and enhance the implementation of the school’s DRRM plan through continuous capacity-building, regular drills, and proactive risk reduction measures to ensure learner safety and resilience', 'Craft and institutionalize a clear, comprehensive, and school-wide mental wellness program to ensure coordinated, accessible, and sustained psychosocial support for all learners and personnel', 'Continuously develop and improve SNED- and PWD-friendly facilities to ensure accessibility, equity, and full participation of all learners', 'Sustain and strengthen the school’s strategic planning process through evidence-based, participatory, and regularly updated planning aligned with learner needs and institutional goals', 'Sustain the functionality of the school-community planning team through active stakeholder engagement, collaborative decision-making, and continuous coordination', 'Strengthen the functionality of the Supreme Elementary Learner Government (SELG) through leadership development, active participation, and meaningful learner representation', 'Continuously improve and innovate the school’s frontline services through efficient systems, stakeholder feedback mechanisms, and client-centered approaches', 'Ensure the effective operationalization of the school’s strategic plan through a well-defined, results-based implementation plan', 'Establish a functional SGC by setting a fixed coordination schedule and formally organize stakeholders through agreed meetings to ensure full participation and operationalization', 'Sustain a functional PTA through active engagement, transparent collaboration, and shared responsibility for learner development', 'Strengthen collaboration with stakeholders and partner schools through sustained partnerships that support shared goals and continuous improvement', 'Continuously strengthen the school’s monitoring and evaluation system to ensure effective implementation and improvement of all programs, projects, and activities', 'Sustain and enhance personnel performance through continuous coaching, monitoring, and support to achieve very satisfactory IPCRF ratings', 'Maintain high organizational performance by ensuring effective planning, implementation, and evaluation of office functions to attain very satisfactory OPCRF results', 'Always conduct needs-based LAC sessions and professional development activities aligned with identified gaps and priorities for instructional improvement', 'Strengthen systems that support the continuous professional growth and career advancement of its personnel through targeted development opportunities', 'Institutionalize a fair and meaningful recognition and rewards system that celebrates personnel achievements and milestones', 'Ensure the accurate, timely, and transparent processing of salaries, allowances, and other benefits for all personnel', 'Ensure equitable and balanced distribution of teacher workload through transparent planning and regular review of assignments', 'Regularly inspect school infrastructure and facilities to ensure safety, functionality, and compliance with standards', 'Continuously initiate and prioritize improvements of school infrastructure and facilities to enhance the learning environment', 'Rehabilitate and establish a functional library to provide a safe, accessible, and conducive learning resource center for learners', 'Sustain reliable water, electricity, and Internet services to support effective teaching and learning', 'Ensure the functionality and effective utilization of the school’s computer laboratory/classroom to support digital learning', 'Maximize the efficient and strategic utilization of the school MOOE in accordance with approved plans and priorities', 'Ensure timely and complete liquidation of all utilized MOOE in compliance with accounting and auditing rules', 'Establish and implement a regular schedule and standardized system for conducting, consolidating, and utilizing client satisfaction survey results to guide continuous improvement', 1, 150, 12, 59),
