r remediation during vacant periods;\r\nTime management of teachers and collaboration with parents and stakeholders; ', 'Integration in Lesson Plans; Organize monthly values-based recognition programs and \"Peace Camps\" for students.', 'Procure or develop automated item analysis software (Excel-based) to reduce clerical burden.', 'Expand industry mapping; forge new partnerships with local SMEs for Work Immersion.', 'Droga/Bullying awareness campaigns; establish an anonymous reporting system.', 'Conduct seminars on the Child Protection Policy (DO 40, s. 2012) for all stakeholders.', 'Intensify \"Project SARDO\" (Student at Risk of Dropping Out) home visits and provide feeding programs.', 'Integrate localized indigenous knowledge and systems (IKSP) into lesson plans and school celebrations.', 'Conduct community mapping to identify OSYs; offer flexible learning options or ADM', 'Request for a dedicated ALS center/room and coordinate with the District for a permanent facilitator.', 'Schedule regular quarterly CPC meetings to review safety protocols and conduct proactive monitoring.', 'Allocate MOOE funds for safety equipment; conduct unannounced earthquake and fire drills.', 'Partner with the Rural Health Unit (RHU) and SDO  for professional counseling', 'None', 'Conduct quarterly internal reviews to ensure all strategic targets remain relevant to current policies.', 'Conduct orientation and \"refresher\" Simplify data presentations using infographics to make them more accessible to non-educators.', 'Implement a \"Leadership Transition Program\" where outgoing officers mentor incoming ones', 'Utilize digital platforms Implement a QR-code-based satisfaction survey at all frontline desks to gather real-time stakeholder feedback.', 'Maintain a digital dashboard to automate progress tracking.', 'Conduct an SGC orientation; formalize meeting schedules via a Board Resolution.', 'Implement a \"Parent Volunteer Program\" to diversify involvement.', 'Establish a quarterly Stake