(743, '2026', '129032', '*Some Grade 3 learners still struggle with reading fluency and comprehension.\r\n*Presence of non-readers and slow readers.\r\n*Limited reading materials suited to learner\'s levels.\r\n*Lack of consistent reading practice at home.', 'N/A', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', '*Limited programs for out-of-school youth (OSYs) and adult learners\r\n*Lack of resources and personnel to handle alternative learning sessions\r\n*Low awareness and participation from target beneficiaries', '*No established ALS program in the school\r\n*Lack of trained ALS teachers or coordinators\r\n*Limited resources and instructional materials', '', '', '', '*Lack of SPED facilities and appropriate learning resources\r\n*Limited accessibility features (ramps, assistive devices)\r\n*No trained SPED teachers available', '', '*Inconsistent participation of community stakeholders\r\n*Limited coordination and communication\r\n*Scheduling conflicts during meetings.', '', '*Limited use of digital tools for communication and services\r\n*Need for faster and more efficient service delivery\r\n*Some stakeholders have limited access to online platforms.', '', '*Inconsistent attendance of SGC members\r\n*Limited participation in decision- making\r\n*Need for regular meetings.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Delays in processing of salaries and allowances due to administrative and system-related issues.', '', '', '', 'Lack of fully equipped library, insufficient reading materials, absence of designated library space/personnel.', '', 'Insufficient number of computers, outdated equipment, limited ICT resources, and lack of dedicated computer laboratory space.', '', '', '', '', '', '*Teachers are skilled and committed in preparing learning materials\r\n*Support from school head and availability of some resources\r\n*Collaboration among teachers in sharing materials', '*Teachers regularly conduct remedial classes\r\n*Availability of reading intervention programs\r\