ument and share best practices', 'Allocate budget for training; provide equal access to CPD opportunities; establish development plans for personnel', 'Develop a recognition and rewards program; allocate resources for incentives; institutionalize regular recognition activities', 'Sustain efficient payroll processes; ensure continuous coordination with offices; maintain accurate records', 'Maintain equitable workload distribution; regularly review assignments; ensure teacher well-being and work-life balance', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Improve feedback systems (surveys, suggestion boxes); ensure timely response to concerns; increase stakeholder participation in evaluation', 0, 29, 12, 60),
