LE-TVL programs, provide relevant work work immersion opportunities, and ensure that learaners acquire skills aligned with industry standards.', 'The school commits to sustaining a safe and supportive learning environment by strictly enforcing a zero-tolerance policy on bullying through continuous awareness, prompt action, and strong collaboration among stakeholders.', 'The school commits to maintaining a child abuse–free environment through continuous monitoring, reporting mechanisms, and stakeholder vigilance.', 'educed Drop-Out Rate — Sustained', 'Culture-Sensitive Activities Conducted', 'Inclusive Learning Access for Disadvantaged, OSYs & Adults', 'The school commits to sustaining a functional and responsive School-Based ALS program.', 'The school commits to strengthening the Child Protection Committee to ensure continuous learner safety and protection.', 'The school commits to continuously implementing and updating the DRRM plan for safety and preparedness.', 'The school commits to strengthening mental health and wellness support through continuous guidance and counseling services.', 'The school commits to maintaining and further improving accessible and inclusive facilities for learners with special needs and PWDs.', 'The school commits to sustaining a well-developed and regularly updated strategic plan to guide continuous improvement', 'The school maintains an active school-community planning team that supports participatory planning and decision-making.', 'The SSG continues to function actively in student governance and school activities, promoting leadership and participation.', 'The school commits to continuously innovate and improve frontline services to ensure efficient and responsive support to stakeholders.', 'Strengthen continuous monitoring of implementation plan for sustained improvement', 'Strengthen engagement and regular participation of SGC members through scheduled meetings and orientation', 'Sustain PTA engagement through continuous communication and collaboration', 'Maintain and expand partnerships to support school programs and initiatives', 'Continue strengthening data-driven monitoring and evaluation processes', 'Sustain high performance through continuous coaching, mentoring, and performance monitoring', 'Maintain collaborative planning and continuous improvement of office performance', 'Continue conducting relevant and needs-based LAC sessions and professional development activities', 'Sustain support for career advancement and continuous professional growth of personnel.', 'Strengthen recognition system to further motivate personnel and sustain excellence', 'Maintain timely and accurate release of salaries, allowances, and benefits', 'Continuously review workload distribution to ensure fairness and efficiency.', 'Sustain regular inspection and maintenance of school facilities', 'Continue upgrading and improving school facilities based on needs assessment.', 'Strengthen library resources, improve accessibility, and update learning material', 'Maintain and improve stability of utilities, especially internet access', 'Improve ICT facilities through repair, upgrading, and additional equipment acquisition', 'Sustain efficient and transparent utilization of MOOE', 'Maintain timely and accurate liquidation of all MOOE funds', 'Sustain quality service delivery and improve stakeholder satisfaction through continuous feedback mechanisms.', 1, 124, 12, 57),
