(784, '2026', '128945', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Limited industry linkages and formal partnerships.', 'Minimal cases reported; occasional minor conflicts among learners.', 'Sensitivity of cases may lead to underreporting.', 'Economic challenges and family-related issues affecting learner retention.', 'Limited documentation of activities.', 'Limited resources and outreach capacity.', 'Irregular attendance of learners and limited learning materials.', 'Need for more frequent meetings and documentation.', 'Need for more frequent drills and updates.', 'Limited trained personnel and structured programs.', 'Limited specialized facilities and resources.', 'Need for more comprehensive data utilization and wider stakeholder participation in planning.', 'Occasional scheduling conflicts and varying levels of stakeholder engagement.', 'Need to further enhance leadership skills and active participation of some student officers.', 'Limited technological resources and need for more streamlined service delivery systems.', 'Need for stronger alignment between planned activities and available resources.', 'Occasional scheduling conflicts and varying levels of stakeholder participation.', 'Limited attendance in some meetings and varying levels of parent engagement.', 'Limited formalized partnerships and coordination mechanisms.', 'Need for more standardized monitoring tools and documentation consistency.', 'Occasional feedback variations due to differing stakeholder expectations.', 'Occasional variation in performance due to workload distribution and emerging competencies.', 'Need for further alignment of office outputs with evolving DepEd priorities.', 'Limited time for scheduled LAC sessions due to instructional demands.', 'Limited opportunities for higher training and certification for some personnel.', 'Limited resources for formal recognition activities.', 'Occasional delays due to administrative processing and external dependencies.', 'Uneven distribution during peak periods and special assignments.', 'Occasional delays in addressing identified repair needs due to budget constraints.', 'Limited funding for major infrastructure upgrades.', 'Limited updated reading materials and space constraints.', 'Occasional interruptions in internet connectivity and utility services.', 'Limited number of functional units and need for upgrading equipment.', 'Need for improved planning of fund allocation timing and prioritization.', 'Occasional delays in submission of supporting documents.', 'Strong implementation of early grade programs, differentiated instruction, regular monitoring, and active parental involvement.', '', '', 'Sustain and enhance intervention programs, strengthen differentiated instruction, and maintain strong home-school partnerships to support continuous learner progress.', 'Structured intervention programs and continuous learner assessment.', 'Integration in daily lessons and strong modeling by teachers.', 'Availability of assessment data and collaborative review practices', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 6, 2, 1, 2, 5, 6, 5, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 5, 3, 5, 3, 5, 2, 3, 'Sustain and enhance intervention programs, strengthen differentiated instruction, and maintain strong home-school partnerships to support continuous learner progress.', '', '', 'Provide capacity-building on material development, encourage collaborative sharing of resources, and allocate time for contextualization.', 'Strengthen remediation programs, implement flexible schedules, and utilize differentiated strategies to address diverse learning gaps.', 'Sustain integration of values across learning areas and enhance contextualized activities with stakeholder involvement.', 'Provide training on data analysis and strengthen the use of results for instructional planning and improvement.', 'Expand partnerships with local industries, strengthen linkage programs, and mobilize resources to enhance learner competencies and employability skills.', 'The school commits to sustaining a safe environment through continuous monitoring, strengthening reporting mechanisms, and reinforcing values education and anti-bullying campaigns.', 'The school will strengthen confidential reporting systems, provide continuous training on child protection, and enhance coordination with stakeholders to ensure learner safety.', 'The school will sustain early intervention strategies, strengthen learner tracking systems, and expand support programs for at-risk learners.', 'The school commits to institutionalizing and documenting culture-sensitive programs and integrating them into school activities and curriculum.', 'The school will expand outreach programs, strengthen partnerships, and provide flexible learning options to ensure inclusive access.', 'The school commits to strengthening ALS implementation through improved resource allocation, monitoring, and community engagement.', 'The school will ensure regular meetings, proper documentation, and continuous capacity-building for committee members.', 'The school commits to regularly updating the DRRM plan, conducting drills, and strengthening coordination with local disaster response units.', 'The school will enhance mental wellness programs, provide training for teachers, and strengthen referral systems for learners needing support.', 'The school commits to improving accessibility, upgrading facilities, and seeking additional resources to support inclusive education.', 'The school commits to strengthening participatory and data-driven planning processes, ensuring regular review and updating of the strategic plan, and aligning it with school goals and learner needs.', 'The school will sustain active engagement of stakeholders through regular meetings, clear role delineation, and strengthened collaboration in decision-making and planning processes.', 'The school commits to strengthening student leadership through continuous capacity-building, mentoring, and providing meaningful opportunities for participation in school governance.', 'The school will enhance service delivery through the adoption of technology, improved communication systems, and continuous feedback mechanisms to ensure efficiency and responsiveness.', 'The school commits to strengthening the alignment of the implementation plan with the strategic plan through regular monitoring, resource alignment, and periodic review of targets and accomplishments.', 'The school will sustain active and inclusive participation in the SGC through regular meetings, capacity-building activities, and strengthened collaboration in school governance.', 'The school commits to strengthening PTA engagement through regular communication, inclusive participation, and collaborative planning of school programs and activities.', 'The school will formalize and expand partnerships with stakeholders and other schools through MOAs, joint programs, and sustained collaboration for shared learning and resource support.', 'The school will strengthen its monitoring and evaluation system by standardizing tools, improving documentation, and using data-driven results for continuous improvement.', 'The school commits to sustaining performance coaching, targeted mentoring, and continuous feedback mechanisms to maintain and further improve personnel performance.', 'The school will continue strengthening performance alignment through regular planning, monitoring, and evaluation of office outputs to ensure sustained improvement.', 'The school will institutionalize structured LAC schedules, ensure relevance of topics based on needs assessment, and sustain teacher collaboration for continuous professional growth.', 'The school commits to strengthening support for scholarships, trainings, and career advancement opportunities to promote continuous professional growth.\r\n\r\n33. The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel\r\nDegree of Manifestation: Always Manifested\r\nCIGPBs Encountered: Limited resources for formal recognition activities.\r\nFacilitating Factors: Established recognition practices and supportive leadership.\r\nCategory: Social / Institutional\r\nProposed Resolutions/Commitment: The school will sustain and enhance recognition programs to motivate personnel through formal and informal acknowledgment of achievements.\r\n\r\n34. The school facilitates receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation in a timely manner\r\nDegree of Manifestation: Always Manifested\r\nCIGPBs Encountered: Occasional delays due to administrative processing and external dependencies.\r\nFacilitating Factors: Efficient administrative coordination and payroll systems.\r\nCategory: Financial / Institutional\r\nProposed Resolutions/Commitment: The school commits to improving coordination with relevant offices to ensure timely and accurate release of salaries and benefits for all personnel.\r\n\r\n35. Teacher workload is distributed fairly and equitably\r\nDegree of Manifestation: Always Manifested\r\nCIGPBs Encountered: Uneven distribution during peak periods and special assignments.\r\nFacilitating Factors: Collaborative scheduling and leadership oversight.\r\nCategory: Institutional / Technical\r\nProposed Resolutions/Commitment: The school will maintain fair workload distribution through transparent scheduling, regular review of assignments, and consultation with personnel.\r\n\r\nIf you want, I can now merge all Indicators 1–35 into one complete SBM Master Matrix (Word/Excel-ready) so you can submit it as a single consolidated document.', 'The school will sustain and enhance recognition programs to motivate personnel through formal and informal acknowledgment of achievements.', 'The school commits to improving coordination with relevant offices to ensure timely and accurate release of salaries and benefits for all personnel.', 'The school will maintain fair workload distribution through transparent scheduling, regular review of assignments, and consultation with personnel.', 'The school commits to sustaining regular facility inspections and strengthening coordination for timely reporting and prioritization of repair and maintenance needs.', 'Limited funding for major infrastructure upgrades.', 'The school commits to improving library resources, updating learning materials, and enhancing reading programs to maximize library utilization.', 'The school will coordinate with service providers and stakeholders to ensure continuous access to essential utilities and improve reliability of services.', 'The school commits to upgrading ICT facilities, maintaining equipment, and maximizing integration of technology in teaching and learning.', 'The school will ensure efficient and strategic utilization of MOOE through improved planning, prioritization of needs, and regular financial monitoring.', 'The school commits to maintaining timely and complete liquidation of all MOOE expenditures through strict compliance with accounting and documentation requirements.', 'The school commits to sustaining high stakeholder satisfaction through responsive service delivery, continuous feedback mechanisms, and ongoing improvement of school programs and services.', 1, 145, 12, 59);
