(803, '2026', '304253', 'NA', 'Most of the areas focused in the NAT were taken in their previous grade levels. Most of the learners have low retention. They were NAT takers 3 or 4 years ago.', 'NA', 'Some teachers failed to submit their prepared LMs', '', 'Some of the discussions focused merely on the achievement of the objectives.', 'They conducted test item analysis after quarterly exams but were not given actions afterwards due to time constraints in providing remediations immediately after the test. The topic for the next quarter will also be after the exam date.', '', 'Bullying incidents happened in the classrooms, especially at the lower grade levels, but these were also immediately resolved. ', 'There are learners who are identified with family issues; perhaps some of them have abuse incidents. ', 'Some ADM learners dropped out due to a transfer of residence and difficulty complying with their class activities.', '', '', '', '', 'Not thoroughly implemented due to overlapping of activities. ', '', 'There is a SPED program, but the facilities are not sufficient to cater to them.', '', 'Some members are not available during  meetings.', 'Some of the learners are inconsistent with their functions as SSLG members.', 'The school has limited innovations on providing frontline services to the stakeholders. ', 'Sometimes, delayed in implementation.', 'Due to the overlapping of activities, SGC meetings are not conducted.', '', 'Collaboration was conducted but not all are sustained due to time constraint.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Insufficient funds.', 'There is a library, but it has no updated resources.', 'Brown-outs sometimes occurred in the place.', 'The room is available, but the computer desktops are not functional.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'The ARAL English and Math Coordinators are well informed about the program, which made them motivated to followi-up the implementation.', '', '', 'Local industries were always our partners during immersions.', '', '', '', 'The coordinators are well-acquainted with their programs.', 'The SNED, IPED, ADM, and ALS Program are implemented in the school.', 'The coordinator has the heart in implementing the program.', 'The school has supportive community partners.', '', 'The coordinator is the school nurse who is well capacitated in handling this area.', '', 'The School Head initiated the planning.', '', '', '', '', '', 'A Group Chat was created to have regular communication with the PTA members.', '', 'There are coordinators who takes charge in the online monitoring.', 'The M &E for continous improvement was implemented.', 'Technical assistance is provided whenever needed.', 'The target MOVs are noted to ensure that the objectives are implemented.', 'The LAC Plan was prepared as the basis of the implementation.', 'The school is into the improvement of the school personnel to ensure the delivery of quality education.', 'A recognition is embeded in the year-end recognition program.', 'There us a personnel in-charge to take care of this.', 'The assignment of workloads is being monitored.', 'The school personnel is oriented to report immediately the school concerns on infrastructure and facilities so that these are acted upon immediately.', '', '', '', '', 'Revisions to procure the needs are submitted when there is an excess money from the liquidated funds.', 'The AO tracks the utilized money and its excess so that we can  determine the amount we need to use for the revision to ensure that we utilize 100% of our MOOE allocation. ', 0, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 6, 6, 6, 1, 2, 2, 2, 6, 1, 1, 5, 2, 6, 1, 1, 2, 1, 6, 6, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 5, 3, 1, 4, 1, 1, 1, 'NA', 'Conduct remediation activities for the possible takers.', 'NA', 'Assign personnel to update the teachers\' weeklies. ', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Inform the teachers of the inclusion of the monitoring of the integration of peace and DepEd Core Values in their LPs and class observations.', 'Do the TOS for every summative test.', 'Sustain', 'Immediate response of the class advisers when bullying happens among the learners.', 'Strengthen the school counseling program and the Child Protection policy.', 'Have regular contact with the parents or guardians regarding the performance of the ADM learners. ', 'Recognize the well-implemented programs and coordinators', 'Sustain the implementation', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Provide copy of the school handbook with the inclusion of the Child Protection Policy. ', 'Discuss the plan during the school meetings to raise awareness among everyone.', 'Sustain the support for the mental health program.', 'Identify the categories of the PWDs in the school and cater to them based on the existing facilities of the school. Identify the needs and include them in the MOOE.', 'Sustain being a visionary leader.', 'Reorganize the school planning team and agree on the schedule of the meetings and monitoring. Ask for assistance from the SPTA for the representation.', 'Meet the SSLG officers and have them craft their school plans and present them to the students and teachers. Guide these learners by empowering them to realize their programs and projects.', 'Be updated on the trends of providing frontline services using technology. ', 'Strengthen the implementation of the M&E activities.', 'Make an SGC Action Plan so that the targets are determined.', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Invite the stakeholders regularly to the school gatherings', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'Sustain the implementation', 'Sustain the implementation', 'schedule the checking of the school facilities at least twice a month.', 'Strengthen partnerships aside from the inclusion of the budget in the MOOE funds.', 'Provide an ICT equipment connected to Wifi so that the learners could access to the internet when they wanted to research their lessons.', 'Include the procurement of Solar Panels to aid during brownouts.', 'Include it in the reports on the availability of ICT equipment.', 'Ensure that SMEA is religiously conducted so that if there is an adjustment, it is still aligned to the targets. ', 'Sustain the implementation.', 'On-time reporting of the results of the monitoring.', 1, 135, 12, NULL),
(804, '2026', '305672', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Lack of trained personnel in handling bullying cases (e.g., counseling, mediation) &\r\nInsufficient integration of values education and anti-bullying lessons in classroom instruction', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Teachers share best practices, resources, and strategies through collaboration, peer mentoring, and joint planning', 'Teachers demonstrate dedication in providing timely remediation and differentiated instruction based on learners’ needs.', 'Teachers demonstrate respectful, inclusive, and empathetic behavior, serving as role models of peace and core values.', 'The school provides formats for test item analysis (TOS, item analysis tables, answer sheets), ensuring uniformity and accuracy.', '', '', 'The school consistently enforces DepEd Child Protection Policy, ensuring all forms of abuse, violence, exploitation, and discrimination are prevented.', 'The school offers alternative delivery modes (ADM), modular learning, or adjusted schedules for learners with special circumstances.', 'Lessons, activities, and school events incorporate local traditions, indigenous knowledge, and cultural practices.', 'The school conducts information drives encouraging OSYs and adult learners to return to or continue education.', '', 'Proper recording of cases, interventions, and resolutions ensures transparency and accountability.', 'Fire drills, earthquake drills, and evacuation exercises are conducted consistently to ensure readiness.', 'The school has a functional guidance office that provides individual and group counseling, psychosocial support, and referral services.', 'Facilities such as ramps, handrails, wide doorways, and accessible comfort rooms are provided and maintained.', 'Teachers and staff actively engage in planning discussions and contribute ideas for school improvement.', 'The team conducts scheduled meetings for planning, review, and updating of school programs and priorities.', 'Officers are properly oriented on their duties in leadership, service, and student representation.', 'teachers undergo training on customer service, ICT use, and efficient service delivery practices.', 'The School Improvement Plan (SIP) is effectively translated into the Annual Implementation Plan (AIP), ensuring clear action steps for implementation.', 'The council conducts scheduled meetings to discuss school priorities, performance, and improvement initiatives.', 'PTA conducts scheduled general assemblies and meetings to discuss school concerns, projects, and learner welfare.', 'Actively initiates, sustains, and strengthens partnerships with stakeholders, partner schools, LGUs, and private organizations.', 'School decisions are based on collected data such as attendance, performance results, accomplishment reports, and stakeholder feedback.', 'Effective implementation of academic programs, learner support services, and administrative processes contributes to stakeholder satisfaction.', 'Continuous mentoring, coaching, and feedback from school heads and master teachers help improve employee performance.', 'Office goals are properly aligned with DepEd Key Result Areas (KRAs), SIP/AIP priorities, and organizational objectives.', 'Training topics are based on classroom observation results, learner performance data, and teachers’ identified instructional gaps.', 'Actively encourages career growth by prioritizing professional development and supporting personnel in meeting promotion requirements.', 'Clear guidelines are in place for recognizing outstanding performance, service milestones, and special achievements.', 'Regular communication with the Schools Division Office ensures correct computation, validation, and release of salaries and benefits.', 'Assignment of teaching loads follows established DepEd policies considering teaching hours, subject specialization, and ancillary tasks.', 'Designated personnel are responsible for conducting routine checks and reporting the condition of school infrastructure.', 'The SPT integrates infrastructure improvement into the SIP/AIP and ensures proper prioritization of projects.', 'Reading campaigns and literacy programs encourage active use of the library.', 'Preventive and corrective maintenance is implemented to ensure uninterrupted water, electricity, and internet services.', 'Teachers regularly use the computer laboratory for lessons, research, digital literacy activities, and interactive learning.', 'The school head ensures efficient planning, allocation, and utilization of MOOE in accordance with DepEd guidelines and school priorities.', 'Open and systematic reporting of expenditures promotes accuracy and accountability in liquidation.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 1, 2, 2, 5, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 6, 6, 6, 1, 6, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 5, 5, 2, 5, 5, 3, 3, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 27, 12, 60),
