s and certifications', 'Institutionalize a formal recognition and rewards system; allocate budget for incentives; conduct regular awarding ceremonies', 'Sustain efficient payroll coordination; ensure timely submission of documents; establish tracking system for compensation concerns', 'Sustain equitable workload practices; regularly review assignments; ensure alignment with teacher specialization and capacity', 'Sustain regular inspection schedules; improve documentation and reporting system; utilize results for planning and resource allocation', 'Sustain improvement initiatives; prioritize critical repairs; strengthen partnerships with LGU and stakeholders; explore additional funding sources', 'Establish a functional library; allocate space and budget', 'allocate budget for maintenance and upgrades; provide backup systems where possible', 'Establish computer laboratory; procure computers and ICT equipment; seek partnerships and donations; train teachers in ICT integration', 'Sustain effective MOOE utilization; improve procurement planning; ensure alignment of expenditures with school priorities', 'Sustain timely and accurate liquidation; strengthen documentation and tracking system; ensure compliance with accounting and auditing standards', 'Strengthen feedback and grievance mechanisms; regularly analyze satisfaction data; implement improvements based on feedback; ensure transparency and communication', 1, 26, 12, 60);
