(823, '2026', '129090', 'Reading  performance of grade 3 learners is generally low. ', 'Low academic performance of grade 6 learners in key subject areas.', '', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'Many teachers seemed to be very busy in the regular teaching delivery that they tend to disregard the conduct of remediation activities.', 'These and other character-building attributes are seemed to be neglected.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', '', 'SY 2025-2026 was laden with alarming number of bullying cases among learners.', '', 'SY 2025-2026\'s drop-outs have increased compared last school year.', 'Due to overlapping of school activities, this area seems to be not given preferential attention--except in the conduct of ALIVE program for Muslim learners.', '', '', 'There is a felt need to reorient CPC vis\'-a-vis new  issuances on child protection activities', 'No concern on this area.', 'Support mechanism from external source is very much needed.', '', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'There was a concern that SGC might overlap and   compete with the SPTA.', '', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', 'No concern on this area, it just needs to be sustained.', '', '', 'Due to several co-curricular activities, this aspect has almost been neglected. ', 'Due to several co-curricular activities, this aspect has almost been neglected. ', 'Awards are being given during conduct of school programs, flag ceremony, and EOSY recognition activities, these should be sustained.', '', '', 'There is still a need to account all of the supplies, materials, equipment received by the teachers from the very start of their duty in the school.', 'There is an approved budget from LSB for classroom repairs.', '', 'Electric bill is currently being shouldered by the school charged to MOOE.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Constant reminder on teachers to refrain from inflicting harm, avoiding corporal punishment towards their own learners specially in imposing disciplinary measures.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Frequent conduct of SPTA Board Meetings', '', '', '', 'In view of conducting instructional supervision in a collegial manner, teachers are well-motivated to  perform their functions in the delivery of instruction ', 'Due to constant encouragement  & positive feedback provided by top management, the school head has been discharging his duties aligned with the key performance indicators.', '', '', '', 'The Administrative Officer II is doing well in terms of performing this particular task.', 'Teachers are being assigned to grade level, subject areas with high consideration of their potential & competence. ', '', '', '', '', '', 'Conduct of consultation with teacher-stakeholders on their classroom needs vis-a-vis teaching delivery activities.', 'Deadlines on submission are constantly being tracked.', 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 2, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 4, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2, 2, 2, 2, 0, 1, 1, 1, 3, 0, 3, 0, 3, 1, 'Intensify instructional supervisory measures especially in the conduct of reading remediation activities.', 'Provision of much-needed technical assistance, support, and resources.', '', '', 'Conduct strict monitoring on the remediation activities undertaken by teachers', 'teachers have to be reminded to integrate these highly important values into their lessons.', '', '', 'Strict implementation of anti-bullying policy in the school', 'Sustain implementation of child protection measures.', 'Conduct follow up with parents, implement ADM.', 'Conduct activities to highlight learners\' diverse culture ', '', '', 'Reorient CPC.', '', 'Coordinate with relevant government agencies like DSWD, DOH,etc.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Reorient and functionalize the SGC this SY.', 'Sustain.', '', '', 'Sustain.', 'Sustain.', 'Intensify conduct of LAC session and other professional development activities for teachers.', 'Intensify conduct of LAC session and other professional development ', '', 'Sustain.', 'Sustain.', 'Conduct of actual inventory.', 'Make constant follow up.', '', 'Request LGU of Sta.Cruz to return system of payment of electric bill to its account.', '', 'Sustain.', 'Sustain.', '', 0, 150, 12, 59),
