\r\n•	Communicate the plan to all stakeholders\r\n', '•	Clearly define roles and responsibilities of team members\r\n•	Schedule regular meetings for updates and feedback\r\n•	Ensure representation from various stakeholders\r\n•	Align team goals with school objectives\r\n•	Develop and implement a community engagement plan\r\n', '•	Define SSG/SPG roles and responsibilities\r\n•	Encourage student participation in activities\r\n•	Provide guidance from teachers/advisors\r\n•	Hold regular meetings with student leaders\r\n•	Gather feedback from students and act on it\r\n', '•	Determine areas for innovation in frontline services\r\n•	Gather feedback from stakeholders on services\r\n•	Train teachers on innovative approaches\r\n•	Evaluate impact of innovations on stakeholders\r\n', '•	Break down strategic goals into actionable tasks\r\n•	Assign tasks to specific teams/individuals\r\n•	Set realistic timelines for implementation\r\n•	Allocate necessary resources (funds, personnel)\r\n•	Regularly track progress and adjust plan as needed\r\n', '•	Clarify SGC roles and responsibilities\r\n•	Provide SGC training and orientation\r\n•	Encourage active participation\r\n•	Share SGC decisions and plans\r\n•	Ensure SGC has decision-making authority\r\n', '•	Encourage parent participation in PTA activities\r\n•	Foster open communication between PTA and parents\r\n•	Define PTA roles and responsibilities\r\n•	Hold regular PTA meetings with updates\r\n•	Plan projects with PTA and school\r\n', '•	Identify potential stakeholders and schools for collaboration\r\n•	Align partnership goals with school objectives\r\n•	Maintain communication with partners\r\n•	Plan joint projects or activities with partners\r\n•	Ensure partnerships benefit all involved\r\n', '•	Define clear indicators for success\r\n•	Schedule regular monitoring and evaluation\r\n•	Use data to inform decisions\r\n•	Gather feedback from stakeholders\r\n•	Adjust programs based on findings\r\n', '•	Recognize and reward outstanding performance\r\n•	Identify areas for improvement and support staff\r\n•	Align individual goals with school objectives\r\n•	Align individual goals with school objectives.\r\n•	Provide training for growth\r\n•	Foster a culture of feedback and growth\r\n', '•	Maintain efficient office processes\r\n•	Provide training for teacher’s growth\r\n•	Gather feedback for continuous improvement\r\n•	Acknowledge office accomplishments\r\n•	Aim for excellence in next review\r\n', '•	Regularly assessing teacher needs for LACs/L&D\r\n•	Design activities addressing specific needs\r\n•	Encourage teacher participation.\r\n•	Evaluate LAC/L&D impact on teaching\r\n•	Gather feedback for improvement\r\n', '•	Identify teachers’ development needs\r\n•	Provide relevant training and workshops\r\n•	Pair staff with mentors for guidance\r\n•	Support career advancement plans\r\n•	Acknowledge professional growth\r\n', '•	Keep track of service years, achievements\r\n•	Develop a recognition/reward system\r\n•	Acknowledge achievements publicly\r\n•	Celebrating milestones with the school\r\n•	Link recognition for professional growth\r\n', '•	Ensure timely submission of documents\r\n•	Communicate compensation details clearly\r\n•	Quickly address compensation concerns\r\n', '•	Regularly review teacher workloads\r\n•	Define workload distribution criteria.\r\n•	Involve teachers in workload decisions\r\n•	Adjust workloads as needed\r\n•	Provide support for overwhelmed teachers\r\n', '•	Schedule routine infrastructure inspections\r\n•	Address issues promptly\r\n•	Involve staff/students in identifying needs\r\n•	Ensure safety protocols are followed\r\n•	Allocate funds for maintenance/upgrades\r\n', '•	Identify priority areas for improvement\r\n•	Develop improvement plans and budget\r\n•	Involving stakeholders in planning\r\n•	Execute improvements efficiently\r\n•	Evaluating impact on learning environment\r\n', '', '•	Provide multiple Best tank or Water tank', '', '•	Track MOOE usage regularly\r\n•	Allocate funds t