ocate funds for the development and procurement of remediation tools.', 'Continue professional development focused on peace education and values integration.', 'Allocate dedicated time for teachers to conduct and discuss item analysis.', 'Develop guidelines and best practices for school-industry collaboration.', 'Develop clear procedures for reporting and addressing bullying incidents.', 'Continue regular training on identifying, preventing, and responding to all forms of child abuse.', 'Foster positive teacher-learner relationships and inclusive school culture.', 'Uphold policies that protect and promote cultural diversity.', 'Develop and adapt curricula and materials suited for disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult learners.', 'Establish clear roles and responsibilities within the school for ALS management.', 'Strengthen skills in case management, counseling, and confidentiality.', 'Integrate disaster preparedness education into the school curriculum.', 'Provide training for teachers and staff on mental health awareness and basic counseling skills.', 'Develop plans to upgrade and install PWD-friendly infrastructure and resources.', 'rovide capacity-building on strategic planning and data-driven decision-making.', 'Align team functions with school and local government policies.', 'Provide continuous leadership training and workshops for student leaders.', 'Foster a culture that encourages experimentation and learning from failures.', 'Provide training on implementation planning, project management, and M&E.', 'Develop clear protocols for meeting management and documentation.', 'Strengthen collaboration between PTA and school administration.', 'Enhance skills in partnership management and effective communication.', 'Develop clear indicators and tools for effective program assessment.', ' Conduct orientation and capacity building on the proper preparation of IPCR.', 'Establish a monitoring tool to track accomplishments vs. targets monthly.', 'Prepare a realistic LAC schedule that does not conflict with class hours', ' Maintain an updated inventory of staff competencies and career goals.', 'Allocate specific budget in the WFP for recognition programs.', 'Develop and disseminate clear criteria and guidelines for giving awards.', 'Strictly adhere to the guidelines on standard teaching load and ancillary functions.', 'Standardize and update the inspection checklist and reporting format.', 'Update the inventory of facilities and prioritize repair/improvement needs.\r\n• Prepare accurate Program of Works (POW) and estimates.', 'Allocate budget for purchasing new books and supplies.', '', 'Conduct regular inspection of water lines, electrical wirings, and connections.', 'Conduct regular review and monitoring of budget utilization status.', 'Ensure 100% compliance with accounting and auditing rules and regulations.', 'Foster a culture of transparency and responsiveness to stakeholder concerns.', 1, 0, 12, 58),
