', 'Provision of necessary funds, printing materials and technology needed for the production of these learning resources\r\n', 'Conduct regular and systematic remediation activities', 'Consistently integrate topics and activities promoting peace, human rights, and the DepEd Core Values', 'Implement appropriate interventions such as remediation, enhancement or re-teaching based on the data gathered from the analysis', '', 'Information Dissemination and Awareness; Strict Implementation and Intervention', 'Vigilant and Proactive in monitoring the safety and well-being of the students, and immediately report or act on any suspected case of abuse or violation.', 'Provide quality instructions and varied learning opportunities, and maximize available resources and assistance programs like HOME VISITATIONS', 'Ensure inclusivity and sensitivity in all activities and create a learning environment where every learner feels proud of their identity and respects the identity of others.', 'Information, Advocacy and Recruitment through Conduct Mapping and Profiling of OSY and adults in the community', '', 'Uphold the rights and welfare of every learner', 'Promote a culture of safety and preparedness', 'Conduct a Mental Health Assessment', 'Conduct training for teachers on Inclusive Education, handling learners with disabilities', 'DEvelop comprehensive and realistic strategic plans such as SIP and AIP based on actual needs and data', 'Reactivate Membership and  Regular conduct of meetings', 'Recognize the SSG as a partner in achieving school goals and ensure that student voices are heard and considered in school planning and decision making', 'Hired Job Order/Clerk', 'Proposed realistic revisions or relignment of plans through proper channels to adapt to current situations without compromising the overall objectives.', 'Strengthen and reactivate the SGC to become fully functional and operationsl', 'Foster a spirit of cooperation, trust and transparency between the teachers and parents', 'Strengthening Stakeholder Partnerships and Transparency', 'Strengthening the Monitoring Process', 'Continuous Monitoring and coaching; Rewards and Recognition', 'Career Progression; Incentives and Recognition', 'Interactive Learning,Documentation and Certification', 'Career Development Orientation', 'Recognition and Awards', '', 'Prepare a Detailed Workload Matrix, Matching Skills and Assignments', 'Stakeholder Participation, Documentation and Reporting', 'Resource Generation & Partnership', 'Allocate room for School Library', 'Request assistance from LGU', 'Request assistance from LGU', 'Implement Promptly and utilize fully', 'Support System and Utilize fully', 'Sustaining Quality and Standards', 0, 114, 12, 57),
