s availble to stakeholders for feedback and continuos improvement', '90%  and aboveof the  teachers reached Outstanding performance rsting in IPCRF', 'The scjool head achieved Outstanding performance in OPRCF', 'The school  has PD QA /PRC approved programs', '9 personnel have been promoted to within/next career stage', 'Increasd numbers of individiual have been given recognition for exemary skills and achievment', 'No record of unrecievables, monetary or other benfits', 'SF 7 transpired the fair and standard minutes/loading fo teachers', 'NSBI has been validated', 'All school classroom and buildings have been repaired/structured', '', 'The school  maintained the monthly payment of mandayory bills', '', 'The school maintained the 100%. MOOE utilization', 'The school maintained the 100%. MOOE utilization ', 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1, 7, 1, 6, 1, 1, 1, 5, 1, 6, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 3, 1, 5, 5, 1, 3, 1, 3, 3, 'Increased ELLNA result to 75,%', 'Maintain best practices in NAT 6', 'Intensify the strategies snd review methods for the ALS passers', 'Involved the key stage 2 and include other learning areas', 'Include Science and Math with parallel  intensification for improvement', 'Add more learning areas for the peace integration', 'Increased proficiency levell in all lesrning areas', '', 'Conduct guidance counselling regularly to identified learners', 'Maintain the supervision and information dissimanation for VAWC', 'Concretized plans and implemention like regular home visitation, parents conferences and motivational means to bring learners back to school', 'Continue the strong partnership with IPs LGU', 'Increased opportunities for learning and growth for the disadvantaged learners', 'Intensify the promotional and advocacy programs to increase enrolment', 'Provision of support and protection to  identified potential victims', 'Intensify  other activities for  Earthquake and Fire', 'Continue and improve the wellness program of teachers', 'Add more