, 6, 6, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Develop a more cohesive  parent -teacher partnership', 'Intensify the conduct of remedial instruction/intervention', 'Strengthen the support of the program', 'Create/formulate localized resources', 'Intensification of remediation activities', 'Ensuring the integration of topics promoting peace', 'Conduct training relative to uniform process of item analysis', '', 'Strengthening the child protection and anti-bullying', 'Conduct information dissemination drive', 'Strengthen the parent and teacher engagement to help the learner', 'Conduct training to capacitate teaching personnel', 'Coordinate with parents and officers of the barangay ', 'Strengthen the school community engagement', 'Conduct orientation/training relative to the child protection policy', 'Allocate funds', 'Capacitate the school personnel', 'Allocate funds to provide assistive materials', 'Allocate funds to improve the school operation', 'Strengthen the  school-stakeholder  partnership', 'Enhance leadership skills among officers', 'Improve and innovate frontline services ', 'Allocate funds, materials  and manpower based on priorities', 'Strengthen the School Governing Council', 'Strengthening the effectiveness and members engagement to PTA organization', 'Enhance partnership  among school and stakeholder', 'Develop a clear monitoring tool and evaluation system', 'Capacitate school personnel to meet the desire performance ', 'Strengthen the attainment of function and  schedule of activities', 'Strengthen scheduling and planning', 'Prioritize need-based training among personnel', 'Strengthen the process of recognizing/awarding of deserving school personnel', 'Sustain accurate and timely submission of pertinent documents', 'Sustain the proper assigning of teacher workload', 'Strengthening the conduct of inspection of infrastructure for safety', 'Strengthen the stakeholder partnership', 'Strengthen stakeholder partnership', 'Maintain and sustain the s\