(894, '2026', '304316', 'This indicator is for elementary level only', 'No result yet for NAT 12', 'No ALS Offering for JHS Level', 'Reliance on the generic Lesson Exemplar; have not time to contextualize learning materials', '', '', '', '', 'There are still cases of bullying in the school campus although all of it was properly resolved.', 'There are still cases of bullying in the school campus although all of it was properly resolved.', 'There are still cases on drop-outs due to transfer of residence, early pregnancy, child labor among others', '', '', '', '', 'Lack of DRRM Tools and Equipment\r\n\r\nLack of training among personnel on basic skills', 'Limited time to conduct activities on mental wellness due to after class activities', 'Lack of facilities for  SPED Learners\r\n\r\nNo SPED-trained teacher', 'Needs to revise an effective strategic plan', 'Lack of involvement in planning\r\n\r\nConflict of schedule\r\n\r\nNot well oriented on their designated roles', '', 'Frontline services ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Implemented ARAL-Reading Program; Conducted pull-out activity for remediation; provided tutorial for mathematics', 'Integration of these topics in the DLL\r\n\r\nConducted activities on the promotion of peace and DepEd core values', 'Conducted test item analysis every quarter\r\n\r\nUtilize d the results of the analysis to determine what kind of interventions  are to be administered', 'Strengthened partnership with identified stakeholders by conducting regular consultations', '', '', '', 'Adherence to inclusivity and Education For All programs', '', 'Implemented Alternative Learning System in Senior High School\r\n\r\nClose follow-up of learners\r\n\r\nMonitored the progress of the learners\r\n\r\nConducted immediate home visitation  ', 'Adherence to the Child Protection Policy Program\r\n\r\nCreation of the CPC Committee\r\n\r\nActivation of the Committee and Adherence to the perfor