y conduct activities on culture-sensitivity\r\n\r\nIntegration of theses topics in the DLL', '', 'Sustain the ALS Program', 'Intense implementation of the program', 'Craft a functional DRRM Plan\r\n\r\nConduct training on DRRM among personnel\r\n\r\nTap other relevant stakeholders who can assist in the SRRM Planiing', 'Devise an Action Plan for mental wellness\r\n\r\nCreate a team/committee who will be in-charge of the activities\r\n\r\nConduct activities, initiate programs for mental wellness', 'Identify SPED Teacher who will be assigned to this class\r\n\r\nConduct training to teachers on how to identify learners who belong to SPED\r\n\r\nProcure materials for the learner', 'Develop a strategic plan with the school planning team to ensure its effectiveness', 'Conduct orientation among the planning team\r\n\r\nDistinguish their respective roles and responsibilities\r\nActive involvement in the planning', 'Provide support to the needs of the SSLG to continue to improve their performance', 'Render efficient and prompt delivery of services', '', '', '', '', '', 'To give reliable feedback during mid-year review\r\n\r\nProvide technical assistance regarding the issues encountered by the personnel\r\n\r\nconstant follow-up', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, 1, 12, 61),
