unctional water, sometimes no water due to line damages, the school has the electricity connection but outages similarly observed and unstable network signal and internet has sometimes observed in other words needs data and strong connection of network is demanded', 'No Computer laboratory room in the school due to building scarcity', '', '', '', 'The grade 6 learners underwent intensive review with NAT like assessments with the dedication of teachers', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Intensification of  No Bullying policy to all key players especially the learners ', 'Convening always with key player in education and guiding them with proper dealing and non-violent discipline.', 'The school maintain dealing with learners and parents with utmost respect and fairness', 'The school maintain and respect the differences and conduct activites which is suited to the culture of the community of Mandaya', 'The school done the community mapping activites', '', 'Organized CPC', 'Activation of DRRM plan  and consistent drills and practice/simulations', '', '', '', 'The school organized SPT to help plans for good and continuesimprovement of the school', 'The organized SELG trained to be more responsible at all times', 'The stakeholders awareness on the school offerings and frontline services', 'Strategic plan is the basis in the operating things in school', 'The school has organized SGC officials', 'The school organized PTA', 'The school maintain its strong sense of partnership towards external and internal stakeholders believing that cooperation brings success', '', '', 'The school teaching and non teaching personnel always  make the best they can be showing that they\'re committed to work', 'The school achieved VS rating because of their deligence and standard performances', '', '', '', 'The school always facilitates the claims and other benefits like Hardship Allowance and other increments of personnel', 'The workload was equally distributed', '', '', '', '', '', 'The school mainta