icers or NTP to help monitoring PAPs', 'The teacher remains committed to do the job, responsibilities attached to the position.', 'The school is encourage to be outstanding next school year bagging the strong performance', 'The school must conduct the properly LAC time frame to help increase proficiency and strategies in teaching subjects', 'The promotion of personnel must be prioritized also believing that when they get promoted they\'re eager to play their roles and success must be met in the end they\'re compensated too.', 'The school or teachers must join, enter to any competition, awarding of excellence to other field.', 'Since the school have this manner of facilitating correct benefits, no resolution being suggested but to maintain it', 'The load was fairly and equitably enough', 'We can inspect but some damages of building must have an action from the higher NSBI since damages of earthquake took seriously', 'Needs supplemental funds to major repair of other infrastructures', 'The books are obsolete, K to 12, where MATATAG or revised k to 12  is not even found in mini library it suggest to procure books and be distributed to all schools, sometimes distribution is not fair and square to all', 'Electricity and internet in strongly demanded in school, these problems leads to the delay of reports submission and other data accuracy.', 'The school suggest to the NSBI to have a new building that is typhoon inspired. The 2 buildings there was built 1968 as per record', 'This practice needs to be maintained', 'This practice needs to be maintained', 'Maintain the good rapport especially the stakeholders', 1, 14, 12, 61),
