(923, '2026', '316107', '', 'The school is located where the internet connection is limited and the number of laptops available for use is also lacking. Thus, teachers are also limited as to the 21st century strategies that they can use.', '', 'Teachers need more technical assistance and trainings on crafting contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of the learners.', '', 'Re-orientation of the teachers regarding on the integration of peace and DepEd Core Values is needed', '', 'The school only offers General Academic Strand which limits its engagement for local industries', 'Nowadays, students\' innate playful attitude sometimes lead to bullying.', '', 'Some students only enroll on the first quarter of the class and are no longer participating for the rest of the school year.', 'Stereotyping risks where activities sometimes turn into \"costume day\" instead of focusing on the activities\' real context.', 'Social and Personal factors where OSYs feel shame and stigma in coming and sitting with younger students or admit that they dropped-out of school in the past', 'Limited resources and manpower for ALS', 'Other members of the CPC are not so active ', '', 'There is no trained expert for mental wellness', '', '', 'Limited availability of some of the members of the planning team from the external stakeholders', '', '', '', 'Limited availability of some of the external stakeholders', '', 'Limited availability of stakeholders', 'Availability of time that can gather the monitoring team due to conflict of schedule', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Some facilities needs repair that are beyond the capacity of the school', '', 'The library is being used as a temporary classroom due to shortage of number of classrooms', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Constant monitoring is done for the conduct of remediation activities', '', 'Teachers use an application in checking the students\' exams which automatically generates the Test Item Analysis', '', '', 'The scho