ations', 'Strengthen monitoring of students\' attendance and follow-up students\' academic standing', 'Deepen teachers\' and students\' commitment to the conduct of culture-sensitive activities', 'Strengthen support and motivation among potential students (OSYS); Conduct child mapping', 'Request additional building and teachers to cater ALS', '', 'Continue on monitoring the DRRM Activities', 'Send Guidance Advocates to trainings for the  Mental Wellness Activities', 'Request for more PWD-friendly facility', 'Continue  on complying the required documents', 'Strengthen commitment and support of external stakeholders', 'Sustain the usual practice', 'Continue the initiated projects extended to the community', 'Sustain prompt compliance', 'Strengthen commitment and support of external stakeholders', 'Continue what has been started', 'Strengthen collaboration with stakeholders', 'Improve communication with the monitoring and planning team', 'Strengthen monitoring of personnel\'s performance', 'Strengthen monitoring of personnel\'s performance', 'Strengthen monitoring of personnel\'s performance', 'Continue Prompt and constant support to personnel', 'Continue Prompt and constant support to personnel', 'Continue Prompt and constant support to personnel', 'Continue Prompt and constant support to personnel', 'Request Local Government Unit for assistance', 'sustain and continue prompt and regular inspection of personnel assigned', 'Request Local Government Unit for assistance', 'sustain and continue prompt and regular inspection', 'sustain and continue prompt and regular inspection', 'sustain and continue prompt and regular inspection', 'sustain and continue prompt and regular inspection', 'Continue and sustain', 0, 3, 12, 61),
