 active, offering life-changing educational pathways right on our campus.', 'Maintaining an active and fully operational Child Protection Committee dedicated to ensuring student welfare.', 'Institutionalizing DRRM framework is in place to safeguard the school community against disasters.', 'Active mental wellness support mechanism is fully integrated into the school’s student services.', 'Equipping school with inclusive infrastructure that meets global accessibility standards.', 'The institution is formulating a comprehensive strategic roadmap to guide its future development.', 'Unified planning team ensures that community voices are integrated into school development.', 'SSLG serves as a dynamic platform for student leadership and civic engagement within the school.', 'Frontline services in school should be foster where stakeholders will be involved.', 'Ensures strategic vision is effectively executed by transforming high-level goals into concrete, results-driven actions within its implementation plan.', 'Active and fully operational School Governance Council (SGC) that serves as a cornerstone for collaborative leadership and decision-making.', 'Leverage fully operational PTA to effectively mobilize community resources and enhance the learning environment.\"', 'Cultivate a culture of collaboration by engaging with community partners and academic peers to drive continuous school improvement.', 'Employs a rigorous review process to measure the effectiveness of its programs, ensuring data-driven adjustments for continuous improvement.', 'Sustaining a culture of excellence, with staff achieving an average performance rating of \'Very Satisfactory or even higher.', 'Institutional efficiency remains high, with an average OPCRF rating of \'Very Satisfactory\' across all key result areas.', 'A comprehensive L&D framework is in place, utilizing needs-based LAC sessions to enhance instructional competence.', 'Committed to the systematic promotion and continuous upskilling of