ly 30- minute guided reading for struggling learners.         \r\n- Weekly small-group sessions using manipulatives and problem-drills.', 'Monthly LAC sessions where teachers check each other\'s lesson plans for values integration.', 'Teachers analyze test resukts (difficulty index, discrimination index, common errors) and identify weak areas.\r\n- Teachers in the same subject collaborate to refine test items and align them with competencies.', 'Organize quarterly meetings with local industries to discuss collaboration opportunities.\r\nFormalize partnerships with industries for resource sharing and immersion programs. ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, 129, 12, 104);
