akes analysis easier to use', 'Provide sustainable supply of learning resources', 'Strengthen anti-bullying campaigns, conduct regular orientation for learners and parents, and enhance monitoring and reporting mechanisms.', 'Sustain awareness programs, strengthen reporting systems, and continue collaboration with parents and community partners.', 'Intensify learner tracking, strengthen home visitation programs, provide interventions for at-risk learners, and engage stakeholders in retention initiatives.', 'Continue implementing inclusive and culture-sensitive programs and strengthen partnerships with cultural groups.', 'Strengthen community mapping, provide flexible learning opportunities, and seek support from LGUs and partners for resources.', 'Coordinate with ALS focal persons, conduct advocacy campaigns, allocate resources, and establish partnerships to support ALS implementation.', 'Conduct regular meetings, provide capacity-building activities, and strengthen monitoring and documentation processes.', 'Sustain DRRM activities, update plans regularly, and continue capacity-building and emergency preparedness programs.', 'Continue mental wellness programs, strengthen referral systems, and provide ongoing psychosocial support services', 'Prioritize construction and improvement of PWD-friendly facilities, mobilize resources, and advocate for additional funding and support.', 'Continue participatory strategic planning, regularly review and update plans, and ensure alignment with DepEd goals and community needs.', 'Sustain stakeholder involvement, strengthen community partnerships, and ensure regular monitoring and evaluation of plans and programs.', 'Continue leadership development activities, strengthen student representation in school governance, and support initiatives that promote learner participation.', 'Enhance the use of digital platforms, provide capacity-building activities for personnel, improve ICT resources, and \r\nstrengthen stakeholder feedback mechanisms to improve service delivery.\r\n', 'Continue effective implementation of plans, conduct periodic reviews, and ensure alignment of activities with school goals and priorities.', 'Strengthen stakeholder engagement, conduct regular meetings, provide orientation to members, and improve communication and coordination mechanisms.', 'Sustain active PTA involvement, strengthen communication channels, and encourage greater participation in school improvement initiatives.', 'Continue building partnerships, expand collaborative programs, and strengthen stakeholder engagement for sustainable support.', 'Maintain regular monitoring and evaluation activities, improve data management systems, and utilize findings for continuous improvement.', 'Sustain performance management practices, provide continuous coaching and mentoring, and recognize outstanding accomplishments of personnel.', 'Continue improving organizational performance through regular monitoring, evaluation, and collaborative planning.', 'Sustain relevant LAC and L&D activities and ensure alignment with teachers’ professional development needs.', 'Continue supporting personnel in attending trainings, pursuing higher studies, and engaging in professional growth activities.', 'Maintain recognition and incentive programs and strengthen appreciation initiatives that promote employee motivation and excellence.', 'Sustain accurate and timely processing of personnel benefits and ensure prompt resolution of compensation-related concerns.', 'Continue equitable distribution of workloads, regularly review assignments, and address workload concerns through consultation and proper scheduling.', 'Continue periodic inspections, document findings, and implement timely corrective actions to ensure safety and functionality.', 'Sustain infrastructure improvement initiatives and strengthen partnerships to support future development projects', 'Allocate resources for library improvement, acquire updated learning materials, designate library personnel, and seek stakeholder support for library development.', 'Maintain regular inspection and maintenance of utilities and ensure uninterrupted access to essential services.', 'Prioritize the establishment of a computer laboratory, seek funding and donations for ICT equipment, and strengthen partnerships with stakeholders and government agencies.', 'Continue prudent financial management and ensure that expenditures are aligned with school priorities and improvement plans.', 'Sustain accurate and timely liquidation practices and strengthen capacity-', 'Sustain quality service delivery, strengthen feedback mechanisms, and address stakeholder concerns promptly to maintain satisfaction levels.', 0, 126, 12, 103),
