ocess.', 'Commit to regularly conduct test item analysis as an essential part of the teaching and learning process to ensure data - driven instruction and improved learner achievement.', '', 'Intensify awareness campaigns, orientations, and classroom discussions on child protection, anti-bullying policies, and responsible learner behavior.', 'Commit to sustain a safe, protective, and nurturing school environment that ensures zero incidence of child abuse in all its forms.', 'Establish an early warning and tracking system to identify learners at risk of dropping out based on attendance, academic performance, and behavior.\r\n-Intensify home visitation, learner follow-up, and counselling services for Identified -at-risks and absentee learners', 'Commit to uphold and promote cultural sensitivity  in all school programs, activities, and interactions.', 'Commit to ensure equitable access to quality learning opportunities for disadvantaged learners, out - of - school youth (OSY), and adult learners.', 'Commit to fully support and sustain a functional ALS program that provide s accessible, flexible, and quality basic education to all learners.', 'Commit to fully support and strengthen the effective functioning of the Child Protection Committee in ensuring safe, secure, and child - friendly learning environment.', 'Commit to fully support and sustain the effective implementation of the SDRRM Plan to ensure safety and preparedness of the entire school community.', 'Commit to fully support and strengthen a functional mental wellness support mechanism that promotes the holistic well - being of all members of the school community.', 'Conduct a comprehensive accessibility audit of the school facilities to identify barriers affecting learners with disabilities\r\n- Develop and implement infrastructure improvement projects such as ramps, accessible comfort rooms, handrails, signage and other PWD-friendly facilities.', 'Commit to actively participate in the formulation, implementat