ues-based LAC sessions.', 'Ensuring all new staff are fully traied i the school\'s digital items analysis tools.', '', 'Active child Protection Committee (CPC) and strong teacher-student rapport.', 'Active child Protection Committee (CPC) and strong teacher-student rapport.', '', 'Rich local culture heritage and cooperative community elders.', 'Functional ALS program and dedicated mobile teachers.', 'Dedicated mobile teachers and strong partnership with the Barangay for venue use.', 'High level of trust between students and teachers.', 'Regualr conduct of earthquake and fire drills', 'Integration of wellness topics in homeroom guidance.', '', 'Strong commitment from the School Planning Team and a cler vision for school improvement.', 'Active participation of the Barnagay Council and PTA in school activities.', '', '', 'Availability of clear template and guidance from the Division.', '', 'High level of trust and cooperation between the school administration and parents.', 'Existing strong ties with the Barangay Council and local religious organizations.', 'Established School Monitoring and Evaluation (SME) team and regular monthly staff meetings.', 'Strong culture of trasparency and open communication between the school head and the community.', 'Strong commitment of teachers to execellence and regular performance mentoring by the School Head', 'Collaborative school culture and clear alignment of school project with the Annual Implementation Plan (AIP).', 'Functional Learning Action Cell (LAC) structure and a culture of sharing among the teaching staff.', 'High motivation among staff for career advancement and supportive school leadership.', 'Active R&R Committee and a positive school climate that celebrates success.', 'Diligent school clerk/designate and efficient record-keeping.', 'Use of the standard School Form 7 (SF7) and open diaglogue during faculty meetings', 'Active School Facilities Coordinator and regular monthly inspection schedules.', 'Strong support from the PTA for minor labor-intensive repairs (bayanihan).', '', '', '', 'Early preparation of the Anual Implementation Plan (AIP) and a highly active school Bids and Awards Committee (BAC).', 'Strong internal auditing practices and meticulous record-keeping by the school\'s fiscal team.', 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 6, 6, 3, 1, 2, 1, 2, 5, 6, 5, 2, 2, 6, 1, 2, 6, 6, 2, 1, 6, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 2, 1, 'Commit to providing updating localized reading and numeracy materials to maintain 100% proficiency.', 'Continue regular mock tests and provide targeted remediation for students in critical learning areas.', 'Institutionalize a Graduates\' Tracking System and provide incentives for mobile teachers who reach remote sitios.', 'Provide a dedicated Learning Hub with equipment; conduct a specialized workshop on Indigenization and Localized of materials.', 'Institutionalize a reward system for students who show significant progress during remediation.', 'Conduct a workshop on the development of localized Peace Education lesson exemplars; invite community elders for a Living History sharing sessions.', 'Conduct quarterly Peer Learning Cell to share advanced item analysis techniques among staff.', 'Seek assistance from the Division Office or LGU to identify potential industry partners; institutionalize an industry day to invite local stakeholders for vocational career orientation.', 'Conduct regular Home -School Safety orientation; institutionalize a Safe Box or digital feedback line for anonymous reporting.', 'Conduct regular Home -School Safety orientation; institutionalize a Safe Box or digital feedback line for anonymous reporting.', 'Strengthen the Adopt-a-Student program with local stakeholders; coordinate with the LGU for potential transport assistance or flexible learning schedule during harvest seasons.', 'Conduct a workshop on the development of indigenous Peoples Education (IPED) localized materials; invite community leaders for cultural sharing sessions.', 'Institutionalize a Community-Based Mapping system in partnership with the Barangay; request for additional mobile teaching kits and portable learning tablets.', 'Institutionalize Project ALS Trace to track the progress and employment status of certified completers.', 'Conduct specialized training for CPC Members on updated child protection policies and remote reporting procedures.', 'Coordinate with the Municipal DRRM Office for a site-specific hazard assessment and equipment donation.', 'Establish a Wellness Corner in the school and conduct Mental Health Awareness sessions for both parents and students.', 'Request for Capital Outlay from the Division Office for the construction of PWD-compliant ramps and a dedicated SPED resource', 'Institutionalize an annual Stakeholders\' Strategic Forum to review and update the SIP/AIP regularly.', 'Provide orientation and capacity-building sessions for community members on school governance and the SBM framework.', 'Establish a formal Leadership Mentoring Program where teachers coach student officers on project management and time management.', 'Develop a Document Request Hotline or a simple tet-based trackig system to streamline frontline services requests for remote parents.', 'Conduct a mid-year Implementation Review to adjust timeline and resource based on actual school needs.', 'Institutionalize a quarterly SGC Summit with pre-set dates to ensure higher attendance; provide members with a simplified Governance.', 'Sustain the Sitio-Based PTA Meetings to reach parents who cannot travel to the school; recognize outstanding PTA project annually.', 'Develop a Partnership Directory to track all collaboration and institutionalize a Stakeholders Appreciation Day.', 'Institutionalize a Sitio-Based Monitoring Tool that allows community leaders to assist in tracking program progress in their respective areas.', 'Instititionalize a Digital MOV Hub where teachers can save and organize their evidence throughout the year to avoid a year-end rush.', 'Conduct a quarterly OPCRF Progress Review to identify which targets need more support before the final evaluation phase.', 'Request the Division Office for Mobile Technical Assistance Teams to visit the school for specialized training.', 'Institutionalize a Career Pathing Workshop to help teachers prepare their portfolios early; advocate for more quo9te allocations for remote schools.', 'Formalize a partnership with the local LGU or private stakeholders to sponsor annual Excellence Awards for school personnel.', 'Request for a digital tracking system from the Division Office to monitor the status of personnel claims in real-time.', 'Develop an Ancillary task Dashboard to visualize the distribution of roles and ensure no single teacher is overload with more than three major coordinatorships.', 'Request for technical assistance from Division Engineer for a comprehensive structure audit of all school buildings.', 'Institutionalize a Facilities Improvement Plan Inked to LGU funding or private sector donations for repairs.', 'Request for the construction of a standard library building and a provision for a Library Hub starter collection of books.', 'Coordinate with the LGU and service providers for the installation of solar power system, water filtration, and satellite-based internet) Starlink or similar.', 'Request for the provision of a Computer Package (DCP) and the construction of a dedicated, secure E-Learning room.', 'Istitutionalize a Supplier Mapping activity at the start of the year to identify and assist local vendors with accreditation requirements.', 'Request technical assistance for the adoptation of a digital Liquidation Tracking System to allow for pre-submission checks and reduce physical travel for corrections.', 'Conduct \r\nstakeholders Feedback Assemblies during schedule school events to gather face-to-face qualitative feedback alongside written surveys.', 0, 30, 12, 60),
