(1091, '2026', '129113', '', '', 'Lack of consolidated records on ALS learner enrollment, attendance, and certification results', 'Limited time for material development, lack of printing resources, and insufficient training on contextualization strategies', 'Limited time due to packed class schedules, insufficient remedial materials, and varied learner levels requiring differentiated instruction', 'Limited instructional time for values integration, lack of structured lesson exemplars, and inconsistent integration across learning areas', 'Limited training on test item analysis, lack of standardized tools/templates, and time constraints due to workload of teachers', '', 'Occasional unreported minor peer conflicts, limited student awareness on proper reporting channels, and need for continuous monitoring in some areas', '', '', 'Limited integration of indigenous/local cultural practices in some school activities, and occasional lack of structured planning for cultural programs', 'Limited outreach activities for OSYs and adult learners, lack of updated database of target learners, and insufficient flexible learning delivery mechanisms', 'Absence of updated records on ALS program implementation, learner enrollment, attendance, and certification outputs', 'Inconsistent scheduling of CPC meetings, limited documentation of cases and activities, and need for continuous capacity building of members', 'Limited updating and simulation drills, incomplete documentation of DRRM activities, and need for continuous capacity building of DRRM personnel', 'Limited mental health resources and personnel, irregular counseling sessions, and low learner awareness on available support services', 'Incomplete accessibility features (e.g., ramps, railings, toilets), limited assistive learning materials, and insufficient SPED-trained personnel', 'Lack of updated strategic planning outputs (e.g., SIP/AIP), limited stakeholder participation in planning, and insufficient technical guidance in strategic formulation and review', 'Inconsistent participation of some members, limited documentation of planning outputs, and occasional weak engagement of some community stakeholders', '', 'Limited ICT infrastructure, inconsistent implementation of innovations across offices, and need for continuous staff upskilling in digital systems', 'Weak translation of strategic objectives into actionable activities, limited monitoring of implementation progress, and insufficient alignment between SIP/AIP and actual school activities', 'Infrequent meetings and participation of members, limited awareness of roles and functions, and weak documentation of council outputs and decisions', '', 'Limited formalized partnerships (MOA/MOU), irregular coordination activities, and dependence on occasional stakeholder initiatives', 'Inconsistent documentation of M&E results, limited use of data for decision-making, and occasional delays in consolidating reports', 'Inconsistent stakeholder feedback mechanisms, limited customer satisfaction monitoring, and gaps in addressing concerns and service expectations', '', '', '', '', 'Lack of structured recognition system, limited budget allocation for awards and incentives, and inconsistent documentation of personnel achievements', 'Occasional delays in processing due to documentation issues, intermittent payroll adjustments, and dependence on external payroll systems', '', '', 'Limited funding for major repairs and upgrades, dependence on external support, and delays in procurement and implementation processes', 'Lack of dedicated library space, insufficient library materials and equipment, and absence of a trained librarian or assigned focal person', '', 'Occasional intermittent internet connectivity and minor Lack of dedicated computer laboratory space, insufficient number of functional computers, limited ICT equipment and maintenance support, and absence of stable network setup for ICT-based instructionmaintenance issues in utilities', '', '', 'Strong leadership support and supervision', 'Active participation of teachers, learners, and stakeholders in academic interventions and review sessions', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Strong implementation of Child Protection Policy, active guidance and counseling services, regular monitoring by school personnel, and strong collaboration with parents and stakeholders', 'Strong learner monitoring system, active homeroom guidance, teacher home visitation (where applicable), and strong parent/community engagement', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Strong support from school administration, active student participation, regular elections and meetings, and guidance of SSG/SPG advisers', '', '', '', 'Strong collaboration between parents and teachers, active PTA leadership, regular meetings and communication, and strong support from school administration', '', '', '', 'Strong performance monitoring system, regular coaching and mentoring by school leadership, and active commitment of personnel to meet performance standards', 'Strong leadership and management practices, clear office targets and work plans, and committed personnel collaboration in achieving performance goals', 'Strong support from school leadership, active participation of teachers, and established LAC system guided by DepEd policies', 'Strong support from school leadership, active participation of personnel in professional development activities, and access to DepEd training programs and guidelines', '', '', 'Strong instructional leadership, collaborative planning among teachers, and clear assignment of teaching loads based on DepEd guidelines', 'Regular facility inspection schedule, active involvement of school maintenance personnel, and support from school leadership and stakeholders', '', '', 'Established utility connections, support from LGU and service providers, and school maintenance system for facilities', '', 'Strong financial management system, adherence to DepEd budgeting guidelines, and active planning and prioritization of school needs', 'Strong adherence to accounting and auditing rules, active coordination between school and finance personnel, and well-organized financial documentation system', 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 6, 2, 2, 6, 2, 1, 6, 5, 6, 5, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 6, 1, 6, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Sustain intensive reading and numeracy interventions, provide additional learning resources, and strengthen monitoring and assessment of learners’ progress.', 'Continue strengthening review and enrichment programs, provide updated learning resources, and sustain collaborative monitoring of learners’ performance.', 'Establish a proper ALS learner tracking and documentation system, coordinate with ALS implementers for updated records, and conduct regular data validation and monitoring to ensure accurate reporting.', 'Strengthen teacher training on contextualization, allocate time for LAC development of learning materials, and provide adequate printing and ICT resources to improve quality and consistency of localized instructional materials.', 'Strengthen structured remediation programs, allocate dedicated remediation time, develop differentiated learning materials, and enhance continuous assessment and monitoring of learners’ progress.', 'Strengthen lesson planning integration of peace education and core values, provide structured exemplars and training, and ensure consistent monitoring of values integration across all learning areas.', 'Conduct training on test item analysis, provide standardized templates and tools, integrate analysis into regular LAC sessions, and institutionalize its use in instructional planning and remediation.', '', 'Strengthen child protection advocacy, intensify awareness campaigns on anti-bullying policy, improve reporting mechanisms, and sustain close monitoring and counseling interventions for learners.', 'ustain strict implementation of child protection policy, conduct regular orientation and awareness activities, strengthen reporting and monitoring mechanisms, and continue close coordination with stakeholders to maintain a safe learning environment.', 'Sustain learner tracking and early warning system, strengthen home visitation and counseling support, enhance stakeholder involvement, and implement continuous interventions for at-risk learners to maintain low dropout rates.', 'Strengthen integration of culture-based education in school programs, coordinate with community elders and cultural leaders, and institutionalize regular culture-sensitive activities in the school calendar.', 'Strengthen community mapping and profiling of OSYs and adult learners, expand ALS and flexible learning modalities, conduct regular outreach and advocacy activities, and enhance coordination with barangay and community stakeholders.', 'Establish a functional ALS monitoring and documentation system, coordinate with ALS implementers for updated program reports, and conduct regular data gathering and validation to support evidence-based planning and reporting.', 'Strengthen regular conduct of CPC meetings, improve documentation and reporting system, provide capacity-building activities for members, and ensure strict implementation of Child Protection Policy in all school activities.', 'Regularly update and enhance the DRRM plan, conduct periodic drills and simulations, strengthen documentation and monitoring of activities, and provide continuous training for DRRM committee members and stakeholders.', 'Strengthen school-based mental health program, increase frequency of counseling and psychosocial support activities, conduct mental health awareness campaigns, and enhance referral system for learners needing specialized care.', 'Improve accessibility infrastructure (ramps, handrails, PWD-friendly comfort rooms), strengthen provision of assistive learning materials, and provide continuous training for teachers on inclusive and SPED-responsive practices.', 'Strengthen capacity building on strategic planning, ensure regular updating and implementation of SIP/AIP, engage stakeholders in participatory planning, and provide technical assistance for evidence-based and outcome-oriented strategic planning processes.', 'Strengthen regular meetings and active participation of all members, improve documentation of planning outputs, and enhance sustained engagement of community stakeholders in school planning and decision-making processes.', 'Sustain leadership training and mentoring programs for student officers, strengthen documentation of SSG/SPG activities, and continue active support from advisers and school leadership to maintain effective student governance and participation.', 'Strengthen ICT infrastructure and digitalization of frontline services, conduct continuous training on innovation and customer service systems, and institutionalize standardized processes to ensure consistent and efficient service delivery to stakeholders.', 'Strengthen alignment of SIP/AIP with clear and actionable implementation plans, enhance regular monitoring and evaluation of plan execution, provide technical assistance on operational planning, and ensure stakeholder participation in implementation and review processes.', 'Strengthen organization and regular conduct of SGC meetings, clarify roles and responsibilities of members, improve documentation and monitoring of decisions, and enhance stakeholder engagement and capacity building for effective school governance.', 'Sustain active parent engagement through regular communication and consultation, strengthen PTA capacity-building activities, and maintain strong collaboration in planning and implementing school programs and projects.', 'Strengthen formal partnership agreements (MOA/MOU), establish regular coordination meetings and joint activities with stakeholders and nearby schools, and enhance partnership mapping and networking to sustain collaboration.', 'Strengthen the school’s monitoring and evaluation system, improve documentation and reporting processes, and ensure regular use of data-driven results for planning, decision-making, and program improvement.', 'Sustain regular performance monitoring and coaching, enhance professional development opportunities, and continuously align individual performance goals with school improvement priorities to maintain high performance ratings.', 'Strong leadership and management practices, clear office targets and work plans, and committed personnel collaboration in achieving performance goals', 'Sustain regular and needs-based LAC sessions, strengthen planning based on identified learning gaps, and enhance partnerships with experts and resource persons to improve the quality of professional development activities.', 'Sustain systematic professional development planning, encourage participation in scholarships and advanced trainings, strengthen internal mentoring/coaching systems, and ensure equitable access to promotion and upskilling opportunities for all personnel.', 'Establish a formal recognition and rewards system, allocate budget for incentives and awards, regularly document personnel achievements, and institutionalize recognition activities during school programs and milestones.', 'Strengthen payroll monitoring and validation processes, ensure timely submission of required documents, improve coordination with finance offices, and maintain accurate records to minimize delays and discrepancies in compensation.', 'Sustain transparent workload allocation, regularly review teaching assignments, and continue collaborative planning to ensure fairness, efficiency, and responsiveness to instructional needs.', 'Sustain regular inspection and monitoring of school facilities, strengthen maintenance and repair planning, and improve coordination for timely resource allocation and infrastructure improvement.', 'Strengthen infrastructure development planning, actively mobilize stakeholder and LGU support, prioritize urgent facility improvements, and enhance proposal preparation for funding assistance and implementation of projects.', 'Establish a functional school library through allocation of space and resources, mobilize stakeholder support for book donations and equipment, assign a library focal person, and develop a basic library management system to support learners’ reading development.', 'Sustain regular maintenance and monitoring of utilities, strengthen coordination with service providers for uninterrupted services, and improve backup systems to ensure continuous water, electricity, and internet connectivity.', 'Establish a functional computer laboratory/classroom through allocation or renovation of space, secure ICT equipment through DepEd/LGU/stakeholder support, develop maintenance and utilization plan, and strengthen ICT integration in teaching and learning through teacher training and digital literacy programs.', 'Sustain efficient budgeting and procurement processes, ensure timely planning and utilization of funds, strengthen monitoring of MOOE expenditures, and continue capacity building of personnel on financial management and procurement procedures.', 'Sustain strict compliance with liquidation procedures, ensure timely preparation and submission of financial documents, strengthen record-keeping and monitoring systems, and continue capacity building on financial management and auditing requirements.', 'Strengthen stakeholder feedback and satisfaction monitoring system, conduct regular surveys and consultations, improve responsiveness to concerns raised, and implement continuous quality improvement in school programs and services.', 0, 25, 12, 60),
