(1101, '2026', '129748', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Isolated cases of peer bullying and verbal conflicts among learners still occur despite interventions.', 'Some cases are underreported due to fear, lack of awareness, or family-related concerns.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Strong implementation of early literacy and numeracy programs, regular assessment, teacher intervention, and parental support.', 'Conduct of NAT review sessions, collaborative teacher planning, and learner-focused interventions.', 'Strong coordination between ALS teachers, barangay officials, and community stakeholders.', 'Teachers’ creativity, collaboration, and support from school administration.', 'Availability of intervention programs and commitment of teachers to learner improvement.', 'Integration of values education across learning areas and active school campaigns.', 'Regular conduct of assessment  review in the classroom. ', '', '', '', 'Effective monitoring system, home visitation, and support from parents and stakeholders.', 'Supportive school environment and active participation of stakeholders and community members.', 'Flexible learning delivery and support from ALS teachers and community stakeholders.', 'Commitment of ALS teacher and support from school administration and community partners.', 'Active participation of committee members and adherence to DepEd policies.', 'Regular DRRM drills and strong coordination with local DRRM offices.', 'Guidance programs, peer support activities, and teacher involvement.', 'School initiatives promoting inclusivity and stakeholder support for facility enhancement.', 'Active participation of school personnel and stakeholders in planning activities.', 'Strong collaboration and support from community leaders, parents, and school personnel.', 'Active participation of learners and guidance from teacher-advisers and school administration.', 'Su