le learning delivery and strengthen learner support and community advocacy programs.', 'Encourage sharing of best practices among teachers through SLAC sessions.', 'Strengthen remediation schedules and provide additional intervention materials.', 'Continue values integration activities and strengthen guidance and  support.', 'Sharing of best practices among teachers.', '', 'Intensify anti-bullying programs, strengthen guidance and support, and involve parents in behavior monitoring.', 'Strengthen reporting mechanisms, conduct regular awareness campaigns, and reinforce child protection policies.', 'Sustain learner monitoring programs and strengthen interventions for at-risk learners.', 'Continue promoting inclusive and culture-sensitive programs and seek additional community support.', 'Expand outreach programs and strengthen partnerships to support marginalized learners.', 'Provide additional learning resources and improve facilities for ALS implementation.', 'Strengthen monitoring and evaluation mechanisms.', 'Procure additional emergency supplies and sustain disaster preparedness activities.', 'Strengthen mental health programs and establish partnerships with health professionals and agencies.', 'Continue improving accessibility features and allocate funds for inclusive infrastructure development.', 'Regularly review and update the strategic plan and strengthen stakeholder engagement in planning processes.', 'Sustain regular meetings and strengthen communication and coordination mechanisms.', 'Conduct leadership trainings and encourage greater student involvement in school governance.', 'Improve ICT resources and continue capacity-building activities for personnel on innovative service delivery.', 'Strengthen monitoring of implementation timelines and ensure proper allocation of resources.', 'Conduct regular meetings and strengthen stakeholder engagement and accountability.', 'Increase parent engagement activities and strengthen communication channels with parents.', 'Sustain partnerships and explore additional collaborations and resource-sharing opportunities.', 'Enhance monitoring tools and strengthen  data management and evaluation.', 'Continue professional development activities and strengthen performance coaching and mentoring.', 'Streamline reporting processes and improve workload management strategies.', 'Sustain needs assessment and allocate resources for relevant trainings and LAC sessions.', 'Strengthen partnerships for training opportunities and provide equitable access to professional development.', 'Continue recognition initiatives and seek additional resources.', 'Strengthen coordination and ensure timely submission of DTR.', 'Review workload distribution regularly and minimize excessive ancillary assignments.', 'Continue periodic inspections and prioritize immediate repair of identified issues.', 'Seek additional funding sources and strengthen stakeholder partnerships for infrastructure development.', 'Acquire updated learning materials and improve access to digital library resources.', 'Coordinate with service providers.', 'Procure additional ICT equipment and strengthen maintenance and upgrading programs.', 'Continue prudent budgeting and prioritize essential school programs and projects.', 'Strengthen monitoring of document submission and sustain transparency and accountability practices.', 'Continue improving school services and facilities and strengthen feedback and response mechanisms.', 1, 22, 12, 105),
