d strengthen appreciation of local traditions', 'Strengthen partnerships to support inclusive learning access', '', 'Sustain committee operations through regular consultations and strengthened reporting mechanisms', 'Enhance disaster preparedness activities and regularly update the DRRM plan', 'Strengthen mental wellness programs and conduct regular psychosocial support activities', 'Develop accessible facilities and seek additional resources for inclusive instruction', 'Strengthen participatory planning and regularly review strategic targets for continuous improvement', 'Enhance stakeholder engagement through stronger communication strategies', 'Conduct leadership development activities', 'Improve digital service systems and strengthen capacity-building for efficient stakeholder services', 'Strengthen monitoring and evaluation mechanisms to ensure timely implementation', 'Conduct regular meetings and strengthen stakeholder participation in decision-making', 'Enhance parent engagement through regular orientation and collaborative school programs', 'Expand partnerships and strengthen collaboration with stakeholders', 'Strengthen monitoring and evaluation systems and ensure timely reporting of accomplishments', 'Sustain professional development activities and strengthen performance coaching and mentoring', 'Enhance office systems and sustain monitoring for continuous improvement', 'Conduct regular needs-based LAC sessions and strengthen teacher capability-building programs', 'Sustain professional development opportunities and strengthen access to relevant trainings', 'Enhance recognition programs and personnel-appreciation activities', 'Strengthen coordination and ensure timely submission of payroll and compensation documents', 'Ensure equitable assignment of tasks and responsibilities', 'Conduct regular inspection and immediate repair of identified facility concerns', 'Strengthen resource mobilization efforts', 'Develop and equip a functional library through resource