uation methods; ensure timely reporting', 'Conduct coaching sessions; provide templates for IPCR documentation; recognize high-performing teachers', 'Align OPCR targets with school strategic goals; conduct quarterly reviews; enhance coordination among departments', 'Improve scheduling; integrate LAC outputs into school improvement plans; provide recognition for active participants', 'Allocate funds for training; partner with nearby schools for shared PD sessions; encourage online learning opportunities', 'Establish recognition program; document achievements; conduct annual awards ceremony', 'Strengthen coordination with DepEd finance offices; provide orientation on payroll processes; maintain transparent communication channels', 'Regular workload reviews; establish monitoring tools; ensure equitable distribution of tasks across grade levels', 'Provide training on facility inspection; adopt standardized checklists; ensure timely reporting', 'Secure additional funding; prioritize urgent repairs; strengthen partnerships with LGUs', '', 'Establish backup systems; coordinate with providers for service reliability; allocate funds for maintenance', '', 'Strengthen documentation practices; ensure timely fund utilization; conduct regular financial reviews', 'Provide training on liquidation procedures; adopt standardized reporting tools; ensure timely submission', 'Conduct regular satisfaction surveys; address feedback promptly; enhance service delivery', 0, 30, 12, 60),
(1122, '2026', '129309', 'Some learners low in reading and numeracy', 'Gaps in mastery in academic', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Few reported bullying cases', 'Few reported child abuse incidence', 'Risk of absenteeism', '', 'Limited resources and support', 'Limited ALS implementation', '', '', 'Lack of guidance personnel', 'Lack of SNED facilities', 'Needs regular updating', 'Limited stakeholders participation', 'Limited leadership training', 'Limited innovative practices', 'Limited monitoring of plan implementation', 'Inactive SGC participation', '', '', '', 'Feedback not regularly collected', 'Some delays in Performance review', 'Limited documentation', '', '', 'Irregular recognition', 'Delays in benefits processing', 'Unequal workload distribution', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Teacher creativity and strategy', 'Existing remediation and intervention', 'Values integration', 'Available assessment', '', '', '', '', 'Community participation', '', '', 'Active committee', 'Existing DRRM plan', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Supportive parents', 'Existing linkages', 'Available school data', '', '', '', 'Skilled teachers', 'External support', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 6, 1, 0, 6, 6, 6, 6, 3, 2, 2, 5, 6, 5, 2, 6, 6, 6, 2, 2, 6, 2, 1, 6, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Strengthen remediation and supervision', 'Conduct intensive review', '', 'Develop and share contextualized materials', 'Schedule regular remediation sessions', 'Integrate values in daily lesson plan', 'Conduct training on item analysis', '', 'Strengthen anti-bullying campaign', 'Conduct awareness and reporting mechanism', 'Strengthen learner monitoring at home', 'Integrate cultural activities in school', 'Provide learning support and resources', 'Strengthen ALS program dekivery', 'Conduct regula CPC training/orientation', 'Conduct regular drills and updates', 'Strengthen mental health program', 'Improve inclusive facilities', 'Review and update SIP regularly