 and behavioral development.', 'Continue strengthening coordination and communication with partner stakeholders and schools; establish clear schedules and agreed plans for joint activities; and sustain collaborative partnerships to support school improvement and learner development.', 'Continue strengthening systematic monitoring and evaluation processes; allocate dedicated time for documentation and reporting; and sustain data-based planning to improve the effectiveness and impact of school programs, projects, and activities.', 'Continue strengthening performance monitoring and coaching among personnel; provide support mechanisms for workload management; and sustain professional development activities to maintain and further improve high performance ratings.', 'Continue strengthening planning, time management, and workload distribution among personnel; sustain regular monitoring of office targets; and enhance collaboration to ensure consistent delivery of quality outputs and maintenance of high performance ratings.', 'Continue conducting structured and needs-based LAC sessions aligned with identified teaching and learning gaps; strengthen scheduling to ensure regular participation; and sustain sharing of best practices to improve instructional quality and learner outcomes.', 'Continue supporting personnel participation in trainings, seminars, and graduate studies; strengthen coordination in scheduling to minimize work disruption; and sustain mentoring and coaching to ensure continuous professional growth and readiness for promotion.', 'Continue institutionalizing regular recognition practices such as simple awards, public acknowledgment, and appreciation activities; explore cost-effective recognition strategies; and sustain a positive school culture that motivates personnel performance and commitment.', '', 'Continue implementing transparent workload mapping and regular reassessment of task distribution; strengthen collaborative planning before assigning duties; and ensure adjustments are made promptly to maintain fairness and prevent overloading of personnel.', 'Continue conducting regular inspection schedules to ensure safety and functionality of facilities; prioritize urgent repairs through available school funds; and strengthen coordination with stakeholders and LGU for infrastructure support and improvement.', 'Continue prioritizing infrastructure improvement through well-prepared proposals and work plans; strengthen partnerships with LGU and stakeholders for resource support; and ensure proper planning and phasing of projects to gradually improve school facilities.', 'Prioritize gradual modernization of the library by improving the physical space and upgrading reading materials; seek support from stakeholders for donations of books and ICT resources; and strengthen efforts to create a more updated, learner-friendly, and resource-rich library environment.', 'Continue strengthening coordination with service providers for timely resolution of interruptions; maintain regular inspection and preventive maintenance of facilities; and explore backup solutions such as water storage and alternative connectivity options to ensure uninterrupted school operation', 'Prioritize gradual upgrading and repair of computer units; seek support from stakeholders and partners for ICT donations and modernization; and implement a scheduled rotation system to ensure equitable learner access to available computers.', 'Continue strengthening timely procurement planning and fund utilization tracking; ensure strict adherence to budgeting schedules and guidelines; and sustain transparent financial management practices to maximize MOOE use in support of school priorities.', 'Continue strict compliance with COA and DepEd financial guidelines; strengthen early preparation and organization of liquidation documents; and sustain regular monitoring and coordination among responsible personnel to ensure timely and complete liquidation of MOOE.', 'Continue strengthening stakeholder engagement and communication to improve awareness of school programs; regularly gather and act on feedback; and sustain quality service delivery to maintain and further improve stakeholder satisfaction.', 1, 111, 12, 57),
