teachers; conduct of meetings at convenient times', 'Existing good relationships with stakeholders; shared goals for school improvement; support from local government units and community organizations', 'Availability of monitoring tools and formats; assigned focal persons for each activity; support from school head in data gathering', 'Commitment of school staff to serve; regular consultation with stakeholders; prompt response to concerns raised', 'Clear performance guidelines, regular monitoring, and constructive feedback mechanisms are in place.', 'Always Manifested None identified; collective targets are met and reported accurately. Aligned individual and institutional goals, regular planning sessions, and transparent reporting systems.', 'Systematic needs assessment, available funding support, and active participation of personnel.', 'Awareness of promotion policies, transparent selection process, and support for further studies/training.', 'Established recognition framework, allocation of funds for awards/incentives, and supportive school leadership.', 'Efficient administrative procedures, clear communication with finance units, and complete personnel records. ', ' Written workload policy, consultation with staff, and regular review of assignments. ', 'Has established regular inspection schedules; assigned personnel are responsible and trained; support from school leadership', 'Availability of school funds (MOOE); support from stakeholders and LGU; clear prioritization of projects based on inspection results', '', 'Stable supply from utility providers; regular maintenance is conducted; available budget for repairs and upgrades', '', 'Proper financial planning and budgeting; clear guidelines on MOOE use; timely procurement process; monitoring by the school finance team ', 'Competent finance personnel; availability of complete supporting documents; strict monitoring and internal control; guidance from Division personnel', 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1,