, and procure necessary supplies and equipment. ', 'Conduct mental health awareness activities, strengthen guidance services, and establish referral systems with health agemcies.', 'Improve facilities, provide SPED training for teachers, and seek additional funding/support for inclusive education resources.', 'Continue collaborative strategic planning, strengthen stakeholder involvement, and regularly monitor and evaluate implementation of plans.', 'sustain regular meetings. improve communication with stakeholders, and encourage wider community participation in school programs and projects.', 'Conduct leadership trainings, strengthen student participation in school governance, and provide continuous guidance to officers.', 'Improve ICT facilities and internet access, continue digitalization of school services and provide capacity-building activities for personnel.', 'Continue alingning programs with the implementation plan and strengthen resource mobilization', 'Maintain regular communication and conduct quarterly meetings', 'Intensity parent engagement through regular updates and flexible meeting schedules', 'Sustain and expand partnerships through continuous coordination and collaboration', 'Strengthen monitoring tools and ensure timely submission of reports', 'Continue mentoring and monitoring personnel performance and provide technical assisstance', 'Strengthen collaboration and ensure timely submission of reports', 'Sustain regular LAC sessions and align topics with teachers\' needs', 'Seek additional funding and encourage participation in free online trainings and webinars', 'Conduct regular recognition and awarding activities', 'Ensure timely submission and monitoring of payroll documents', 'Review and balance teaching and non-teaching assignments regularly.', 'Conduct regular inspection and immediate repair of damaged facilities', 'Prioritize and implement school improvement projects gradually', 'Request additional books and improve library facilities', 'Improve internet connectivity and maintain utility facilities regularly', 'Acquire additional computers and conduct regular maintenance', 'Monitor and utilize MOOE funds based on approved plans and priorities', 'Ensure timely preparation and submission of liquidation reports', 'Continue improving school services and regularly gather stakeholder feedback', 1, 25, 12, 60),
(1183, '2026', '305676', 'No Grade 3 Learners ', 'No NAT for Grade 10', 'No ALS Implementation', 'Teachers who instruct non-major subjects find contextualization difficult', '', '', 'Lack of time and limited technical Skills', 'the School has no Senior High School offering', 'Peer pressure and negative influence among students contributing to bullying behavior and Stigma and discrimination preventing learners from seeking help or counseling.', '', '', '', '', 'the school has no School-Based ALS Program', '', 'The school has an existing Contingency Plan; however, there is a notable gap in the availability of trained personnel and well-prepared learners to effectively respond to severe emergency situations. This limitation affects the school’s overall readiness and responsiveness during disasters, accidents, and other critical incidents, thereby posing challenges in ensuring the safety and welfare of the school community.', '', 'No PWD Learners', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Accomplishment report of ARAL Implementation and Project KADATENG, PHIL-IRI Pre and Post Test Results.', 'Daily Lesson Log showing the integration of peace and DepEd Core Values. COT, Instructional Materials and accomplishment reports of School activities such as History Month and Symposium on Anti Bullying.', '', '', '', 'Accomplishment report of zero child abuse incidence in School.', 'School Drop-Out Reduction Report\r\nLearner Attendance Monitoring Records Intervention Program Documentation\r\nMinutes of Meetings on Learner Retention Programs\r\nGuidance Counseling Records and Referral Forms\r\nParent-Teacher Conference Attendance Sheets\r\nPhotographs of Intervention and Retention Activities\r\nLearner Tracking Sheets\r\nMonthly Enrollment and Attendance Reports', 'Program of Activities for culture-sensitive programs and celebrations\r\nActivity Proposals and Approved Project Plans\r\nPhotographs of cultural a