ions, and responsibilities.\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Allocate available resources and seek stakeholder support to sustain personnel recognition and incentive programs.\r\nStrengthen the consistent implementation of recognition and awarding activities through proper planning and scheduling.', '', '', '', '', 'Prioritize the establishment of a library facility through school planning, stakeholder support, and resource mobilization initiatives.\r\nMaximize available spaces and seek assistance from partners and stakeholders for the provision of temporary reading areas and library resources.', 'Strengthen regular maintenance and improvement of the school water system to ensure safe, stable, and continuous water supply.\r\n\r\n\r\nSeek support from stakeholders and partner agencies for the upgrading and sustainability of the school water facilities.\r\n\r\n', 'Seek support from stakeholders, LGUs, and partner organizations for the provision and upgrading of computers and ICT equipment and room.\r\nImplement proper maintenance, scheduling, and resource-sharing strategies to maximize the use of available ICT facilities and equipment.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 0, 26, 12, 60),
