ide flexible learning schedules.', 'Provide ICT training and allocate fund / resources for instructional materials development. ', 'Sustain remediation programs and strengthen learner monitoring and parental support.', 'continue integrating peace education and core values in all learning areas and provide additional materials and trainings.', 'Strengthen assessment practices and allocate more time for collaborative data analysis and intervention planning.', 'Strengthen linkages with local industries and seek additional resources and training opportunities for learners.', 'Strengthen anti-bullying campaigns, conduct regular guidance activities, and promote positive peer relationships.', 'Sustain child protection programs and continue orientation on child rights and safety.', 'Strengthen partnership with parents and stakeholders, intensify  monitoring of at-risk learners, and provide support programs monitoring.', 'conduct more culture-sensitive and inclusive activities and encourage community participation in cultural programs.', 'Provide additional learning resources and strengthen inclusive education programs and participation.', 'Strengthen advocacy for ALS enrollment and provide adequate learning resources and support.', 'Sustain regular monitoring, orientation, and implementation of child protection programs.', 'Sustain regular monitoring,  orientation, and implementation of child protection program.', 'Strengthen mental health awareness activities and continue providing psycholosocial support and referrals when needed.', 'Improve accessibility facilities, provide SPED learning materials, and strengthen inclusive education programs.', 'Continue participation planning and strengthen monitoring and evaluation of school programs.', 'Sustain regular meetings and strengthen stakeholders engagement in school planning.', 'Conduct leadership training and encourage wider students participation in school programs.', 'Improve ICT facilities and and implementation more effi