rs shall consistently prepare contextualized learning materials that are responsive to the diverse needs of the learners. ', 'Teachers shall consistently implement appropriate intervention to address learning gaps in reading, comprehension, science, and mathematics.', 'Teachers shall consistently integrate peace education and DepEd Core Values in classroom instructions and school activities. ', 'Strengthen the conduct of test item analysis to improve learning strategies and learner performance outcome.', 'The school shall continuously engage to local industries and partners to strengthen the TLE-TVL course offerings. ', 'Strengthen the implementation of the school\'s rules and policy for anti-bullying through regular orientation and monitoring. ', 'Maintain a safe and child-friendly learning environment that protects the rights and welfare of every learner. ', 'The school shall continuously implement programs and interventions that will contribute to the reduction of the learners drop-out incidence.', 'The school will continuously conduct culture-sensitive activities that promote respect and appreciation of different culture and traditions within the school community. ', 'The school shall continue to provide accessible, inclusive, and equitable learning opportunities for out-of-school youth and adult learners through Alternative Learning System (ALS).', 'The school shall sustain a functional School-Based Alternative Learning System (ALS).', 'The school shall maintain a functional child-protection committee to protect and safeguard the rights of all learners within the school community. ', 'The school shall continuously strengthen the disaster preparedness, prevention, and recovery programs through regular drills, capacity-building activities, and risk assessments.  ', 'Strengthen the school-based mental wellness programs through regular counseling, emotional support and wellness activities for learnears and school personnel.', 'The school shall continuously improve 