fessional development of the school personnel to enhance their competencies, performance, and personal growth. ', 'The school shall continuously implement recognition programs and appreciation activities that acknowledge the contributions, accomplishments, dedications, and outstanding performance of teaching and non-teaching personnel.', 'The school shall continue to facilitate the timely receipt of correct salaries, allowances, and other additional compensation of school personnel in accordance with the policies, rules and regulations.', 'The school shall continuously ensure that the workload is distributed fairly and equitably among school personnel. ', 'Maintain the regular monitoring and assessment of school infrastructure and facilities to ensure safety among learners.  ', 'Continue implementing programs and projects that enhance school infrastructure and facilities.', 'Maintain a functional and conducive library environment for the learners.', 'Sustain the continuous availability and functionality of water, electric, and interne connection. ', 'Maintain the functionality and accessibility of the computer laboratory to support technology-integrated teaching and learning.', 'Maintain the transparent, efficient, and timely utilization of MOOE funds. ', 'Maintain the timely, accurate, and complete liquidation of all utilized MOOE funds. ', 'Strengthen and institutionalized feedback mechanisms such as surveys, suggestion systems, and consultations.', 0, 125, 12, 57),
