l projects', '', '', '', 'Conduct of mid-year and year-end review and evaluation', 'Collaborative preparation of OPCRF targets', '', 'Regular dissemination of PD opportunities to personnel', '', 'Efficient processing by school admin and division office ', 'Consultation with teachers before finalizing class program ', 'School Head and Property custodian conduct periodic inspection', 'Support from PTA, BLGU, and IP community', '', '', '', 'Proper planning and budgeting of MOOE with stakeholders', 'Regular monitoring and follow-up by school head on liquidation status', 2, 3, 0, 1, 6, 6, 2, 0, 6, 2, 3, 6, 2, 0, 2, 1, 6, 0, 2, 6, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 6, 2, 6, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 2, 2, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Conduct project BASA-ARAL for struggling grade 3 learners every MWF', 'Integrate ICT-based activities and higher order thinking skills in lessons', '', 'Conduct in-school training on contextualization and use of local resources', 'continue project BOOST and Reading Remediation Program', 'Conduct monthly values formation activities ', 'set schedule for submission and discussion of test results in LAC', '', 'Conduct a trimester orientation for learners and parents', 'Establish reporting and referral system for suspected abuse cases', 'Implement Project Balik-Eskwela: Tracking and retrieval of at-risk learners', 'Celebrate IP Day and integrate IP songs, stories, and crafts in lessons', 'Coordinate with District ALS Coordinator for program implementation', '', 'Set quarterly CPC meeting schedule and document minutes', 'Conduct quarterly earthquake and fire drills', 'Conduct training on mental health and psychosocial support for teachers', '', 'Conduct planning workshop with stakeholders every opening block of school year', 'Document all agreements and track implementation', 'Conduct leadership training for SPG officers', 'Teachers and staff are willing to learn new processes', 'Document best practices and adjustments for next cycle', 'Orient SGC members based on DepEd Order No. 26, s