\' progress\r\n3. Integrate intervention activities during vacant periods and classroom routines', '1. Strengthen regular reading intervention programs, comprehension activities and higher order thinking exercises across learning areas \r\n2. Conduct diagnostic assessments and differentiated instructions based on learners\' needs\r\n3. Teachers commit to creating learner-centered activities that promote communication, creativity , collaboration and critical thinking skills', 'Sustain the practice', '1.Provide training and coaching on contectualization and localization of lessons ; encourage use of real-life examples ,local situations and hands-on activities ; and develop simple and low-cost improvised teaching aids to make lesson more engaging and relevant\r\n\r\n', 'Sustain the practice', 'Sustain the practice', '1.Conduct regular training , LAC sessions, and coaching on test analysis;\r\nProvide simple templates and step-by-step guides for easy use\r\n2. Integrate item analysis into school assessment schedules, assign collaborative analysis per grade level and utilize ICT tools or simplified spreadsheets to reduce workload\r\n3. School leader and teachers commit to allocate time for item analysis activities', 'Partner with small-scale establishments present in the locality', 'Strengthen implementation of school anti-bullying policies through regular monitoring  and supervision; establishment of monitoring mechanisms and immediate response protocols', 'Strengthen implementation of school Child-Protection Policy through regular monitoring  and supervision; establishment of monitoring mechanisms and immediate response protocols', '1. Identify PARDO  and provide timely support and\r\nintervention  like  feeding program, home visitation and   counseling\r\n2. Strengthen collaboration with internal and external stakeholders through regular meetings and advocacy programs\r\n', '1. Conduct of regular training , LAC sessions and orientation on culturally responsive \r\ntea