ATORS , TOOLS, ASSIGNED focal person and regular schedule for tracking , reviewing and reporting progress and results of all PPAs to ensure continuous improvement and accountablility', 'Strengthen the alignment of individual performance targets with KRAs and ensure that all deliverables are accomplished with quality, timeliness and measurable impact', 'Strengthen the alignment of individual performance targets with KRAs and ensure that all deliverables are accomplished with quality, timeliness and measurable impact', 'Institutionalized and protected schedule for LAC and L & D sessions within the School Claendar , with strong leadership support, clear agenda alignment with instructional needs and strict implementation to prioritize continuous professional development of teachers', 'Institutionalize and sustain LAC /L&D SESSIONS, MENTORING AND COACHING PROGRAMS and aligning training activities with IPCR  targets and promotion requirements with strong leadership support  and fixed schedule to ensure continuous growth of personnel', 'Establish a formal, school-based recognition and reward system with clear guidelines , and integration of milestone achievements in personal records', 'Sustain the practice', 'Uphold a fair , transparent and collaborative system in the distribution of workload by ensuring tasks are equally distributed to all personnel', 'Sustain a regular and systematic inspection of school infrastructure and facilities for monitoring and immediate maintenance actions', 'Repair and maintenance of school infrastructure  and facilities must be indicated in the AIP/APP for proper implementation', 'The school will maximize available spaces and alternate reading areas by the classrooms for the meantime or shared spaces like at the computer room', 'Stregthen preventive maintenance, allocate sufficient resources for repair and upgrades , establish coordination with utility providers to ensure continuous and reliable water, electricity and internet services', 'The school shared spaced for computer from one of the Kindergarten rooms. Single classroom was divided by wall partition for computer laboratory', 'Ensure 100 % efficient, transparent and timely utilization of MOOE in accordance with government policies, school priorities and learners\' needs', 'Ensure timely , complete and compliant liquidation of 100%  of MOOE utilization through strict adherence to COA and DepED financial guidelines, proper documentation, transparency and record-keeping', 'Strengthen stakeholders\' feedback and engagement mechanisms by regularly conducting consultations, surveys,  and validation activities to ensure good results and have concrete school improvement actions', 1, 8, 12, 61),
