(1274, '2026', '128542', 'learners have difficulty in reading and numeracy due to learning gaps and limited home support.', 'ome learners still need improvement in mastery of competencies measured in NAT.', '', 'Continuous enhancement of contextualized learning materials is needed.\r\n\r\nFacilitating Factors:', 'Need continuous strengthening of remediation activities for learners with difficulties.', 'Need continuous reinforcement of values integration.', 'Test item analysis is not consistently done across all grade levels.', '', 'Occasional peer conflicts and minor bullying incidents still occur.', 'Isolated cases of child protection concerns are monitored.', 'Some learners are at risk of dropping out due to personal and financial factors.', 'Need continuous strengthening of culture-sensitive activities.', 'Limited participation of OSY and disadvantaged learners.', '', '', 'Need continuous DRRM improvement.', 'Limited structured mental health interventions.', 'Lack of ramps, handrails, and accessible comfort rooms', 'Continuous updating of school strategic plan.', 'Limited participation of some stakeholders in planning.', 'Overlapping schedules of stakeholders', 'Limited documentation and inconsistent monitoring of processes', 'Occasional delays in implementation tracking', 'Irregular attendance of some members', 'Irregular attendance of some PTA members', 'occasional coordination gaps', 'Inconsistent use of monitoring tools', 'Feedback not fully maximized for improvement planning', '', 'Occasional delays in consolidating reports', 'Limited scheduling due to workload constraints', '', '', 'Occasional delays in salary claim claim of newly hired employee', '', 'Irregular inspection schedules', 'Limited funding for major repairs', 'Lack of available space for Library development', 'Unstable internet and occasional utility interruptions', 'Lack of operational ICT equipment', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Active Child Protection Commi