circumstances.\r\nConduct regular literacy, numeracy, and life skills enhancement activities to improve learner competencies.', 'Participate actively in trainings, workshops, and LAC sessions on contextualization and instructional material development.\r\nStrengthen collaboration and sharing of best practices among teachers in creating and improving learning resources.\r\nIntegrate local culture, community experiences, indigenous knowledge, and real-life situations into instructional materials.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 132, 12, 106);
