or prompt home visitations.', 'Regularly collaborate with local cultural and community leaders to further diversify inclusive learning activities and maintain open-door enrollment strategies.Regularly collaborate with local cultural and community leaders to further diversify inclusive learning activities and maintain open-door enrollment strategies.', 'Regularly collaborate with local cultural and community leaders to further diversify inclusive learning activities and maintain open-door enrollment strategies.', 'Coordinate with the District ALS Coordinator to establish a formal mapping and registration drive for potential adult learners within the community, and dedicate a flexible learning schedule', 'Maintain regular quarterly committee meetings and organize re-orientation sessions to update members on recent DepEd child protection issuances.', 'Regularly update the school\'s hazard map, conduct the mandatory quarterly multi-hazard drills, and ensure all emergency kits are replenished.', 'Sustain regular psychological first aid and wellness sessions integrated into Homeroom Guidance, and establish a dedicated consultation hour for student support.', 'Propose the construction of standard concrete ramps and PWD-accessible restroom modifications in the next School Improvement Plan (SIP) / Annual Implementation Plan (AIP), and request financial assistance or materials from the LGU and Brigada Eskwela partners.', 'Sustain regular mid-year and year-end reviews of the physical and financial targets in the AIP to ensure 100% accomplishment.', 'Maintain strong engagement with community representatives by actively involving them in school milestone evaluations and transparency fora.', 'Continue to allocate an accessible venue/platform for learner leaders to voice out student welfare concerns and spearhead school campaigns.', 'Regularly update frontline feedback mechanisms to continuously adjust and speed up service delivery for parents and visitors.', 'Conduct regular quarterly reviews of the AIP to ensure all physical and financial milestones are met on schedule.', 'Sustain the active engagement of the council by keeping them closely involved in school policy formulation and major community transparency fora.', 'Maintain strong, transparent communication lines regarding school projects and continue involving parents in school improvement initiatives.', 'Sustain and expand existing partnerships by consistently updating donors on the positive impact of their contributions.', 'Institutionalize the quarterly reporting of SMEA findings to promptly address any emerging operational challenges.', 'Sustain high performance by conducting monthly informal check-ins and providing timely technical assistance on instructional competencies.', 'Maintain office efficiency by conducting quarterly milestone reviews to ensure all operational targets are hit on time.', 'Continue utilizing data-driven e-SAT results to design highly relevant LAC sessions that focus on emerging pedagogical needs.Continue utilizing data-driven e-SAT results to design highly relevant LAC sessions that focus on emerging pedagogical needs.', 'Maintain an updated personnel professional profile to easily identify and recommend qualified staff for upcoming promotions and specialized training.', 'Sustain staff morale by regularly holding year-end or quarterly recognition ceremonies to honor outstanding contributions.', 'Ensure 100% accuracy and zero delays by maintaining a strict internal schedule for the submission of personnel time records and benefit claims.', 'Continue the practice of collaborative schedule planning before the opening of each school year to prevent teacher burnout and ensure equity.', 'Sustain regular bi-monthly structural walkthroughs to immediately log and address minor wear and tear before they become hazards.', 'Maintain strong relations with external stakeholders by continuously presenting clear facility improvement plans during assemblies', 'Coordinate with the LGU and property donors to source out supplementary reading books, and allocate a vacant room or reading corner in the next school year budget', 'Ensure continuous utility availability by designating a focal person to monitor signal strength and water/power issues daily.', 'Submit a formal request to the Division Office for the DepEd Computerization Program (DCP) package and include laboratory space renovations in the upcoming SIP.', 'Sustain a 100% efficient utilization rate by reviewing the financial plan monthly to adjust for shifting project needs.', 'Maintain zero-backlog liquidation status by preparing financial reports within 5 days of every transaction.', 'Continuously evaluate feedback reports to refine the school\'s services and maintain high levels of stakeholder satisfaction.', 1, 133, 12, 106),
