room', '', '', '', '', '', 'Teachers equipped with knowledge through the LAC and training attended on contextualization of learning materials.', 'ARAL Reading and Remediation programis present in the school to help learners with difficulty in that areas in accordance to No learners shall left behind.', 'Values integration is mandatory in crafting their lesson plan,', 'The school submitted Proficiency level per subject to the Division Office thereby conducts test analysis per quarter.', '', 'Low Enrolment and class is manageable.', 'No reported case of child abuse.', 'Inclusion of all learners including SARDOS in the SBFP encourages learners to always present in the class.', '', '', '', 'The school is compliance to Deped Order 40 s. 2012. thus creating of a functional child protection policy.', 'The yearly activities conducted by the Division Office allows us to revisit our DRRM plan.', 'Teachers were equipped with skill in the mental wellness program.', '', 'The presence of the School Improvement Plan which was revisited every year.', '', '', 'Effective communication channels between the school and stakeholders.', 'Regular monitoring and evaluation of programs and activities and Availability of resources and effective planning mechanisms', '', 'Open and effective communication channels and Active participation of parents in school programs and activities', 'Shared goals and commitment toward school improvement and Effective networking and partnership-building initiatives', '', 'Strong stakeholder engagement and participation\r\nEffective communication and feedback mechanisms', 'Effective leadership and supervision from school administrators\r\nRegular performance monitoring, coaching, and feedback mechanisms', 'Effective leadership and management practices within the school\r\nClear office performance targets and accountability measures', 'Clear identification of teachers’ professional development needs and Strong support from school leadership for professional deve