he attitudes learning objectives.', 'Continue with such advocacy.', 'N/A', 'Continue on advocating the child protection policy.', 'Continue on advocating the child protection policy.', 'Intensify advocacy on inclusion of SARDOS in the feeding program.', 'Plan and include activities that are culture-sensitive on the school calendar particularly on the end of term block.', 'Open a ALS Program in the school.', 'Open a ALS Program in the school for SY 2026-2027.', 'Intensify and create new committee members and orient on the DepEd Order No. 40 s. 2012.', 'Implement the DRRM plan.', 'Intensify the wellness program in the school.', 'Construct PWD friendly facilities even if there was no data on PWD and SNED learners.', 'Implement the SIP.', 'Re organize school-community planning team and conduct orientation with target meetings of once every term particularly at the end of term block.', 'Follow up the action plan and let them conduct activities which align to their action plan,', 'Sustain and further strengthen innovative frontline service practices through continuous monitoring and evaluation.', 'Sustain effective implementation and monitoring practices through continuous collaboration, capacity-building activities, and regular review of the strategic plan to ensure alignment with school goals and stakeholder needs.', 'Need for stronger stakeholder engagement and clearer governance structure.', 'Continue strengthening parent-school partnerships by increasing engagement activities, enhancing communication strategies, and encouraging greater participation in school initiatives and community-building programs.', 'Sustain and strengthen partnerships through continuous collaboration, regular stakeholder engagement activities, and the development of joint programs and projects that promote mutual support, resource sharing, and school improvement initiatives.', 'Continue strengthening the monitoring and evaluation processes through regular review meetings, enhanced data-driven 