egular orientation on compensation policies and procedures to ensure accurate and timely release of salaries and benefits.', 'Continue ensuring equitable workload distribution by regularly reviewing assignments, strengthening consultation and communication mechanisms, hiring or designating additional support personnel when necessary, and promoting work-life balance and wellness programs to maintain teacher productivity and morale.', 'Continue strengthening infrastructure inspection and maintenance practices by allocating sufficient resources for repairs and improvements, conducting regular safety inspections, enhancing coordination with stakeholders and local agencies, and implementing preventive maintenance programs to ensure safe, functional, and conducive learning environments.', 'Continue strengthening infrastructure improvement initiatives by increasing resource mobilization, enhancing partnerships with stakeholders and local agencies, prioritizing repair and development projects based on school needs, and implementing sustainable maintenance programs to ensure safe, accessible, and learner-friendly facilities.', 'Strengthen  library services by allocating additional resources for updated books and digital materials, improving library facilities and equipment, enhancing reading promotion programs, and sustaining partnerships with stakeholders to support the development of a learner-centered and technology-supported library environment.', 'Continue improving utility services by strengthening maintenance and monitoring systems, upgrading internet connectivity and electrical facilities, ensuring sustainable water supply systems, and enhancing coordination with service providers and stakeholders to support an efficient and conducive learning environment.', 'Prioritize the establishment and improvement of a functional computer laboratory/classroom through resource mobilization, stakeholder partnerships, and allocation of funds for ICT infrastructure, equipment, internet connectivity, and technical support to enhance technology-integrated teaching and learning.', 'Continue strengthening financial management practices by sustaining transparent and efficient utilization of MOOE funds, enhancing monitoring and reporting systems, providing regular orientation on financial procedures, and prioritizing expenditures based on the school’s most urgent and essential needs.', 'Sustain effective financial accountability practices by strengthening monitoring and documentation systems, providing regular orientation on liquidation procedures, improving coordination among concerned personnel, and ensuring timely submission and processing of financial reports and supporting documents.', 'Sustain stakeholder satisfaction by continuously improving school services, strengthening communication and feedback systems, conducting regular stakeholder consultations, and providing capacity-building activities for personnel to maintain quality and responsiveness.', 0, 131, 12, NULL),
