practices,  proper planning and budgeting, and active monitoring', 'Organized financial records and compliance with liquidation procedures', 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 6, 6, 3, 6, 1, 1, 2, 1, 6, 5, 2, 6, 2, 1, 2, 2, 6, 6, 1, 6, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 3, 2, 5, 5, 1, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Develop localized reading and math contextualized worksheets during upcoming SLAC sessions and launch a targeted remediation program.', 'Establish a structured, school-wide NAT review program and conduct regular diagnostic test simulations for exit-grade levels.', 'No available data since the school currently has no ALS learners.', 'Continue organizing an annual peer-review and showcase event to share high-quality localized learning materials.', 'Institutionalize a parental communication pledge during enrollment to secure consistent student attendance in after-school remedial tracks.', 'Maintain current integration practices and build a digital shared drive to serve as an auditing repository for values-driven lesson plans.', 'Conduct a targeted mentoring session during a SLAC block to train teachers on translating raw item analysis data into actionable lesson adjustments.', 'Establish partnerships with relevant local industries.', 'Sustain anti-bullying campaign, strengthen reporting system, conduct regular orientation for learners and parents, and continue guidance and peer support programs.', 'Conduct parent education sessions on child protection.', 'Strengthen school-community partnerships', 'Continue collaboration with community and develop and use localized instructional materials.', 'Strengthen community mapping of OSYs', 'No available data since the school currently has no ALS learners.', 'Reorganize the Child Protection Committee', 'Procure additional DRRM supplies, improve communication system, and sustain disaster drills and preparedness activities.', 'Sustain homeroom guidance and mental wellness activities', 'Improve school facilities to be PWD-friendly (ramps, handrails, accessible toilets)', 'Sustain participatory planning, improve data gathering and analysis, strengthen stakeholder involvement through flexible meeting arrangements, and align plans with available resources', 'Strengthen stakeholder engagement, schedule regular and flexible meetings, and improve communication', 'Organize and institutionalize Supreme Student Government, conduct leadership training; assign teacher-advisers, and implement student-led activities to build leadership skills', 'Strengthen use of available communication platforms and establish regular information dissemination system', 'Strengthen monitoring and evaluation system, prioritize activities based on available resources, improve scheduling and tracking, and increase stakeholder participation in implementation.', 'Reorganize and activate SGC, conduct orientation and capacity-building, schedule regular meetings, and strengthen stakeholder engagement and participation', 'Sustain active PTA involvement, implement flexible meeting schedules, strengthen communication with parents, and encourage participation through community-based activities', 'Improve communication and coordination mechanisms', 'Strengthen monitoring and evaluation system', 'Sustain performance monitoring and evaluation and provide continuous professional development through available platforms', 'Strengthen teamwork and coordination, improve data management practices, maximize available resources, and continuously monitor office performance and provide feedback for improvement', 'Sustain regular LAC sessions and align topics with identified needs, and utilize available ICT or offline resources', 'Sustain participation in professional development activities, maximize available online and division trainings, and encourage peer coaching', 'Continue regular acknowledgment of personnel accomplishments', 'Ensure timely and complete submission of documents and monitor and follow up claims regularly', 'Sustain fair and transparent workload distribution, regularly review teacher assignments, provide support for teachers with multiple roles', 'Sustain regular inspection schedule and strengthen documentation of inspection results', 'Strengthen partnerships for resource mobilization', 'Promote reading programs and activities', 'Explore alternative sources (water system, solar power) and improve internet access through available programs', 'Train teachers in ICT integration and gradually establish a functional computer area', 'Sustain efficient utilization of MOOE, strengthen financial planning and prioritization, and ensure transparency in fund usage', 'Ensure complete and timely submission of liquidation documents and strengthen record-keeping system', 'Establish regular feedback system (surveys, consultations), strengthen communication channels with stakeholders, address concerns promptly, and sustain quality delivery of school services', 1, 20, 12, 105),
(1300, '2026', '304195', 'Grade 3 learners are not included in our school since we are offering JHS and SHS  only.', 'Less time of review and sometimes there were class disruptions..', 'Not Applicable', '', '', '', '', '', 'Minimal cases of peer conflicts and misunderstandings among learners.', '', '', '', 'Limited instructional resources and irregular attendance of some learners.', '', '', '', '', 'Limited accessibility features and assistive learning materials for learners with special needs.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Monitoring tools are not consistently used; post-evaluation reports are sometimes incomplete.', 'Some stakeholders are unaware of the feedback mechanisms available to them.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Limited budget allocation for major repairs and upgrading of facilities; dependence on external support.', 'Insufficient books and updated reading materials; limited library space and ICT resources; lack of item for librarian', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Availability of Learning Resources, Continuous Capacity Building', 'Use of diagnostic tests and assessment results; strong teacher commitment; support from school heads; existing intervention programs (catch-up sessions, tutoring).', 'Strong understanding of DepEd core values; regular LAC sessions; supportive school leadership; availability of contextualized examples.', 'Availability of standardized templates; ICT tools for analysis; strong instructional supervision; LAC discussions on assessment.', 'Active linkages with LGU and industries; existing MOA partnerships; strong TLE-TVL program implementation; support from stakeholders.', '', 'Active Child Protection Committee and implementation of Child Protection Policy.', 'Strong monitoring system and support from parents and stakeholders.', 'Supportive community and participation of learners and teachers.', '', 'Committed ALS teachers and support from DepEd and stakeholders.', 'Active participation of committee members and school personnel.', 'Active DRRM coordinators and regular disaster drills.', 'Guidance support and school-based wellness activities.', '', 'Active participation of stakeholders and strong school leadership.\r\n\r\nCategory:', 'Good coordination between school personnel and community stakeholders.', 'Active participation of student leaders and support from teacher advisers.', 'Supportive school personnel and willingness to adopt innovative practices.', 'Active participation of parents and stakeholders ensures the continuity of programs.', ' Presence of committed SGC officers who advocate for school improvement.', 'Supportive PTA officers who coordinate closely with the school administration.', 'Existing MOAs with barangay units and alumni associations support school programs.', '', '', 'Regular coaching and feedback from department heads motivates personnel to perform well.', 'Collaborative effort among all staff ensures timely submission of performance reports.', 'Teachers actively participate in LAC sessions to address instructional gaps.', 'School head endorses qualified personnel for promotions and relevant trainings regularly.', 'School administration actively acknowledges personnel achievements during flag ceremonies and culminating activities.', 'Coordination with the Division accounting office ensures accurate and timely salary processing.', 'School head regularly reviews the master schedule to ensure equitable workload distribution.', 'Strong support from school head and maintenance team; established inspection schedule; active involvement of teachers and stakeholders.', '', '', 'Existing utility connections; support from LGU and service providers; basic infrastructure already in place.', 'Presence of ICT coordinator; availability of basic computer lab; support from ICT-related programs.', 'Clear budgeting guidelines; active planning team; regular monitoring and liquidation system.', 'Guidance from accounting office; trained administrative staff; established financial procedures.', 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 6, 6, 6, 6, 2, 2, 2, 5, 6, 5, 2, 2, 6, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 6, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 3, 2, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Not included as our top priority of concern.', 'Include the class remediation schedule at the end of the term block.', 'Not Applicable', 'Continuously develop and improve contextualized learning materials aligned with curriculum standards and learners’ needs. ; Participate actively in trainings, Learning Action Cell (LAC) sessions, and collaborative activities related to instructional material development.', 'The school commits to strengthen and sustain remediation programs through data-driven instruction, structured intervention sessions, and provision of adequate learning materials to address learners’ gaps effectively.', 'The school commits to consistently integrate peace education and DepEd core values in all learning areas to strengthen learners’ character formation and promote a positive school culture.', 'The school commits to consistently integrate peace education and DepEd core values in all learning areas to strengthen learners’ character formation and promote a positive school culture.', 'The school commits to strengthen and expand partnerships with local industries to enhance TLE-TVL programs, improve learner competencies, and ensure work-ready graduates.', 'Continue strengthening awareness campaigns, guidance counseling, and monitoring of learner behavior.', 'Conduct regular orientation and advocacy programs on child protection and safety.', 'Strengthen home visitation, learner monitoring, and intervention programs.', 'Continue integrating cultural awareness activities in school programs and celebrations.', 'Strengthen inclusive learning programs and provide continuous support to target learners.', 'Enhance ALS implementation through stakeholder collaboration and resource mobilization.', 'Conduct regular meetings, trainings, and monitoring activities for child protection.', 'Strengthen disaster preparedness activities and procure additional emergency supplies.', 'Enhance mental wellness programs and strengthen referral systems for learners.', 'Improve and maintain PWD-friendly facilities and provide inclusive learning resources.', 'Continue collaborative planning, monitoring, and evaluation of school programs and targets.', 'Strengthen stakeholder engagement and conduct regular planning and consultation meetings.', 'Provide leadership trainings and encourage active involvement in school activities and programs.', 'Enhance digital and frontline services through continuous improvement and resource mobilization.', 'Conduct quarterly reviews to ensure alignment of action plans with school goals and targets.', 'Set a fixed quarterly SGC meeting schedule and document all proceedings properly.', 'Conduct home visitations and use group chats to increase parental involvement and attendance.', 'Initiate partnership-building activities with LGUs, NGOs, and neighboring schools each semester.', 'Standardize M&E tools and require submission of evaluation reports after every school activity.', 'Conduct IPCR orientation at the start of each school year and provide mid-year feedback sessions.', 'Assign a designated records officer to monitor and compile OPCR documents each term.', 'Schedule LAC sessions during non-teaching days and source additional funding through MOOE allocations.', 'Maintain an updated training tracker and encourage personnel to pursue in-service training opportunities.', 'Integrate a recognition program in the school calendar and allocate budget for awards each school year.', 'Submit all payroll-related documents ahead of deadlines to avoid delays in compensation release.', 'Review and adjust the master schedule every term to ensure fair and equitable teaching load distribution among all personnel.', 'The school commits to conduct regular and systematic inspection of all facilities to ensure safety, functionality, and compliance with standards, with immediate reporting and repair of identified issues.', 'The school commits to strengthen resource mobilization and partnerships to continuously improve and upgrade school facilities to provide a safe and conducive learning environment.', 'The school commits to develop and sustain a functional library by improving resources, expanding reading materials, and strengthening reading programs to promote literacy and learning.', 'The school commits to maintain and improve essential utilities by coordinating with service providers and LGU to ensure consistent and reliable water, electricity, and internet services.', 'The school commits to upgrade and maintain the computer laboratory by repairing existing units, acquiring new equipment, and maximizing ICT integration in teaching and learning.', 'The school commits to ensure efficient, transparent, and timely utilization of MOOE aligned with approved plans and DepEd guidelines to support school operations and priorities.', 'The school commits to ensure timely and complete liquidation of all MOOE funds through strict compliance with accounting rules, proper documentation, and regular monitoring of expenditures.', 'Disseminate feedback forms widely and use results to improve school services and programs', 0, 111, 12, 57),
