(1312, '2026', '129334', 'a.many grade 3learnershave low reading comprehension and numeracy skills\r\nb. Lack of parentalsupportand follow up at home. Limited learning materials and intervention programs for struggling learners.', 'many grade 6 learners have  low perform ance in the NAT, particularly in 21st century skills and core learning areas.Limited instructional materials, inadequate leraner support and insufficient remediation programs affect learners Academic achievement.', '', 'a.teachers have limited time and training in developing contextualized learning materials suited  to learners needs.\r\nb. Insufficient resources and instructional materials hinder the production of quality contextualized materials.', 'a. Learners with low performance in reading, science and mathematics need more intensive remediation and monitoring.\r\nb. Limited time, materials and teacher workload affect the regular conduct of remediation activities.', 'a. Teachers have limited instructional materials and strategies for integrating peace education and DepEd core values in daily lessons.\r\nb. Some learners show low awareness and application values and peaceful behavior in school activities.', 'a. Teachers have limited Knowledge and skills in conducting and interpreting test item analysis.\r\nB. Lack of time and standardized assessment tools affects the regular implementation of test item analysis.', '', 'a. Cases of bullying among learners are still observedue to weak awareness and inconsistent monitoring of child protection policies.\r\nB. Limited parental involvement and lack of regular values formation activities affect learners positive behavior and discipline.', 'The school lacks complete and updated records or monitoring data on child abuse cases and related incidents.', 'Some learners  continue to drop out due to financial difficulties,poor attendance and lack of parental support.', 'The school has limited programs and activities that promotes awareness and appreciation of diverse cultures and traditions.', 'The school lacks complete data and  monitoring records on disadvantaged learners, OSYs and adult learners needing access to learning opportunities.', 'The school has insufficient data and documentation on the implementation and functionality of the school -based ALS program', 'The Child Protection Committee has limited monitoring, coordination and implementation of child protection programs and activities.', 'The school has limited implementation, monitoring and regular updating of it\'s DRRM plan and preparedness activities.', 'The school lacks sufficient data,programs, and monitoring mechanisms related to learners and teachers mental wellness support.', 'The school lacks adequate SPED and PWD -friendly facilities and accessible learning spaces for learners with special needs.', 'The school has limited participation, planning skills and data utilization in the development and implementation of the strategic plan.', 'The school-community planning team has limited participation, coordination and involvement of stakeholders in planning activities.', 'The Supreme Student Government has limited student participation, leadership activities and support in implementing school programs.', 'The school has limited innovative  systems, technology, and stakeholder feedback mechanism in delivering Frontline services.', 'The school has limited monitoring, coordination, and resource allocation for the effective implementation of the strategic plan.', 'The School council has limited stakeholder participation, coordination,and involvement in school governance and decision-making processes.', 'The school has limited parental participation and involvement in school programs and activities.', 'The school has limited coordination and partnership activities with stakeholders and neighboring schools.', 'The school has limited monitoring tools, data analysis and regular evaluation of programs, projects and activities.', 'The school receives limited positive feedback from internal and external Stakeholders due to gaps in communication and service delivery.', 'Some school personnel have difficultly meeting performance targets due to workload , limited training and insufficient coaching support.', 'The school has challenges in meeting  office performance targets due to limited coordination,  monitoring, and resource support.', 'The school has limited time, resources, and training opportunities to conduct regular needs-based LAC and learning and Development activities.', 'School personnel have limited access to training, professional development program and promotion opportunities.', 'The school has no established system for recognizing and rewarding personnel achievements and exemplary performance.', 'Delays and discrepancies in the processing of salaries, allowances and additional compensation affect school personnel.', 'Some teachers still experience unequal distribution of ancillary taks and workload assignments during peak school activities.', 'The school has limited regular inspection and monitoring of infrastructure and facilities due to insufficient manpower and resources.', 'The school has limited funds and resources for the Improvement and maintenance of infrastructure and facilities.', 'The school has no available functional library and lacks adequate reading resources and learning materials for learners.', 'Occasional interruptions in water, electricity and internet connectivity still affect school operations and learning activities.', 'The school has no available functional computer laboratory/classroom and lacks adequate ICT equipment and facilities.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Effective financial management, proper planning and regular monitoring contribute to the efficient utilization of MOOE funds.', 'Effective financial management, accurate documentation, and timely submission of reports ensure 100% liquidation of utilized MOOE.', 1, 2, 0, 3, 2, 6, 1, 0, 6, 2, 3, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 6, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 3, 3, 2, 5, 3, 5, 5, 3, 3, 3, 'a.conduct remedial reading and numeracy intervention programs regularly.\r\nb.provide capability training for teachers on early literacy and numeracy instruction.\r\nc. Monitors learners progress through periodic assessment and feedback.\r\nd. Strengthen partnerships with parents through regular communication and orientation.', 'Conduct regular remediation classes and teacher capacity-building activities to improve learners performance in the NAT.Strengthen parental involvement and provide additional learning resources through school and stakeholders support.', '', 'a. Conduct training and workshops on the development of contextualized learning materials for teachers.\r\nb. Allocate funds and strengthen stakeholders support for the reproduction and provision of instructional resources.', 'a. Conduct regular remediation sessions and provide appropriate intervention materials for struggling learners.\r\nb. Strengthen teacher support and monitoringto ensure consistent implementation of remediation activities.', 'a. Conduct orientation and training for teachers on effective integration of Peace education and DepEd core values.\r\nB. Develop and utilize contextualized learning activities that promote values formation and positive behavior among learners.', 'A. Conduct training and mentoring on test item analysis and data driven instruction for teachers.\r\nB. Strengthen school monitoring and scheduling to ensure regular conduct and utilization of assessment results.', '', 'A. Conduct regular orientation and advocacy programs on anti bullying policies and child protection for learners, teachers and parents.', 'Strengthen the School monitoring, reporting and documentation system on child protection and abuse-related cases.', 'Strengthen learner monitoring, parental engagement and intervention programs to reduce drop out incidence.', 'Conduct culture-sensitive programs and integrate cultural awareness activities in school events and classroom instruction.', 'Strengthen learner mapping, data collection and community coordination to identify and support disadvantaged, OSYs and adult learners.', 'Strengthen monitoring, documentation,and coordination activities to establish and sustain a functional school-based ALS program.', 'Strengthen the functionality of the Child Protection Committee through regular meetings, training,and proper implementation of the child protection policies.', 'Conduct regular DRRM training, drills,and plan reviews to strengthen disaster preparedness and response implementation.', 'Establish and strengthen mental wellness programs, monitoring systems, and referral mechanisms for learners and school personnel.', 'Allocate resources and strengthen stakeholders support for the Improvement of SPED and PWD -friendly facilities and services.', 'Conduct collaborative planning workshops and strengthen data-driven decision-making to develop and implement an effective school strategic plan.', 'Strengthen stakeholders engagement and conduct regular planning meetings to improve the functionality of the school-community planning team.', 'Strengthen student leadership programs and provide guidance and support to improve the functionality of the Supreme Student Government.', 'Strengthen the use of innovative practices and improve stakeholder feedback system to enhance Frontline service delivery.', 'Strengthen implementation monitoring and stakeholder collaboration to effective opetionalize the school strategic plan.', 'Conduct regular meetings and strengthen take holder engagement to improve the functionality of the School Governance Council.', 'Strengthen communication and encourage active parental involvement through regularPTA  meetings and school activities.', 'Strengthen collaboration and establish regular partnership activities  with stakeholders and other schools to support school programs and initiatives.', 'Strengthen monitoring and Evaluation systems through regular data gathering, assessment, and reporting of school programs and activities.', 'Conduct capability-building activities and provide regular coaching and monitoring to improve personnel performance ratings.', 'Strengthen performance monitoring, coordination and capacity-building activities to improve office performance ratings.', 'Conduct regular needs assessment and strengthen support for the implementation of relevant LAC and Learning and Development activities.', 'Strengthen professional development programs and provide support for personnel training, career advancement and promotion opportunities.', 'Establish a recognition and incentive program to acknowledge and reward personnel achievements and outstanding performance.', 'Strengthen coordination and monitoring of payroll and compensation processing to ensure timely and accurate release of benefits.', 'Strengthen workload monitoring and ensure equitable distribution of teaching and non teaching assignments among teachers.', 'Conduct regular inspection and maintenance activities to ensure the safety and proper condition of school infrastructure and facilities.', 'Strengthen resource Mobilization and stakeholder partnerships to support infrastructure and facility improvement projects.', 'Strengthen resource generation and stakeholder support for the establishment of a functional school library and provision resources.', 'Strengthen maintenance and coordination with service providers to ensure continuous and reliable utility services in the school.', 'Strengthen resource Mobilization and stakeholder partnerships for the establishment of a functional computer laboratory/classroom.', 'Sustain effective financial management practices and strengthen monitoring to ensure continuous effecient utilization of MOOE funds.', 'Sustain proper financial monitoring and compliance with liquidation procedures to maintain timely and accurate reporting of MOOE  utilization.', 'Strengthen stakeholder engagement, communication and service improvement initiatives to increase stakeholder satisfaction ratings.', 0, 12, 12, 61),
