ration among teachers and proper scheduling by school heads', 'Active involvement of school personnel and support from Local Government Unit (LGU), barangay and other community stakeholders.', 'Community participation and implementation of school improvement initiatives. Infra support from the LGU and Barangay', '', '', '', 'Sound financial management practices and compliance with budgeting guidelines', 'Organized documentation practices and cooperation among accountable personnel', 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 3, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 1, 6, 2, 2, 5, 2, 2, 6, 3, 2, 4, 6, 4, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 3, 3, 3, 1, 3, 3, 5, 3, 3, 3, 3, '', 'Strengthened intervention programs, minimize disruption of classes, conduct remedial and mock tests, request additional learning resources', 'Intensify advocacy campaign and provide more flexible learning schedules', 'Allocate budget for printing, internet connection, and conduct LAC sessions on contextualization', 'Continue reading and numeracy intervention programs and involve parents\r\n\r\nConstant monitoring on the teachers’ implementation of the programs: ARAL Reading and ARAL Math\r\n', 'More training to capacitate teachers in the integration of peace and values in teaching and learning process', 'Conduct capability training/workshops on assessment and item analysis', 'Strengthen partnerships through MOA/MOU and request assistance from stakeholders', 'Strengthen anti-bullying campaigns and awareness programs among students and strengthen coordination between parents, teachers and school officials', 'Sustain awareness program, strengthen reporting mechanism and conduct orientation on child protection and safeguarding', 'Intensify monitoring of at-risk learners, provide intervention programs, strengthen school-community partnerships, and encourage parental involvement.', 'Strengthen culturally-sensitive programs and continue promoting respect for diversity and cultural awareness among learners', 'Strengthen communication and follow-up with learners throu