INSERT INTO `sbm_ta` (`id`, `fy`, `school_id`, `q1`, `q2`, `q3`, `q4`, `q5`, `q6`, `q7`, `q8`, `q9`, `q10`, `q11`, `q12`, `q13`, `q14`, `q15`, `q16`, `q17`, `q18`, `q19`, `q20`, `q21`, `q22`, `q23`, `q24`, `q25`, `q26`, `q27`, `q28`, `q29`, `q30`, `q31`, `q32`, `q33`, `q34`, `q35`, `q36`, `q37`, `q38`, `q39`, `q40`, `q41`, `q42`, `qq1`, `qq2`, `qq3`, `qq4`, `qq5`, `qq6`, `qq7`, `qq8`, `qq9`, `qq10`, `qq11`, `qq12`, `qq13`, `qq14`, `qq15`, `qq16`, `qq17`, `qq18`, `qq19`, `qq20`, `qq21`, `qq22`, `qq23`, `qq24`, `qq25`, `qq26`, `qq27`, `qq28`, `qq29`, `qq30`, `qq31`, `qq32`, `qq33`, `qq34`, `qq35`, `qq36`, `qq37`, `qq38`, `qq39`, `qq40`, `qq41`, `qq42`, `a1`, `a2`, `a3`, `a4`, `a5`, `a6`, `a7`, `a8`, `a9`, `a10`, `a11`, `a12`, `a13`, `a14`, `a15`, `a16`, `a17`, `a18`, `a19`, `a20`, `a21`, `a22`, `a23`, `a24`, `a25`, `a26`, `a27`, `a28`, `a29`, `a30`, `a31`, `a32`, `a33`, `a34`, `a35`, `a36`, `a37`, `a38`, `a39`, `a40`, `a41`, `a42`, `f1`, `f2`, `f3`, `f4`, `f5`, `f6`, `f7`, `f8`, `f9`, `f10`, `f11`, `f12`, `f13`, `f14`, `f15`, `f16`, `f17`, `f18`, `f19`, `f20`, `f21`, `f22`, `f23`, `f24`, `f25`, `f26`, `f27`, `f29`, `f30`, `f31`, `f32`, `f33`, `f34`, `f35`, `f36`, `f37`, `f38`, `f39`, `f40`, `f41`, `f42`, `f28`, `stat`, `district`, `region`, `division`) VALUES
(1338, '2026', '128729', 'Some learners still demonstrate difficulties in reading comprehension, vocabulary development, basic numeracy operations, and problem-solving skills. Irregular attendance and limited parental support affect learning progress.', 'Some learners have not yet attained the desired proficiency levels in key learning areas due to learning gaps, limited mastery of competencies, insufficient exposure to higher-order thinking skills, and inconsistent study habits. Attendance issues and varying levels of parental support also affect learner performance.', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', 'N/A', 'Isolated cases of bullying and peer conflicts are still reported despite the implementation of anti-bullying policies and awareness programs. Some incidents remain unreported due to fear or lack of awareness of reporting mechanisms.', '', '', '', '', 'N/A', '', '', '', 'N/A', '', 'Participation of some stakeholders in planning activities is occasionally limited due to schedule conflicts, competing commitments, and varying levels of engagement and awareness of school programs.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Variations in teaching loads, ancillary assignments, committee responsibilities, and special designations occasionally result in workload imbalances among teachers. Limited personnel may also affect equitable distribution of tasks.', '', '', 'N/A', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Teachers demonstrate creativity and commitment in developing contextualized learning materials. Continuous professional development, collaborative planning, administrative support, and access to reference materials contribute to the effective preparation of learner-centered resources.', 'Teachers consistently implement remediation programs and targeted interventions for learners with learning gaps. Strong instructional leadership, regular learner assessment, teacher collaboration, parental support, and the availability of intervention materials contribute to the successful implementation of remediation activities.', 'Teachers consistently embed peace education, values formation, and the DepEd core values (Maka-Diyos, Maka-tao, Makakalikasan, at Makabansa) in classroom instruction and school activities. Supportive school policies, continuous teacher development, and active participation of learners contribute to the successful implementation of values integration.', 'Teachers regularly conduct test item analysis to identify learners’ strengths, weaknesses, and competency gaps. Strong instructional leadership, collaborative data analysis, established assessment practices, and the use of assessment results for instructional planning contribute to effective data-driven decision-making.', '', '', 'Effective implementation of child protection policies, active Child Protection Committee, strong collaboration with parents and community stakeholders, and continuous advocacy on child rights and protection.', 'Effective learner monitoring system, home visitation activities, parental involvement, learner support programs, and timely interventions for at-risk learners.', 'Integration of local culture and traditions in school programs, active community participation, and respect for cultural diversity among learners and personnel.', 'Supportive school policies, community partnerships, flexible learning opportunities, and coordination with relevant stakeholders to reach marginalized learners.', '', 'Active committee members, regular meetings, established child protection policies, and effective coordination with stakeholders and relevant agencies.', 'Established DRRM policies and procedures, regular drills, active DRRM committee, and support from local government and community partners.', 'Availability of guidance and counseling services, mental health awareness activities, supportive school environment, and collaboration with parents and stakeholders.', '', 'Strong leadership and stakeholder participation in planning processes, regular review of school priorities, availability of planning tools, and alignment with DepEd goals and policies contribute to the effective development of the school\'s strategic plan.', '', 'Active student leaders, supportive school administration and teacher-advisers, regular leadership activities, and meaningful student participation in school governance contribute to the effective functioning of the SSG/SPG.', 'Adoption of efficient systems and processes, use of technology, responsive school personnel, and continuous improvement initiatives enhance the delivery of frontline services to stakeholders.', 'Clear alignment of programs, projects, and activities with the strategic plan, effective leadership, stakeholder participation, and regular monitoring ensure successful implementation.', 'Active participation of council members, regular meetings, collaborative decision-making, and strong support from school and community stakeholders contribute to the functionality of the SGC.', 'Active involvement of parents and teachers, regular PTA meetings, effective communication, and strong support for school programs and activities contribute to a functional PTA.', 'Strong networking and partnerships with stakeholders, neighboring schools, community organizations, and local government units support resource-sharing and collaborative initiatives.', 'Established monitoring and evaluation mechanisms, data-driven decision-making, committed personnel, and regular reporting processes contribute to effective program implementation and assessment.', 'Quality service delivery, responsive school personnel, transparent governance practices, and positive stakeholder relationships contribute to favorable stakeholder satisfaction ratings.', 'Dedicated personnel, effective performance monitoring, supportive leadership, regular coaching and mentoring, and adherence to performance standards contribute to high individual performance ratings.', 'Effective implementation of school programs, collaborative teamwork, strong leadership, and systematic monitoring and evaluation contribute to achieving organizational targets.', 'Regular training needs assessment, active participation of personnel, supportive school leadership, and relevant professional development programs ensure effective implementation of LACs and L&D activities.', 'Availability of professional development opportunities, supportive leadership, mentoring programs, and encouragement for career advancement contribute to personnel growth and development.', 'Established recognition programs, supportive school culture, and appreciation of employee accomplishments contribute to high morale and motivation among personnel.', 'Efficient coordination with relevant offices, accurate records management, timely submission of required documents, and adherence to established procedures ensure prompt compensation processing.', '', 'Regular facility inspections, active participation of school personnel, established maintenance procedures, and support from stakeholders contribute to the upkeep of school infrastructure and facilities.', 'Proactive school leadership, stakeholder support, resource mobilization efforts, and effective planning contribute to the continuous improvement of school infrastructure and facilities.', '', 'Reliable utility services, regular maintenance, support from service providers, and proper management of school resources ensure the continuous operation of water, electricity, and internet facilities.', 'Availability of computer equipment, internet connectivity, technical support, and proper maintenance practices contribute to the effective utilization of the computer laboratory/classroom.', 'Effective financial planning, adherence to budget utilization guidelines, timely procurement processes, and proper monitoring of expenditures contribute to optimal utilization of MOOE funds.', 'Accurate record-keeping, timely submission of financial reports, compliance with accounting and auditing regulations, and effective coordination among responsible personnel ensure complete liquidation of utilized funds.', 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 6, 2, 2, 6, 2, 0, 2, 5, 6, 0, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 3, 2, 5, 5, 0, 5, 5, 3, 3, 'Strengthen reading and numeracy intervention programs, provide remediation and enrichment activities, intensify parent engagement, monitor learner progress regularly, and mobilize additional learning resources to support struggling learners.', 'Intensify NAT preparation and intervention programs, conduct regular assessment and remediation activities, strengthen integration of 21st-century skills in classroom instruction, enhance parental involvement, and provide continuous capacity-building opportunities for teachers to improve instructional delivery.', 'N/A', 'Sustain the development and utilization of contextualized learning materials through continuous capacity-building, sharing of best practices, regular quality assurance, and provision of necessary resources and technical support.', 'Continue strengthening remediation programs through regular monitoring of learner progress, enhancement of intervention materials, capacity-building for teachers, and sustained collaboration with parents and stakeholders to ensure improved learning outcomes.', 'Sustain the integration of peace education and DepEd core values across learning areas and school programs through continuous teacher enhancement, monitoring of implementation, and strengthened collaboration among learners, parents, and stakeholders.', 'Continue conducting systematic test item analysis and utilizing assessment results to enhance instructional strategies, develop targeted interventions, improve assessment quality, and strengthen learner achievement across all learning areas.', 'N/A', 'Strengthen the implementation of the Child Protection Policy, intensify anti-bullying campaigns, conduct regular values formation activities, and encourage prompt reporting and intervention for bullying incidents.', 'Sustain child protection programs, strengthen awareness campaigns, and continue monitoring and reporting mechanisms to ensure a safe learning environment.', 'Continue implementing learner retention programs, strengthen stakeholder engagement, and regularly monitor attendance and participation of learners.', 'Sustain culture-sensitive programs and activities that promote inclusivity, diversity, and appreciation of local heritage and traditions.', 'Continue expanding access to inclusive learning opportunities and strengthen partnerships to support disadvantaged and out-of-school learners.', 'N/A', 'Sustain the functionality of the committee through continuous capacity-building, regular monitoring, and strengthened implementation of child protection initiatives.', 'Continue updating and implementing the DRRM plan, conduct regular simulations and trainings, and ensure availability of emergency resources and equipment.', 'Sustain mental wellness programs, strengthen referral mechanisms, and continue promoting a supportive and inclusive school environment.', 'N/A', 'Sustain participatory strategic planning processes through regular monitoring, evaluation, and updating of the strategic plan to ensure responsiveness to emerging needs and priorities.', 'Strengthen stakeholder engagement through regular consultations, capacity-building activities, clear communication of roles and responsibilities, and increased collaboration between the school and community partners.', 'Continue strengthening student leadership programs, provide opportunities for leadership development, and encourage active participation in school improvement initiatives.', 'Sustain innovation and continuous improvement efforts in service delivery by leveraging technology, gathering stakeholder feedback, and enhancing the capacity of personnel to provide quality services.', 'Sustain the implementation planning process through regular monitoring, evaluation, and updating of action plans to address emerging needs and priorities.', 'Continue strengthening the SGC through capacity-building activities, regular consultations, and sustained stakeholder engagement in school governance.', 'Sustain active PTA participation and strengthen collaboration between parents and the school in supporting learner achievement and school improvement initiatives.', 'Maintain and expand partnerships through regular engagement, collaborative projects, and resource mobilization efforts that support school improvement goals.', 'Continue strengthening monitoring and evaluation systems to ensure program effectiveness, accountability, and continuous improvement of school operations and outcomes.', 'Sustain performance management practices through continuous coaching, monitoring, recognition, and professional development opportunities.', 'Continue strengthening organizational performance through data-driven planning, regular performance reviews, and continuous improvement initiatives.', 'Sustain the conduct of needs-based LACs and L&D activities that address identified competency gaps and support professional growth.', 'Continue providing opportunities for training, professional development, and career progression to enhance personnel competencies and effectiveness.', 'Sustain recognition and incentive programs that acknowledge outstanding performance, dedication, and significant achievements of personnel.', 'Continue strengthening coordination and monitoring mechanisms to ensure the timely and accurate release of salaries, allowances, and other benefits.', 'Regularly review workload assignments, ensure compliance with workload policies, promote equitable distribution of teaching and non-teaching responsibilities, and provide support mechanisms to address workload concerns.', 'Continue conducting periodic inspections and preventive maintenance activities to ensure the safety, functionality, and sustainability of school facilities.', 'Sustain infrastructure improvement initiatives through regular assessment, strategic planning, and strengthened partnerships for resource generation and facility enhancement.', 'N/A', 'Continue maintaining and upgrading utility facilities as needed to ensure uninterrupted services that support teaching, learning, and school operations.', 'Sustain the functionality of the computer laboratory through regular maintenance, upgrading of equipment, and provision of technical support and digital learning resources.', 'Continue strengthening financial management practices to ensure efficient, transparent, and strategic utilization of MOOE resources.', 'Sustain sound financial management practices by maintaining accurate documentation, ensuring timely liquidation, and complying with all applicable financial and auditing requirements.', 'Sustain stakeholder satisfaction through continuous improvement of services, regular feedback mechanisms, timely response to concerns, and strengthened stakeholder engagement.', 1, 133, 12, 106),
