(1348, '2026', '341526', 'Our school is purely Senior High School', 'No NAT exam conducted for grade 12', 'Not ALS implementing School', 'Time constraints for teachers balancing heavy teaching loads with material development and localization.', 'Overlapping remedial schedules; student attendance issues', 'A need for deeper integration strategies beyond simple lesson plan citations', '', 'Limited local industry diversity near the school;', 'Gaps in tracking subtle forms of cyberbullying and relational exclusion among learners.', 'Teachers encounter difficulties in identifying psychological abuse signs originating from domestic environments.', 'Economic challenges facing student families, causing learners to seek seasonal labor to augment household funds.', 'Busy academic calendars sometimes compress cultural celebration periods into single-day milestones.', 'Teachers require more upskilling on custom adult learning strategies and flexible non-formal module curation', 'We are not ALS program implementing school', 'Members need refresher courses on updated international and national legal mechanisms for online child safety.', 'Teachers require more advanced training in basic life support, trauma response, and psychological first aid.', 'Teaching staff find it challenging to distinguish ordinary behavioral issues from underlying clinical issues.', 'Gaps in planning for distinct, privacy-focused PWD facilities', '', '', '', 'Some parents and remote stakeholders struggle to access digital feedback systems due to low tech-literacy and intermittent internet connectivity', '', 'Poor engagement from community/barangay representatives due to busy personal schedules and low awareness of the SGC.', '', '', '', 'Feedback collection is occasionally delayed or lacks open-ended qualitative context.', '', '', 'Time constraints and overlapping school activities occasionally disrupt the regular schedule of LAC sessions.', '', '', '', '', 'Minor damages (roof leaks, electrical wear) are identified but repair schedules are sometimes delayed due to lack of immediate local raw materials.', 'Budget gaps for minor renovations', '', '', 'The school has  computer laboratory, but, there is no working computer units to be used by the learners. All computers set were condemned', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Regular, institutionalized post-examination evaluation days; active Master Teacher mentoring;', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Systematic utilization of DepEd’s standard School Improvement Plan (SIP) manual and data-driven templates.', 'Formalized system of representations (PTA, Barangay, Alumni, Faculty, Students).', 'Leadership capability trainings and close mentorship by a dedicated faculty adviser.', '', 'Clear alignment between the School Improvement Plan (SIP) and the Annual Implementation Plan (AIP).', '', 'Smooth, transparent, and structured annual PTA elections and project turnover processes.', 'Active participation in inter-school learning cells, technical exchanges, and district meetings.', 'A highly reliable, active School Monitoring and Evaluation Team (SMEA) keeping track of timelines.', '', 'trong individual accountability among teaching and non-teaching staff.', 'Accurate alignment of the Office Performance Commitment and Review Form (OPCRF) with the School Improvement Plan (SIP).', '', 'Timely dissemination of promotions, scholarships, and institutional training advisories.', 'A fully operational Rewards and Recognition (R&R) Committee.', 'Smooth communication lines between the school\'s finance unit and the Division Office', 'Democratic and transparent preparation of the master school program by school heads and department chairs.', '', '', 'Designated enthusiastic School Library In-charge', 'Strategic budgeting of MOOE funds for utility bills.', '', '100% utilization of MOOE. Highly systematic and organized bookkeeping', '100% liquidation of MOOE. Highly systematic and organized bookkeeping', 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 5, 1, 1, 3, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 6, 1, 6, 1, 2, 2, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 5, 3, 1, 3, 3, 3, 3, 'N/A', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'Institutionalize \"Learning Action Cells\" (LAC sessions) specifically dedicated to collaborative material development.', 'ntegrate structured remediation windows directly into the daily class matrix; create home-school check-ins for attendance.', 'Conduct peer-sharing sessions on creative values integration; design authentic, values-driven project-based assessments.', 'Maintain the schedule of post-quarterly test analyses and expand the practice to include formative assessments.', 'Formalize a broader network of partners through structured Memorandums of Agreement (MOA);', 'Conduct capacity-building seminars for teachers on detecting and resolving micro-bullying and cyber-behavior management', 'Partner with licensed psychologists or social workers for specialized training on identifying signs of domestic trauma.', 'Strengthen the home visitation schedule by utilizing homeroom advisers and assigning clear community tracking guides.', 'Map out calendar items early to integrate cultural elements naturally across quarterly cross-curricular activities.', 'Send teaching staff to specialized alternative delivery mode (ADM) and andragogy training sessions.', 'Apply for the implementation of  ALS program', 'Schedule an annual capacity-building webinar updating all committee members on contemporary child safety issues.', 'Coordinate with the local Bureau of Fire Protection (BFP) and Red Cross for official rescue certification training.', 'Invite a child psychologist to conduct a professional screening seminar for the faculty.', 'Ensure that upcoming PWD bathroom construction designs feature separate, private stalls for male and female users.', 'Conduct quarterly technical reviews of the Enhanced SIP to adjust operational objectives against new division directives. Conduct SMEA', 'Institutionalize a consistent, calendar-based meeting schedule for the planning team.', 'Create a peer-to-peer transition program where outgoing student leaders train incoming officers.', 'Deploy user-friendly hybrid feedback channels (combining SMS blasts with physical drop-boxes).', 'Sustain annual strategic planning workshops using data-driven targets.', 'Launch a local advocacy campaign highlighting the value of the SGC; offer flexible or hybrid (online/onsite) meeting options.', 'Continue providing leadership transitions and orientation for incoming PTA officers.', 'Formalize regular cross-sharing events where local schools swap successful instructional methods', 'Standardize a process where SMEA team findings directly feed into the planning of the next quarter\'s PPAs', 'Regular monitoring and evaluation of individual targets (IPCRF) using standardized data-driven tools.', 'Maintain high performance by conducting quarterly institutional reviews to refine office processes and targets.', 'Institutionalize a fixed, sacred \"LAC Hour\" in the class program that avoids scheduling conflicts, and maximize internal Master Teachers as resource speakers to minimize expenses.', 'Continue creating a database of personnel qualification profiles to automatically notify eligible staff members when career development steps open up.', 'Sustain this practice by expanding category options to give visibility to non-teaching personnel and community project innovators.', 'Maintain administrative workflow efficiency by setting up digital reminders for personnel to submit attendance logs early every month', 'Maintain balance by reviewing ancillary duties at the end of every semester to rotate heavy tasks and preserve long-term teacher well-being.', 'Train additional non-teaching staff on technical hazard protocols.', 'Strengthen resource mobilization campaigns with local LGU/NGO partners. Include in the AIP', 'Establish a \"One Book, One Child\" donation drive via external stakeholders.', 'Explore standard rain-water harvesting systems to sustain basic sanitation requirements.', 'Submit an urgent request for the DepEd Computerization Program (DCP) package.', 'Build a registry of accredited, compliant local merchants for school procurement', 'Pre-audit check before the submission of liquidation report.', 'Digitize satisfaction surveys via QR codes to maximize daily feedback capture.', 1, 133, 12, 106),
