(50, 'To establish a functional monitoring and evaluation system that promotes accountability and supports ongoing school development.', '• Validate the usability and practicability of the tool. • Initiate a simple yet comprehensive monitoring and evaluation activity. • Empower teachers in sustaining the SBM through the sense of ownership.', '• Crafted monitoring and evaluation tool to track the development of the system. • Facilitated quarterly school-based monitoring and evaluation activity and plan adjustments if necessary. • Involved teachers in analyzing data and using the results to improve instruction and student learning outcomes.', '-Focus Group Discussions \r\n-Collaborative Expertise Sessions', 'September, 2025', 'Teachers, School Heads, & Key Stakeholders', '500.00', 'To establish a functional monitoring and evaluation system that promotes accountability and supports ongoing school development.', 2025, 129248, 61, 12, 6),
