(123, 'Conduct Orientation on SBM', 'To increase awareness SBM principles', 'Oriented teachers, parents and stakeholders', 'Presentation during SPTA BOD Meeting', 'July 2026', 'SH, Teachers SPTA Officers', '1500.00', '', 2026, 128858, 59, 12, 139),
(124, '1. Establish SBM  Committee\r\n', 'To organize and oversee SBM implementation\r\n', ' Functional SBM committee with defined roles', 'Identify and train committee members; hold orientation meetings\r\n', 'May 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Parent Representatiive', '300', 'This role entails organizing and overseeing the implementation of the School-Based Management (SBM) framework, ensuring that policies, programs, and activities are effectively executed, monitored, and aligned with the institution’s goals. It requires strategic coordination, consistent supervision, and proactive problem-solving to enhance overall school performance and stakeholder engagement.', 2026, 129058, 60, 12, 32),
(125, '2. Conduct Needs Assessment', 'To identify school strengths, weaknesses, and priorities', 'Comprehensive SBM needs assessment report', 'Surveys, focus group discussions, review of school records', 'June 2026', 'School Head, SBM Committee, Teachers, Student', '500', 'This involves systematically identifying the school’s strengths, weaknesses, and priority areas to inform planning and decision-making, ensuring targeted improvements and the effective allocation of resources.', 2026, 129058, 60, 12, 32),
(126, '3. Develop SBM Action Plan', 'To create a clear roadmap for SBM activities', 'Written SBM Action Plan approved by stakeholders', 'Collaborative planning workshops; consultations with stakeholders', 'June 2026', 'School Head, SBM Committee, PTA', '300', 'This involves developing a clear and actionable roadmap for School-Based Management (SBM) activities, outlining objectives, timelines, responsibilities, and performance indicators to guide effective implementation and ensure continuous school improvement.', 2026, 129058, 60, 12, 32),
(127, '4. Implement SBM Programs', 'To execute planned activities for school improvement', 'Active programs aligned with SBM objectives (e.g., improved student welfare, curriculum enhancement)', 'Project-based implementation, regular monitoring, coordination with community', 'July to February 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, SBM Committee, Student', '5000', 'This entails executing planned activities aimed at school improvement, ensuring that programs and initiatives are implemented effectively, monitored regularly, and aligned with the school’s goals for enhanced student outcomes and overall performance.', 2026, 129058, 60, 12, 32),
(128, '5. Monitoring & Evaluation', 'To track progress and identify areas for improvement', 'Regular SBM reports and feedback for decision-making', 'Conduct regular meetings, classroom observations, performance reviews', 'July to February 2027', 'School Head, SBM Committee, PTA', '500', 'This involves continuously tracking progress on school improvement initiatives, analyzing performance data, and identifying areas for further development to ensure ongoing growth and effective adjustment of strategies.', 2026, 129058, 60, 12, 32),
(129, '6. Community & Stakeholder Engagement', 'To ensure participation and support from all stakeholders', 'Increased community involvement and support in school programs', 'Regular consultations, parent-teacher meetings, community forums', 'July to February 2027', 'School Head, SBM Committee, Parents, Communit', '400', 'This involves fostering active participation and securing the support of all stakeholders—teachers, students, parents, and the community—to ensure the success and sustainability of school improvement initiatives.', 2026, 129058, 60, 12, 32),
(130, 'Strengthening Stakeholder Participation in School-Based Management', 'To enhance active participation and collaboration of stakeholders in planning, implementing, and monitoring school programs.', 'Approved School Improvement Plan (SIP) / Annual Implementation Plan (AIP)\r\nIncreased stakeholder engagement\r\nDocumented minutes and attendance', 'The implementation of the School-Based Management (SBM) Action Plan will utilize a participatory, collaborative, and data-driven approach to ensure effective and sustainable school governance.', '1–2 days (June 2026)', 'School Head/ SBM Coordinator/ Teachers/ PTA O', '2000.00', 'Strengthening stakeholder participation in School-Based Management is vital in fostering collaboration, shared responsibility, and community support, ultimately leading to more effective and responsive school governance and improved learner outcomes.', 2026, 128641, 58, 12, 43),
(131, 'Orientation of Stakeholders on DepEd Order 007, s. 2024', 'To capacitate internal stakeholders on the provisions of DepEd Order 007, s. 2024', 'Capacitated internal stakeholders on the provisions of DepEd Order 007, s. 2024', 'Crafting of Activity Design; Sending of invitation letters/memo to internal stakeholders', 'August 2025', 'School Head, Teaching Personnel', '2000', '', 2026, 305516, 61, 12, 12),
(132, 'Integration of Results of the Self-Assessment in the Strategic Plan and Implementation Plan\r\n', 'To integrate the results of the self-assessment in the strategic plan as identified improvement areas and in the implementation plan as a school program, project or activity for continuous improvement', ' Integrated the Results of the Self-Assessment in the Strategic Plan and Implementation Plan', 'Analysis of the results of self-assessment; identification of improvement areas in the strategic plan; adjustment of implementation plan', 'April - May 2026', 'School Head, Teaching Personnel', '500', '', 2026, 305516, 61, 12, 12),
(133, 'Implementation of the SBM Action Plan', 'To implement action plan for continuous improvement of practices and learning outcomes', 'Implemented the SBM Action Plan', 'Monitors the progress of SBM Implementation; Undergoes subsequent self-assessment; Invites SDO to provide technical assistance; Establishes the school context with SDO based on the results of progress monitoring and the status of SBM implementation Agrees with SDO on priority improvement areas in the various SBM dimensions', 'First Quarter-Third Quarter', 'School Head, Teaching Personnel', '2500', '', 2026, 305516, 61, 12, 12),
(134, 'Conduct of SBM Self-Assessment', 'To self-assess manifestations of SBM indicators through SBM Self-Assessment Checklist; Analyze observed school practices and achieved learning outcomes; To guide its process of continuous improvement', 'Self-assessed manifestations of SBM indicators through SBM Self-Assessment Checklist', 'Invitation of internal and external stakeholders to participate in the self-assessment; Accomplish the SBM Self-Assessment Checklist', 'March - April 2026', 'School Head, Teaching Personnel', '500', '', 2026, 305516, 61, 12, 12);
