(153, 'Implementation of a Comprehensive Child Protection Program (CPP)\r\nIncludes awareness campaigns, reporting systems, and intervention strategies', 'To eliminate bullying and child abuse incidents in school. \r\nTo create a safe, inclusive, and child-friendly learning environment. \r\nTo strengthen awareness and responsiveness among stakeholders.', '100% of students and staff oriented on child protection policies \r\nFunctional Child Protection Committee (CPC) \r\nDocumented reports showing zero or decreasing bullying/abuse cases \r\nEstablished reporting and response system \r\nIncreased student confidence in reporting incidents', '1. Policy Implementation \r\n2. Capacity Building \r\n3. Advocacy and Awareness \r\n4. Support Systems \r\n5.Monitoring and Reporting ', 'Within the 1st - 3rd Grading period of School', 'School Head / Principal, Child Protection Com', '5000', '', 2026, 128545, 57, 12, 109),
