(383, 'Dropout Reduction Program', 'The school has reduced its drop-out incidence', 'Decreased dropout rate; 100% learner retention; completed home visitations and intervention reports', 'Conduct learner profiling and identification of at-risk students; implement home visitation and counseling; provide financial and material assistance through partnerships; strengthen school feeding program; utilize Early Registration and Learner Information System (LIS) monitoring', 'Year-round ', 'School Head, Guidance Counselor/Teacher, Clas', 'School and Office Supplies', '', 2026, 129426, 61, 12, 15);
