(444, 'Project GAWA: “Gawang Lokal – Contextualized Learning Materials Initiative”', 'Strengthen teacher capacity in creating and utilizing contextualized learning materials aligned with learners’ local experiences.', 'Teachers produce and use at least two contextualized IMs per grading period.', '- Conduct LAC sessions on localization and IM development. \r\n- Provide supplies for printing and production. \r\n- Share outputs through an IM repository.\r\n', 'Q1 – Q4 SY 2026–2027', 'LAC Leader, Teachers, School Head', '7000', '', 2026, 129407, 103, 12, 126),
