(482, 'To conduct SBM Orientation and Capacity Building', 'To orient stakeholders on SBM', 'Increased awareness and understanding of SBM', 'Conduct orientation, workshops, and open forum', 'June, 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Parents, Stakeholders', '5000.00', 'Ensure full participation', 2026, 128548, 57, 12, 109),
