(485, 'Early Identification of At-Risk Learners', 'To identify students who are likely to drop out based on attendance, behavior, and performance', 'List of at-risk learners with updated profiles', 'Review attendance records, academic performance, and conduct profiling; coordinate with class advisers for monitoring', 'June 2026- March 2027', 'School Head and Teachers', '00', '', 2026, 325105, 103, 12, 128),
