(492, 'Orientation on Child Protection Policy (CPP)', 'To ensure all stakeholders understand policies on bullying and child abuse', 'Increased awareness of child protection policies; signed commitment forms from stakeholders', 'Conduct school-wide orientation for learners, teachers, parents; use real-life scenarios and discussions', 'June 2026- March 2027', 'School Head, Guidance advocate and Teachers', '3000', '', 2026, 325105, 103, 12, 128),
