(612, 'Developing a functional School Library to Support Quality Education', '1. To provide accessible, updated, and relevant learning resources for all learners and teachers.\r\n2. To promote reading habits and a culture of literacy among pupils through regular library use and reading programs.\r\n3.To develop learners’ research ', '1. Established a fully equipped library\r\n\r\n2.Updated and sufficient learning resources\r\n\r\n3. Organized Library System\r\n\r\n4. Increased library utilization\r\n\r\n5. Improved reading skills and literacy levels\r\n', 'Conduct an inventory of existing books, materials, and facilities\r\n\r\nIdentify gaps and resources based on curriculum needs\r\n\r\nAssess available space and current library condition\r\n\r\nDevelop a library improvement plan\r\n', 'June – October, 2026', 'School Head / Principal  Teachers  ,Reading C', '50,000.00', 'The school library is well-established, organized, and functional, providing learners and teachers with easy access to relevant learning resources. It serves as an effective learning hub that supports literacy development and enhances instructional delivery. It is a place promoting a strong culture of reading and independent learning among pupils.', 2026, 128719, 58, 12, 34),
