(616, 'Conduct Baseline Assessment,Development of ELLN Intervention Materials, Remedial Reading Program and Numeracy Enhancement Program on Improving  Grade 3 learners Proficiency Level of Early language, literacy and numeracy skills', '1.Determine learners’ proficiency levels in language, literacy, and numeracy.\r\n2.Provide targeted instructional resources for struggling learners.\r\n3.Improve reading fluency, comprehension, and vocabulary.\r\nStrengthen learners’ basic computational ', '1.Baseline data and list of learners needing intervention\r\n2.Contextualized and localized ELLN materials\r\n3.Increased reading proficiency and improved CRLA results\r\nImproved literacy and numeracy proficiency', '1.Administer CRLA, RMA  assessments\r\n2.Preparation of flashcards, worksheets, big books, and manipulatives.\r\n3.Guided reading, phonics drills, peer tutoring, and storytelling.\r\n4.Use of manipulatives, drills, games, and differentiated instruction.\r\n5.Structured 30-minute daily reading and numeracy sessions', 'June 2026-March 2027', 'Grade 3 Learners,Teachers and School Head', '5000.00', 'At least 80% of Grade 3 learners will achieve proficiency in literacy and numeracy.', 2026, 128590, 58, 12, 36),
