(632, 'Implementing School Based- Management (SBM) for Improved School Performance', '1. Enhance school performance and student outcomes\r\n2. Increase stakeholders participation in decision-making\r\n3. Improve transparency and accountability in school management', '1. Improved school management and leadership\r\n2. Increased parent and community engagement\r\n3. Better resource allocation and utilization', '1. Establish SBM Team: Form a team with teachers, parents, and stakeholders\r\n2. Conduct Needs Assessment: Identify areas for improvement\r\n3. Develop SBM Plan, Create a plan with objectives, strategies, and actions\r\n4. Train and Capacitate: Provide trainings for SBM team members\r\n5. Implement SBM Plan: Execute the plan and monitor progress\r\n6. Evaluate and Adjust: Regularly evaluate and adjust the plan', 'May 2026 - January 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, Internal and External ', '6000', 'Follow-through and adjustment along the way.', 2026, 315905, 58, 12, 40),
(633, 'Project SULAT -Strategic Utilization of Learning & Assessment Tools\r\n(Data Harvests)', 'To use assessment data to tailor remedial and enrichment programs.', 'Quarterly Learner Profiling; Adjusted Lesson Plans', 'A school-wide initiative focusing on data-driven instruction. Teachers will conduct quarterly \"Data Harvests\" to analyze learner performance and adjust teaching strategies.', 'Quarterly (Oct, Jan, April, June)', 'School Head, Teachers, Subject Coordinators', '2000', 'This initiative will help determine the least learned competencies based on quarterly exams and eventually assess where the school give due Interventions.', 2026, 128746, 58, 12, 41),
