(706, 'Intervention Plan to improve the proficiency level for learners of Early Language, Literacy and Numeracy Skills', '-Identify learners\' strengths and weaknesses based on Pre-RMA\r\n-Categorize learners by performance levels per competency\r\n-Set SMART goals per group and competency\r\n-Plan targeted intervention sessions aligned with MATATAG CURRICULUM\r\n-Improve learne', '-Pre-RMA test data\r\n-learner profile sheets\r\n-Lesson Plan templates\r\n-Intervention guides\r\n-Math kits, flashcards, visual aids, worksheets, manipulatives blocks, counters, etc.\r\n-Monitoring Tools, scoring rubrics, reflection logs\r\n-Post-RMA tools, Progress charts, summary template', '-Analyze Pre-RMA results\r\n-Grouping Learners\r\n  *Emerging (Not Proficient)\r\n  *Emerging (Proficient)\r\n  *Developing (Nearly Proficient)\r\n  *Transitioning (Proficient)\r\n  *At Grade Level (Highly Proficient)\r\n-Identify top priority competencies\r\n-Prepare differentiated lesson plans per group\r\n-Align activities with learners\' needs\r\n-Develop weekly intervention schedule\r\n-Focus Areas & Strategies\r\n  *Number ID & Discrimination: Use Number Flashcards, bingo games\r\n  *Patterns and Fractions: Use manipulations and pattern cards\r\n  *Operations: Daily drills, ral-life problem solving\r\n  *Reading Comprehensions: Use Short Stories, Vocabularies, CVC Words etc.', '3rd week of July 2026 - whole Year Round', 'School Head, School Guidance Coordinator, Tea', '5000.00', 'effectiveness should be attained', 2026, 500846, 58, 12, 35),
