(816, 'Identify learning competencies that need to be unpack.', 'To unpack learning competencies to suit the learning style of learners.', 'List of learning competencies to be unpack and list of unpack learning competencies', 'The school head and two master teachers of the school will conduct a collaborative expert sessions on unpacking of learning competencies. Doing the unpacking then submission and critiquing of outputs. Observation of classes and the feedbacking.', 'July to September 2026', 'Master Teachers, Teachers and school head', '500.00', '', 2026, 128715, 58, 12, 34),
