(908, 'Strengthen monitoring and evaluation', 'Strengthen school leadership and decision-making', 'Trained school leaders', 'Training needs assessment will be conducted to identify leadership gaps and priority competencies among school heads and coordinators. This will be done through surveys, interviews, and review of school performance data.\r\n\r\nBased on the identified needs, a comprehensive training design will be prepared. This includes the development of training modules focusing on leadership skills such as decision-making, strategic planning, communication, and school governance aligned with SBM principles.\r\n\r\nThe training implementation phase will be carried out through workshops, seminars, and interactive sessions. Resource persons such as experienced school heads, master teachers, or external experts will facilitate the sessions.', 'June–July 2026', 'School Head, Master Teachers', '5000', '', 2026, 129383, 103, 12, 127),
