(910, 'Implementation of Early Language, Literacy, and Numeracy (ELLN) intervention program for Grade 3 learners through structured reading, writing, and numeracy activities.', 'Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.', 'Improved reading comprehension and fluency levels\r\nEnhanced writing and communication skills\r\nIncreased numeracy and problem-solving abilities\r\nMajority of learners meeting or exceeding proficiency standards\r\nReduced number of non-readers and struggling learners', 'Conduct baseline assessment to identify learner needs\r\nImplement differentiated instruction and small-group interventions\r\nUse phonics-based and comprehension strategies in reading\r\nIntegrate numeracy drills and real-life problem-solving tasks\r\nUtilize learning materials such as workbooks, flashcards, and ICT tools\r\nConduct regular progress monitoring and feedback sessions\r\nEngage parents through home-based reading and numeracy activities', 'Whole school year (with quarterly monitoring)', 'School Head Grade 3 Teachers Reading Coordina', '1000', 'Close monitoring and continuous intervention are necessary to ensure all learners reach the desired proficiency level. Collaboration with parents is highly encouraged.', 2026, 128622, 58, 12, 44),
