(1014, 'School Report Card (SRC)', 'To monitor progress and ensure transparency in school performance.', 'Community awareness of school status and budget.', 'Present school progress and fiscal status to the community.', 'July 2026 -  March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, PTA Officers', '1000.00', '', 2026, 204529, 58, 12, 39),
