(1024, 'Assessment and Enrollment of Learners with Special Needs', 'To identify, assess, and enroll eligible learners with disabilities in the SpEd program', 'Updated list of SpEd learners; IEPs (Individualized Education Plans) developed; Referral pathway established', 'Coordinate with MDO, DSWD, and LGU; Conduct initial assessment; Develop IEPs; Enroll qualified learners', 'July to August 2026', 'School Head, SpEd Teacher, Guidance Coor, Par', '3000', '', 2026, 128677, 58, 12, 38),
