(1039, 'Participation in Division/Regional Training and Seminars', 'To expose teachers to updated pedagogy, policy, and best practices beyond the school level', 'Teachers attended at least 1 training per year; Training reports and learning portfolios submitted', 'Identify training needs via IPCRF; Endorse teachers to Division trainings; Conduct school-based echo seminars', 'As scheduled by Division/Region', 'School Head, All Teaching Personnel', '4000', '', 2026, 128677, 58, 12, 38),
