(1041, 'B1. Conduct of Learners’ Needs Assessment and Context Analysis', 'identify learners’ cultural backgrounds, and learning needs to guide development of contextualized instructional materials', 'Comprehensive learners’ profile, contextual analysis report indicating learning needs and gaps ', 'Conduct diagnostic tests, surveys, and focus group discussions; analyze learner performance data, community context, available local resources', 'June 2026', 'School Head, Teachers', '300', 'Basis for material development', 2026, 304224, 58, 12, 36),
