(1058, '\"Action Plan on the Prevention ang Management of Bullying Cases\"', 'Utilize existing data to identify trends, hotspots, and learners at risk.\r\nEnsure effective implementation of anti-bullying programs.\r\nIncrease awareness of anti-bullying policies and reporting procedures.', 'Data-driven intervention plan\r\nFunctional and responsive CPC\r\nInformed and vigilant school community', 'Conduct data review and planning workshop with stakeholders\r\nReorganization, planning sessions, and policy dissemination.\r\nConduct seminars on DepEd Order No. 40, s. 2012. and DM 090 s. 2025', 'June 2026', 'School Head, Child Protection Committee (CPC)', '500', 'No reported Bullying cases during the period.\r\nA significant decrease in bullying incidents was observed due to strengthened awareness campaigns and consistent implementation of anti-bullying programs.', 2026, 128656, 58, 12, 36),
