(1258, 'Establishing PWD‑Friendly School Facilities', 'To provide safe, accessible, and inclusive school facilities that support the mobility, participation, and learning needs of Persons With Disabilities (PWDs).', 'Accessible ramps with proper handrails\r\nClearly marked PWD‑friendly comfort rooms', 'Conduct an accessibility assessment of school facilities\r\nIdentify priority areas for PWD access improvements', 'Whole Year Round', 'School Head/ Teachers/ Community Volunteers', '100000', 'PWD‑friendly facilities promote inclusivity, safety, and equal access to education. Continuous monitoring and coordination with stakeholders will ensure sustainability and compliance with accessibility standards.', 2026, 205018, 59, 12, 139),
