(1339, 'Organize and make our School Governing Council functionlize', '1. To organize our School Governance Council.                                                                  2. To make our SGC functionlize ', 'The School Governance Council is 100% organized and functionalized this coming school opening.', '1. Make a list of prospect candidates for SGC.                                                                   2. Send a notice of meeting.                        3. Conduct orientation                                  4. Discuss their functions and roles as SGC.                                                                          5. Election and induction of newly elected SGC.                                                6.Making of Action Plan ', 'June -July 2026', 'SH, Teachers and stakeholders', '500', '', 2026, 0, 59, 12, 139),
(1340, 'School Clean-Up Drive', 'Maintain a clean, safe, and healthy school environment', 'Clean classrooms, surroundings, and waste properly managed', 'Organize clean-up teams;  assign specific areas; provide cleaning materials', 'Monthly', 'Teachers, pupils, PTA members', '500', 'Support discipline, cleanliness, and teamwork among learners', 2026, 205022, 59, 12, 147),
(1341, 'Construction/Installation of Facilities (ramps, handrails, accessible toilets, signage)', 'Provide safe and accessible facilities for learners with disabilities', 'Functional ramps, handrails, PWD toilets, and signages installed', 'Resource mobilization, Brigada Eskwela, partnership with LGU/NGOs', 'June 2026-march 2027', 'School Head, LGU, PTA, Community Volunteers', '50000.00', 'External funding support needed', 2026, 128931, 59, 12, 0),
