(1377, 'Design projects that require application of 21st century skills (e.g., group projects, problem-solving challenges).', 'Improve learners\' proficiency level in 21st century skills (critical thinking, creativity, collaboration, communication, etc.) by the end of the school year.', 'Improved proficiency levels', '-Evaluate learners\' current proficiency in 21st century skills.\r\n-Identify specific skills and target proficiency levels (e.g., critical thinking: 75% by June).\r\n-Incorporate 21st century skills into lesson plans and activities.\r\n-Leverage technology to support skill development\r\n-Regularly assess and track learners\' progress towards targets.', 'July  2026- January 2027', 'Teachers, Master Teacher and School Head', '15000', '', 2026, 128860, 59, 12, 139),
