(1578, 'Establish and implement Citizen\'s Charter and Digital Help Desk for stakeholders (students, parents, teachers, community partners).', 'Improve accessibility and responsiveness of school services and enhance transparency and accountability in school operations.', 'Functional digital platforms (Online helpdesk) and Printed/Digital Survey for Increased stakeholder satisfaction', 'Train staff on innovative service delivery tools and customer service skills; develop or adopt digital platforms for communication, feedback, and service requests; and Use KPIs (response time, satisfaction ratings, usage statistics) to measure success.', 'Whole Year Round', 'School Head, ICT Coordinator, Administrative ', '1000', 'The innovation in frontline services has enhanced accessibility and transparency. Stakeholders expressed satisfaction with faster response times and improved communication channels. Minor challenges in technology adoption were addressed through additional training and support. ', 2026, 128576, 58, 12, 36),
