(1585, 'School Conducts culture- Sensitive Activities.', 'To promote and implement culture-sensitive activities that respect, preserve, and integrate the diverse cultural backgrounds of learners within the school environment.', '1. Organized events such as cultural presentations, Indigenous Peoples (IP) celebrations, and heritage-based activities. 2. Active involvement of learners in cultural performances, storytelling, dances, songs, and exhibits. 3. Lesson plan indicating the conduct of culture- sensitive activities. \r\n4. Photos, videos, attendance sheets, and reports of conducted cultural activities, and compilation of Lesson Plans.', 'The school will conduct culture-sensitive activities by integrating local traditions, values, and practices into school programs and classroom activities. This promotes respect, appreciation, and understanding of diverse cultural backgrounds among learners. And at the end of the activities their is an awarding ceremony for the best performer and out fits.   Also teachers will make a lesson plan showing / indicating Culture-Sensitive Activities.', 'August- November 2026', 'Teachers, Parents, IPs Representative and Pup', '1500.00', 'Active participation and meaningful learning experiences of all IPs Learners.  100% of the teachers can create a Lesson Plan indicating culture- sensitive activities.', 2026, 128576, 58, 12, 36),
