(1636, 'Establishment of School Library', 'To establish a functional, accessible, and resource-rich school library that supports literacy, research, and lifelong learning among learners.', 'Provision of designated and organized school library with adequate books and learning materials', 'Conduct needs assessment such as available rooms, adequate books and learning materials and request for financial support to LGU and NGOs.', 'June 2026 - January 2027', 'School Head, School LR coordinator, Teachers', '50000.00', 'Budget source will be MOOE, LGU, PTA and donations from NGOs and private individuals', 2026, 129012, 59, 12, 146),
(1637, 'Integrate peace concepts and core values (Maka-Diyos, Makatao, Makakalikasan, Makabansa) in daily lesson', 'Sustain integration of peace education and DepEd core values in lessons', 'Consistent integration of Deped core values', 'Teachers integrate peace education and DepEd core values through daily lesson embedding, reflective activities, experiential learning, and collaborative classroom practices. Values formation is strengthened through consistent modeling, storytelling, and real-life application, supported by classroom observation and feedback.', 'Whole year', 'Teachers', '3,000', 'Efforts shall be maintained to ensure the continuous and consistent integration of peace education and DepEd core values in classroom instruction and school-wide activities, strengthening learners’ character development and positive behavior.', 2026, 304241, 58, 12, 38),
