(1663, 'Conduct regular coordination meetings with industry partners', 'Strengthen partnerships with local industries for TLE-TVL enhancement', 'Active partnerships ', 'The school adopts a partnership-based and experiential learning approach by collaborating with local industries through MOAs, training programs, and immersion activities. Industry experts are engaged to provide real-world learning experiences, while curriculum alignment ensures that TLE-TVL offerings meet current labor market demands. Continuous monitoring and evaluation are conducted to sustain effective implementation.', 'Whole year', 'School Head, TLE-TVL Coordinator', '2,000', 'The school will continue to strengthen and sustain partnerships with local industries to ensure that TLE-TVL programs remain relevant, skills-based, and aligned with industry standards for improved learner employability.', 2026, 304241, 58, 12, 38),
(1664, 'Teachers prepare contextualized learning materials responsive to the needs of learners', 'To develop and implement contextualized instructional materials.', 'Contextualized Learning Resource (CLR) Portfolio, Assessment Results and Localized Material Inventory', 'Community Mapping: Identify local industries, landmarks, and traditions that align with your Subject Matter.\r\n\r\nGap Analysis: Determine which curriculum standards students find most \"foreign\" or difficult to grasp.\r\n\r\nMaterial Development: Rewrite standard examples. Instead of \"John buys an apple,\" use \"Juan buys a mango from the neighborhood talipapa.\"\r\n\r\nValidation: Peer review the materials with fellow teachers or community members to ensure cultural sensitivity and accuracy.', 'Year round', 'Teachers, School Head, MT', '', '', 2026, 128933, 59, 12, 144),
(1665, 'Resource Management:\r\nOptimize School Facilities and Learning Resources', 'Ensure efficient utilization of school resources for teaching and learning.', 'Inventory report, properly maintained facilities, availability of instructional materials.', 'Conduct audits, maintenance schedules, and resource allocation plans.', '1 semester', 'School Principal, LR coordinator, Teachers', '20000', 'Monitor usage and report resource gaps regularly.\r\nRegular inventory learning resource materials.', 2026, 129075, 59, 12, 149),
(1667, 'The school conducts culture-sensitive activities.', 'To conduct Linggo ng Wika in celebrating Buwan ng Wikang Pambansa.', 'Conducted one (1) culture-sensitive activity.', '1. Planning conference with the teachers.\r\n\r\n2. Allocate funds for the activity.\r\n\r\n3. Perform the procurement process.\r\n\r\n4. Procure the materials for the activity.\r\n\r\n5. Conduct the activity .\r\n\r\n      6. Monitor and evaluate of the program.\r\n', 'August, 2026', 'Teachers, School Head, MT, pupils, parents', '', '', 2026, 128933, 59, 12, 144),
