(1711, '1. Creation of TWG 2. Identification of Training needs. 3. Identification of resource person & facilitators 4. Conduct orientation/NSET/LAC sessions of teachers.', '1. To develop and implement a School Improvement Plan {SIP} that is responsive to the actual needs & context of the school & community. 2. To improve learners\' outcomes and academic performance through evidence-based teaching strategies & continuous ', '1. Approved 3-year School Improvement Plan {SIP} ,AIP aligned w/ SIP presented & approved by SGC. ', '1. Planning phase- Preparation, consultation & Scheduling. 2. Implementation Phase - Actual execution of our activities. 3. Monitoring Phase - Checking progress & compliance. 4. Assessing phase - Assessing results & impact', 'June - October 2026', 'School Head, Master Teacher, Teachers & Teach', '500000.00', '*Successfully conducted. *Quorum achieved & Plans approved. Items received & distributed to teachers & learners. * Liquidation complete. * Showing quality outputs from learners accomplishments & high participation of parents & community.', 2026, 129083, 59, 12, 149),
(1712, 'Contextualized Learning Materials Development', 'To enhance teaching effectiveness and learner engagement through the development and use of contextualized, localized, and learner-responsive instructional materials.', 'Teachers create localized learning materials/worksheets and visual aids.', 'Develop contextualized materials and align these learning materials with learner needs.', '*Every grading period', 'School Head, Master Teachers and Learning Are', '30000.00', 'Contextualized materials shall be aligned with MELCs and based on learners’ local culture, language, and real-life experiences.', 2026, 304217, 58, 12, 35),
(1713, 'Installation of Solar Power System', 'Ensure stable and sustainable electricity supply in school; support ICT integration and uninterrupted learning', 'Functional solar power system installed; reduced electricity interruptions; improved use of ICT facilities', 'Conduct needs assessment; procure materials; installation and testing; orientation on usage and maintenance', '2nd–3rd Quarter', 'School Head, Teachers, Electricians, Stakehol', '50000', '', 2026, 204506, 58, 12, 39),
