(1716, 'Conduct School Based Disaster Risk Reduction and Management (SDRRM)', 'To promote a sustainable learning environment.\r\nTo ensure the safety of all students, teachers and other employee at school site and facilities.\r\n\r\n\r\n', '100% Readiness of students, teachers and other employees in times of calamities and disaster. 90% to 100% of the school facilities are in good condition for safety of our students and personnel.', 'Quarterly Earthquake and fire drill, Repair of School facilities.', 'June 2025 to March 2026', 'All teachers, SDRRM  Coordinator, School Head', '20,000.00', '', 2026, 128592, 58, 12, 36),
