(1728, 'Strengthening Test Item Analysis (TIA) for Instructional Improvement', 'To strengthen the regular conduct and utilization of Test Item Analysis (TIA) to improve teaching strategies and learner performance.', 'Improved quality of test items and the least learned competencies are clearly identified and addressed.', 'Conduct training on test construction and item analysis during LAC sessions.', 'Every after quarterly assessment', 'School Head, Master Teachers and Learning Are', '50000.00', 'The results of the TIA will be used to identify the least-mastered competencies (LMCs) and to guide remediation and enrichment programs.', 2026, 304217, 58, 12, 35),
