(1753, 'Establishment of functional School Library', 'To establish  functional school library.', 'Established school library', '*Consultation with stakeholders\r\n*Renovation, layout planning, allocation of reading corners, reference section and digital area\r\n*Purchase, donations, partnerships with NGOs and community\r\n*Use Dewey Decimal System, digital cataloging software and labeling\r\n*Conduct workshops and training for teacher in-charge and student assistants/student volunteering program\r\n*Drafting policies, orientation sessions, posters and handouts\r\n*Install ICT facilities and subscribe to online databases\r\n*Track borrowing records, conduct evaluations, adjust policies\r\n*Secure funding, involve parents/alumni, continuous resource updating\r\n*', 'School Year 202602027', 'School Principal, Teachers, Learners, parents', '100000.00', 'This project was not included in the SIP', 2026, 129024, 59, 12, 146),
