(1760, '* Coordinate with stakeholders\r\n*Solicit of books and equipment\r\n*Establish room for library', '*Provide access to quality reading and reference materials\r\n*Create safe, quiet space for study and reading activities\r\n*Promote a culture of reading and academic excellence', 'A fully functional school library with at least 200 initial books, proper shelving, and reading tables.', '1.Needs assessment- survey among teachers and learners to determine reading interest, needed reference\r\n2.Planning and Coordination-coordinate with PTA, BLGU, alumni and private partners\r\n3.Resource mobilization- Tap PTA, Alumni, and external partners\r\n4. Site Preparation and organization-Identify and renovate the designated room, painting, lighting, and ventilation\r\n5. Capacity building-conduct a brief orientation among teachers.\r\n6.Launching and utilization-Orient all learners on library rules.\r\n7.Monitoring and evaluation-log daily users and barrowed books, Conduct quarterly evaluation', 'academic year 2026-2027', 'School head, teachers, PTA,  alumni, learners', '50000.', 'Utilize portion of School Site Income (SSI), canteen, PTA fund', 2026, 129021, 59, 12, 146),
