(1771, 'Installation of a school library as a welcoming place for all learners', 'To make the school library a welcoming place for everyone to learn and work together, providing all students with the materials they need.\r\n', '1. Make the library a welcoming and accessible space for everyone, including students with disabilities.\r\n\r\n2. Comfortable seating and study areas available for collaborative and individual learning.\r\n\r\n3. More students are using the library, as shown by our sign-in logs.\r\n', '1. Conduct a walkthrough to identify accessibility gaps, seating needs, and areas for improvement.\r\n\r\n2. Document required upgrades such as ramps, handrails, seating, and study areas in the SIP/AIP.\r\n\r\n2. Use school funds for small needs and partner with local leaders, parents, or groups for bigger projects.\r\n\r\n3. Schedule regular maintenance and continue stakeholder engagement for long-term support.', 'June 2026 - December 2026', 'School Head / SBM Coordinator / Class Adviser', '15000', 'The library helps students read, research, and work together. Its accessible design makes sure everyone, including students with disabilities, has the same chance to learn.', 2026, 129016, 59, 12, 146),
