(1819, 'Drafting of the Comprehensive SLAC Plan and Approved by SDO.', 'Produce a complete, actionable approved by SDO SLAC Plan that covers at least one school year.', 'SLAC Plan containing:\r\n- Rationale and objectives\r\n- List of sessions (topics, dates, facilitators)\r\n- Learning resources needed\r\n- Monitoring and evaluation indicators\r\n- SLAC calendar\r\nApproved SLAC Plan.', 'Core Team writes the plan using DepEd format (Annex A of DO 35, s. 2016)\r\n- Schedule at least 1 SLAC session per month (minimum 8 sessions/year)\r\n- Assign facilitators per topic (teachers can rotate presenting)\r\n- Include pre-test/post-test for each session', '1 month for drafting and approval and whole y', 'School Head and teachers', '1000', 'Intensive conduct of regular SLAC sessions.', 2026, 128950, 59, 12, 145),
