(1824, 'The school has a functional SGC', 'To organize, capacitate, and sustain an effective School Governing Council composed of key stakeholders (school heads, teachers, parents, community members, and local partners) that ensures transparency, accountability, and collaborative governance i', 'The school will initiate the organization of the School Governing Council (SGC) by identifying and inviting key stakeholders such as school heads, teachers, parents, community leaders, and local partners to serve as members. Orientation and capacity-building activities will be conducted to equip members with knowledge on their roles, SBM principles, and governance processes. The council will then develop its structure, policies, and annual work plan aligned with school goals. Regular meetings will be scheduled to discuss, plan, and review school programs and initiatives, ensuring proper documentation of proceedings and decisions. Continuous monitoring, evaluation, and feedback mechanisms will be established to strengthen participation, improve decision-making, and sustain the functionality and effectiveness of the SGC.', 'The school will initiate the organization of the School Governing Council (SGC) by identifying and inviting key stakeholders such as school heads, teachers, parents, community leaders, and local partners to serve as members. Orientation and capacity-building activities will be conducted to equip members with knowledge on their roles, SBM principles, and governance processes. The council will then develop its structure, policies, and annual work plan aligned with school goals. Regular meetings will be scheduled to discuss, plan, and review school programs and initiatives, ensuring proper documentation of proceedings and decisions. Continuous monitoring, evaluation, and feedback mechanisms will be established to strengthen participation, improve decision-making, and sustain the functionality and effectiveness of the SGC.', 'School Year 2026 - 2027', 'School Head, Stakeholders (Internal and Exter', '', '', 2026, 128941, 59, 12, 144),
