(1864, 'Quarterly Evaluation and Analysis Session', 'Analyze monitoring data to identify root causes of low performance and document lessons.', ' Quarterly SMEA evaluation report (narrative with analysis)\r\n- Root cause analysis per underperforming KPI\r\n- List of good practices and challenges', ' Hold a 1-day quarterly SMEA workshop (end of each grading period)\r\n- Use structured tools: SWOT analysis, 5 Whys, problem tree\r\n- Compare actual vs. target; compute efficiency and effectiveness ratios\r\n- Document insights', 'End of semester.', 'SMEA Team, School Head, Department Heads, PTA', '4500', 'Schedule this back-to-back with the existing quarterly faculty meeting to save time.', 2026, 128950, 59, 12, 145),
