(2030, 'Parent-Teacher Association (PTA) Revitalization', 'To actively involve parents, students, community members, and staff in school decision-making and operations.', '1. Increased parent-teacher association (PTA) engagement.\r\n2. Active participation of student representatives in school governance.\r\n3. Stronger community partnerships and support.', '1. Regular PTA meetings and feedback sessions.\r\n2. Supreme Elementary League Government council activities and representation in school forums.', 'Whole year Round', 'School Head , Master Teacher /SBM Focal P/PTA', '1000.00', 'Active PTA involvement translates into stronger community support and a more holistic approach to student development. The key is to move beyond traditional fundraising and empower parents as active partners in school improvement.', 2026, 128681, 58, 12, 38),
