(2032, 'Reorganization of new set of officers', 'To reorganize and strengthen the School-Based Management (SBM) structure by selecting competent, responsible, and committed officers who will actively support school governance, programs, and continuous improvement.', '- Fully reorganized and functional SBM officers\r\n- Transparent and democratic selection process\r\n- Clearly defined roles and responsibilities\r\n- Active participation in SBM programs and school governance\r\n- Strengthened school leadership and collaboration\r\n', 'The reorganization will follow a participatory, transparent, and democratic process involving nomination, validation, election or selection, and induction of officers. Stakeholders will be engaged to ensure fairness, accountability, and shared responsibility in strengthening School-Based Management.', 'June 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, PTA Officers, Parents ', '1000', '', 2026, 129137, 59, 12, 151),
