(2107, 'Monitoring, Evaluation, and Continuous Improvement', 'To establish a system for regularly monitoring progress, evaluating impact, and making necessary adjustments to SBM initiatives.', '1. Regular SBM progress reports.\r\n2. Data-driven decision-making based on monitoring and evaluation findings.\r\n3. A culture of continuous improvement within the school.', '1. Development of key performance indicators (KPIs) for SBM.\r\n2. Regular data collection and analysis.\r\n3. Feedback mechanisms for continuous improvement.', 'Whole year Round', 'School Head , Master Teacher /SBM Focal Perso', '1000.00', 'This serves as the school’s quality assurance mechanism. By identifying systemic bottlenecks early, the school can pivot strategies promptly, ensuring that all programs directly contribute to improved learner outcomes.', 2026, 128681, 58, 12, 38),
