(2170, 'Digital Learning Hub: Establishing a Functional Computer Laboratory', 'Provide students with access to modern ICT tools for learning.\r\n\r\nEnhance teachers’ capacity to integrate technology into instruction.\r\n\r\nSupport DepEd’s thrust on digital literacy and 21st-century skills.\r\n\r\nCreate an inclusive learning environment ', 'Fully equipped and operational computer laboratory.\r\n\r\nAt least 80% of teachers trained in basic ICT integration.\r\n\r\nStudents able to demonstrate digital literacy skills (typing, research, presentations).\r\n\r\nDocumentation of ICT-based lessons and outputs.', 'Needs Assessment: Survey current ICT resources and teacher readiness.\r\n\r\nResource Mobilization: Solicit support from LGU, PTA, alumni, and private partners.\r\n\r\nCapacity Building: Conduct ICT training workshops for teachers.\r\n\r\nImplementation: Phased installation of equipment and structured student use schedules.\r\n\r\nMonitoring & Evaluation: Regular assessment of lab usage and impact on learning outcomes.', 'Phase 1 (Months 1–2): Planning, resource mobi', 'School Head / Principal: Overall project lead', '900000', '', 2026, 128856, 59, 12, 139),
