(2183, 'Implementation of BQuest Award (Beacon of Quality and Unmatched Excellence in Service & Teaching)', '1. Recognize and reward outstanding performance of school personnel\r\n2. Promote a culture of excellence, accountability, and continuous improvement\r\n3. Motivate teachers and staff to deliver quality service and instruction', '1. Established BQuest Award system and criteria\r\n2. List of qualified nominees and awardees\r\n3. Conducted awarding ceremonies\r\n4. Improved performance of school personnel', '1. Develop clear guidelines, criteria, and selection process\r\n2. Organize a selection committee\r\n3. Collect and evaluate nominations based on performance indicators (e.g., teaching effectiveness, innovation, service delivery)\r\n4. Validate results through documentation and performance records\r\n5. Conduct recognition and awarding ceremonies\r\n6. Disseminate results to stakeholders', 'Annual', 'School Head, Selection Committee, Master Teac', 'MOOE Funds for plaques, certificates, and tokens', 'Align with DepEd policies on rewards and recognition', 2026, 128955, 59, 12, 0),
