(2195, 'Implement a school-based drop out (Early warning system (Early Warning System, Learner Monitoring and Intervention support)', 'To identify learners at risk of dropping out through an Early Warning System.\r\nTo reduce drop out incidents through timely and targeted intervention', 'Identified learners at risk of dropping out.\r\nReduced  drop out incidents.', 'Early identification: Monitor daily attendance and performance: flag learners with frequent absences profiling: maintain individual learner profiles ( academic, socio-economic, behavioral factors) intervention:conduct home visitations. Provide remediation classes and peer tutoring.', 'Whole year round, with monthly monitoring', 'School Head, class advisers, teachers', '12000.00', 'This action plan aims to institutionalize pro-active and sustainable dropout reduction mechanism. Continuous monitoring, strong stakeholders collaboaration, and learner-centered interventions will ensure that the indicator progresses from not yet manifested to always manifested.', 2026, 128942, 59, 12, 144),
