(2353, 'The school conducts needs-based Learning Action Cells and Learning & Development  activities', '1. To identify and address the professional development needs of teachers and personnel through LAC sessions and L&D activities.\r\n2. To promote a culture of continuous learning and collaboration among school personnel.\r\n', '1. Conducted regular, documented LAC sessions and L&D activities.\r\n2. Attendance sheets and session reports\r\n3. Identified teacher needs and action points addressed\r\n4. Improved teaching strategies and classroom practices\r\n5. Enhanced learner performance based on improved instruction\r\n', '1. Conduct Training Needs Assessment among teachers\r\n2. Schedule regular LAC sessions \r\n3. Invite resource speakers \r\n4. Use workshops, demonstrations, and collaborative planning\r\n5. Conduct peer sharing, coaching, and mentoring\r\n6. Provide post-activity evaluation and feedback forms', 'Beginning of the School Year/monthly', 'School Head, Teachers', 'None', '1. Implementation is subject to availability of time, resources, and approved school calendar.\r\n2. Activities shall be aligned with DepEd policies and SBM practices.\r\n3. Continuous monitoring and evaluation will be conducted to ensure effectiveness and sustainability.\r\n4. Adjustments may be made based on emerging needs and instructional priorities.', 2026, 205023, 59, 12, 144),
