(2358, 'Implementation of Intensive Remediation Sessions (Reading, Comprehension, Science & Technology, and Mathematics).', 'To bridge identified learning gaps in core subjects through targeted instruction.\r\nTo improve student literacy and numeracy proficiency levels.\r\nTo enhance critical thinking skills and scientific literacy through hands-on intervention.', 'Measurable increase in student assessment scores.\r\nUpdated individual student progress profiles.\r\nConsolidated remediation reports and learner portfolios.', 'Differentiated Instruction: Grouping students based on skill levels.\r\nScaffolded Learning: Using simplified modules and visual aids.\r\nPeer Tutoring: Leveraging collaborative learning.\r\nHands-on Drills: Practical math problem-solving and scientific experimentation.', 'Quarterly (Every Friday afternoon or schedule', 'ubject Teachers, Department Heads, Students, ', '5000', 'Regular assessment (Pre-test and Post-test) will be conducted to evaluate the effectiveness of the intervention and adjust strategies accordingly.', 2026, 137013, 58, 12, 39),
