(2371, 'Implementation of a Digital Frontline Service Portal and Automated Stakeholder Assistance System.', 'To streamline the delivery of school services (enrollment, records, and academic inquiries) for parents and students.\r\n\r\nTo reduce waiting times and improve the accuracy of information dissemination.\r\n\r\nTo enhance stakeholder satisfaction through acc', 'A functional online appointment and inquiry system.\r\n\r\nReduced physical queues and faster turnaround for document requests.\r\n\r\nHigh stakeholder satisfaction ratings based on quarterly feedback surveys.', 'Utilizing QR codes and digital forms for academic remediation sign-ups and frontline inquiries.\r\nFeedback Loop: Integrating a real-time digital feedback mechanism (Kiosk or SMS-based) at the point of service.\r\n\r\nCapacity Building: Training administrative staff on \"Customer First\" digital protocols and efficient data handling.', 'Initial rollout over the first semester, with', 'School Information Officer  Administrative St', '3000', 'This innovation transforms the school from a traditional office setup into a responsive, tech-driven service hub, ensuring that administrative support matches the high quality of academic instruction.', 2026, 204531, 58, 12, 0),
