(2375, 'Optimization and Maintenance of School Physical Facilities (Water, Electricity, and Internet).', 'To ensure 100% functionality and safety of water and electrical systems for student and staff use.\r\n\r\nTo provide high-speed, reliable internet connectivity to support digital remediation and administrative frontline services.\r\n\r\nTo establish a sustai', 'Certified safe drinking water and functional sanitation facilities.\r\n\r\nStable electrical supply in all classrooms and laboratories.\r\n\r\nCampus-wide Wi-Fi coverage for instructional and frontline service use.', 'Conduct monthly inspections of pipes, wiring, and routers to identify wear and tear.\r\n\r\nResource Management: Implementation of \"Green Policies\" for water and power conservation.\r\n\r\nBandwidth Management: Prioritizing internet traffic for academic remediation tools and stakeholder frontline portals.', 'Year-round implementation (Monthly maintenanc', 'School Property Custodian  ICT Coordinator  P', '2000', 'Maintaining functional basic facilities is a foundational requirement for SBM Level 3 accreditation, as it directly impacts the safety and efficiency of the learning environment.', 2026, 204531, 58, 12, 0),
