(2425, 'Strengthening of SBM committee', 'Establish functional SBM structure ', 'Organized SBM team with defined roles', 'Meetings, designation order', '1-2 months', 'School Head, Teachers, Community Leaders', '3000.00', 'Basis for SIP planning ', 2026, 129087, 59, 12, 149),
