(2471, 'Establish school-based mental health and DRRM programs', 'Promote safe, inclusive, and supportive learning environment', 'Functional DRRM plan and mental wellness support system', 'Trainings, drills, counseling sessions', 'Semi-Annual', 'Teachers, Guidance Advocate, DRRM Team', '5000', 'The school promotes a generally safe and supportive learning environment. However, mental health support systems and full functionality of DRRM mechanisms are still developing. Strengthening these areas will ensure a more inclusive, safe, and resilient school environment for all learners.', 2026, 128920, 59, 12, 142),
(2472, 'SWOT Analysis', 'To identify school needs and priority areas for improvement', 'Completed needs assessment report', 'Surveys, focus group discussions, data analysis', 'June–July', 'School Head, teachers, PTA Officers, Brgy. Co', '1000.00', '', 2026, 128504, 57, 12, 110),
(2473, 'Strengthen partnerships with LGU, PTA, and local industries', 'Enhance support for school programs and learner development', 'MOA/MOU with stakeholders and active partnerships', 'Stakeholder meetings, advocacy campaigns, partnership building', 'Whole Year', 'School Head, PTA, LGU, Private Sector', '2000', 'The school maintains active collaboration with parents and stakeholders, contributing positively to school programs. However, partnerships with external organizations and industries are still limited. Expanding stakeholder engagement will further enhance resource support and learner opportunities.', 2026, 128920, 59, 12, 142),
