(2578, 'The school achieves an average rating of very satisfactory in the individual performance.', 'To monitor the implementation of all personnel in line with the individual performance.', 'Monitored the individual performance of all employee from performance planning and commitment to performance rewarding and development planning.', 'Conduct monitoring to all implementation of all personnel in line with the individual performance.', 'Monthly', 'School Head, Head Teachers, Master Teachers ', '20000', 'Checked and monitored the implementation of all personnel in line with the individual performance.', 2026, 304311, 61, 12, 7),
(2579, 'PASIK-CLUBAN- \"Ignite the Spirit: School Sports Festival 2026”', 'Participate in activities that promote responsible citizenship and leadership.\r\n2. Practice desirable social, cultural, moral and spiritual values.\r\n3. Participate in nature conversation, preservation of the natural resources of our country\r\n4. Stren', 'Personal Growth\r\n2. Leadership Skills\r\n3. Teamwork and Collaboration\r\n4. Outdoor Skills\r\n5. Social Interaction\r\n6. Character Building\r\n7. Friendships and Camaraderie\r\n8. Life-long Memories\r\n9. Sense of Achievement\r\n10. Physical Fitness\r\n', 'The proponent will tap the Supreme Secondary Learner Government (SSLG), Barkada Kontra Droga (BKD), Math Club Officers and Youth for Environment in Schools Organization (YES-O) in the school to participate the planning and be included as the working committee together with the PTA officers who will be participating. The students will be encouraged to participate in the said activity.\r\nThe participating parents, SSLG, BKD, Math club officers and YES-O will be grouped and assigned to different committee to serve until the end of the activity.\r\n', ' (3) DAYS ', 'Teaching Personnel (Teacher I-III, MT I-IV, H', '55170.00', '', 2026, 304284, 59, 12, 143),
(2580, 'Pundasyong Matatag, Paaralang Maunlad”', 'To honor and commemorate the history, milestones, and accomplishments of the school since its establishment.\r\n2. To provide a platform for recognizing and celebrating the academic, extracurricular, and professional achievements of students and staff.', '.Personal Growth\r\n2. Leadership Skills\r\n3. Teamwork and Collaboration\r\n4. Social Interaction\r\n5. Character Building\r\n7. Friendships and Camaraderie\r\n8. Life-long Memories\r\n9. Sense of Achievement\r\n', 'The proponent will tap the Supreme Secondary Learner Government (SSLG), Barkada Kontra Droga (BKD), Math Club Officers, Boys Scout and Youth for Environment in Schools Organization (YES-O) in the school to participate the planning and be included as the working committee together with the PTA officers who will be participating. The students will be encouraged to participate in the said activity.\r\nThe participating parents, SSLG, BKD, Math club officers and YES-O will be grouped and assigned to different committee to serve until the end of the activity.\r\n', '- 1 day', 'Teaching Personnel (Teacher I-III, MT I-IV, H', '62410.00', '', 2026, 304284, 59, 12, 143),
