 Video	All SHS students\r\nClass Advisers 	Subject teachers\r\nSHS Coordinator\r\n', 'Whole academic year 2026-2027', 'Teaching Personnel (Teacher I-III, MT I-IV, H', '5520.00', '', 2026, 304284, 59, 12, 143),
