(2649, 'Finance and Resource Management, and Mobilization 6.1 Improvement of school library operations. ', '6.1 To functionalize the School Library and improve its structure and its operation.', '6.1 SIP; Picture of the Physical structure of the School Library; Pertinent documents of its operation like logbook of clients, borrowers card, and others.', '6.1.1 Inclusion in the SIP;  Improvement the library structure with documentation like POW, Pictures, and others;\r\n Assign Teacher Library In-charge; and \r\ndocument day to day operation.\r\n', 'June, 2026 to March, 2027', 'School Head,   Sch. Teacher- Librarian, Sch. ', '20000.00', 'School Library is greatly considered an avenue for learning, place where to read and absolutely where to borrow reading materials and other learning resources. ', 2026, 204520, 58, 12, 37),
