(2665, '“Kasuga Green Campus” initiative with tree planting and waste segregation', 'Instill environmental responsibility and beautify the school grounds', '50 trees planted; functional waste segregation bins; eco-club established', 'Organize student eco-club; monthly clean-up drives', 'June–November 2026', 'Science teachers, student eco-club, PTA ', '400', 'Supports DepEd’s Brigada Eskwela and environmental initiatives', 2026, 316009, 59, 12, 143),
