(2671, 'Implementation of Literacy and Numeracy Intervention Program', 'To enhance students’ literacy and numeracy skills through targeted, context-responsive interventions, resulting in improved reading proficiency and numeracy competence among learners', 'Improved reading levels; increased numeracy test scores; intervention reports', 'Conduct baseline assessment; group learners by level; implement remedial reading and numeracy sessions; monitor progress regularly', 'whole year round', 'School Head, Teachers, Reading Coordinator, M', '15000.00', 'Focus on struggling and disadvantaged learners; use mother tongue/localized materials where possible', 2026, 502370, 59, 12, 0),
