(2676, 'FUNCTIONALIZE AND STRENGTHEN SCHOOL GOVERNANCE COUNCIL', 'To functionalize and strengthen the School Governing Council (SGC) as an active, collaborative, and accountable body in school governance to improve learner outcomes.', 'Oriented SGC members; approved SIP/AIP', 'Conduct orientations, workshops, and seminars\r\nUse lecture-discussion, workshops, and group activities. \r\nProvide modules/materials for SGC members', 'JUNE 2026 - APRIL 2027', 'SCHOOL HEAD, TEACHERS, AND SGC OFFICIALS', '5000', 'INCREASE STAKEHOLDER PARTICIPATION IN THE NEXT CYCLE', 2026, 323409, 106, 12, 134),
