(2735, '>Orient school heads, teachers, parents, and stakeholders about SBM principles and policies\r\n>Conduct baseline assessment using SBM tools\r\n>Review or update the School Improvement Plan (SIP) based on assessment results\r\n>Roll out priority programs\r\n>', '>Build awareness and organize the SBM structure\r\n>Develop a responsive School Improvement Plan (SIP)\r\n>Execute planned programs and projects\r\n>Track progress and ensure accountability\r\n>Sustain and improve SBM practices', '>Organized SBM Team\r\n>Baseline assessment report\r\n>Updated SIP\r\n>Program implementation reports\r\n>Quarterly monitoring reports\r\n>SBM evaluation report\r\n>Enhanced SIP for next school year', 'a. Leadership & Planning  \r\nb. Stakeholder Engagement & Program Launch\r\nc. Curriculum & Instruction Improvement\r\nd. Mid-Year Monitoring & Adjustment\r\ne. Strengthening Implementation\r\nf. Evaluation & Sustainability\r\n', 'June  2025 - March 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Non-Teaching personnel', '35,000.00', 'Schedule may differ depends on the availability of materials, persons involved and some conflict of schedules of school personnel', 2026, 128997, 60, 12, 29);
