(2856, 'Strengthening School-Based Basa Program through targeted intervention strategies.', '1.  Conduct daily 30 minutes remedial reading session for slow readers. \r\n2. Provide 100% of reading teachers and reading materials, such as big books and supplementary worksheets', 'Reduced the number of non-readers and the frustration level of readers; increased the number of instructional and independent - level readers.', '1. Administer Phil-IRI pre-test to identify non-readers\' frustration, instructional, and independent readers per grade level.\r\n2. Inventory existing materials, teachers trained in reading', 'Year round', 'Language Teachers', '10000', 'Target Achieved - significant decreased in non-readers. Program contributed to improved academic performance. ', 2026, 315907, 58, 12, 34),
