(3106, 'Organization of  School Governing Council', 'To establish a well-organized and functional School Governing Council that fosters participatory decision-making, strengthens collaboration among stakeholders, and ensures transparent, accountable, and sustainable management of school programs and re', 'A fully established and functional School Governing Council with defined membership, clear roles and responsibilities, approved organizational structure, and documented policies  and procedures. ', '1. stakeholder identification and Engagement.\r\n2.Orientation and Capacity Building\r\n3.Formal organization and documentation.\r\n4. Regular meeting and Decision-Making Process\r\n5.Implementation of Programs and Projects.\r\n6. Monitoring and evaluation.\r\n', 'July 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Barangay Captain', '5000.00', 'The success organization of the School Governing Council is a vital step in strengthening participator governance within the school. By ensuring that stakeholders are actively involved, the SGC becomes platform for transparent decision-making accountability, and shared responsibility in advancing school improvement initiatives. Continuous orientation, documentation, and monitoring are essential to sustain its functionality.', 2026, 128831, 59, 12, 138),
