(3147, 'Provision of technical assistance, support and resources ', 'Increase proficiency level of grade 6 learners in the National Achievement Test (NAT)', '*Copy of formative test results in key subject areas\r\n*Copy of minutes of the conference/Focus Group Discussion (FGD)', '1.Collect and analyze the formative test results from grade 6 teachers \r\n2.Conduct a separate monthly conference/Focus Group Discussion(FGD).\r\n', 'Monthly', 'Principal, Master Teachers, Classroom Teacher', '10000', 'During monthly conference/FGD conducted, teachers shall be given opportunity to raise concerns, problems & challenges encountered in the course of lesson delivery. Likewise, identified learners shall also be provided an avenue to air out their own reasons to determine the factors of their low academic performance. In so doing, appropriate technical assistance, support and resources can be subsequently provided. With this dialogue,  it is expected that things will be made clearer as far as setting direction on attaining desired learning outcomes is concerned. ', 2026, 129090, 59, 12, 150),
(3148, 'Strict implementation of Anti-bullying policy', 'Reduce bullying cases by at least 75% over last school year 2025-2026.', '*Copy of incident reports on bullying, anecdotal records.\r\n*Copy of the minutes on conference conducted with the teachers, learners, parents concerned.', '1.Conduct symposium on bullying.\r\n2.Institutionalize activities on anti-bullying inside the classrooms and school.\r\n3.Provide feedback/complaint mechanism through hotline numbers and/or social media platforms', 'Year round', 'Principal, Master Teachers, Classroom Teacher', '5000', 'Sanctions for learners involved in bullying shall be imposed with respect to the legal provisions set by the Department of Education (DepEd).', 2026, 129090, 59, 12, 150),
(3149, 'Reorganize and functionalize the School Governance Council (SGC)', 'SGC shall be reorganized and functionalized this school year 2026-2027.\r\n ', '*Minutes of SGC Meetings, orientation conducted \r\n*Copy of MOVS on SGC-related activities ', '1.Conduct meeting with concerned stakeholders\r\n2.Conduct reorientation on SGC functions\r\n3.Conduct series of SGC-related activities ', 'July 2026', 'Principal, Stakeholders Concerned ', '3000', 'This SY 2026-2027, the School Governance Council (SGC) shall be revitalized, to work hand in hand with the school\'s Parents-Teachers Association (SPTA) in promoting children\'s well-being, welfare and performance, and in improving school operations for the attainment of its projects, programs, and activities. ', 2026, 129090, 59, 12, 150),
