(3178, 'Annual orientation on Child Protection Policy for learners, staff, and parents', 'Sustain a safe school environment free from any form of child abuse.', 'Sustained safe and protective school environment', 'Strict implementation and continuous dissemination of the Child Protection Policy (CPP) and related DepEd issuances.', 'First Quarter', 'School Head, Child Protection Committee (CPC)', '3000', 'The school consistently ensures a safe and protective environment resulting in zero child abuse incidence.', 2026, 304241, 58, 12, 38),
