(3180, 'Re-orientation about the policy guidelines on the implementation of School-Based Management System', 'Re-orient teachers and stakeholders about the policy guidelines on the implementation of School-Based Management System', 'Teachers and stakeholders are oriented about the  policy guidelines of the School-Based Management System', 'Discussion on the policy guidelines of SBM through LAC session', 'July 3 & 10, 2026', 'School Head, Teachers and Stakeholders', '500.00', 'Re-orientation on the policy guidelines of SBM  will be done two consecutive Fridays, every 3:00 -5:00 PM', 2026, 205501, 61, 12, 3),
