(3190, 'Conduct of Advocacy Campaign - Oplan Balik Eskwela', 'Increase awareness on enrollment and encourage out-of-school children to enroll', '1. Increased enrollment rate\r\n2. List of enrollees', '1. Social media posting\r\n2. Coordination with Barangay Officials\r\n3. Distribution of flyers', 'January 2026 to December 2026', 'School Head & All Teachers', '595.00', '', 2026, 128684, 106, 12, 134),
