(3229, 'The school recognizes and rewards milestone achievements of its personnel', '1. To recognize and reward achievements of school personnel\r\n', '1. Approved criteria for recognition system\r\n2. Program developed and disseminated\r\n3. At least 4 recognition activities conducted\r\n4. 100% of identified personnel recognized\r\n5. Increased visibility of personnel achievements\r\n6. Feedback collected and used for improvement', '1. Identify criteria for milestone achievements (e.g., years of service, outstanding performance, awards)\r\n2. Create a Recognition and Rewards Program (RRP)\r\n3. Conduct quarterly recognition ceremonies\r\n4. Provide incentives (certificates, tokens, public recognition)\r\n5. Post achievements on school bulletin boards and social media\r\n6. Gather feedback to improve the program', 'Monthly, Quarterly, Annually', 'School Head, Teachers, Non-Teaching Personnel', '5000', '', 2026, 128973, 60, 12, 26),
(3230, 'Getting Started', 'To re-orient teachers and staff on the concepts and principles of School-Based Management.', '100% of the teachers and staff had attended the orientation', 'Make an Activity Design on the conduct of the SBM Orientation, Draft a Memorandum for the conduct of the orientation, Conduct the Activity', 'May 26, 2026', 'School Head, Department Heads, Teachers, Non-', '3000.00', '', 2026, 304316, 61, 12, 1),
