(3236, 'The school has a functional library.', '1. To establish and organize a functional school library\r\n2. To increase availability of reading materials\r\n3. To ensure proper tracking and borrowing system\r\n4. To promote reading habit among learners\r\n5. To strengthen literacy through library use\r\n', '1. Library area is established and functional\r\n2. At least adequate learning resources available per grade level\r\n3. Functional record system for borrowed books\r\n4. Increased library usage by learners\r\n5. Improved reading engagement and participation\r\n6. Library is clean, organized, and well-maintained\r\n7. Increased book donations and support', '1. Designate and organize a library space; assign library focal person\r\n2. Inventory existing books; procure/solicit books and reading materials\r\n3. Implement borrowing/return system and library logbook\r\n4. Schedule regular library time per grade level (multigrade setup)\r\n5. Conduct reading programs (Reading Corner Time, Storytelling, Drop Everything and Read)\r\n6. Assign learner/library monitors; implement cleaning schedule\r\n7. Engage PTA/LGU/donors for book donations and support', 'Quarterly, Whole Year', 'School Head, Teachers, Non-Teaching Personnel', '10000', '', 2026, 128973, 60, 12, 26),
