(3241, 'The school has functional water, electric, and internet facilities', '1. To determine the condition and adequacy of school water facility\r\n2. To ensure continuous supply of clean and safe water\r\n3. To ensure learners and staff have easy access to safe water\r\n4. To ensure safe and potable water supply\r\n5. To sustain fun', '1. Water system condition is assessed and documented\r\n2. Functional and leak-free water system\r\n3. At least functional water points available in key areas\r\n4. Safe and clean water available for use\r\n5. Regular maintenance system implemented\r\n6. Improved hygiene practices among learners\r\n7. Continuous support and resource mobilization', '1. Conduct assessment of existing water source, pipes, tanks, and faucets\r\n2. Repair leaks, broken pipes, faucets, and storage tanks\r\n3. Install additional water points or faucets if needed\r\n4. Conduct basic water testing and implement cleaning/disinfection schedule\r\n5. Assign maintenance schedule and responsible personnel\r\n6. Conduct handwashing and WASH awareness activities\r\n7. Engage PTA, LGU, and donors for upgrades and repairs', 'Quarterly, Whole Year', 'School Head, Teachers, NTPs, PTA', '5000', '', 2026, 128973, 60, 12, 26),
