(3252, 'The school has a functional computer laboratory/classroom', '1. To set up a functional computer laboratory/classroom\r\n2. To determine available ICT resources and needs\r\n3. To provide adequate ICT equipment and materials\r\n4. To ensure access to digital learning resources\r\n5. To integrate ICT in classroom instru', '1. Computer lab/classroom is properly organized and functional\r\n2. Complete inventory and needs assessment report\r\n3. Increased number of functional computers available for learners\r\n4. Stable internet connection available for instructional use\r\n5. Learners demonstrate basic ICT skills\r\n6. Computers are functional and well-maintained\r\n7. Teachers trained and applying ICT in teaching\r\n8. Increased ICT resources and support', '1. Designate computer room; arrange layout and install basic furniture\r\n2. Conduct inventory of computers, printers, and accessories\r\n3. Acquire additional computers, peripherals, and software (as needed)\r\n4. Install/upgrade internet connection in the ICT room\r\n5. Conduct ICT-assisted lessons and basic computer literacy sessions\r\n6. Assign ICT caretaker; implement usage rules and maintenance schedule\r\n7. Conduct training on basic ICT integration and digital tools\r\n8. Engage LGU, PTA, donors for equipment and internet support', 'Quarterly, Whole Year', 'School Head, Teachers, Non-Teaching Personnel', '10000', '', 2026, 128973, 60, 12, 26),
