(3325, 'To install rainwater collector for functional school water facility.', 'To provide an alternative and sustainable water source for school gardening and toilet sanitation; to reduce water utility costs; and to promote environmental conservation awareness among learners.', 'Installed and operational rainwater harvesting system; maintenance schedule for the facility; and documented reduction in monthly water consumption.', 'Site identification and technical assessment; procurement of materials (drums, PVC pipes, filters); collaborative labor through \"Brigada Eskwela\" or community volunteers; and orientation of students on proper usage.', '3rd - 4th quarter (July-December)', 'School Head, School Facilities Coordinator, P', 'P32,000.00 - school MOOE funds or LGU grants.', 'This facility directly supports the WinS (Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene in Schools) program and contributes to a disaster-resilient school environment.', 2026, 137070, 58, 12, 40),
