(3352, 'JDVP partners : recognizing commitment and excellence ', '1. To acknowledge and appreciate the dedication and contributions of JDVP partners.\r\n2. To recognize outstanding achievements and excellence in partnership \r\n3. To foster a sense of community and strengthen relationships  among JDVP partners.\r\n4. To ', '1. JDVP partners are formally acknowledge for dedication.\r\n2. Documented recognition program outputs for SBM monitoring and reporting.', '1. Organize a recognition ceremony highlighting partner achievements.\r\n2. Provide certificates, tokens, and formal messages of appreciation.', 'MArch 26, 2026', 'JDVP partners', '3780.00', '1. Activity strengthen collaboration and goodwill between the school and JDVP partners.\r\n2. Budget allocation ensures proper logistics, awards, and program documentation.', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
