(3354, 'CITY MEET 2026', '1. To explore the sports skills of the learners.\r\n2. To develop physical, health and mental alertness. \r\n3. To promote athletes discipline and sportmanship.', '1.Event successfully conducted with active participation of athletes, coaches, and assistant coaches.\r\n2. Learners showcased improved sports skills, discipline , and teamwork.\r\n3. Activities promoted physical health, mental alertness, and school spirit.\r\n', '1. Preparation\r\n* identify and train athletes through regular practice sessions.\r\n* assign coaches and assistant coaches to specific sports eveents. \r\n* Secure logistics, uniforms, and necessary equipment.\r\n2. Implementation\r\n* Conduct scheduled competitions with proper supervision \r\n* Ensure fair play and adherence to sports rules\r\n* Provide medical and safety support dduring events.\r\n3. Documentation\r\n* Record attendance, results , and achievements of athletes.\r\n* compile reports, photos, and evaluation forms.\r\n* Submit consolidated documentation to school governance and DepEd. ', 'FEBRUARY 4-6, 2026', 'Coaches, assistant coaches, athletes, TWG.sch', '71075.00', 'City meet strengthen camaraderie among schools and highlighted student talents.', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
(3355, 'PAGDIRIWANG NG BUWAN NG WIKA.', '1. Ganap na maipatupad ang panpanguluhang proklamasyon BLG. 1041,s. 2007\r\n2. Mahikayat ang mga guro na makiisa sa mg programa na nagpapataas ng kamalayng pang wika.\r\n3. Maganyak ang mga mag aaral na pahalahahan ang pambansang wika sa pamamagitan ng a', '1. Active participation of teachers and students in Buwan Ng Wika programs.\r\n2. Documented cultural presentations and outputs for SBM montoring.', 'Organize language and cultural activities such as contest, exhibits, and performance.\r\n2. Facilitate teacher-led sessions promoting Filipino language and heritage.', 'August 15,2025', 'Guro at mga estudyante', '6470.00', '1. Activity strengthen appreciation of Filipino identify and supports national directives.\r\n2. 2. Budget allocation ensures logistics, prizes and materials are adequately provided.', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
