(3374, 'Strengthening the Implementation of School-Based Management (SBM) Practices for Improved School Performance and Stakeholder Engagement', '•	To strengthen the implementation of SBM principles in school governance and operations. \r\n•	To improve collaboration among school leaders, teachers, learners, parents, and stakeholders. \r\n•	To enhance data-driven decision-making in planning, implem', '•	Functional School Governance structures (SGC, PTA, SPG/SSG, committees). \r\n•	Updated School Improvement Plan (SIP) and Annual Implementation Plan (AIP). \r\n•	Improved learner performance and school outcomes. \r\n•	Strengthened stakeholder participation and engagement. \r\n•	Documented SBM processes, reports, and monitoring tools. ', '•	Conduct SBM orientation and re-orientation for stakeholders. \r\n•	Organize consultative meetings and planning workshops. \r\n•	Implement data-driven planning using assessment and school performance data. \r\n•	Strengthen committees (SGC, PTA, DRRM, Child Protection, etc.). \r\n•	Conduct regular monitoring, evaluation, and feedback sessions. \r\n•	Utilize LAC sessions for continuous improvement of instruction and SBM practices. \r\n•	Establish partnerships with LGUs, NGOs, and community stakeholders. ', 'School  Year 2026-2027', '•	School Head  •	Teachers  •	School Governanc', '', 'This action plan aims to ensure effective and sustained implementation of SBM practices through collaborative leadership, stakeholder engagement, and continuous improvement. Regular monitoring and evaluation shall be conducted to assess progress and address emerging needs.', 2026, 128471, 57, 12, 119),
(3375, 'Organize culture-sensitive activities (e.g., cultural presentations, Indigenous Peoples (IP) Day, and local heritage celebrations)', 'To promote respect, awareness, and appreciation of diverse cultures among learners', 'Increased learner participation and awareness of cultural diversity', 'School-based celebrations, integration in classroom activities, stakeholder collaboration, and reflective discussions', 'June 2026 to March 2027', 'Teaching personnel', '15000', '', 2026, 128666, 58, 12, 43);
