(3396, 'Visioning and Missioning workshop', 'All stakeholders should understand and aligned with the school\'s vision and mission as it relates  to SBM', '1.Clearly articulated and communicated SBM-aligned vision and mission\r\n2. Improved/ Increased stakeholder awareness and buy-in', '1.Stakeholders consultation  and workshop\r\n2. Development of Communication materials ( brochures , posters, online content)', 'July 2027', 'School Head, Teacher/SBM Focal person', '1500.00', 'This kind of activity  gives direction for SBM efforts. All success  ensuring the voice be heard and valued. Output be a living document and not a piece of paper.', 2026, 128676, 58, 12, 0),
