(3504, 'ASEAN MONTH : Philippine History and National Heroes Day Celebration', '1.  To make students understand the importance of ASEAN , through the representation of ASEAN countries.\r\n2. To help the students appreciate the cultural diversity of the country.\r\n3. To help the students develop self confidence.\r\n4. to instill the v', '* Students gain deeper understanding of ASEAN\'s significance and cultural diversity.\r\n* Active participation of 220 students in presentations and activities.\r\n* Enhanced appreciation of Philippines history and national heroes in the ASEAN context.\r\n* Documented outputs ( presentations, reports, photos ) for school records and evaluation.', '* Preparation \r\n* Implementation\r\n* Documentation and Evaluation.', 'August 1-31, 2025', '220 paticipants', '10009.00', '', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
(3505, 'CURRICULUM & TEACHING:                                                                            \r\nImplementation of Targeted Remediation and Enrichment Program', 'To improve learner proficiency in core learning areas and 21st-century skills aligned with NAT.', 'Increased percentage of learners achieving proficiency level.', 'Differentiated instruction, small group sessions, peer tutoring, and use of NAT-aligned materials', 'Year-round', '-Teachers, Master Teachers, School Heads', '15,000.00', 'Focus on least learned competencies', 2026, 304271, 60, 12, 27),
