(3507, 'EMPOWERING ARALING PANLIPUNAN through culturally relevant instructional tools and civic engagement.', '1. To provide necessary equipment and culturally aligned materials to support classroom - based and co-curricular activities   in Araling Panlipunan.\r\n2. To promote learner  participation n school-wide civic and cultural events that enhance national ', '1. Procurement of culturally aligned instruction materials and equipment.\r\n2. Enhanced classroom and co-curricular activities in Araling Panlipunan.\r\n3. Improved student engagement and appreciation of Filipino culture and heritage.\r\n4. Documented utilization of materials for SB monitoring and evaluation.', '1. Identify and list required culturally relevant materials and equipment.\r\n2. Coordinate with procurement personnel ffor acquisition and delivery.\r\n3. Integrate materials into classroom lessons and co-curricular activities.\r\n4. Monitor usage and collect feedback from teachers and students.\r\n5. Prepare documentation ( reports, photos, receipt ) for SBM compliance.\r\n', 'July 27,2025', 'Procurement personnel', '29950.00', '1. Activity supports curriculum enrichment and cultural integration in Araling Panlipunan.\r\n2. Budget allocation ensures procurement of quality and relevant materials.\r\n3. Outputs will be consolidated into reports for governance and future planning.\r\n4. Expected to strengthen cultural awareness and instructional effectiveness.', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
