(3509, 'WORLD TEACHERS DAY CELEBRATION : A day of gratitude : Honoring our educators.', '1. To recognize and honor the dedication and contribution of teachers .\r\n2. To promote awareness of the importance of the teaching profession .\r\n3. To foster a culture of gratitude and respect towards teachers.\r\n4. To inspire teachers by celebrating ', '1. Teachers are formally recognized and honored for their dedication and contribution.\r\n2. Documented program highlights and students participation for SBM monitoring. ', '1. Organize a celebration program with tributes, messages, and tokens of appreciation.\r\n2. Facilitate student-led activities showcasing gratitude and respect for teachers.', 'October 7, 2025', 'Teachers and staff, school head, students.', '26500.00', '1. Activity strengthens teacher morale and promotes awareness of the teaching profession\'s importance.\r\n2. Budget allocation ensures logistics, materials, and recognition tokens are adequately provided.', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
(3510, 'Review/Adjustment of AIP, if necessary', 'To review and adjust the Annual Implementation Plan (AIP) based on SBM assessment results to ensure responsive, effective, and needs-based school programs and activities.', 'Adjusted AIP if necessary', 'Conduct data review and analysis of SBM assessment results, followed by consultative meetings with stakeholders to collaboratively revise and align the AIP with identified priorities and needs.', 'June 2025', 'School Head, Internal and External Stakeholde', '500.00', '', 2026, 501608, 61, 12, 7),
(3511, 'FBS NC II PRE AND NATIONAL ASSESSMENT PREPARATION.', '1. To equip our students in all learning competencies within the qualification.\r\n2. To ensure that their skills and their character will enable them to become competent in the national assessment .\r\n3. To let them experience the possible scenario in ', '1. Students demonstrate readiness for the FBS NC II national assessment.\r\n2. Completion of practice sessions covering all learning competencies.\r\n3. Improved confidence and mastery of skills aligned with qualification standards.\r\n4. Documented evaluation results and feedback reports for SBM monitoring.', '1. Conduct intensive review sessions and competency-based drills.\r\n2. Simulate assessment scenarios to familiarize students with actual testing conditions.\r\n3. Provide coaching and mentoring by TVL teachers.\r\n4. Use standardized rubrics and checklist for practice evaluation.\r\n5. Monitor progress through daiily performance tracking and feedback.  ', 'NOVEMBER 5-7 & 10-12, 2025', 'TVL students', '8753.85', '1. Activity ensures alignment with TESDA standards and national assessment requirements.\r\n2. Budget allocation supports materials, practice tools, and logistical needs.\r\n3. Outputs will be consolidated into reports for SBM documentation and future reference\r\n4. Expected to enhance student employability and skill certification success. ', 2026, 304325, 103, 12, 0),
