(3552, 'SBM Assessment', 'To assess the school’s level of the Degree of Manifestation of SBM of Practice', 'The school\'s Degree of Manifestation of SBM Practice was assessed.', '*Convene the SBM officers\r\n*Conduct the self-assessment using the SBM Self-Assessment Checklist (Annex A)\r\n*Fill-out the Technical Assistance Needs Assessment Form\r\n*Submission of the SBM Assessment Result to the SDO Management Information System.\r\n', 'March 2026', '*School Head *SBM Focal Person *SBM Officers', '1000.00', '', 2026, 316101, 61, 12, 11),
