(3559, 'Resource Mobilization & Partnerships', 'Strengthen stakeholder support', 'MOAs; donation records', 'Apply a stakeholder engagement and networking strategy; establish linkages with LGU, NGOs, and private partners; prepare proposals and communication letters; document partnerships.', 'Whole Year', 'School Head, SGC', '1500', 'Support for school programs', 2026, 128691, 106, 12, 134),
