(3579, 'OSY Mapping and Home Visitation', 'To identify and locate OSY in the community and encourage them to return to learning programs', '•  Updated list of OSY \r\n•  Increased OSY referrals to ALS \r\n•  Strengthened school-community linkage\r\n', '•  Conduct house-to-house visits \r\n•  Coordinate with barangay and youth leaders \r\n•  Gather basic learner information \r\n•  Encourage enrollment in ALS\r\n', 'June – March 2027', '•  School Head  •  Guidance Advocate  •  ALS ', '3000.00', '', 2026, 301748, 107, 12, 82),
(3580, 'SGC Strengthening & Community Outreach\r\n\r\n', 'To establish a functional school-community planning team and improve communication with stakeholders.', '100% functional School Governance Council (SGC) with active community representation.', 'Conduct SGC reorganization meetings.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Formalize invitations to Brgy. Council and SPTA.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Draft partnership MOAs.\r\n\r\n', 'June – August 2027', 'School Head, SGC Members, Brgy. Council, SPTA', '3000.00', '', 2026, 301748, 107, 12, 82),
