(3583, 'Every trimester meet with the school administration to encourage the continuation of the School Governance Council (SGC).', 'To encourage the school administration to continue the School Governance Council (SGC) for better school decision-making.', '• Continued support and approval of the School Governance Council (SGC) • Increased participation of stakeholders in decision-making • Strengthened collaboration between school and community • Clear plans and actions for school improvement', '• Conduct a brief meeting or presentation with the school administration \r\n• Present the importance and benefits of the SGC \r\n• Share feedback or examples of its positive impact \r\n• Encourage open discussion and suggestions \r\n• Build agreement and support for its continuation\r\n', 'June 2026-April 2027', 'School Administration (Principal) School Gove', '6000.00', '', 2026, 301748, 107, 12, 82),
