(3626, '1. Conduct orientation on the Revised SBM anchored on DO 007, s. 2024.', 'To conduct orientation on DO 007, s. 2024 to teachers and other stakeholders.', '1. School personnel are informed and can access the revised framework.\r\n2. Have a clear understanding of the roles and responsibilities based on the new guidelines.', '1. Craft an Activity Design for the orientation.\r\n2. Make and send the School Memo to all personnel involved.\r\n3. Conduct the orientation.', 'May 28, 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Stakeholders', '6500.00', 'Successful in the conduct of the orientation.', 2026, 304315, 61, 12, 13),
(3627, 'Conduct School-Based Management (SBM) Level Assessment using the official self-checklist tool, including validation, documentation review, and stakeholder consultation.', 'To assess the school’s current SBM level using the self-checklist tool, identify strengths and gaps for improvement, ensure alignment with SBM principles, and prepare supporting documents for validation.', 'A completed SBM Self-Checklist Assessment, a consolidated evaluation report with identified strengths and gaps, a prioritized list of improvement areas, an organized portfolio of supporting documents (MOVs) (Google Drive), and inputs for updating the School Improvement Plan (SIP).', 'Conduct an orientation on the SBM self-assessment process, collaboratively accomplish the self-checklist tool, gather and review supporting documents (MOVs), engage key stakeholders for validation, analyze results to identify strengths and gaps, and integrate findings into improvement planning and the School Improvement Plan (SIP).', 'March - May 2026/ November-December 2026', 'School Head, SBM Designated Coordinator and S', '4000.00', 'The SBM self-assessment process should be transparent, inclusive, and evidence-based to ensure accurate and reliable results. All ratings must be supported by appropriate Means of Verification (MOVs), such as the completed SBM Self-Assessment Checklist, School Improvement Plan (SIP) and Annual Implementation Plan (AIP), minutes of meetings, attendance sheets, monitoring and evaluation reports, and stakeholder consultation records. These documents should be well-organized and readily available for validation and accreditation, while the assessment findings are utilized to guide continuous improvement, strategic planning, and sustained stakeholder engagement.', 2026, 304260, 104, 12, 129),
(3628, '1. Assess the management of the school using the Self-Assessment Tool and analyze the result.', '1. To evaluate the school\'s management using the Self-Assessment Tool.\r\n2. Analyze the result of the assessment.', '1. Accomplished Self-Assessment Tool', '1. Accomplish the Self-Assessment Tool via MIS.\r\n2. Develop an Action Plan based on the results of the assessment.', ' May 28, 2026 & June 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Stakeholders', '0', 'Highlights  improvements in school management and areas for improvement as well.', 2026, 304315, 61, 12, 13),
(3629, '1. Organize the SBM Core team.', '1. To organize the functional SBM Core Team.', '1. The SBM Core team is structured with well-defined roles and responsibilities.', '1. Establish the SBM Core Team, including Department Heads, external stakeholders, and non-teaching staff.\r\n2. Define the team\'s roles and responsibilities by issuing a designation order.', 'May 29, 2026', 'School Head, SBM Core team', '1000.00', 'SBM Team shall serve as the backbone in the implementation of the school PAPs.', 2026, 304315, 61, 12, 13),
(3630, 'Project ELLN', 'Increase proficiency in language, literacy, and numeracy for Grade 3 learners.', '100% of Grade 3 learners reaching proficiency levels.', 'Conduct differentiated instruction and small-group reading/math workshops.', 'Year-Round', 'School Principal, Grade 3 Teachers', '25000.00', 'Focus on indicator 1 which is Grade 3 learners achieve the proficiency level for each cluster of early language, literacy, and numeracy skills.', 2026, 129552, 107, 12, 57),
(3632, '1. Conduct a workshop for the SBM Core team on the utilization of the tools to implement the revised SBM.', '1. To organize a workshop focused on how to utilize the Self-Assessment Tool, making a Technical Plan, and other tools for the data collection.', '1. Enhanced skills of the SBM Core team in managing school processes.\r\n2. SBM Core Team is capable of utilizing different tools to implement the revised  SBM.', '1. Organize  a workshop on the planning, monitoring, & evaluation processes of SBM using different tools.\r\n2. Conduct training sessions for the data collection related to school performance assessments.\r\n3. Conduct orientation on the use of relevant tools and platforms for SBM implementation.', 'June   2026', 'School Head , SBM Core Team', '3000.00', 'Closedly monitored the implementation of all school Programs,  Activities, & Projects having the SBM Team working on them', 2026, 304315, 61, 12, 13),
(3634, '1. Review the School Improvement Plan (SIP) to ensure it aligns with the revised SBM guidelines.', '1. To review the SIP to ensure it aligns with the revised SBM guidelines.', '1. Detailed SIP that aligns with the updated SBM guidelines.\r\n2. All School personnel & stakeholders understand the objectives and implementation strategies of the SIP.', '1. Perform needs assessment using current school data and performance metrics.\r\n2. Re-visit SIP', 'June 2026', 'School Head , SBM Core Team', '1000.00', 'Alignment of the AIP with the revised SBM guidelines.', 2026, 304315, 61, 12, 13),
