(3636, '1.  Monitor and evaluate the implementation of the revised SBM.', '1. To carry out the monitoring and evaluation of the SBM implementation.\r\n', '1. Effective monitoring systems are established.\r\n2. Adjustments are made based on evaluation results to ensure continuous progress and improvement.\r\n3. Documentation of best practices is maintained for future SBM cycles.', '1. Conduct regular monitoring based on SBM indicators.\r\n2. Hold quarterly meetings to discuss progress, challenges, and necessary adjustments.\r\n3. Document lessons learned and best practices for ongoing improvement.', 'T1 - Sept 2026/T2 - Dec 2026/T3- Apr 2027', 'School Head, SBM Core team', '3000.00', 'Gaps and challenges shall be addressed.', 2026, 304315, 61, 12, 13),
