(3896, 'SBM Orientation & Re-Orientation', 'To ensure clear understanding of SBM roles and responsibilities.', 'Oriented stakeholders', 'Orientation meeting, presentation, Q&A', 'June and as needed', 'School Head, SBM Coordinators, Teachers, Admi', '1500', '', 2026, 129306, 61, 12, 11),
(3897, 'Preparation & Dissemination of School Report Card (SRC)', 'To provide accurate, transparent, and timely information on the school’s performance, accomplishments, and challenges to stakeholders.\r\nTo strengthen accountability and support evidence‑based decision‑making for continuous school improvement.', 'Completed and validated School Report Card (SRC).\r\nSRC disseminated and presented to stakeholders.\r\nIncreased stakeholder awareness and understanding of school performance.\r\nDocumentation such as SRC copies, attendance sheets, minutes, and photos.', 'Collection and consolidation of school data (enrollment, performance indicators, financial utilization, program implementation).\r\nAnalysis and validation of data outputs by the School Planning Team.\r\nPreparation of SRC using approved templates.\r\nPresentation and dissemination through meetings, bulletin boards, and other communication channels.', 'Annually (usually Quarter 3 or Quarter 4 of t', 'School Head School Planning Team (SPT) School', '3000', 'Key accountability mechanism under SBM Principle III (Accountability and Continuous Improvement).\r\nSRC outputs serve as major Means of Verification (MOVs) for SBM Level II–III validation.\r\nSRC results guide planning, program improvement, and stakeholder engagement.', 2026, 129305, 61, 12, 11),
