(3907, 'Financial Reporting & Liquidation ', 'To ensure accurate, timely, and transparent reporting and liquidation of all school financial transactions, particularly the utilization of Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\r\nTo promote accountability, compliance with financial policie', 'To ensure accurate, timely, and transparent reporting and liquidation of all school financial transactions, particularly the utilization of Maintenance and Other Operating Expenses (MOOE).\r\nTo promote accountability, compliance with financial policies, and responsible stewardship of school funds.', 'Consolidation and review of financial transactions and supporting documents.\r\nPreparation of financial statements and liquidation reports following DepEd and COA guidelines.\r\nRegular coordination with the Schools Division Office and finance units.\r\nValidation, documentation, and submission of reports within required schedules.', 'Quarterly and Annually (or as required by fin', 'School Head MOOE Coordinator / Disbursing Off', '1000', 'Supports SBM Principle III (Accountability and Continuous Improvement) and Principle IV (Management of Resources).\r\nEnsures transparency, compliance, and audit readiness.\r\nFinancial reports and liquidation records serve as key Means of Verification (MOVs) for SBM Level II–III validation and COA compliance.', 2026, 129305, 61, 12, 11),
