(3966, 'Project “Kitan”\r\n', '\"Enhance Security of School Facilities. \r\n\r\nReduce Energy Costs through Solar Lighting.\"\r\n', '\"Purchased Solar lights.\r\n\r\nSignificant Reduction in Electricity Costs.\r\n\r\nEnhanced Nighttime Security & Safety.\"\r\n', '\"1.	Conduct a site assessment and Decide on lighting specifications based on coverage requirements.\r\n2.	Draft a cost-benefit projection comparing current electricity costs with solar installation.\r\n3.	Consider a donor or stakeholder presentation.                         4.Installation of electrical and light in the classrooms\"\r\n', 'January to December 2026', 'School Head and Supply Officer and Physical F', '29300.00', '', 2026, 306176, 105, 12, 23),
