(3978, '\"Project “LAWA MADDIGÁR”\r\n(Health Monitoring System/WINS)\"\r\n', '\"Identify students with low health performance.\r\n \r\n- Track and improve the health condition of students quarterly.\r\n \r\n- Provide basic tools and equipment in monitoring the health performance of the students                                 -Minor re', '\"Conducted health screening among students through the MAPEH teacher (BMI).\r\n \r\n- Purchase tools and equipment that provide basic life support.\"\r\n', '\"*Conduct a BMI at the beginning of the school year.\r\n*Strengthen the implementation of Gulayan sa Paaralan for Feeding.\r\n*Health monitoring every week\r\n*Purchase of health-related materials and medicines\r\n*Implementation of the school clinic\r\n*Strengthen the implementation of record keeping for students and Teachers.* strenghten the implementation of project \"\"Ugas\"\" or \"\"handwash habit\"\"\"\r\n', 'January 2026 to December 2026', 'Health Coordinator, MAPEH teacher, Advisers, ', '77975.00', '', 2026, 306176, 105, 12, 23),
(3979, 'PROJECT “SINÁBBADAN” (Unity)\r\n', '\"To participate in any culturally related activities from 50% to 100%\r\n \r\nTo provide support and necessary materials, and other supplies needed for the different IPED programs activities. \"\r\n', '\" Attendance Sheet.\r\n Participation in all Festival activities in the Division and IPED implementation  in school.\"\r\n', '\"*Orientation of teachers\r\n*Conduct SLAC/Training and workshop\r\n*Joint community engagement\r\n*Enhancement of “Apo Sandawa “Home\r\n*Cultural activities every Friday of the week\r\n*Celebration of IP day and IP month\r\n*Purchase of Instructional materials for the IPED program and communityengagement\r\n*Crafting of Work Action Plan (WAP)\r\n*Monitoring and evaluation\r\n*Establish stakeholder partnership *Purchase of Printer for IPED program\"\r\n', 'October 2026', '\"School Head,  IP Coordinator, Students\"', '35000.00', '', 2026, 306176, 105, 12, 23),
