(3984, 'Project W.A.T.C.H.\r\n', '\"Cultivate an appreciation of time consciousness for personal discipline and respect for others’ time.\r\n \r\n- Instill honesty as a central character value, central to integrity and ethical behavior\"\r\n', '', '\"Curriculum integration. \r\nCreating W.A.T.C.H. Clubs led by students with advisory support.\r\n*Communications campaigns, such as feature columns in school papers, bulletin postings, and event announcements.\r\n*Workshops and seminars for students, teachers, and administrators.\r\n*Recognition schemes to reward punctual or honest individuals during ceremonies.\r\n*Crafting of Work Action Plan (WAP)\r\n*Purchase of Watch program materials   Installation of transparency board./bulletin board \"\r\n', 'January to December 2026', 'School Head WATCH coordinator Teachers SSLG O', '18200.00', '', 2026, 306176, 105, 12, 23),
