(4058, 'Strengthening teaching and learning through curriculum improvements, lesson planning, classroom observations, and learner-centered strategies, while also ensuring a safe and supportive learning environment through clean-up drives, safety drills, and ', 'Improve the school by strengthening all key areas of governance and operations in a coordinated and sustainable way. It focuses on improving teaching and learning, creating a safe and supportive environment for learners, and developing strong, capabl', 'To strengthen teaching and learning, improve learner achievement, and maintain a safe and supportive environment for all students, while also promoting strong leadership, transparency, and active stakeholder involvement. Overall, it is designed to develop competent and motivated staff, ensure efficient use of resources, and build strong community partnerships that lead to sustained school improvement and better learning outcomes.', 'Implemented through a collaborative and evidence-based approach that involves all stakeholders in improving the school. It starts with identifying needs and planning together, followed by carrying out targeted activities such as improving teaching practices, strengthening leadership, enhancing the learning environment, and developing staff and resources. Throughout the process, continuous monitoring, feedback, and adjustments are done to ensure accountability, improve performance, and sustain meaningful school development.', 'June 2026- April 2027', 'School Head, Master Teacher, Teachers, SGC, P', '10000', 'Well-coordinated effort to continuously improve the school by strengthening teaching and learning, creating a safe and supportive environment, and promoting strong leadership and transparent governance. It also focuses on developing teachers and staff, managing resources efficiently, and building strong community partnerships to sustain quality education and improve learner outcomes.', 2026, 1296, 107, 12, 69),
