(4205, '1. Establish/advocate provision of Computer Laboratory through LGU, DepEd proposals, and stakeholder partnership\r\n2. Improve and stabilize school water system through alternative water sources (tank, deep well, rainwater harvesting)\r\n3. Strengthen Mo', '1. To address lack of ICT facilities and improve digital literacy and instruction\r\n2. To ensure consistent and safe water supply for school use\r\n3. To ensure consistent use of M&E tools and improve data-driven decision-making\r\n4.To reduce delays in d', 'Functional computer laboratory proposal submitted and funding sourced\r\nFunctional and reliable water system installed\r\nStandardized M&E tools fully implemented and used quarterly\r\nComplete and well-documented minutes and increased stakeholder participation\r\nIncreased stakeholder attendance and engagement\r\nActive stakeholder participation in SBM evaluation and review activities\r\nSafe temporary learning spaces and rehabilitation plan for library', 'Proposal writing, stakeholder consultation, partnership building (LGU/PTA/NGO), resource mobilization\r\nInfrastructure assessment, coordination with LGU, installation of water tanks/rainwater system\r\nLAC sessions, training on M&E tools, coaching and mentoring, digital templates\r\nRegular meetings, use of standardized templates, digital record keeping, reminders and follow-ups\r\nFlexible meeting schedules, communication through digital platforms, community coordination\r\nOrientation on SBM, stakeholder forums, feedback mechanisms, consultation meetings\r\nRapid damage assessment, space reconfiguration, DRRM coordination, rehabilitation proposal', 'Short-term to Medium-term (SY 2026–2027) Shor', 'School Head, ICT Coordinator, PTA, SGC, LGU, ', '100000', 'Budgetary Requirement is subjected to adjustment ', 2026, 129659, 107, 12, 68),
(4206, 'SBM orientation and planning session\r\n', 'To engage school stakeholders with the revised SBM framework and school priorities', 'Clear understanding of SBM roles and school development plan', 'Orientation, collaborative planning workshop\r\n', 'May 2026', 'Reagan C. Diola', '3000', '', 2026, 128767, 58, 12, 42),
