(4410, 'Project ABANTE: Advancing School Excellence through School-Based Management', 'To nurture excellence, you need to provide people with examples of excellence. In a larger organization with a much wider sprawl of information, there are technological strategies for making information easily accessible without the overhead of stori', 'Benchmarked 3 level 3 schools for their best practices.; 100% implemented programs and projects; Prepared all the documents needed for the validation. \r\n', 'Conduct benchmarking activities to outstanding implementing schools in SBM; Implement planned programs, projects, SIP, and AIP.\r\nPrepare the MOVs and bid books for evaluation. \r\n', 'Year- round', 'School Head, SBM Coordinator and Team, Teache', '10000', '', 2026, 128768, 104, 12, 129),
