(4431, 'Construction/Installation of Ramps,  Widening of Pathways and Doors, Installation of Grab Bars and slope and floor adjustments.', 'To install essential  accessibility features  such as ramps. grab bars, widened pathways and doors, and slope and floor adjustment to accommodate wheelchairs and walkers.', 'Safe and hazard - free environment with functional ramps, handrails,  wide pathway and doors, and adjusted floor and slope.', 'Site Survey and Evaluation\r\nPrioritization of Project and stakeholders consultation.', 'Whole Year Round', 'School Head, School Facilities Committee Main', '150,000.00', 'Funds not available yet', 2026, 128841, 60, 12, 0),
(4432, 'Organization of SBM-TWG', 'To establish or organize the School-Based Management Technical Working Group', 'Organized SBM-Technical Working Group', 'Organize SBM-TWG with different functions and responsibilities', 'March 2026', 'School Head SBM Coordinator TP & NTP', '', '', 2026, 128772, 104, 12, 129),
