(4436, 'Renovation of PWD Comfort Rooms, Classroom arrangement, and Provision of Tactile Paving.', 'To modify existing facilities including restrooms, classrooms and corridors to ensure ease of movement and safety.', 'Improved accessibility and ease of movement for PWDs and learners with mobility difficulties within the school premises.\r\nAvailability of accessible facilities such as PWD - friendly comfort rooms and designated areas.', 'Site Survey and Evaluation\r\nPrioritization of Project and stakeholders consultation.', 'Whole Year Round', 'School Head, School Facilities Committee Main', '200,000.00', 'Funds not available yet.', 2026, 128841, 60, 12, 0),
