(4453, '5. Learning Environment-Access to disadvantaged, OSYs and adult learners', 'To expand access to basic education to those disadvantaged, OSYs, and adult illiterate learners', 'Increased enrolment and retention of OSY and adult learners, Improved literacy and numeracy and employability among disadvantaged  people', 'ADMs, Strengthened ALS program, Livelihood skills training,  Giving of incentives', 'SY 2026-2027', 'ALS/ADM focals', '2500.00', 'Reaching out for the OSY and disadvantaged learners is a noble act of teachers.  Given the resources, it will be realized', 2026, 501415, 60, 12, 31),
