(4457, 'Installation of Accessibility Signs with Large Fonts and Symbols', 'To implement clear and visible signage using large fonts, symbols and contrasting colors for easy identification and guidance.', 'Clear guidance and navigation through visible and easy - to - understand signage and symbols.', 'Environmental Enhancement: Installation of clear, high - visibility signage with symbols and large fonts.', 'Whole Year Round', 'School Head, School Facilities Committee Main', '50,000.00', 'Unavailability of funds', 2026, 128841, 60, 12, 0),
