(4459, 'Conduct regular inspection and maintenance, clearing of obstacles and orientation for students and staff on how to use the facilities properly and how to assist PWDs correctly.', 'To maintain and regularly inspect facilities to ensure they remain safe, functional, and free from obstacles  or hazard', 'Increased awareness among students, teachers, and staff on how to properly assist and accommodate PWDs.\r\nEnhanced participation of PWD learners in school activities as physical barriers are removed.', 'Monitoring and Sustainability Phase: Monthly inspection of facilities  to ensure they are intact, clean, and functional\r\n                                                                                    Establish a routine for repair and upkeep of ramps, rails, and signs.\r\nFeedback Mechanism: Gather suggestions from users to improve facilities further.', 'Monthly', 'School Head, School Facilities Committee Main', '2,000.00', '', 2026, 128841, 60, 12, 0),
(4460, '7. Learning Environment-Functional Child Protection Committee', 'To establish and strengthen CPC structure in school', 'Functional CPC that protects learners\' rights and ensure safe learning environment', 'Institutionalizing/Formalizing CPC/CPP, Conduct of Orientation on DepEd CPP', 'Opening of the SY', 'CPC Focal, School Head, Guidance Focal', '1500.00', 'CPP if well -disseminated to learners and parents can help maintain peace and harmony in school', 2026, 501415, 60, 12, 31),
(4461, 'Conduct election or appointment of officers and organization of Committee.', 'To revitalize, organize, and fully operationalize the School Governing Council (SGC) to ensure active participation, shared decision-making, and effective collaboration in school management and development.', 'Fully organized and structured SGC\r\n', 'Assessment and Re- organization', 'June - July 2026', 'School Head, SGC Members, SPT and PTA Officer', '3,000.00', '', 2026, 128841, 60, 12, 0),
