(4511, 'Formulation/Updating of School Improvement Plan (SIP) and Annual Implementation Plan', '1. Develop a comprehensive participatory and data driven SIP.\r\n2. Translate SIP into specific, measurable activities through AIP.\r\n3. Ensure alignment with division and national education goals.', '-Approved 3- year SIP\r\n-Approved AIP with detailed activities, timeline and budget\r\n', '-Conduct situational analysis using school data\r\n-Hold consultation meetings with different stakeholders groups\r\n-Organized planning workshop\r\n-Review and finalized documents approval\r\n', 'June - July 2026', 'School Heads, Teachers, SGC Members, PTA Offi', '1000.00', 'copies submitted to the Schools Division Office for reference', 2026, 305511, 60, 12, 30),
