(4527, 'Implementation of Mathematics/Numeracy Program', 'To improve learners’ numeracy skills in the four fundamental operations.                                               To reduce he number of learners performing below proficiency level.                                                       To streng', 'Improved scores in Mathematics assessments (quarterly and summative tests).            Decreased number of low performing learners.           \r\nProgress monitoring reports of learners\' numeracy levels.', 'Conduct baseline and periodic numeracy assessments, RMA. \r\nUse differentiated instruction and learner centered activities.\r\nIntegrate real-life problem solving tasks.\r\nConduct remediation.\r\nEngage parents through home numeracy intervention.\r\nMonitor progress and provide feedbacks.\r\n', 'School-year round 2026-2027', 'Learners, Teachers, Parents, School Head', '10000', 'Improving and enhancing learners\' numeracy skills is not an easy task. It requires learners and teachers\' commitment and so as to parents and school head. If either one of the person involved is not commited then attainment of objectives is not possible.', 2026, 129063, 60, 12, 33),
