(4537, 'In-Service Training (INSET) and Peer Coaching Program', '1. Upgrade teachers\' knowledge and skills in content and pedagogy.\r\n2. Enhance capability in using varied teaching strategies and assessment tools.\r\n3. Promote continuous professional growth.', '-Conducted school-based trainings\r\n- Observation notes and coaching reports\r\n- Improved lesson plans and teaching materials\r\n- Higher teacher confidence and competence', '-Identify master teachers or competent staff as facilitators/coaches\r\n-Conduct classroom observation and  post conference\r\n-Improved lesson plans and teaching materials\r\n-Higher teacher confidence and competence', 'August 2026 - February 2027', 'School heads, Teachers, PSDS', '4000.00', '', 2026, 305511, 60, 12, 30),
