(4627, '1.Implementation of  targeted Reading and Numeracy Enhancement Program for Grade 3 Learners', '1. Improve learners\' reading comprehension and numeracy skills\r\n\r\n2.Provide support to learners who are below proficiency level\r\n\r\n3.Strengthen teachers\' strategies in teaching literacy and numeracy\r\n\r\n4. Sustain proficiency level of learners through', '1. Improved reading and numeracy performance of grade 3 learners\r\n\r\n2. List of learners with targeted interventions\r\n\r\n3. Conducted remediation sessions\r\n\r\n4. Assessment results showing progress', '1. Conduct baseline assessment (Phil-IRI, numeracy test)\r\n\r\n2. Group learners based on ability level\r\n\r\n3. Implement short daily reading and numeracy drills (15-20 minutes)\r\n4. Conduct remediation for struggling learners(After class or schedule time)\r\n5. Use localized and simple instructional materials\r\n6. Monitor progress monthly and adjust strategies as needed', '1.  June 2026-March 2027 (Whole School Year) ', '', '', '', 2026, 128844, 60, 12, 30),
