(4978, 'Project INSPIRE (Integrating National Standards with Localized Instructional Resources)', 'To develop and utilize learning materials that are culturally relevant and responsive to the specific needs of Gusatbak Elementary School learners.', 'A localized Resource Bank of lesson plans and activity sheets for all grade levels.', 'Conduct a Writeshop for teachers to adapt existing modules using local stories, indigenous materials, and community-based examples. ', 'Quarter 2, SY 2026-2027', 'School Head, Teachers, Curriculum Coordinator', '5000', 'Aiming to move the manifestation level from frequently to Always', 2026, 205045, 60, 12, 30),
(4979, 'Community-School Industry Linkage Program', 'To establish formal partnerships with local businesses and industries to support TLE/TVL offering and real-world skill', 'Signed MOA with at least three local industry partner; guest speaker schedule for TLE classes.', 'Stakeholder mapping and consultative meetings with local farmers, traders, or artisans in Don Marcelino to align school skills training with local economic needs.', 'Year-Year Round ', 'School Head, TLE Teachers, Local Business Own', '2000', 'Prioritizing this as it currently shows the lowest manifestation level in the assessment.', 2026, 205045, 60, 12, 30),
(4980, 'Project READ-MATH (Refining Education through Assessment and Dedicated Mentoring)', 'To maintain and further improve proficiency levels i reading comprehension, science, and mathematics through data-driven remediation.', 'Documented progress reports of learners under remediation, 100% mastery of core competencies.', 'Use the results of the Test Item Analysis to identify specific learning gaps and conduct small group tutoring sessions after regular class hours.', 'Monthly/Every Friday Afternoon', 'Subject Teachers, Remedial Coordinators Volun', '', 'Sustainig the Always Manifested status of learner proficiency', 2026, 205045, 60, 12, 30),
(4981, 'Peace and Values Integration Seminar-Workshop', 'To ensure that DepEd core values (Maka-Diyos, Makatao, Makakalikasan, at Makabansa) are deeply embedded in every lesson across all subjects.', 'Updated Lesson Plas (DLL/PLP) reflecting explicit values integration and peace education topics', 'Peer coaching and Learning Action Cell (LAC) sessions where teachers share best practices for integrating peace and values i non-humanities subjects.', 'Once per quarter', 'All Teaching Staff, School Head', '1000', 'Focus on consistency across all grade levels', 2026, 205045, 60, 12, 30),
