(4990, 'SGC Functionality & Collaborattion Intensive ', 'To elevate the SGC from frequently to always manifested by ensuring regular, documented consultative meetings', 'Complete SGC Minutes of Meetings (4 regular meetings/year); Resolution on school strategic direction; Updated SGC Transparency Board', 'Create a feedback loop where SGC recommendations are formally integrated into the AIP.', 'August 2026, November 2026, February 2027, Ma', 'School Head, SGC Chairperson, Elected SGC Mem', '2000', 'Aims to transition the council into a fully proactive decision-making body', 2026, 205045, 60, 12, 30),
