(4992, 'Celebration of Indigenous Peoples (IP) Day', '• To promote awareness and appreciation of Indigenous Peoples’ culture and traditions\r\n• To strengthen respect for cultural diversity and inclusivity among learners', '• Active participation of learners and stakeholders\r\n• Increased appreciation of IP culture and heritage\r\n• Successful conduct of IP Day Celebration', '• Conduct of opening program\r\n• Cultural presentations and indigenous dances\r\n• Exhibit of indigenous materials, and crafts\r\n• Storytelling and sharing of Indigenous Knowledge, Systems, and Practices (IKSP)\r\n• Poster-making and slogan-making activities', 'October 2025 (1 day celebration)', 'School Head, Teachers, IP Coordinator, Learne', '1800', '• Encourage participation of IP community members\r\n• Promote respect for indigenous culture and traditions', 2026, 128846, 60, 12, 30),
