(4994, 'Search for King and Queen of Hearts 2025', '• To promote learners’ confidence, talents, and social skills\r\n• To encourage participation in school activities\r\n• To support school programs through a friendly fundraising activity', '• Active participation of learners and stakeholders\r\n• Successful conduct of the Search for King and Queen of Hearts 2025\r\n• Improved confidence and camaraderie among learners', '• Orientation of candidates and parents\r\n• Distribution of guidelines and mechanics\r\n• Campaign and voting activities\r\n• Presentation and coronation program\r\n• Awarding of winners and special awards', 'February 28, 2025', 'School Head, Teachers, SELG Officers, Parents', '8000', '• Ensure fair and transparent selection process\r\n• Encourage sportsmanship and active participation among learners', 2026, 128846, 60, 12, 30),
