(5095, 'Implementation of the School-Based (SBM) through stakeholder engagement, capacity building, school improvement initiatives, monitoring, and evaluation for School Year 2026-2027.', '1. Strengthen participatory governance and shared accountability among school stakeholders.\r\n2. Improve teaching-learning processes through collaborative planning and implementation.\r\n3. Enhance community participation in school programs and projects', '1. Approved and Implemented SBM Action Plan for SY: 2026-2027.\r\n2. Increased participation of parents, community members, and stakeholders in school activities.\r\n3. Conducted capacity-building activities for teachers and school personnel.\r\n4. Improved school programs, projects, and learning environment.\r\n5. Accomplished monitoring reports, documentation, and evaluation results for SBM Implementation.', '1. Conduct orientation and planning meeting with stakeholders.\r\n2. Organize committees and assign roles and responsibilities.\r\n3. Implement school programs and projects aligned with SBM principles.\r\n4. Conduct regular monitoring, evaluation, and feedback sessions.\r\n5. Strengthen partnerships with LGU, PTA, brgy officials, NGOs, and otherstakeholders.\r\n6. Utilize collaborative decision-making and participatory approaches in school governance.', 'June 2026 - April 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, PTA Officers, Parents,', '25000', 'This action plan shall be monitored quarterly to ensure effective implementation of School-Based Management and continuous improvement of school performance and learner outcomes at Maltusan Elementary School.', 2026, 128848, 60, 12, 30),
