(5146, 'Development and Integration of Peace Education and Core Values in Lesson Exemplars', 'To strengthen the integration of peace education and core values across subjects through the development and utilization of contextualized lesson exemplars.', 'Developed and contextualized lesson exemplars integrating peace education and core values across subjects.\r\nIncreased teacher competence in integrating values and peace education in lessons.', 'Curriculum Integration\r\nContextualized Learning\r\n', 'June 2026-March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, Master Teachers', '9000', 'The successful implementation of this action plan requires the active participation and collaboration of teachers, school leaders, and stakeholders. Developing lesson exemplars with explicit integration of peace education and core values will help promote positive learner behavior, strengthen moral development, and create a more inclusive and peaceful learning environment.', 2026, 129103, 60, 12, 25),
