(5150, 'Standardized Item Analysis Implementation Program', 'To standardize the implementation of item analysis in all learning areas and grade levels to improve assessment practices, instructional decision-making, and learner performance.', 'Standardized implementation of item analysis across all learning areas and grade levels.\r\nImproved teacher competence in assessment and data analysis.\r\nAccurate identification of learner strengths and learning gaps.', 'Capacity Building\r\nCollaborative Planning\r\nContinuous Improvement', 'June 2026-March 2027', 'School Head, Coordinators, Teachers', '7500', 'The successful implementation of this action plan requires the cooperation and commitment of school leaders and teachers in maintaining consistent and accurate assessment practices. Standardizing item analysis across all learning areas and grade levels will strengthen data-driven instruction, improve assessment quality, and support learner achievement through timely interventions and instructional adjustments.', 2026, 129103, 60, 12, 25),
