(5166, 'Stakeholder Collaboration, Communication, and Shared Accountability Program', 'To strengthen collaboration, communication, and shared accountability among school and community stakeholders to support effective school governance and program implementation.', 'Improved communication and collaboration among school and community stakeholders.\r\nIncreased stakeholder participation in school programs and activities.\r\nStrengthened partnerships and support for school improvement initiatives.\r\nEnhanced transparency, cooperation, and shared accountability.\r\nImproved planning, implementation, and monitoring of school programs.', 'Collaborative Governance\r\nStakeholder Engagement', 'June 2026-March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, Stakeholders', '9000', 'Strengthening collaboration and communication through regular meetings, consultations, and participatory planning will help create a supportive and sustainable partnership that contributes to continuous school improvement and learner success.', 2026, 129103, 60, 12, 25);
