(5315, 'Re – orientation of Teachers on School – Based Management Implementation \r\nDesignate chairmen of respective SBM principles\r\nAssessment of Current SBM practices\r\nSBM Program Planning \r\nSharing SBM best Practices\r\nRenovation of the SBM Hub\r\nRepainting ', '1. To re- orient teachers on School – Based Management (SBM) Implementation\r\n2. To designate Chairmen of respective SBM principles\r\n3. To determine the extent/level of SBM implementation  \r\n4. To be able to plan the SBM Implementation process for SY.', '1. Teachers updated and aligned with SBM concepts, roles, and responsibilities.\r\n2.  Clear assignment of SBM principles leaders with official designation.\r\n3.  Assessment report on current SBM practices.\r\n4.  SBM Implementation Plan with goals, strategies, and timelines.\r\n5.  Renovation plan and improved physical environment of SBM Hub.\r\n', '1. Conduct orientation sessions, workshops, and interactive discussions using presentations, case studies, and Q&A.\r\n2. Hold meetings, issue memos, and facilitate consensus-building among staff.\r\n3. Use surveys, focus group discussions, document reviews, and performance data analysis.\r\n4.  Strategic planning workshops, collaborative goal setting, and creation of action plans.\r\n5.  Organize planning meetings, mobilize resources, involve community stakeholders, and schedule renovation activities.', 'AUGUST 2026', 'Teachers and school Head', '10000', 'The SBM Action Plan objectives collectively strengthen participatory governance, transparency, and accountability in the school. By re-orienting teachers, designating leaders, assessing current practices, and planning for the upcoming school year, the school ensures clarity of roles and evidence-based decision-making. The renovation of the SBM Hub complements these organizational improvements by providing a conducive environment for planning and stakeholder engagement. Together, these initiatives foster collaboration, shared leadership, and sustainable progress in both organizational and physical aspects of SBM.', 2026, 128972, 60, 12, 27),
