(5406, 'Strengthen resource mobilization (PTA, LGU, NGOs), conduct proposal writing for funding, establish improved monitoring and evaluation system, and conduct sustainability planning workshops', 'To ensure adequate funding and resources, strengthen monitoring and evaluation systems, and sustain school programs and initiatives effectively', 'Increased financial and material resources, functional monitoring and evaluation system, and sustained and well-managed school programs', 'Stakeholder engagement, financial planning, capacity building, development of M&E tools, regular program reviews, and reporting', 'Whole school year (with quarterly monitoring ', 'School Head, Teachers, M&E Coordinator, PTA O', '10000.00', 'Subject to availability of external support; continuous improvement is required', 2026, 128501, 57, 12, 110);
