(5407, 'Conduct PTA orientation and reorientation seminars, regular PTA meetings, parent engagement programs, and school partnership activities', 'o increase parental participation and attendance in PTA activities, strengthen understanding of PTA roles, and improve school-community collaboration for learner support', 'Active and well-informed PTA members, increased attendance in meetings, stronger parent-school partnership, and improved learner support at home and school', 'Orientation seminars, capacity-building workshops, regular consultations, interactive meetings, and feedback mechanisms', 'Whole school year (Quarterly Meeting)', 'School Head, Teachers, PTA Officers, Parents/', '5000.00', 'Continuous engagement and monitoring required.', 2026, 128501, 57, 12, 110),
(5408, 'Conduct regular Learning Action Cell (LAC) sessions, training workshops, mentoring and coaching activities, and professional development programs', 'To enhance teachers’ professional growth, improve teaching practices, and strengthen collaborative learning among teachers and staff', 'Improved teacher competencies, effective implementation of LAC sessions, increased teacher engagement, and enhanced teaching-learning process', 'Collaborative learning sessions and peer mentoring', 'Whole school year (monthly)', 'School Head, Master Teachers, Teachers, LAC C', '5000.00', 'Continuous monitoring and evaluation shall be conducted to ensure effectiveness and sustainability of LAC implementation', 2026, 128501, 57, 12, 110),
(5409, 'Implementation of School Reading Program. ', 'To improve the reading comprehension, fluency, and vocabulary skills of learners, especially struggling readers.', 'Increased reading proficiency of learners, reduced number of non-readers and frustration readers and improved learner participation and academic performance.', 'Conduct reader assessment, identify struggling readers, implement daily remedial reading sessions, provide reading materials, monitor learner progress, and involve parents in home reading activities.', 'JUNE 2O26- APRIL 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, Parents and learners', '10000', 'Progress monitoring and evaluation will be conducted quarterly to assess the effectiveness of the reading program.', 2026, 128694, 106, 12, 134),
(5410, 'Implementing peer coaching and mentoring among teachers.', '1. Strengthen professional collaboration and teamwork among teachers.\r\n2. Enhance instructional practices through peer observation, feedback, and mentoring.\r\n3. Support beginning and struggling teachers through guided coaching and mentoring sessions.', '1. Improved teaching performance and classroom management skills.\r\n2. Established peer coaching and mentoring teams.\r\n3. Developed coaching plans, observation notes, and mentoring reports.\r\n4. Increased teacher confidence and professional engagement.\r\n5. Enhanced collaboration and sharing of best practices among teachers.', 'Peer observation and classroom visitation\r\n Coaching and mentoring sessions\r\nDemonstration teaching and feedbacking\r\nCollaborative lesson planning Reflection and sharing sessions', 'JUNE 2026- APRIL 2027', 'School Head and teachers', '2000', 'Peer coaching and mentoring shall be conducted in a supportive and collaborative environment to encourage professional growth and continuous improvement. Monitoring and evaluation activities will be implemented to measure the effectiveness of the program and its impact on teaching and learning outcomes.', 2026, 128694, 106, 12, 134),
(5411, 'Conduct child protection and anti-bullying orientation seminars, cyberbullying awareness campaigns, establishment of reporting and monitoring systems, and regular monitoring of learner behavior', 'To strengthen child protection measures, increase learner awareness on bullying and reporting procedures, and ensure a safe and supportive school environment', 'Improved awareness of learners and staff on child protection policies, functional reporting and monitoring mechanisms, reduced bullying incidents, and enhanced learner discipline and safety', 'Orientation programs, information dissemination, guidance counseling, regular monitoring, incident documentation, and stakeholder collaboration', 'hole school year (continuous monitoring)', 'School Head, Child Protection Committee, Guid', '6000.00', 'Strict implementation of DepEd Child Protection Policy and continuous monitoring and evaluation are required', 2026, 128501, 57, 12, 110),
(5412, 'Conduct orientation and training workshops for Child Protection Committee (CPC) members, strengthen reporting and documentation systems, and implement regular monitoring and evaluation meetings', 'To enhance the knowledge and capability of CPC members, improve reporting and documentation practices, and strengthen the effectiveness of child protection implementation in school', 'Well-trained CPC members, organized and updated documentation system, timely reporting of cases, and improved implementation of child protection measures', 'Seminars, workshops, policy orientation, coaching sessions, monitoring activities, and evaluation conferences', 'Whole school year', 'School Head, CPC Members, Guidance Coordinato', '10000.00', 'Continuous monitoring and adherence to DepEd Child Protection Policy and protocols are required', 2026, 128501, 57, 12, 110),
