(5669, '“Boses ng Mag-aaral, Kaunlaran ng Paaralan”', 'At the end of the activity, the learners are expected to:\r\n1.Identify school issues and concerns experienced in Catagman Elementary School.\r\n2.Express ideas and opinions on how to improve the school environment.\r\n3.Demonstrate cooperation and active ', 'SBM Action Plan\r\nGroup Poster or Slogan\r\nRole Play / Short Presentation\r\nGroup Reporting Output\r\nReflection Statement', 'Collaborative Learning\r\nSimulation\r\nBrainstorming\r\nValues Integration Approach\r\n', 'whole year round', 'School Head / Principal,Teachers,learners,par', '10,000.00 (MOOE,PTA,IGP)', 'The activity is highly recommended for implementation as it effectively promotes active learner participation, collaboration, and awareness of school improvement initiatives in Catagman Elementary School.\r\n\r\nIt successfully integrates the principles of School-Based Management by encouraging shared responsibility among learners, teachers, parents, and other stakeholders in identifying school concerns and proposing practical solutions.\r\n\r\nOverall, the activity is relevant, engaging, and aligned with learner-centered and community-based education goals, making it suitable for enhancing both academic and social development of the pupils.', 2026, 128728, 106, 12, 133),
