(5698, 'Dropout Prevention Program', 'Reduce dropout risk due to financial difficulties, absenteeism, and family problems', 'Sustained learner participation; reduced dropout rate', '*monitor attendance and performance to flag at-risk learners early.\r\n*Flexible Learning Options: modular lessons and alternative schedules for learners with responsibilities.\r\n*Recognition and Motivation: simple rewards for consistent attendance and effort.', '1st Trimester – Identify at-risk learners, 2n', 'School Head, Master Teacher, Guidance Counsel', '0.0', '', 2026, 501770, 57, 12, 116),
