(5701, 'Strengthening partnerships with external mental health professionals and local health units for referral and support services', 'To establish and strengthen collaborative partnerships with external mental health professionals and local health units to ensure accessible, timely, and appropriate referral and support services for learners’ mental health and psychosocial needs.', 'Conduct of joint activities such as mental health orientations, trainings, or consultation sessions', 'Ensure active involvement of learners, teachers, and parents where appropriate', 'End of third term.', 'School Planning Team and School Project Team', '5000', 'Encourages shared responsibility among learners, teachers, and parents in addressing psychosocial concerns', 2026, 128552, 57, 12, 108),
