(5703, 'Strengthening Literacy and Numeracy Skills of Grade 1-6', 'Improve the literacy and numeracy performance of Grade 1-6 ', '* Increased number of learners reading at Grade level\r\n*Improved numeracy competency of Grade 1-6 learners', '*Administration of Phil-IRI, CRLA, and RMA\r\n*Analysis of assessment results to identify learning gaps\r\n*Consolidation of data for profiling\r\n*Crafting individualized or group intervention plans\r\n* Conducting LAC Sessions', 'June 2026 to March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, parents, pupils', '5000', 'Implementation shall be continuously monitored and evaluated to ensure improved literacy and numeracy outcomes among Grade 1-6 learners', 2026, 128688, 106, 12, 134),
