(5730, 'Complete lack of a computer room and zero working computers or laptops available for our pupils/teacher to use ', 'Acquire fundamental computer equipment and establish a temporary, secure space for tech-driven learning.', 'A formal letter request was submitted to the Division Office; a temporary ICT station was designated.', 'Draft and submit an urgent request for complete DCP hardware packages; allocate a secure room layout in the future school plan.', 'Short-Term / Prioritized', 'School Head, ICT Coordinator, Division Office', '', '', 2026, 204016, 57, 12, 116),
