(5732, 'Absence of a dedicated library room due to limited available classroom space and standard budgetary allocations for standalone library structures.', 'Enhance alternative literacy spaces given the lack of a dedicated standalone library building.', 'Fully functioning, well-stocked reading hubs and interactive book corners inside 100% of classrooms.', 'Organize localized book-donation drives; design collaborative reading nooks with the help of classroom PTA officers.', 'Mid-Year', 'School Head, Reading Coordinators, Classroom ', '', '', 2026, 204016, 57, 12, 116),
