(5776, 'Integration of Peace Education and DepEd Core Values in Classroom Instruction', 'To promote peace, respect, responsibility, and positive values among learners through the integration of peace education and DepEd core values into daily classroom instruction and learning activities.', 'Increased learner awareness and understanding of peace education and DepEd core values\r\nImproved learner behavior, discipline, and interpersonal relationships\r\nIntegration of values-based activities and discussions in lesson delivery\r\nDevelopment of a positive, inclusive, and respectful classroom environment\r\n\r\n', 'Teachers will integrate topics related to peace education, empathy, respect, cooperation, and the DepEd core values—Maka-Diyos, Maka-tao, Makakalikasan, and Makabansa—into daily lessons and classroom activities. Contextualized examples, storytelling, role-playing, group discussions, and reflective activities will be utilized to help learners apply positive values in real-life situations. Teachers will also model appropriate behavior and encourage learners to practice peaceful conflict resolution, teamwork, and respect for diversity within the school community.', 'June-April', 'School Head, Class Adviser', '5000', 'Integrating peace education and DepEd core values into classroom instruction helps develop responsible, respectful, and values-oriented learners. Consistent reinforcement of positive values and behavior is essential in creating a safe, peaceful, and learner-friendly school environment.', 2026, 128438, 57, 12, 121),
(5777, 'Grade 6, 10, and 12 learners achieve the proficiency level in all 21st century skills in core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT)', 'To achieve the proficiency level in all 21st century skills in core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT)', 'Achieved achieve the proficiency level in all 21st century skills in core learning areas in the National Achievement Test (NAT)', 'Remediation Program, ARAL Program, Summer Class', 'June-May', 'Teachers, Parents, and School Head', '22500', '', 2026, 128459, 57, 12, 119),
