(5794, 'Schedule quarterly school facility inspections and coordinate with stakeholders for repair and maintenance.', 'To Conduct regular inspection and coordinate with stakeholders for immediate repair and maintenance support.', 'Early identification of facility issues (classrooms, restrooms, electrical, plumbing)\r\n\r\nTimely repairs and reduced safety risks\r\n\r\nImproved learning environment and sustained infrastructure quality', 'Form a school maintenance committee with representatives from teachers, parents, and LGU\r\n\r\nConduct scheduled walkthrough inspections with documentation of findings\r\n\r\nCoordinate with LGU engineering office, DepEd, and private partners for repair support\r\n\r\nImplement a reporting system for urgent maintenance needs', 'Quarterly inspections (June, September, Decem', 'School Principal  SBM Coordinator  Maintenanc', '80000', 'Urgent repairs will be escalated immediately to stakeholders; long-term projects will be integrated into SIP/AIP.', 2026, 128495, 57, 12, 111),
