(5797, 'Implement scheduled computer maintenance, upgrade internet infrastructure, and mobilize partnerships for ICT resource acquisition.', 'To Conduct regular maintenance of computers, strengthen internet connectivity, and seek additional ICT resources through partnerships and school programs.', 'Fully functional computers with reduced downtime\r\n\r\nStable and faster internet connectivity for classrooms and offices\r\n\r\nAdditional ICT tools (projectors, tablets, e-learning platforms) secured through partnerships', 'Establish a maintenance schedule with ICT staff or service providers\r\n\r\nCoordinate with LGU and DepEd ICT programs for connectivity upgrades\r\n\r\nDraft proposals to NGOs, private companies, and alumni for ICT donations\r\n\r\nTrain teachers and students on proper ICT usage and care', 'July 2026 – December 2026 (initial implementa', 'School Principal  SBM Coordinator  ICT Coordi', '200000', 'Sustainability plan includes annual ICT audit, renewal of internet contracts, and continuous partnership engagement.', 2026, 128495, 57, 12, 111),
