(5800, 'Implement scheduled monitoring and inspection of school facilities, programs, and resources with active stakeholder participation.', 'To Regular monitoring and inspection conducted by school personnel and stakeholders.', 'Early detection of issues in facilities, equipment, and programs\r\n\r\nTimely corrective actions and repairs\r\n\r\nStrengthened accountability and transparency in school operations', 'Establish a monitoring committee composed of teachers, PTA, and LGU representatives\r\n\r\nConduct monthly walkthrough inspections with documentation of findings\r\n\r\nUse standardized monitoring tools/checklists for consistency\r\n\r\nShare inspection reports with stakeholders and integrate feedback into SIP/AIP', 'Monthly inspections (every last Friday of the', 'School Principal  SBM Coordinator  Teachers a', '60000', 'Findings will be reported to stakeholders quarterly; urgent issues will be escalated immediately for resolution.', 2026, 128495, 57, 12, 111),
