(5804, 'Schedule Learning Action Cell (LAC) sessions in the school calendar with flexible arrangements for teachers.', '  \r\nTo integrate LAC sessions into the school calendar and provide flexible schedules.', 'Regular LAC sessions embedded in the school calendar\r\n\r\nIncreased teacher collaboration and professional development\r\n\r\nImproved teaching strategies and classroom practices', 'Align LAC schedules with DepEd guidelines and school priorities\r\n\r\nProvide flexible options (after class hours, weekends, or blended formats)\r\n\r\nEncourage peer mentoring and collaborative lesson planning\r\n\r\nDocument outcomes and integrate into SIP/AIP', 'Monthly sessions (every 2nd Friday of the mon', 'School Principal  SBM Coordinator  LAC Facili', '50000', 'Flexibility ensures maximum teacher participation; outcomes will be reviewed quarterly to adjust schedules and content.', 2026, 128495, 57, 12, 111),
