(5806, 'Conduct daily reading–numeracy routines, remediation/enrichment, parent involvement.', 'To intensify early language, literacy, and numeracy interventions so more Grade 3 learners reach proficiency.', '1. Improved quarterly reading and numeracy assessment results of Grade 3 learners (e.g., school-based tests/diagnostics).\r\n\r\n2. At least 80–85% of Grade 3 learners reaching “proficient” or higher in school ELLN/ELNA indicators by year-end.\r\n\r\n3. Documented list of learners given remediation and enrichment and the interventions provided.\r\n\r\n', '1. Baseline and quarterly ELLN assessments.\r\n\r\n2. 20–30 minute daily ELLN routines and 2–3x/week small-group remediation/enrichment.\r\n\r\n3. LAC sessions and simple home tasks for parents.', 'Quarter 4: Weeks 1–2 (planning/baseline), Wee', 'Grade 3 teachers, school head/ELLN coordinato', '', 'Integrate in SIP/AIP and monitor via assessment trackers, observation notes, and LAC minutes; document good practices for sharing and scaling.', 2026, 128325, 57, 12, 116),
