(5809, 'Conduct annual review workshops to align the school’s strategic plan with DepEd priorities and evolving community needs.', 'To continue annual review and alignment of the strategic plan with DepEd priorities and community needs.', 'Updated strategic plan reflecting DepEd directives and local priorities\r\n\r\nStronger stakeholder ownership of school goals\r\n\r\nClear roadmap for SIP/AIP implementation', 'Review DepEd policy updates and integrate into school planning\r\n\r\nConduct community consultations to identify emerging needs\r\n\r\nFacilitate workshops with teachers, PTA, and LGU representatives\r\n\r\nDocument revisions and disseminate updated plan to stakeholders', 'Annual review (every January)', 'School Principal  SBM Coordinator  Teachers a', '120000', 'Strategic plan revisions will be integrated into SIP/AIP; monitoring reports will track alignment progress throughout the year.', 2026, 128495, 57, 12, 111),
