(5901, 'S.I.L.I.D.\r\n(Strengthening Infrastructure for Learners’ Inclusive Development)', '1. Identify the shortage and condition of existing classroom buildings.\r\n2. Provide safe, conducive, and adequate learning spaces for learners.\r\n3. Mobilize stakeholders and partners to support classroom construction and repair projects.', '1. Increased stakeholder participation and support for classroom projects.\r\n2. Improved and additional classroom facilities.\r\n3. Safer and more learner-friendly school environment.', '1. Conduct school facility inspection and classroom assessment.\r\n2. Coordinate with LGU, DepEd officials, PTA, NGOs, and stakeholders for possible funding and assistance.\r\n3. Prepare project proposals and request letters for classroom construction/repair.', 'School Year 2025–2026 / Whole Year Implementa', 'School Head, Teachers, PTA Officers, Barangay', '', 'Implementation depends on the availability of funds and support from stakeholders and partner agencies.', 2026, 128556, 57, 12, 108),
(5902, '\"KAISA\"\r\n(Kalinangan at Inklusibong Samahan para sa mga Aaral)', '1. Promote unity, respect, and inclusivity among learners from different tribes and cultural backgrounds.\r\n2. Strengthen cultural awareness and appreciation within the school community.\r\n3. Prevent discrimination, bullying, and misunderstanding among', '1. Improved relationship and cooperation among learners from diverse tribes.\r\n2. Increased cultural awareness and appreciation among teachers and learners.\r\n3. Reduced incidents of discrimination and conflicts.', '1. Organize multicultural presentations, tribal showcases, and school programs promoting inclusivity.\r\n2. Integrate cultural sensitivity and inclusiveness in classroom discussions and activities.\r\n3. Encourage peer collaboration and cooperative learning among diverse learners.\r\n4. Strengthen coordination with parents, IP leaders, and community stakeholders.', 'School Year 2025–2026 / Whole Year Implementa', 'School Head, Teachers, Learners, Parents, IP ', '', 'Continuous collaboration and active participation of stakeholders are essential in maintaining an inclusive, respectful, and culturally responsive learning environment.', 2026, 128557, 57, 12, 108),
