(5912, '1. Conduct Nutritional Assessment and BMI Monitoring 2. Implementation of School-Based Feeding Program (SBFP) 3. Gulayan sa Paaralan Program (School Garden) 4. Nutrition Education Campaign 5. Parent Orientation on Proper Nutrition and Food Preparatio', 'To improve the nutritional status of learners through strengthened school-based feeding interventions, health monitoring, and stakeholder participation.', '1. Updated BMI and nutritional profile of learners 2. Improved weight and nutritional condition of beneficiaries 3. Learners and parents equipped with nutrition knowledge 4. Parents actively participating in nutrition programs 5. Learners dewormed and medically assessed 6. Progress reports and updated nutritional data', '1. Height and weight measurement, BMI computation 2. Daily feeding of nutritious meals/snacks 3. School gardening and crop maintenance 4. Meetings, demonstrations, orientation sessions 5. Coordination with health personnel 6. Regular monitoring and documentation', 'Whole School Year', 'School Heads, Teachers, Parents, Learners and', '40000', '1. Regular monitoring shall be conducted to track learners’ nutritional improvement. 2. Priority beneficiaries are severely wasted and wasted learners identified through BMI assessment. 3. Strengthen learners’ and parents’ awareness on proper nutrition and healthy lifestyle. 4. Continuous stakeholder support and donations are encouraged for program sustainability. 5. Results will serve as basis for program improvement and future interventions.', 2026, 306038, 57, 12, 116),
