(5966, 'Capacity Building on Data Analysis and Assessment Management', 'To strengthen teachers’ competency in test item analysis and efficient assessment practices.', 'Improved assessment quality and timely completion of test analysis reports.', 'Conduct LAC sessions, training-workshops, and use simplified digital/manual templates for test analysis.', 'Every End of Term Block', 'School Head, Teachers', '5000', 'Supports data-driven instruction', 2026, 204015, 57, 12, 109),
