(6028, 'Prepare a MOOE utilization plan aligned with the School Improvement Plan (SIP) and Annual Implementation Plan (AIP); Conduct orientation sessions for teachers and stakeholders on allowable MOOE expenditures and liquidation procedures; Implement syste', '•	Ensure 100% liquidation of MOOE funds in compliance with DepEd financial guidelines.\r\n•	Strengthen transparency and accountability in financial management.\r\n•	Promote stakeholder trust and confidence in school resource utilization.\r\n•	Minimize erro', '•	100% liquidation reports submitted on time and accepted by DepEd.\r\n•	Documented financial records showing proper utilization of funds.\r\n•	Increased stakeholder confidence in school financial management.\r\n•	Reduced cases of unliquidated or disallowed expenses.', '•	Participatory financial planning with teachers, PTA, and stakeholders to align expenditures with SIP priorities.\r\n•	Systematic monitoring of disbursements through financial logs, vouchers, and receipts.\r\n•	Quarterly consultations and reviews to track utilization and prepare liquidation reports.\r\n•	Compliance with DepEd financial guidelines for disbursement and liquidation.\r\n•	Transparent communication of MOOE utilization and liquidation status through assemblies, newsletters, and digital platforms.\r\n•	Continuous monitoring and evaluation by the School Head, finance staff, and stakeholders.', 'June 2026 to March 2027', 'Teachers; School Head, AO, AdSup-COS', '5000.00', '', 2026, 128560, 57, 12, 109),
