(6191, 'Reassignment and Scheduling of Personnel', 'To maximize the available workforce and ensure continuous delivery of frontline services', 'Improved staff distribution and work schedules', 'Strategic task delegation, duty scheduling, and team coordination', 'Year-round', 'School Head, Non-teaching Personnel, ICT Coor', '0', 'Subject to approval and availability of positions', 2026, 304187, 57, 12, 124),
