(6193, 'School Management and Workload Rationalization Program', 'To address limited manpower and overlapping responsibilities affecting timely implementation and monitoring of school programs.', 'Improved work distribution and timely accomplishment of school targets.', 'Reorganize school committees, delegate tasks strategically, engage volunteers and stakeholders for support.', 'June 2026–March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, PTA, Stakeholders', '2000', 'Maximizes available human resources in multigrade context', 2026, 204015, 57, 12, 109),
