(6272, 'Implement School-Based Mental Wellness and Psychosocial Support Program', '1. Promote mental wellness and emotional resilience among learners and school personnel.\r\n2. Strengthen the school’s support system for psychosocial and emotional needs.\r\n', '1. Functional mental wellness support mechanisms and referral system established.\r\n2. Increased awareness of mental health and psychosocial well-being among learners, teachers, and parents.\r\n3. Improved learner behavior, attendance, and emotional well-being.', '.Conduct mental wellness seminars, stress management sessions, and psychosocial support activities.\r\n• Integrate social-emotional learning activities in classroom instruction.\r\n• Collaborate with health personnel, guidance advocates, and community stakeholders for support services.', 'June 2026 – March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, Guidance Coordinator/D', '8000.00', 'Continuous monitoring and evaluation shall be conducted to ensure accessibility, confidentiality, inclusiveness, and effectiveness of the mental wellness support mechanisms.', 2026, 128300, 57, 12, 116),
