(6284, 'Conduct repair , maintenance and upgrading of non functional computer units , request additional computer units through stakeholders and school funds .', '1. To restore and maintain the functionality of computer laboratory units.2. To provide sufficient and accessible computer units for learners', 'Increased the number of functional computer units. \r\nLearners can participate effectively in ICT classes and digital learning activities.', '1. conduct inventory and assessment 2. Coordinate with the ICT coordinators and Technicians for repair and maintenance 3. Allocate MOOE funds or solicit support from stakeholders 4. implement regular monitoring and preventive maintenance of computers 5. Schedule invetory.', 'Whole year round', 'School head, teachers, parents, stakeholders ', '50000.00', 'Immediate repair and continuous maintenance of computer units are necessary to ensure that all learners have equal access to technology-based learning opportunities', 2026, 315807, 57, 12, 109),
