(7399, 'Strengthening School Governance and Stakeholder Engagement Program', '1. To effectively implement the school’s strategic plan through structured activities.\r\n2. To strengthen the functionality of the School Governance Council (SGC) and PTA.\r\n3. To enhance collaboration between the school, stakeholders, and partner inst', '1. Approved and implemented School Improvement Plan (SIP) / Annual Implementation Plan (AIP)\r\n2. Regularly conducted SGC and PTA meetings with documented minutes\r\n3. Signed partnerships or MOAs with stakeholders and partner schools', '1. Conduct In-Service Trainings (INSET) and Learning Action Cell (LAC) sessions\r\n2. Hold regular SGC and PTA meetings for planning and decision-making\r\n3. Organize stakeholder consultations and partnership meetings', 'Preparation Phase: 1–2 weeks, Implementation ', '1. School Head / Principal 2. Teachers and De', '8000', 'The activity supports continuous improvement in school governance and instructional quality.\r\nActive participation of stakeholders is critical for success.\r\nSustainability depends on consistent monitoring, evaluation, and stakeholder engagement.', 2026, 315815, 57, 12, 123),
