(7421, 'Conduct of Coordination Meeting and Orientation Meeting on the Revised SBM Framework, Assessment Process and Tool', 'To orient and capacitate SBM-TWG on the revised SMB-Framework  Assessment Process and Tool', 'Successfully conducted coordination meeting with attendance sheet, minutes, action plan, and improved understanding of SBM indicators, MOVs and documentation  requirements', 'The School Head and SBM-TWG Chairperson shall conduct a coordination meeting to discuss the revised SBM framework, clarify roles and responsibilities, align strategies, and conduct collaborative planning and task distribution.', ' November 28, 2025', 'School Head, Teachers, Coordinators', '200.00', 'Completed/For follow-up on implementation', 2026, 500457, 61, 12, 8),
(7422, 'Parangal Para sa Gurong Marangal', 'Conduct meeting to organize praise system. Conduct annual awarding ceremony for teachers ', 'Established school-based praise system. Organize praise committee with defined roles. Award teachers\' achievement.', 'Conduct meeting to organize praise committee', 'October 2026- December 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, and Administrative Off', '6520', 'To be monitored and evaluated quarterly for improvement\r\nSupport from stakeholders is highly encouraged for sustainability', 2026, 128314, 57, 12, 116),
(7423, 'Regular SBM Monitoring, Documentation, and Reporting of School Activities', 'To ensure the continuous monitoring, proper documentation, and timely reporting of SBM-related activities and accomplishments', 'Complete SBM monitoring reports, updated documentation and organized records for validation', 'SBM-TWG members shall regularly monitor assigned areas, collect MOVs and submit documentation to the SBM focal person. Monthly consolidation of reports shall be conducted for tracking progress and compliance', 'November 2025-June 2026', 'School Head, ICT Coordinator, SBM-TWG Members', '300.00', 'For sustainability', 2026, 500457, 61, 12, 8),
