(7425, 'Project NAT-SULONG', 'Conduct orientation to parents. Regularly administer practice tests modeled after NAT format.', 'Parents orientation conducted. Regularly practice tests modeled after NAT format administered. Increase NAT result', 'Conduct orientation to parents and learners on NAT goals and strategies.\r\nDevelop and administer weekly/bi-weekly NAT-based practice tests.\r\nConduct item analysis and remediation after each test.\r\nProvide targeted intervention for least mastered skills.\r\nMonitor learners’ progress through regular assessment and feedback.', 'June 2026 - March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, and Parents', '24000', 'Continuous monitoring and evaluation to ensure effectiveness.\r\nStrengthen collaboration between school and parents.\r\nResults will be used for planning further interventions.', 2026, 128314, 57, 12, 116),
(7426, 'Project UGNAYAN ( Ugnayan ng Paaralan at Pamayanan para sa Edukasyon)', 'Increase the Involvement of the School Governing Council in mobilizing resources for school infrastructure through better training and clear roles.', '80% increased in the improvement of School Governing Council (SGC) member', 'Involve PTA and external stakeholders in mobilizing resources and advocating for infrastructure development through fundraising events and partnerships.\r\nOrganize coordination meetings between SGC, school heads, and LGU officials to align infrastructure priorities.', 'June 2026 - March 2027', 'Makopa Elementary School', '16483', 'Continuous collaboration with stakeholders is essential for successful implementation\r\nRegular monitoring and evaluation of SGC performance shall be conducted\r\nStrengthen partnerships with LGU and community to sustain infrastructure projects\r\nCapacity-building activities for SGC members are highly encouraged for long-term effectiveness', 2026, 128314, 57, 12, 116),
(7427, 'Conduct SBM Evaluation and Internal Assessment Review', 'To assess SBM implementation progress and identify areas for improvement', 'SBM internal assessment report, action plan for improvement, and updated compliance status', 'The SBM team shall conduct periodic self-assessment using SBM tools, review accomplishments, and identify gaps. Results shall be used for planning interventions and improvements', 'November 2025-March 2026', 'School Head, SBM Chairperson, Coordinators', '200.00', '', 2026, 500457, 61, 12, 8),
(7428, 'Project PATAK', 'Install potable water system.\r\nProcure water tank/rain water collector.\r\nCoordinate with GPTA and Barangay officials extend water lines to classroom.', 'Potable water system installed.\r\nWater tank/rain water collector procured.\r\nCoordinated to stakeholders.\r\nWater lines extended to classrooms..', 'Conduct coordination meetings with GPTA, Barangay officials, and stakeholders.\r\nIdentify priority areas for water line extension.\r\nMobilize community support and resources for installation.\r\nProcure and install water tank/rainwater collector.\r\nMonitor and maintain the water supply system regularly.\r\nRemarks', 'June 2026-March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, SPTA Officers, BLGU', '196000', 'For implementation upon availability of funds and stakeholder support.\r\nContinuous coordination with barangay officials and community partners is needed.\r\nSustainability and maintenance of water facilities shall be ensured.', 2026, 128314, 57, 12, 116),
(7429, 'Preparation in all areas of concern and Consolidation of SBM documents, reports and MOVs', 'To prepare for Division SBM monitoring and assessment', 'A complete and well=organized compilation of SBM reports, portfolios, and Means of Verification (MOVs) demonstrating readiness for the Division SBM Monitoring & Evaluation Assessment, with enhanced compliance to SBM standards and indicators.', 'The Division SBM-TWG, in collaboration with the School Head and SBM-TWG members, shall review, validate, and consolidate all required reports, portfolios, and means of verification (MOVs) aligned with four SBM principles. Continuous coaching, document validation, and mock assessment activities shall also be conducted to ensure the school\'s readiness for the Division SBM monitoring and evaluation assessment', 'November 2025-March 2026', 'Division SBM-TWG, School Head, Teacher', '500', '', 2026, 500457, 61, 12, 8),
(7430, 'Let\'s Read', 'Conduct parents orientation to struggling learners.\r\nConduct one on one reading session\r\nSet-up reading corners.', 'Parents orientation conducted.\r\nOne-on-one guided reading session.\r\nReading corners set-up.\r\nIncrease in proficiency level of learners.', 'Conduct regular coordination meeting to parents.\r\nRegular assessment of learners.', 'June 2026 - March 2027', 'School Head, Teachers, and Reading Coordinato', '106,080', 'Continuous monitoring and assessment will be conducted to ensure improvement in learners’ reading proficiency, with active participation and support from parents, teachers, and the school community.', 2026, 128314, 57, 12, 116),
