(7442, '“Numeracy RISE: Nurturing Understanding and Mastery for Every Learner”', 'To increase the Grade ready learners from Grades 1 to 3', 'Increased numeracy proficiency levels among grade 1 to 3 learners based on standard assessment metrics; contextualized numeracy flashcards, drill sheets, and instructional materials developed and utilized; progress tracing sheets mapping the improvement of at-risk learners', 'Conduct diagnostic assessment  to identify specific learning gaps in numeracy; implement structured daily 15-minute numeracy drills and  remedial math session; use contextualized learning materials and math focused educational games; administer periodic post-test to monitor and evaluate learner progress', 'year round', 'KS1 teachers, Math coordinator, School Head', '20000.00', 'Target for full implementation across all key stage 1 sections, regular monitoring reports to be submitted during quarterly SMEA', 2026, 128436, 57, 12, 0),
