(7446, 'Project GABAY: Systematic Innovation for Nurturing Academic Growth”', 'To conduct and facilitate LAC Session for strengthening Teacher’s capacity in the new curriculum using 21st Century skills', 'Conducted quarterly SLAC sessions on the new curriculum; enhanced teacher competence in integrating 21st-century skills and active learning strategies into daily lesson plans; compiled portfolio of session outputs, attendance sheets, and teacher-made instructional materials', 'Aminister TNA to identify specific curriculum gaps and teacher training needs; formulate a systematic LAAC plan specifying session schedules, topics, and competent resource speakers; conduct interactive workshop sessions focusing on technology integration and higher-order thinking skills (HOTS); Monitor classroom implementation through post-LAC observations and instructional supervisory visits', 'year round', 'School Head and School LAC Coordinators', '15000.00', 'Continuous implementation to ensure sustained professional growth; evaluation reports and completion folders to be presented during quarterly SMEA', 2026, 128436, 57, 12, 0),
