(7451, '“Project Katuwang: Katuparan ng Adhikain Tungo sa wastong Asal at Galing”', 'To establish and sustain functional SGC ', 'Organized and structured SGC with designated officers and working committees; Formulated and adopted SGC Constitution and By-laws, and operational guidelines; Documented regular quarterly consultative meetings; assembly minutes, and signed resolutions supporting school improvement projects; Increased active participation of external community stakeholders in school transparency and governance activities', 'Conduct a school-wide orientation on the roles, functions, and standard composition of a functional SGC; Facilitate a democratic election or appointment process to select  council members representing the LGU, NGO,PTA, alumni, and student body; Set a fixed annual calendar for regular quarterly council meetings and stakeholder engagement forums; Engage council in the collaborative review, budgeting, and endorsement of the SIP and AIP', 'year round', 'School Head, Stakeholders, LGU, NGO, PTA Offi', '10000.00', 'Continuous implementation to foster community ownership and transparent school governance, milestone council resolutions and achievements to be presented during quarter SMEA', 2026, 128436, 57, 12, 0),
