(8044, 'Conduct intensive reading and numeracy remediation, strengthen parent-teacher collaboration, and monitor learner progress regularly.', '1. Improve learners\' reading proficiency and numeracy skills through targeted remediation interventions.\r\n2. Strengthen parent-teacher collaboration to support learners\' academic progress at home and in school.\r\n3.Monitor and evaluate learner progres', '1. Increased percentage of learners achieving grade-level reading and numeracy competencies.\r\n2. Active participation of parents in learning support activities; increased attendance in meetings and conferences.\r\n3. Updated learner progress records and intervention reports.\r\n4. Teachers equipped with appropriate intervention techniques and instructional practices.', '1. Conduct diagnostic assessments; implement intensive reading and numeracy remediation sessions; utilize differentiated instruction and learning materials.\r\n2. Conduct Parent Orientation, Learning Action Sessions, Home Reading Program, and Parent-Teacher Conferences.\r\n3. Conduct monthly assessments, progress monitoring, data analysis, and feedback sessions with learners and parents.\r\n4. Conduct school-based training, peer coaching, demonstration teaching, and Learning Action Cell (LAC) sessions.', 'June 2025-March 2026', 'School Head, Teachers, Reading Coordinators, ', '15000.00', '1. Priority learners identified through baseline assessment.\r\n2.Encourage regular communication through school and community platforms.\r\n3. Results will guide instructional adjustments and interventions.\r\n4. Align with DepEd literacy and numeracy programs.', 2026, 129127, 60, 12, 25),
